window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":601,"title":"Chapter 601 - Defeating Lu Feiyu and Fighting Dong Fanghao","paragraphs":["This was not the first time Chu Yunfan and Lu Feiyu had fought. The last time Lu Feiyu met Chu Yunfan, he was beaten until he coughed up blood and was forced to run away.","Up until now, Lu Feiyu still had some lingering fear. Based on Chu Yunfan’s massacre on Star Myriad Island, if he had not escaped in time, his ending would not have been any better than the others.","At the tail-end of the conference, when everyone had gone up to surround Chu Yunfan, Lu Feiyun did not have the courage to go forward. Only by truly fighting with Chu Yunfan could one understand how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","This time, when he met Chu Yunfan again, Lu Feiyu revealed a solemn and vigilant expression.","“It looks like we’re fated.” Chu Yunfan grinned slightly.","From Lu Feiyu’s point of view, Chu Yunfan was clearly mocking him. His face was instantly filled with anger. In reality, he might not have dared to attack Chu Yunfan, and he did not want Chu Yunfan to seize the opportunity to ridicule him.","Now that they were in the virtual network, everything was naturally different. Even if Lu Feiyu lost, he would at most die and become a hero again a second later.","“Chu Yunfan, don’t be too proud. Take this!”","Lu Feiyu’s saber struck out. The long saber, which was a third thinner than ordinary sabers, quickly arrived before Chu Yunfan.","Compared to the last time Lu Feiyu had fought with Chu Yunfan, he was now much stronger. He had gone from the peak of the sixth level of the Acquired Stage to the seventh. After three months of bitter cultivation, he had successfully stepped into the peak of the seventh level.","Compared to Dong Fanghao back on the island, Lu Feiyu was no weaker. But at that time, even Dong Fanghao was no match for Chu Yunfan, let alone the current Lu Feiyu.","This strike was based on the principle of killing. It was so fast that it was hard to imagine. It descended from the sky, bringing with it an irresistible might as it slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan did not even glance at it. The True Energy in his whole body instantly burst out, forming a strong energy force around him. Lu Feiyu’s strike was extremely fast, and its power was shocking. It could even cut open steel like tofu.","But now, the blade stopped only three inches away from Chu Yunfan. It could not get close to him at all.","“Sh*t!”","Lu Feiyu instantly reacted. Chu Yunfan’s True Energy was so dense that it was unbelievable. It was a miracle that his saber could not cut through it.","“Mantis Divine Kick!”","However, how could Chu Yunfan give Lu Feiyu a chance? Chu Yunfan simply raised his leg and kicked out.","This kick swept across Lu Feiyu’s body like a razor. After a muffled groan, Lu Feiyu’s body turned into a ball of light, and was instantly killed.","Instant kill in one move.","“What power. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation has already reached an unbelievable level!”","“Lu Feiyu’s cultivation has already reached the seventh level of the Acquired Stage. Even if we were to do it ourselves, we might not be able to deal with Lu Feiyu so cleanly. Chu Yunfan is only a freshman, yet he’s already comparable to an ordinary instructor. His talent is truly monstrous.”","“I don’t think so. An ordinary instructor might not even be his match. His cultivation is absolutely unfathomable and unrivaled. Jeang Yuanbin has really picked up a treasure.”","“That’s right. Previously, we were all laughing at Jeang Yuanbin for not being able to make a move in time. Looks like he picked up a loophole in the end.”","When the many instructors saw this scene, they immediately started discussing among themselves. They were much more powerful than an ordinary instructor. After seeing this scene, they could naturally deduce that Chu Yunfan was probably even more powerful than an ordinary peak Acquired instructor.","Although Federation University would produce many monstrous students who were comparable to peak Acquired instructors every year, it was still rare for a freshmen to reach such a level.","The last time someone had reached this level, as far as they knew, it was the Jiang family’s Jiang Lingxiao.","When the tutors thought of the life and death battle between Chu Yunfan and Jiang Lingxiao, they felt that it was even more of a pity. One of these two heaven-gifted geniuses had to fall. This was very disadvantageous for Federation University.","After finishing off Lu Feiyu with a single kick, Chu Yunfan entered the finals unhindered. His next opponent was none other than the top three of this year’s Federation University, Dong Fanghao.","Upon seeing Chu Yunfan, Dong Fanghao’s expression turned solemn. Although the current Chu Yunfan looked like an ordinary youth by the side of the road, he, who had actually fought Chu Yunfan, knew how powerful he was.","The more this was the case, the more in danger it made Dong Fanghao feel. He even felt all the hairs on his body stand on end. This feeling made him understand that the Chu Yunfan in front of him was even more terrifying than during the conference on Star Myriad Island.","Dong Fanghao immediately decided to strike first to gain the upper hand. This was because he knew that he could only defeat Chu Yunfan if he seized the opportunity first.","Without a word, Dong Fanghao instantly stepped forward. In a few flashes, he had arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. His steel blade swept through the air, and in an instant, one could see it with the naked eye that in front of Chu Yunfan, countless pieces of air collapsed and turned into nothingness.","This terrifying slash that could destroy a dead branch was much stronger than back at the conference. A few months ago, Dong Fanghao was already at the peak of the seventh level of the Acquired Stage. And now, not only had he crossed the threshold of eighth level, he had also rushed to the ninth level of the Acquired Stage in one go.","Although Dog Fanghao was only at the initial stages of the ninth level, it was still the same Mountain Destroyer. This time, the power of this move was at least several times stronger.","“The ninth level of the Acquired Stage. Dong Fanghao has stepped into the ninth level. If it was in the past, he would definitely be the best candidate for the first seat of the grade. Unfortunately, this year, be it Chu Yunfan or Mei Haiyun, they’re both too outstanding. Even the radiance of a peerless genius like Dong Fanghao has been snatched away,” an instructor could not help but exclaim in shock when he saw this slash.","At this rate, in a few months at most, Dong Fanghao would be able to step into the peak of the Acquired Stage and stand on equal footing with them. Moreover, most of the student body had yet to step into the Acquired Stage. From this, one could see how powerful and terrifying Dong Fanghao was.","Everyone turned their gazes toward Chu Yunfan. This slash was terrifying. Even the instructors at the peak of the Acquired Stage would not be able to casually deal with it.","When compared to Dong Fanghao, there were not many differences between him and them.","And at this moment, Chu Yunfan made his move. He merely threw out a simple punch. It was just an ordinary punch, but it had a kind of power that could turn something rotten into something magical. The punch smashed the terrifying energy force that the blade attack brought into nothingness, and then directly collided with the blade light."]},{"number":602,"title":"Chapter 602 - Defeating Dong Fanghao, the","paragraphs":["Boom!","A terrifying surge of True Energy exploded out. Chu Yunfan’s fist landed on the steel saber, and its terrifying fist light instantly destroyed the saber’s light.","Or rather, no saber light could withstand even a single one of Chu Yunfan’s blows.","Even someone as strong as Dong Fanghao, who had already stepped into the ninth level of the Acquired Stage, was unable to withstand a single blow from the current Chu Yunfan. He was simply not a match.","What the...?” Although Dong Fanghao knew that Chu Yunfan was terrifying, this casual punch successfully dispelling his Mountain Destroyer was completely out of Dong Fanghao’s expectations.","Immediately after, a terrifying power with boundless True Energy swept over. Dong Fanghao’s attack was easily broken by Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan’s attack continued to sweep over like a shadow.","Dong Fanghao was forced to take a few steps back before he was able to neutralize the overwhelming power brought about by this terrifying power. Immediately, he sensed that Chu Yunfan’s body was like a bottomless pit that contained a terrifying power within. At the same time, this power was also endless. His attacks were completely useless against Chu Yunfan.","Indeed. Just as Dong Fanghao had sensed, Chu Yunfan was much more terrifying than back at the conference.","This attack of Dong Fanghao could even crack a low-level mecha, and Chu Yunfan had received it with his bare hands without taking a single scratch. This was absolutely terrifying.","However, the situation clearly did not allow Dong Fanghao the time to ponder over this too much. Before he realized it, Chu Yunfan was already standing before him. He had no choice but to go all out. He braced himself and took a step forward to stop his retreat. Then, he counterattacked.","“Second movement of the Mountain Destroyer—Sky Crusher!”","This slash was even more violent and terrifying than the previous one. But it also took a huge toll on Dong Fanghao. His face revealed a pained expression.","The Mountain Crusher was undoubted of extremely high grade. It even reached the Innate Stage. To the current Dong Fanghao, the more moves he used, the greater the toll on his body.","Dong Fanghao had wanted to save this move for when he was dealing with Mei Haiyun. He had not expected that he would need to use it now. But in his heart, Chu Yunfan was even more dangerous than Mei Haiyun, so this was not considered a loss.","“Mantis Divine Kick!”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes seemed devoid of any emotion. With a great shout, he lifted his leg and the True Energy around Chu Yunfan erupted. A mantis-like halo instantly shrouded his body.","“Chu Yunfan made a breakthrough in the battle!” One of the instructor’s eyes widened in disbelief. It was truly unbelievable that Chu Yunfan was able to make a breakthrough in such a battle.","Although the Mantis Divine Kick that Chu Yunfan had used earlier was extremely powerful, it had only reached the Impeccable Stage. It had yet to reach the level of perfection. But with this kick, Chu Yunfan’s technique had broken through from the Impeccable Stage to the Perfection Stage.","Chu Yunfan was actually able to break through in such an intense battle. Even the instructors did not know what to say. It seemed that his talent was even more formidable and terrifying than they had imagined.","Boom!","Another terrifying attack. Chu Yunfan’s kick instantly turned the second movement of the Mountain Destroyer into nothingness.","“I’ve finally broken through,” Chu Yunfan said as he retracted his leg.","After a few days, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation of the Mantis Divine Kick had finally broken through and entered the Perfection Stage. Although his strength had not changed, the power of the Mantis Divine Kick had increased greatly, and so had his battle prowess.","“You used me as a whetstone!” Dong Fanghao’s eyes widened. He could feel a terrifying power that caused his blade to tremble and surge through his arm. He could not accept that Chu Yunfan had used him as a whetstone to hone his martial skills.","Dong Fanghao had done this sort of thing in the past, but he had only chosen to do such a thing against opponents who were not a threat to him at all.","In other words, in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, Dong Fanghao was not a threat.","Thinking of this, Dong Fanghao’s anger surged. He admitted that Chu Yunfan was very strong, but this was outright disrespect.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re underestimating me too much!”","Dong Fanghao’s aura became sharp and fierce. The True Energy in his body surged out instantly and he pounced toward Chu Yunfan. The saber in his hand slashed out. In an instant, countless saber shadows appeared in the sky and fell down like raindrops.","Boom, boom, boom!","Countless True Energy exploded in the air as if a huge landmine had exploded. They slashed down crazily at Chu Yunfan.","“To thank you for helping my Mantis Divine Kick break through to the Perfection Stage, I’ll let you see the difference in our strength!” Chu Yunfan shouted. The True Energy in his body exploded. Then, everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s leg strike out like lightning. His entire body was wrapped in True Energy and it turned into an incomparably huge praying mantis. It was as if it could tear apart the entire world.","Once this kick was sent out, the saber light that rained down from the sky instantly turned into nothingness and was drowned out by the terrifying True Energy tide.","Chu Yunfan’s rich cultivation strength was on vivid display.","This kick broke through all of the saber light, and its momentum did not decrease as it directly smashed toward Dong Fanghao.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s kick met Dong Fanghao’s sharp saber light head-on. The terrifying collision was like a comet crashing into Earth, setting off a boundless tide.","Dong Fanghao instantly felt a boundless tide surge through his arm. Previously, he could just barely block it, but now, he could not resist at all. In an instant, his palm split open and blood splattered everywhere. Then, the saber in Dong Fanghao’s hand was sent flying. He could no longer hold on to it.","After kicking away the saber in Dong Fanghao’s hand, the attack did not lose its momentum and directly hit Dong Fanghao in the chest.","Dong Fanghao let out a muffled groan, and his entire chest caved in. Chu Yunfan’s kick had landed squarely on his chest, causing it to cave in. Blood spattered out of the wound.","If this was a real battle, this kick would have been enough to kill Dong Fanghao.","Pfft!","Dong Fanghao spat out a mouthful of blood. His eyes widened in disbelief. Compared to the previous battle, the gap between them had not shrunk. Instead, it had grown even larger.","Fortunately, this was only the virtual network. With a stunned gaze, Dong Fanghao turned into a stream of light and disappeared."]},{"number":603,"title":"Chapter 603 - The Final Round","paragraphs":["“Dong Fanghao has lost!”","All of the instructors were roused. They had already prepared themselves mentally.","After all, Chu Yunfan had defeated Dong Fanghao once before. The difference in strength was immense. Although Dong Fanghao had become stronger in the past few months, it was clear that Chu Yunfan too was stronger. He could not possibly have grown weaker.","“With Dong Fanghao’s heaven-gifted talent, he actually wasn’t able to close the gap in strength within a few months,” an instructor said with his mouth agape.","“It’s only been a few months, but the gap is now even greater!”","Even if many instructors were unwilling, they had to admit that there was indeed a big gap. Chu Yunfan had become even more terrifying.","To successfully defeat Dong Fanghao in one move was something that most instructors could not do. Did this not mean that Chu Yunfan’s strength was above most of the instructors?","This fact immediately shocked many of them. Standing shoulder to shoulder with peak Acquired instructors and surpassing them were two completely different matters.","Most would be stuck at the peak of the Acquired Stage for a very long time. Among the instructors at Federation University, there were those who had been stuck for several years, or even more than ten years, without making the slightest bit of progress.","This could not be helped. The Federation had yet to find a way to increase the probability of a peak Acquired Stage expert breaking through on a large scale. They could only rely on their luck.","If one could obtain something like an Innate Pill, it would then be possible for them to break through. This was the reason why organizations like the Eight Greats were getting bigger and bigger. Only through these families would one be able to obtain better cultivation resources.","Fortunately, society had a sufficient number of peak Acquired Stage experts. Every year, many would advance to become Innate Stage experts. They were all created by relying on numbers.","However, they knew that regardless of whether it was Chu Yunfan, Dong Fanghao, or Mei Haiyun, they were definitely not ordinary people. Based on precedence set by the past generations, as long as nothing unexpected happened, they would definitely step into the Innate Stage.","They were the elites of the entire human race and the elites of Heaven.","The Federation had always had both quality and quantity at the same time. Ordinary people represented quantity, while Chu Yunfan and the others represented quality in the eyes of the Federation.","Be it Chu Yunfan, Dong Fanghao, or Mei Haiyun, they would all become important figures with limitless prospects in the future. It could be said that they had booked a ticket to enter the upper echelons of the Federation.","In fact, most of them might not even be a match for Chu Yunfan.","After Chu Yunfan defeated Dong Fanghao, the ranking competition entered the finals. His last opponent was none other than Mei Haiyun.","It was obvious that Mei Haiyun had heard about how Chu Yunfan had easily defeated Dong Fanghao. He was on high alert as he faced Chu Yunfan. He had already been defeated by Chu Yunfan once and therefore knew how powerful and terrifying Chu Yunfan was. Even though he had undergone an earth-shattering change, Chu Yunfan was still not an opponent that could be easily dealt with.","The battle between the two was undoubtedly the focus of everyone’s attention. This battle was going to determine the year’s number one.","Whoever won would be number one among the freshmen!","“I think Chu Yunfan’s chances of winning are higher. Don’t forget, he defeated Mei Haiyun a few months ago.”","“I don’t think so. Although Chu Yunfan is very strong, Mei Haiyun isn’t a pushover. Mei Haiyun was able to sweep away everyone before this and had no equal opponents.”","“But overall, these two people are far ahead. Other than Dong Fanghao, it’s very difficult for the others to pose any threat to them.”","“They’re truly heaven-gifted geniuses. Humans are getting stronger and stronger, and there are more and more geniuses.”","Facing such a situation, Mei Haiyun’s expression was calm and unruffled, as if he was not facing a formidable enemy. There was a faint fluctuation of heaven and earth Spirit Energy around his body.","‘The peak of the Acquired Stage!’ Chu Yunfan immediately determined that Mei Haiyun’s cultivation had reached the peak Acquired Stage. Mei Haiyun was a level stronger than Dong Fanghao.","Although a peak Acquired Stage expert was nothing like an Innate Stage expert who could control the Spirit Energy of the world, Mei Haiyun was at the final step and could trigger a slight fluctuation.","Boom!","Mei Haiyun’s eyes suddenly opened wide and a terrifying power began to surge through his body.","“Chu Yunfan, I know you’re very strong, but I’m not a pushover. I’ll let you have a taste of my power.” Mei Haiyun’s body was surrounded by a strange power, and soon after, this power began to surge through his body.","The surface of Mei Haiyun’s body was covered with runes. It looked strange and holy.","With the blessing of this rune power, Mei Haiyun’s strength suddenly surpassed the peak of the Acquired Stage and became comparable to the Innate Stage.","Boom!","Endless airwaves formed around Mei Haiyun.","“What is that? How did Mei Haiyun suddenly become so much stronger?”","Many of the instructors were stunned when they saw this scene.","“It’s rune power. I recall that there’s such a branch in martial arts. It’s very rare and has only been found in the ruins of the Ancient Zenith Civilization that was excavated recently.”","Some knowledgeable instructors recognized that the power around Mei Haiyun was a branch of martial arts called rune power.","In ancient times, there were people who relied on drawing runes to activate some mysterious power to strengthen themselves. They would obtain power that surpassed their original.","This rune power was extremely rare in the current Federation’s martial arts system.","“I feel that Mei Haiyun is going to win.”","“That’s right. His strength has increased by so much. It has surpassed the Acquired level and has risen to the Innate level.”","Chu Yunfan looked at Mei Haiyun’s transformation. In his mind, he had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. He recognized this rune power. In his impression, rune power was not contained to only such a level. In fact, it was much more terrifying than this.","Rune power could be used in battle. Through various mysterious methods, it could draw upon the power of Heaven and Earth. It was a powerful system comparable to martial skills.","As for Mei Haiyun, he had only obtained a rough idea of how to use it. However, it was already shocking enough throughout the current Federation.","If the original Mei Haiyun was still not a match for him, then the current Mei Haiyun had undoubtedly become an existence that even Chu Yunfan had to treat seriously.","“Chu Yunfan, this is the first time that I’m using this power. No one else has the qualifications to force me to use it. I have no choice but to take you seriously. This time, I will defeat you fair and square.”"]},{"number":604,"title":"Chapter 604 - Victory, First of the Year","paragraphs":["“Defeat me? Don’t you know that even Wang Qi is no match for me?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","“Wang Qi is nothing. When he was at his peak, he was only on par with me. Now that I’ve already surpassed the peak of the Acquired Stage, even if it was him in front of me, he would be no match for me,” Mei Haiyun said indifferently.","Chu Yunfan instantly understood. It turned out that Mei Haiyun did not know about Wang Qi’s breakthrough. In terms of strength, Wang Qi was considered outstanding at Federation University.","However, Wang Qi was at most on par with Mei Haiyun. Therefore, Mei Haiyun did not take Wang Qi’s defeat seriously. He did not know that Wang Qi was defeated by Chu Yunfan after breaking through to the Innate Stage.","Otherwise, Mei Haiyun would not be so confident.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan was too lazy to say anything more. To him, it did not matter whether Mei Haiyun knew or not.","Boom!","The terrifying power surged through Mei Haiyun’s body. He took a step forward and a terrifying sword light instantly shot out from his hand and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","It was the Five Elemental Swords!","Quick!","Quick!","Quick!","The sword was extremely fast. Most of the instructors could not even keep up with the attack. It was fast to an unimaginable extent. The Five Elemental Swords was already fast, to begin with. After borrowing the power of the runes to barely break through to the Innate Stage, Mei Haiyun’s speed had soared to another level.","Just as everyone blinked, the sword had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","This was the power of the Innate Stage that even most of the instructors were shocked by. No matter what method Mei Haiyun used to obtain it, the Innate Stage was still the Innate Stage.","Facing this attack, Chu Yunfan was not the slightest bit perturbed. He merely raised his hand and his palm blocked the sword.","Bam!","A loud explosion rang out and the entire arena seemed like it was about to explode.","Chu Yunfan had blocked this shocking attack with his bare hands.","The sword light spread out, but no matter what, it could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","“This is impossible!”","Everyone’s eyes widened in disbelief. It was unbelievable that Mei Haiyun, who had unleashed his Innate level battle strength, could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. This undoubtedly shocked them.","Mei Haiyun was even more shocked. He had held nothing back, yet he was unable to do anything to Chu Yunfan. However, he had no time to think. Immediately, he shouted, “The five elements of Heaven and Earth, the eternity of the world! Lend me the power of the five elements and fight with me!”","Mei Haiyun’s attack had been unsuccessful, but his gaze became even more determined. In an instant, he once again thrust out a terrifying sword light. The sword light turned into a rain of swords in the sky. It was extremely terrifying as if it could devour everything.","“Come on!” Chu Yunfan was not afraid. He punched out fist shadows that filled the sky. Those fist shadows were extremely fast. Each punch was able to destroy one sword shadow.","Boom, boom, boom!","A series of explosions erupted, forming a terrifying cyclone that swept out in all directions.","The instructors’ eyes widened as they saw Chu Yunfan stand his ground and not move an inch. He was like a majestic divine mountain—his clothes fluttering in the wind.","Even in the face of thousands of soldiers, Chu Yunfan was not the least bit affected.","“He hasn’t even used his sword. He can go against Mei Haiyun with his bare hands. How strong is his physical body?”","“Mei Haiyun has already stepped into the Innate level, yet Chu Yunfan isn’t at a disadvantage at all. Although he isn’t at the Innate level, he isn’t any weaker than the Innate level.”","“Oh my god, the students this year are too monstrous. There are actually two students in the first grade who are able to step into the Innate level. Compared to them, we really have no time to waste.”","At this moment, Mei Haiyun, who was in the ring, began to become anxious. This was because Chu Yunfan did not have any weaknesses. This was not at all what he had imagined. From performing his own attacks, he was now exhausted.","Chu Yunfan’s casual punches were able to break Mei Haiyun’s sword light. What kind of terrifying physique was this?","What was even more terrifying was Chu Yunfan’s speed. His punches were not considered any special techniques. He was purely relying on his extreme speed. This was even more terrifying than the brilliant sword techniques Mei Haiyun displayed.","Chu Yunfan felt his entire body boiling. Every drop of blood was burning. Among those of the same age, only Mei Haiyun could arouse such a feeling within him.","“This level alone is not enough to defeat me!” Chu Yunfan’s voice was like a bell, instantly reverberating throughout the entire arena.","“Unity of the Five Elements!”","At that moment, Mei Haiyun seized the opportunity. The sword light of the five elements swarmed around his body and instantly turned into a terrifying sword ray that was about a hundred feet long. The chaotic sword pierced through the clouds and rose up. Then, it slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","This was Mei Haiyun’s higher cultivation of the Five Elemental Swords. If Mei Haiyun was able to combine the five elements into one attack, he might have had a chance of defeating Chu Yunfan. But now, it was different. He was no match for Chu Yunfan.","This was because Chu Yunfan was also completely different from before.","Watch carefully now!” Chu Yunfan shouted as he drew the Ju Que on his back. As he brandished his sword, the entire sky seemed to shake. Countless airwaves instantly split apart, turning into a long dragon of air currents. He faced the united swords head-on.","“Sky Sword!”","Chu Yunfan displayed the Sky Sword of the World Overlord technique. This was a level that surpassed the Earth Sword. If the Earth Sword of the World Overlord was only an Acquired level martial skill, then the Sky Sword was without a doubt a martial skill that had stepped into the Innate level and was not inferior to the Five Elemental Swords","Rumble!","A terrifying attack erupted in an instant. The sword light of the united sword swept down. After being in a stalemate with Chu Yunfan’s Sky Sword for a split second, it was instantly defeated. There was simply no way for the stalemate to continue.","This attack swept across the sky, crossed space, and instantly shattered the light of the united sword, and the attack barreled into Mei Haiyun.","Mei Haiyun had no way of resisting. Facing Chu Yunfan who was using his full strength, he was completely unable to withstand a single blow.","Pfft!","Mei Haiyun spat out a mouthful of blood. He flew through the air before turning into a ball of light and disappearing from the arena.","The result of this battle was clear.","Chu Yunfan had won."]},{"number":605,"title":"Chapter 605 - Reputation Ferments and Danger","paragraphs":["Victory and defeat had been decided. Chu Yunfan defeated Mei Haiyun and took his place as the first of the year. This result was both within and beyond everyone’s expectations.","It was within their expectations because Chu Yunfan had already won first place at the Dao Conference. At that time, he had already defeated Mei Haiyun. They were already shocked once before so this was not much.","But from the perspective of the unexpected, Mei Haiyun displayed combat strength that exceeded everyone’s imagination. Even though it was only for a short period, he had unleashed the combat strength of the Innate Stage when he was at the peak of the Acquired Stage. Such combat strength had surpassed most of the people at Federation University. Regardless of whether it was the students or the instructors, only a small number of people were able to firmly suppress Mei Haiyun.","However, even with this kind of combat prowess, Mei Haiyun was still unable to withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan. From the start to the end, he had been completely suppressed by Chu Yunfan and was unable to retaliate.","This battle had happened under the crowd’s watchful eyes. Everyone knew that Chu Yunfan’s true combat prowess had probably already surpassed the Acquired Stage.","Previously, many had heard of Chu Yunfan defeating Wang Qi. However, there were not many who knew that Wang Qi had already stepped into the Innate Stage. It was only now that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had surpassed the Acquired Stage and the fact that he had entered the Innate Stage was finally made known to everyone.","The results of this battle revealed all of this.","Following the end of this year’s ranking competition, Chu Yunfan successfully ascended to the top, becoming one of the only four first seats at Federation University.","The results of this battle spread out at astonishing speed.","Everyone was not shocked that Chu Yunfan had obtained first place in the year, but rather, they were shocked by his breakthrough in strength. In everyone’s eyes, Chu Yunfan’s current true strength was unfathomable and unrivaled.","And the people paying attention to Federation University’s annual assessment were not just the people within the university. There were also experts from other sects paying attention to Chu Yunfan.","At Qinghua University, Situ Ziying had just defeated all of his opponents and easily won the first seat. However, when he heard about the battle at Federation University, he fell silent.","“Mei Haiyun. Chu Yunfan.”","Situ Ziying realized that these two were like two huge mountains that he could not surpass. When he had just stepped into the ninth level of the Acquired Stage whilst the two of them had already entered an Innate level battle.","“The Innate Stage?”","On Star Cluster Island, after Han Bing obtained detailed information about this battle, his expression turned grave. Almost immediately, he decided to enter seclusion.","...","For a moment, this battle made those geniuses who claimed to have outstanding talent fall silent. As the saying goes, “where there is strength, there is strength.” This battle made them realize the gap and they felt depressed.","The results of this battle continued to ferment. Previously, there were still some who were unconvinced by Chu Yunfan’s claim that he was the best among his peers. But now, even if they were unwilling to admit it, they had to admit that Chu Yunfan was comparable to them. There indeed was a real generational gap.","Video of this battle began to circulate on the virtual network. Not only Chu Yunfan’s peers, but even the sophomores, juniors, and even seniors began to study the flow of the battle.","This was the first time that Chu Yunfan’s battle video was so highly valued. It was collected by everyone and used as research information. Since he was so strong, there was no doubt that his future was limitless. At this moment, many started to gather his battle data.","There were even some decent analysis posts popping up on the Internet.","“The battle strength of both sides has clearly surpassed that of the Acquired Stage. That kind of battle is not something that an Acquired Stage can endure.”","“The True Energy of the Acquired Stage is limited. If a battle of this level were to be carried out, they would be completely exhausted in just a few moves.”","“Mei Haiyun is indeed worthy of being called a heaven-gifted genius. I’ve read up on his Five Elemental Swords. It’s a famous technique of the Mei family. For so many years, only Mei Haiyun has been able to master it without suffering any ill effects. The Meis were originally just a small family. However, following Mei Haiyun’s rise, their future became limitless.”","“The truly terrifying one is Chu Yunfan. Mei Haiyun broke through to the Innate level by relying on the use of runes. I’m certain that these runes are one-time use and can’t be reused. Chu Yunfan is different. He relied on his own strength to overcome this heavenly chasm that’s impossible to overcome.”","“That’s right. Did you notice that he fought against the Five Elemental Swords with his bare hands? According to our analysis of the Five Elemental Swords’ power, even a low-level mecha would’ve been torn apart. However, Chu Yunfan was able to receive it with his bare hands. Doesn’t that mean that the toughness of Chu Yunfan’s body is comparable to that of a mecha?”","“There are truly talented people emerging from every generation. How terrifying!”","As the analysis and commentary of these videos continued to ferment, Chu Yunfan’s reputation started to truly become known to everyone. As for the person in question, he had just obtained first place in the year and became one of the four first seats of Federation University.","But before Chu Yunfan could even catch his breath, he received a message on his terminal.","[Chu Yunfan, your friend, Gao Hongzhi, is in our hands. If you don’t want him to die, then surrender yourself. Don’t tell anyone. Otherwise, your friend won’t be able to hold on to his life.]","[You have two hours. If you miss the deadline, it won’t be our fault.]","There was a coordinate attached to the message as well.","“These people must be tired of living!” A fierce look flashed through Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","The first thing Chu Yunfan did was confirm Gao Hongzhi’s situation. As expected, he could not find Gao Hongzhi and he was not able to contact him.","Chu Yunfan could not contain his anger. He did not know who the other party was because there were too many who coveted the items in his possession, but he was sure that they were definitely targeting him.","“No matter who it is, I will make all of you pay the price!”","Chu Yunfan was burning with rage. The other party had used Gao Hongzhi to threaten him, and it had really hit his sore spot. He and Gao Hongzhi were like brothers, and he could not sit idly by.","Chu Yunfan did not have the time to think too much and hurriedly flew out of Federation University. No matter who it was, whoever dared to use Gao Hongzhi to threaten him, he would make the other party regret it.","At this moment, countless people were watching Chu Yunfan. Regardless of whether it was the Demon Descends Illustration or the Divine Ability monster’s inner core, they were both undoubtedly treasures that countless people coveted.","At Federation University, many did not stand a chance even if they wanted to make a move. The number of experts at Federation University was even more terrifying than a military fortress. However, once Chu Yunfan left the university, in the eyes of many, the opportunity finally came."]},{"number":606,"title":"Chapter 606 - Slaughtering the Dark Blood Pool Assassins","paragraphs":["“Chu Yunfan has finally stuck his head out of his shell.”","This news began to spread at an astonishing speed. For many who coveted the treasures in Chu Yunfan’s possession, this was undoubtedly a great piece of good news. He had finally emerged from the turtle shell that was Federation University.","“I’m going to get that inner core!”","“The Demon Descends Illustration is mine!”","In the darkness, an unknown number of eyes were spying on Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. From the moment he came out, these people who were itching to make a move finally began to take action.","This journey was destined to be extremely dangerous.","As he only had two hours, Chu Yunfan did not have much time. He needed to use all his strength to arrive at the given coordinates within two hours. The other party had obviously planned all of this. They did not give Chu Yunfan any extra time to think or prepare.","There was an endless forest outside Federation University. Compared to the vastness of the entire Kunlun Realm, this was just a small part that humans had managed to develop. Humans were still in the midst of expanding outward using the base city model.","Fortunately, the area near Federation University was cleaned up all year round. It was not like the more remote areas where one would encounter a group of monsters after just a few steps.","But at this moment, a rain of blood suddenly began to fall from the sky. Without any warning, it became torrential rain.","This endless rain of blood carried with it the strong stench of iron.","Chu Yunfan stopped. He felt that the raindrops were getting heavier and heavier. He realized that this blood rain had a corrosive effect. If an ordinary person was not careful, they might fall for it.","Chu Yunfan stopped at the first moment because he knew that someone was trying to ambush him. And it was not hard to guess who. It was one of the three major assassin organizations—the Dark Blood Pool.","Every time the Dark Blood Pool ambushed a person, it liked to create such an effect. It was not just to create fear. The blood rain also contained corrosive poison.","“Come out. Hehe. Dark Blood Pool. One of the three major assassin organizations. I’ve met the young lord of the Green Cloths, but he was nothing. Let’s see how capable the Dark Blood Pool is.”","Chu Yunfan was anxious because he did not have much time. However, he looked calm on the surface. He knew that the more this was the case, the calmer he needed to be. He could not be anxious.","“Hehe, Chu Yunfan, you’re really bold. The bounty on your head is sky-high. And you’ve finally come out of your shell. Hehehe!”","At this moment, in the midst of the blood rain, more than ten figures appeared before Chu Yunfan. Hidden within the blood rain, if one did not look carefully, one might even miss them.","These more than ten figures looked tall and big, but there was no spirit in their eyes. Only fierce killing intent.","“Blood Slaves.”","Chu Yunfan had read the encyclopedia and knew that this was a type of hired thug bred by the Dark Blood Pool called the Blood Slaves.","All of these Blood Slaves had been brainwashed by the Dark Blood Pool through a special method. They were manipulated experts because they had no concept of life and death. They were fearless and unafraid of death. This was the most difficult to deal with.","Since the Dark Blood Pool was one of the three major assassin organizations, it naturally had its own capabilities.","Chu Yunfan knew that although these Blood Slaves were very difficult to deal with, the real trouble was the person controlling them behind the scenes. Once they were killed, everything would be solved.","The Blood Slaves instantly surrounded him. They were all Acquired Stage experts. Acquired Stage Blood Slaves were considered elites even within the Dark Blood Pool. Moreover, these Blood Slaves were the best among the best. They were experts at the peak of the Acquired Stage.","In order to deal with Chu Yunfan, they had poured a lot of money into this.","“I don’t care what your plans are. Those who block me will die!”","Chu Yunfan did not have time to linger. He did not have much time left, so he had no other choice.","At this moment, the Blood Slaves had surrounded Chu Yunfan. Only the desire to kill was left in the minds of these Blood Slaves. They roared and charged at Chu Yunfan.","All kinds of weapons cut through the air and exploded with loud booms.","“You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan sneered and shouted, “Mantis Divine Kick!”","Chu Yunfan kicked out like a lightning bolt that tore through the night sky. His leg swept out like a sharp razor.","Previously, Chu Yunfan had been holding back when he was attacking back at the university, but after leaving the confines of the university and facing an assassin organization like the Dark Blood Pool, Chu Yunfan naturally held nothing back.","This kick landed on the head of a peak Acquired Stage Blood Slave, causing his entire head to explode. Naturally, he ceased to exist and collapsed into a pool of his own blood.","A huge price had to be paid for every Peak Acquired Stage Blood Slave. Even some of the geniuses from Federation University would have a headache when they encountered them. Yet, Chu Yunfan’s kick had blown up their heads, and the expression of the person hiding in the shadows instantly changed.","And this was only the beginning.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s kicks were so fast that they left afterimages. After using all his strength, the Blood Slaves that were charging at him were all killed in just a few breaths. All of them collapsed into pools of blood.","Chu Yunfan’s lethality when he was angered was truly terrifying.","The moment Chu Yunfan retracted his aura, a long saber that was as thin as a cicada’s wing suddenly appeared beside him. It sliced through the air and swept toward Chu Yunfan’s neck.","“Chu Yunfan! You’ve killed so many of my Blood Slaves! I want you to pay with your life!”","An explosive shout that contained extreme anger was heard from all directions. No one knew where the speaker was.","Clang!","The slash landed on Chu Yunfan’s neck, but only a sound like metal clashing could be heard.","The slash only sent sparks flying in all directions. There was no way to hurt Chu Yunfan at all.","Since the attack failed, the person immediately realized that there was a big problem and hurriedly tried to retreat. However, Chu Yunfan had been waiting for this opportunity. He had not hesitated to let the other party injure him with a slash.","At this moment, a hand reached out like lightning. It grabbed at the air, and Chu Yunfan managed to drag someone out.","That person had not expected that Chu Yunfan would be able to break his invisibility spell and was grabbed by Chu Yunfan at the neck. He did not even have time to react before Chu Yunfan crushed his head. In an instant, fresh blood spurted out and landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, which was then bounced away by True Energy.","“Piece of trash.”","Chu Yunfan sneered and flew into the distance."]},{"number":607,"title":"Chapter 607 - The Corpses of the Dark Blood Pool Assassins","paragraphs":["The young lord of the Dark Blood Pool never thought that he would be killed so easily. He thought that Chu Yunfan was a soft persimmon that could be easily crushed. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be so terrifying when he was in a rage?","The young lord was killed on the spot without any time to prepare for it. Although he had entered the Innate Stage, in terms of direct combat strength, the difference between him and Chu Yunfan was too great.","The young lord was killed in a single move.","After killing the young lord of the Dark Blood Pool, Chu Yunfan did not stop and continued to rush toward the coordinates.","Not long after Chu Yunfan killed the young lord of the Dark Blood Pool, a group of people rushed over. All of them carried extremely valiant auras. They had clearly tracked Chu Yunfan to this point. And they had not expected to see a scene of Dark Blood Pool member corpses strewn all across the ground.","Everyone’s faces revealed a hint of disbelief. The Dark Blood Pool had always been arrogant and despotic. They had even carried out an assassination on the president and succeeded. They spared not a single glance for ordinary folk.","The young lord of the Dark Blood Pool often targeted people who were the top young talents of the world. An ordinary person would not be qualified to be killed by the Dark Blood Pool.","At the same time, the strength of the young lord was also unquestionable. An ordinary person would be terrified when they heard his name.","An ordinary young talent would be considered lucky if they could escape from their assassination, not to mention that there were corpses all over the place.","“There’s no mistake. I’ve tested it. It’s the young lord of the Dark Blood Pool. He passed the debut assessment five years ago and once killed a young talent that attracted the attention of the world. The Federation has put out a bounty of over 50 million for his head.” One of them confirmed the identity of the young lord who was lying in a pool of blood.","“I’ve heard that once the Dark Blood Pool makes a move against someone, they will fight to the death. Everything is just as expected. For a rising star like Chu Yunfan, they had sent out so many Blood Slaves. Coupled with the young lord, even an experienced Innate expert might suffer,” another person said.","“However, the truly terrifying thing is that the ones who fell were actually the Dark Blood Pool. Dozens of Blood Slaves, coupled with their young lord, actually suffered such a crushing defeat. All of them were killed with a single strike. Some of them had their heads blown off, while others were kicked in the gut till they died. Their techniques were clean and neat, and they didn’t use any second moves,” the leader of the group said with a solemn expression. “Looks like all our estimations of Chu Yunfan were wrong. His strength has probably already reached the Innate Stage.”","After Chu Yunfan had completed the annual assessment, the leader instantly received the news and hurriedly came out. And although Chu Yunfan’s performance in the annual assessment was shocking, those who coveted the treasures in his possession did not have the time to listen to this news.","“Continue the chase. We must catch up to Chu Yunfan. We can’t let the others succeed,” the leader quickly said. To him, it was not only snatching the items in Chu Yunfan’s possession but also getting them before anyone else did.","There were definitely more than one or two who coveted the items in Chu Yunfan’s possession. These treasures would even lure out some old monsters. Nobody knew who their enemies were, so the only thing they could do was to get ahead of the others.","After this group of people left, just a few moments later, another group of people caught up to them. They too saw the Dark Blood Pool assassins lying dead on the ground.","After a short time, they also came to the same conclusion. Their expressions became even more solemn.","Groups of people rushed over one after another. Soon, the news that the Dark Blood Pool had fallen at Chu Yunfan’s hands began to spread. There was no such thing as an impenetrable wall. Especially since Chu Yunfan had immediately left after killing them, there was no way to cover up the situation.","The only difference was how much time it would take.","Chu Yunfan was anxious, but his expression did not change. Only his tightly clenched fists revealed the anxiety in his heart.","However, Chu Yunfan’s trip was too eye-catching for many people.","In the sky, an aircraft flew past, and a group of about forty to fifty mercenaries parachuted their way down in front of Chu Yunfan. All of these mercenaries had extremely valiant auras. From afar, just their aura alone was enough to scare an ordinary person.","Chu Yunfan did not care at all and walked forward.","“Chu Yunfan, hand over the Demon Descends Illustration and the inner core. Otherwise, don’t blame us for not being polite,” one of the mercenaries said. His aura was obviously much stronger than the other mercenaries.","All of these mercenaries were only at the Acquired Stage. Some of them were at the peak of the Acquired Stage, while the rest were at ordinary Acquired Stage martial artists.","Such a lineup was undoubtedly very shocking for a mercenary group. They must have been the elites of the entire mercenary group.","And the mercenary who spoke was obviously much stronger. He had stepped into the Innate Stage, which was why he did not fear Chu Yunfan at all. After all, in his heart, no matter how strong Chu Yunfan was, he was only a freshman.","“Pieces of trash,” Chu Yunfan said coldly as he glanced at these mercenaries. “All those who get in my way will die.”","“You still dare to be so arrogant? Go! The one who kills him will be awarded 50 million!” the leader of the mercenary group said in anger upon seeing that Chu Yunfan still dared to say such arrogant words.","The eyes of those dozens of people immediately lit up. 50 million was undoubtedly an astronomical amount of money for these bloodthirsty mercenaries. After receiving this huge amount of money, they could retire. They would not have to live on the knife’s edge every day.","After all, not everyone liked this kind of life. It was just to make a living.","The dozens of people were like tigers. For the reward of tens of millions, they did their best. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was no longer a human, but a string of numbers.","“Stubborn. In that case, all of you can go to hell.” Chu Yunfan’s expression became increasingly cold. He knew that there were too many who coveted the items in his possession. The moment he stepped foot out of Federation University, he would become everyone’s target.","Normally, it would be fine. However, Chu Yunfan only had a total of two hours to save Gao Hongzhi. After factoring out the time it took to reach his destination, he did not have much time left. Those who stood in his way would die.","The huge sword behind Chu Yunfan struck out.","Voom!","With a loud rumble, the Ju Que began to roar. With a slash, as if it had been calculated, an expert from the mercenary group charged forward and was struck by the sword.","Slash!","The mercenary group expert did not even have time to scream before he was cut in half.","A bloody massacre began."]},{"number":608,"title":"Chapter 608 - Killing Them All","paragraphs":["Chu Yunfan held back when attacking within the city, so he naturally could not be considered completely unrestrained.","However, it was different now. The terrifying power of Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique could be completely unleashed.","It was extremely powerful. With a single slash, two or three people were killed. In addition, Chu Yunfan was frighteningly fast. Every slash was as fast as lightning. The eyes of ordinary people could not keep up with such speed.","In just a short moment, Chu Yunfan had killed more than ten people. Under the attacks of more than ten people, he was completely impenetrable in both offense and defense. Not only was he able to defend himself steadily, but he was also able to kill them.","There was no doubting the astonishing efficiency of this killing technique.","It even stunned these mercenaries who had experienced countless killings. They were considered seasoned killers, but facing someone like Chu Yunfan who cut down people like he was cutting down weeds, it was the first time they had seen anyone kill in such a way.","This was far more terrifying than death.","They were not killing machines like the Blood Slaves who had lost all concept of death. They had come to kill Chu Yunfan because of the high reward. However, this was not as important as their lives.","There were so many of them that had come to surround and kill Chu Yunfan, yet they could not see any hope. They were instantly overcome by fear and this caused them to hesitate.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had already killed many members of the mercenary group. This undoubtedly made the leader very angry.","“Time. We just need more time. The master is on his way. As long as we delay him, he’ll be dead meat!” the leader of the mercenary group said loudly.","“We just need to delay him!","“Get into formation. Delay him!","“Just hold out for a bit longer!”","Hearing their leader say this, the expressions on the mercenaries’ faces changed. In a short period, they had completely changed their original goal.","With Chu Yunfan’s fierce performance, they did not dare to hope of killing him. But at the very least, they had to delay him.","Their faces showed determination once again, and their morale was boosted.","“Delay me?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He knew that he could not afford to be delayed now. Otherwise, the many people behind him would pounce on him like wild beasts who had picked up on the scent of blood.","At that time, even if he wanted to escape, Chu Yunfan would have to face wave after wave of people with evil intentions.","Most importantly, Chu Yunfan did not have much time. He had to get to the coordinates within two hours.","These mercenaries quickly formed a battle formation and charged toward Chu Yunfan once again.","“World Overlord!”","Chu Yunfan roared and his body swayed. In a few steps, he charged into the middle of the battle formation.","Seven to eight weapons were stabbed at Chu Yunfan at the same time. However, before they could stab him, they were hit by the Ju Que.","All sorts of weapons collided violently with the gigantic sword. These people instantly felt as if they had been struck by lightning. It was as if they had suffered an extremely heavy blow. They lost control of the weapons in their hands. In an instant, all of their weapons were flung out of their hands.","Their first reaction was to retreat, but how could Chu Yunfan give them such an opportunity? With a shake of his wrist, the Ju Que in his hand swept out with a terrifying sword ray.","Slash!","Slash!","Slash!","The terrifying sword ray swept across the bodies of these people, causing them to scream in pain and fly backward. All of them were left with fatal wounds and died instantly.","“Chu Yunfan!”","When the leader saw that Chu Yunfan had killed another seven or eight people in one breath, he could not contain his anger. His heart bled. These were the elites among the elites of their mercenary group. Such large numbers of elites could not be found in other large mercenary groups like theirs. But now, they were all cut down like mowed grass.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was undoubtedly beyond his expectations. If his combat strength had only been at the Acquired Stage, these people would undoubtedly be enough to kill Chu Yunfan. But now, his strength was at least ten times more terrifying than they had expected. Their numbers did not matter.","Boom!","The instantly leader rushed forward as if he wanted to shatter the sky. He swept up a terrifying pressure and aimed it toward Chu Yunfan.","The terrifying aura was like a vast ocean. Like wave after wave of killing. And Chu Yunfan was like a small boat. No matter how many waves there were, it was not enough to destroy him.","This was a battle between Innate level experts. The many Acquired experts were forced to the side and could not get close. This was not a battle level that they could interfere in.","The leader was furious. He thrust out his spear, and each spear burst out with a booming sound and a brilliant spear light.","However, Chu Yunfan was not the slightest bit afraid.","“King of the Jungle!”","Chu Yunfan’s terrifyingly dense True Energy blasted out along with this punch and faced the spear head-on.","Boom!","A huge explosion went off, and Chu Yunfan blocked the spear with his bare hands. The terrifying fist force swept out, and the True Energy of the Emperor Method that was even tougher than Innate-level True Energy instantly dispersed the spear light.","Voom!","Unable to hold out, the leader hastily retreated. His hands holding on to his spear were shaking violently, and a surge of True Energy was wreaking havoc on the weapon.","“What great strength. How is this possible?”","This was the first time that the leader truly felt Chu Yunfan’s terror and difficulty. He understood why his men had appeared so weak when facing Chu Yunfan previously. It was not that they were too useless, but that Chu Yunfan was truly terrifying.","“Mantis Divine Kick!”","And just as the leader was still in shock, Chu Yunfan’s next wave of attacks had already swept across.","Chu Yunfan’s leg swept across the sky like a comet, directly sweeping toward the leader.","Bam!","The leader barely had time to raise his spear to resist before he was hit. Immediately, he spat out a mouthful of blood. He was unable to stand, and he continuously retreated. The Innate True Energy protecting his body surface had been instantly shattered.","Spurt!","The leader kept retreating, but his retreat speed was unable to catch up with Chu Yunfan’s attack speed. The Ju Que followed him like a shadow.","“Sky Sword!”","The sword swept out and the leader let out a blood-curdling scream. He was slashed into two halves and died miserably."]},{"number":609,"title":"Chapter 609 - Shocked","paragraphs":["The situation had changed too quickly. Just when the remaining experts of the mercenary group thought that they could turn the tables, their vice-leader, who was a genuine Innate expert, had been killed by Chu Yunfan within just a few moves.","Everything had happened too quickly and too suddenly. They did not even have time to prepare before it had already happened.","Even battles between Innate experts did not reach such a sudden ending. It would usually take a long time for the victor to be decided. But now, within a short time, the victor of this battle had been decided.","This was because the difference in strength was too big. Although the leader had already stepped into the Innate Stage, his strength was at most similar to Wang Qi’s. It was impossible for him to be a match for Chu Yunfan.","The outcome of the battle was decided in just a few moves. The leader had been too careless. He thought that he was an Innate expert, but after fighting Chu Yunfan, he was easily killed.","“This is more trouble than it’s worth. Retreat!”","The remaining mercenaries looked at each other and instantly made a decision. They immediately retreated. They did not even dare to think about taking revenge. What a joke. This guy was simply a super killer. How would they dare to stay?","“You want to leave? You’ve wasted so much of my time and now you’re trying to leave?!”","Chu Yunfan’s killing intent exploded. He was originally in a hurry, but these people had come at him menacingly. Naturally, he was not about to let them go.","These mercenary group’s experts were all experienced. The remaining dozen or so frantically fled in all directions. However, they did not know that to Chu Yunfan, numbers were meaningless.","Chu Yunfan chased after them. Although they fled in all directions, their speed could not compare to his. In just a short moment, he caught up to and killed them all, leaving no one behind.","Following that, Chu Yunfan disappeared into the forest and continued to fly in the direction of the coordinates.","Not long after Chu Yunfan’s departure, another group of people arrived. They were the people who were chasing after Chu Yunfan.","They too moved quickly. Chu Yunfan was delayed for only a short while and they managed to catch up to him.","“They all died in one strike. As expected, just like those people from the Dark Blood Pool, they’re all dead. Even Acquired Stage experts can’t withstand a single strike from Chu Yunfan. Even Innate Stage experts can’t escape death,” one of them said with an incomparably solemn expression after confirming the situation.","“This confirms his strength. How on Earth has he trained to reach such a stage?!” another person spoke up.","“I just received news that Chu Yunfan displayed Innate-level strength during Federation University’s annual assessment.”","This person’s words caused the entire team to turn solemn. Chasing after an Acquired Stage expert and chasing after an Innate Stage expert were two completely different matters.","“Looks like there’s no mistake. Be it the Dark Blood Pool or the Thunderbolt mercenary group, they had placed a lot of importance on Chu Yunfan. They have to give it their all for a junior like him. If Chu Yunfan is just an ordinary peak Acquired Stage expert, this configuration would’ve been enough to kill him,” the leader of this group of people said.","“Our previous estimations were all wrong. Our calculations were all based on the fact that he had not stepped into the Innate Stage. However, if he has stepped into the Innate Stage and his strength is so savage, then our plans will have to change. At the very least, I don’t dare to say that I would be a match for him.","“Request for reinforcements from headquarters. We must seize the items in his possession before they’re taken by someone else!”","Very quickly, this group made their decision. They immediately began chasing after the footprints Chu Yunfan left behind.","Following that, a few more groups of people rushed over. They all came to the same conclusion. Including the experts from the Dark Blood Pool that Chu Yunfan had killed previously, Chu Yunfan displayed an astonishing combat strength that was not shown in the original intelligence reports. This caused these people to urgently adjust their strategies.","In order to prevent any accidents, they had to send even more powerful experts over.","After another ten minutes, a fighter jet flew over from the sky. Soon enough, a group of people landed where the corpses of the Thunderbolts lay.","One of them had a muscular figure and looked extraordinary and he was leading the group. He was the leader of the Thunderbolt mercenary group. Since this group dared to openly chase after Chu Yunfan, it was natural that their leader was not an unknown person.","Not everyone could withstand the revenge of Federation University, and the Thunderbolts were one of the top 100 mercenary groups within the Federation. They had many Innate experts within their ranks.","Although they were only in the top 100, it was already considered very high among the hundreds of thousands of mercenary groups.","And their leader, Zhang Leiting, was a famous Innate expert. His might shook the world.","At this moment, looking at the corpses on the ground, Zhang Leiting’s expression turned ugly. From the moment he received the news, he had set off as fast as he could. It had only been fifteen minutes since he had departed from the base. He thought that nothing would happen in such a short time. After all, he believed in the strength of his vice-leader.","However, when Zhang Leiting arrived, all he saw were corpses on the ground. The elites and experts of the mercenary group behind him quickly inspected the corpses.","“All of them were killed with a single strike. They didn’t even have the strength to fight back. There aren’t too many wounds on the vice leader’s body. The battle ended quickly.”","As they analyzed the situation, they were able to outline a portion of the battle situation. Although it was not a complete picture, it was enough to determine how Chu Yunfan had swept to the end.","It was not difficult to figure out that Chu Yunfan had the upper hand.","Their expressions turned ugly. After all, they thought that Chu Yunfan was just a rising star. It was just that this rising star had treasures in his possession. Otherwise, it would be difficult for him to be noticed by them.","It was only meaningful when a genius grew up. They had seen too many people die in the process.","However, from the looks of it, Chu Yunfan was no longer a greenhorn. He had stepped into the Innate Stage. No one would treat him as fletching anymore.","“Chase after him. We must catch up to him. I didn’t want to offend Jeang Yuanbin too much. I only wanted to snatch the inner core and the illustration that he possessed. But now, I must tear him to pieces. Otherwise, how can I comfort the souls of my dead brothers?!”"]},{"number":610,"title":"Chapter 610 - The Lightning Winged Beast Came Out","paragraphs":["Chu Yunfan was madly rushing forward, but the craze that he had caused was just beginning.","Many people were either chasing after Chu Yufnan from behind or trying to block his path from the front.","Because his appearance had been too sudden, many had not been prepared. The battle was about to erupt.","Everything happened too suddenly. It could have been considered a sudden turn of events. After receiving the news, quite a number of people from all over rushed over to stop Chu Yunfan.","Soon after, the results of the encounters were quickly spread out. It undoubtedly shook the entire circle.","Many in this circle had ill intentions toward Chu Yunfan. However, it was clear that their previous judgment of his strength had been completely wrong. It had only been a few months since the Dao Conference, yet Chu Yunfan’s strength had already undergone an earth-shattering change.","Most importantly, Chu Yunfan had stepped into the Innate Stage. In the Federation, stepping into the Innate Stage meant stepping into the ranks of the experts. It was not just Chu Yunfan’s age that allowed him to become an expert in a certain circle.","Many of the veteran experts at the peak of the Acquired Stage who had wanted to try their luck had no choice but to stop their plans, even though obtaining the illustration and the inner core might be their only chance to break through to the Innate Stage.","However, as experts who had been through thick and thin for so many years, they knew that after Chu Yunfan had stepped into the Innate Stage, he was no longer someone they could interfere with. Rashly participating in a fight between experts of another level was undoubtedly a path to death.","After the Thunderbolts, another two groups of corpses strewn across the ground. The same as before, they all lay dead. And this time, an even more serious situation occurred. Perhaps because they had learned from the lessons of the Dark Blood Pool and the Thunderbolts, these two groups had attacked with the might of several Innate experts at the same time.","However, without exception, they were all annihilated.","“What the... It doesn’t seem like they were attacked to death. Instead, it seems like they encountered monsters!” The Thunderbolt’s leader, Zhang Leiting, who was chasing after Chu Yunfan, looked at the densely packed battlefield which had over a hundred experts lying dead, fresh blood soaking the ground.","The smell of blood had attracted many monsters to wander outside the battlefield. However, they seemed to have sensed a terrifying aura and did not dare to casually approach.","“That’s right. It doesn’t seem like humans ambushed them. It must have been monsters,” another expert who identified the traces said with a serious expression.","Several Innate experts and dozens of Acquired Stage experts were completely annihilated. Moreover, from the situation at the scene, it looked like they had not been able to withstand even a single blow. Everyone was killed in one blow. This was no ordinary monster.","“They’re all well-known figures. There are people from the Bloodcrow mercenary group, people from the Soul-Killer Butterfly pioneer group, and a few lone figures. They’re all Innate experts. The strongest ones are even in the fourth level of the Innate Stage. The weaker ones have already stepped into the Innate Stage. Each of them has a reputation. Now, all of them have died here.”","“Everyone, be careful,” Zhang Leiting said with a solemn expression.","If there were monsters of this level, even elite troops like them could be wiped out. In the history of human exploration, there have been many cases of complete annihilation.","However, when Zhang Leiting thought of his subordinates that Chu Yunfan had slaughtered, he could not control his anger. He had completely forgotten that he was the one who had sent people to ambush Chu Yunfan first.","To Zhang Leiting, he had originally only wanted to seize the inner core and the illustration. Only after many of his subordinates had died did he feel that he and Chu Yunfan would not rest until one of them was dead. He had to kill Chu Yunfan to vent the hatred in his heart.","However, Zhang Leiting did not know that in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, it was already a fight to the death if they wanted to seize the inner core and the illustration. There was no room for maneuver.","At this moment, in the forest, a figure was jumping around like a blue lightning bolt. and above this blue lightning-like figure was a human figure.","That person was none other than Chu Yunfan. And the creature Chu Yunfan was sitting on was none other than the Thunder Winged Beast.","The Thunder Winged Beast, which had been digesting and swallowing the peak Innate Stage monster’s inner core in Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram for more than half a year, had finally completely digested the inner core.","Among the people who had stopped Chu Yunfan before, there had been several Innate experts. The strong ones had even stepped into the fourth level of the Innate Stage. Such peak experts were not considered weak among Innate experts.","Encountering those people, Chu Yunfan would not have been a match without his trump card. However, in front of the Thunder Winged Beast, which had just come out of seclusion, they were nothing.","After coming out of seclusion, the Thunder Winged Beast’s strength had broken through from the Acquired Stage to the Innate Stage. Moreover, it had advanced by leaps and bounds, reaching the seventh level of the Innate Stage in one fell swoop.","Even among the experts in the seventh level of the Innate Stage, the Thunder Winged Beast was an absolute powerhouse.","Compared to the Innate experts that were chasing after Chu Yunfan, there was a fundamental difference. Moreover, they had never thought of the existence of the Thunder Winged Beast. In many of the intelligence reports regarding Chu Yunfan, the Thunder Winged Beast was also rarely mentioned. Even if it was mentioned, it had been said to only be in the Sea Qi Stage, not even at the Acquired Stage.","Naturally, they did not take the beast seriously. The Thunder Winged Beast had the potential to step into the Divine Abilities Stage, but that was only potential. It was not an existence of that level just yet.","And it was precisely the Thunder Winged Beast that they disregarded that gave them a fatal blow. When they were besieging Chu Yunfan, the Thunder Winged Beast appeared like lightning and cooperated with Chu Yunfan to kill them.","Finally, after more than an hour of running, the Thunder Winged Beast finally finished digesting the monster’s inner core. It came out of seclusion and carried Chu Yunfan on its back for the rest of the journey. It saved Chu Yunfan at least half an hour of time.","Chu Yunfan finally arrived at the outskirts of the coordinates he had been given. He had arrived at an incomparably huge mountain forest. There were huge trees everywhere that blotted out the sky and covered the Sun. From within this area, came the roars of many monsters. From time to time, the loud sounds of huge beasts moving would burst out like thunder.","The entire area was a desolate scene.","After Chu Yunfan got down from the Thunder Winged Beast, he stowed it back into the Mountain River Diagram. Now that the Thunder Winged Beast’s strength had increased greatly after coming out of seclusion, without a doubt, it had already become one of his trump cards.","If Chu Yunfan used it well, it would undoubtedly have an unexpected effect, just like how he killed those Innate experts who had gotten in his way."]},{"number":611,"title":"Chapter 611 - I Want All of You to Pay the Price","paragraphs":["Chu Yunfan stood rooted to the ground. Through his terminal, he discovered electromagnetic interference. It was obvious that an inescapable net had been set up here. It was waiting for him to come and throw his life away.","Everything was already prepared. The other party had clearly not set up this trap on a whim. They were definitely well prepared.","“I don’t care who you are. I’ll make you regret making this decision,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","Chu Yunfan did not know who was behind this. However, there were only a few who had the guts to kidnap someone from Federation University. There were probably not many who had the confidence to face a counterattack from Federation University.","The other party clearly hoped for Chu Yunfan to come and throw his life away. However, he did not come unprepared.","Chu Yunfan was here to save people. Not die.","Everyone had underestimated the trump cards Chu Yunfan had at this moment. They thought that they had already seen through his strength. They thought that the Innate Stage was his limit.","However, Chu Yunfan had the Demon Descends Illustration in his possession. Once it was unleashed, its power would be extremely terrifying. Previously, he had unleashed battle prowess that far surpassed the Innate Stage and easily killed the Blood Prince.","And now, Chu Yunfan’s strength and cultivation level were no longer the same as before. Naturally, the illustration would play a great role.","On top of that, Chu Yunfan had on him the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill. He had originally planned to use it together with the Innate Pill to break through to the Innate Stage when it was time. But now, it looked like it could not wait until then.","The effects of the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill was the same as the One-Stripe Purple-gold Pill. Not only would it greatly increase the consumer’s strength, but it would also rise very quickly.","This was one of the trump cards in Chu Yunfan’s hands. That was why he dared to come here even though he knew that the other party had set up an inescapable net. If he came recklessly without being fully prepared, he would really be courting death.","And on the way here, the Thunder Winged Beast had finished digesting the inner core and broke through to the seventh level of the Innate Stage. This was great news for Chu Yunfan. He now had another trump card that was enough to determine victory.","Although the Thunder Winged Beast’s strength was still far from that terrifying peak Innate giant python, just absorbing the inner core was enough for the Thunder Winged Beast to reach such a realm. This was enough to prove the strength of the Thunder Winged Beast’s Innate bloodline.","The more outstanding the Innate genetic bloodline was, the more one could absorb, and naturally, grow faster. If it was an ordinary person, they would not be able to absorb it at all. Forcefully absorbing such energy would only result in self-destruction. This was a very real possibility.","One trump card after another stacked together, giving Chu Yunfan absolute confidence. No matter who it was, they would have to pay the absolute price.","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath and then strode into the forest. As expected, an inescapable net had been buried in the forest. From afar, dozens of mechas flew toward him at high speed. The levels of these mechas were a mix of highs and lows. Most of them were basic mechas, while eight of them were intermediate mechas.","Chu Yunfan’s expression became increasingly cold. This was clearly a big deal. Even a basic mecha would not be inferior to ordinary peak Acquired Stage experts in terms of combat strength. Intermediate mechas, on the other hand, were comparable to Innate Stage experts.","These dozens of mecha surrounded Chu Yunfan.","“What a big deal. To kill little old me, you’ve sent out such a large lineup. Should I say it’s an honor?” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","“Chu Yunfan, you clearly know that this is an inescapable net, yet you still dared to come. At least you have guts,” a female voice came from afar.","A bright red intermediate mecha flew over. The mask of this mecha opened up to reveal Jiang Feiyan’s face. Seeing Chu Yunfan’s calm expression, she was a little surprised. This was because when Chu Yunfan saw her, he did not look surprised at all.","“Aren’t you surprised to see me?” Jiang Feiyan asked.","“I’ve considered a lot of possibilities during the one-hour journey here. As for who is most likely to target me, the Jiangs are naturally at the top of the list, and you’re on my list of suspects,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","The moment Chu Yunfan received the news, his brain began to operate at a rapid speed, deducing all sorts of possibilities. And among them, the Jiangs were naturally the top suspects.","“The Jiangs are indeed one of the eight great families. Casually mobilizing so many mecha. In terms of deep foundations, it is indeed impressive,” Chu Yunfan said.","Humans originally did not have an advantage in terms of quantity and quality when compared to monsters. Furthermore, the path of martial arts was much more difficult for humans compared to monsters that could become very powerful by relying on their gifted bloodlines.","At this time, the appearance of mechas were the sharp weapons that humans used to contend against monsters. Therefore, the Federation Government had always been very strict with the control of mechas. Yet, the Jiangs were able to casually deploy so many of them. This was proof of the Jiangs’ deep foundation and strength.","“I didn’t expect you to have such foresight. But it’s such a pity. Ever since you became enemies with our family, everything has been destined. A wise man submits to circumstances. Hand over those two items and you’ll be granted a quick death,” Jiang Feiyan’s face revealed a look of triumph.","Previously, Chu Yunfan had casually sent Jiang Feiyan flying with a slap. He did not even look at her and treated her like a piece of trash. But now, he was going to die in her hands. There was probably no better way to reflect the retribution of the heavenly Dao than this.","The thought of Chu Yunfan crying in front of her made Jiang Feiyan extremely happy.","“Of course, if you’re willing to kneel down and beg for mercy, I might let you live for a while longer.”","Chu Yunfan glanced at Jiang Feiyan and did not take her words seriously. He merely said, “Where’s my brother? Now that I’m here, you can let him go.”","“Bring him here.”","As soon as Jiang Feiyan’s voice fell, a figure flew over. This figure was none other than Elder Guan whom Chu Yunfan had previously defeated.","Elder Guan had just recovered after receiving treatment these past few days. The moment he laid eyes on Chu Yunfan again, it was natural that his eyes flashed red. The look he was giving Chu Yunfan was filled with killing intent. Ever since he had stepped into the Innate Stage, he had never suffered such a huge loss.","The figure that Elder Guan was holding was none other than Gao Hongzhi. At this moment, Gao Hongzhi had been tortured to the point that he no longer looked human. There were not many parts of his body that were intact, and many of his bones could be seen."]},{"number":612,"title":"Chapter 612 - The Inescapable Net","paragraphs":["Elder Guan threw Gao Hongzhi toward Chu Yunfan as if he did not care at all. After all, it was just a bargaining chip to attract Chu Yunfan here. As long as he came, it was enough.","In their eyes, the current Chu Yunfan could only be described with the words, “a turtle in a jar.”","Everything was under control.","Chu Yunfan caught Gao Hongzhi and had only touched him lightly. Yet Gao Hongzhi could not help but frown and let out muffled groans. It was obvious that he had more than one or two broken bones. That was why he felt intense pain after just a slight touch.","Chu Yunfan did not say anything. He just gently put Gao Hongzhi down and opened up the space within the Mountain River Diagram. Chu Yunfan stored all kinds of healing pills inside. He poured them into Gao Hongzhi’s mouth as if they were free.","Jiang Feiyan and Elder Guan were both dumbfounded. What were they looking at? A space had suddenly opened up in midair.","What did this mean? It meant that this was a spatial treasure.","Once this news was spread out, the experts of the Federation would probably take action. Its value was higher than that of the Demon Descends Illustration and the inner core of a Divine Ability Stage monster.","The space-folding technology had always been a difficult problem for the Federation. Through the excavation of Ancient Zenith Civilization remains, the Federation had gained quite a number of spatial equipment. All of which had been refined by top experts from the Ancient Zenith Civilization.","However, if this number were to be distributed among the countless experts now, it would be as rare as phoenix feathers or qilin horns. They were all controlled by families, financial groups, and government departments. It was not as if there were no individuals who possessed such equipment, but only the top experts at the Divine Ability Stage would have such things.","This was because there were too little of these items. Other than the few pieces of equipment that an individual had control over, most of them were used as strategic equipment. It was especially convenient in the transportation of strategic materials and so on.","Therefore, the appearance of any spatial equipment would cause a sensation. Until the day spatial equipment could be mass-produced and spread to the general public, the price of spatial equipment would most likely never drop.","And Chu Yunfan actually had spatial equipment. This was something that even Jiang Feiyan and the others had not expected.","If that were the case, then the added-up value of the items in Chu Yunfan’s possession would be hard to estimate. Killing him was not just to eliminate a future trouble, it was also an unexpected gain.","Just the items that Chu Yunfan had exposed were already priceless.","“I didn’t know you had something like that on you. Looks like I’m in luck,” a cold voice said.","A man about 50 years old, came through the sky. Step by step, he came.","‘A high-level Innate master!’","Chu Yunfan’s pupils contracted slightly. Whether it was Jiang Feiyan who was wearing an intermediate mecha or Elder Guan, they were nothing in his eyes. However, he felt an immense threat once this person appeared.","This was definitely not any Innate level expert that Chu Yunfan had met before. Even if this man could not compare to Jeang Yuanbin, he was definitely far above Jiang Lingxiao.","Innate experts could control the Spirit Energy of nature to a certain extent, so they could create such an astonishing scene of flying through the air. They were only half a step away from true flight.","Of course, only top experts who had developed supernatural abilities had the ability to fly. This was because flying was not a martial arts technique, but a kind of supernatural ability.","What was a supernatural ability? It was something that completely went against all sorts of rules and inconceivable things. It was a supernatural ability that allowed a human, who did not have wings, to fly.","Ordinary Innate masters would not be so calm and collected. Only Innate Masters above the seventh level of the Innate Stage could control the Spirit Energy of nature to such an extent. Of course, the consumption of True Energy was also very shocking.","Experts of such a level were extremely rare in society. Reaching the Innate Stage from the peak of the Acquired Stage depended on luck. And the probability of an Innate expert being able to cultivate to the peak of seventh level of the Innate Stage or above was one in a hundred.","Otherwise, Jeang Yuanbin’s status in Federation University would not be so high, and he would be on equal footing with the university leaders.","In order to kill Chu Yunfan, the Jiangs had really put in a lot of capital.","Chu Yunfan recognized this man. The Jiang family’s Jiang Ruoxu was mentioned in the Encyclopedia of Cultivation. There was a list of experts in the encyclopedia, and those who were able to enter this list were all famous experts.","Even if the students of Federation University met them, it would be best for them to flee immediately. This was because there was no chance of victory. Even for a heaven-gifted genius like Jiang Lingxiao, it would be considered good enough if he could survive.","“The Jiangs will not be able to take away this spatial equipment so easily.”","At this moment, an old man dressed in a long black robe appeared from afar. It was as though he was flying through the sky.","This old man’s aura was not inferior to Jiang Ruoxu’s. This was also a top-tier expert that was mentioned in the encyclopedia. However, he was not an expert of the Jiang family. Instead, he belonged to the other one of the Great Eights—a top-tier expert of the Huang family.","Huang Du!","Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm. As expected, it was far from just the Jiangs. Even the Huangs had joined in.","Such a lineup could be described as luxurious!","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan sensed from afar that dozens of figures had surrounded this place, forming the outermost perimeter of this encirclement. Their positions caused his pupils to slightly contract. It was a kind of formation.","As for the auras of those people and the experts of the Jiangs surrounding Chu Yunfan, it was another matter. It was obvious that the cultivation techniques they cultivated were different. They belonged to a different system.","They must be the experts of the Huang family.","The Jiangs and the Huangs added up to over a hundred experts. Among them, there were more than twenty people who were in the Innate Stage and above. In addition, there were also Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du, who were extremely terrifying big shots.","Regardless of whether it was to encircle or suppress anyone, escape was almost impossible. No one could escape from this encirclement.","“No matter what we decide to do with it, we have to kill this kid first. We’ll divide whatever we find on him,” Jiang Ruoxu said.","Jiang Ruoxu already regarded Chu Yunfan as a dead person. It did not matter when Chu Yunfan died.","“All right then.” Huang Du too knew that the most important thing was to kill Chu Yunfan. In his eyes, Chu Yunfan would not be able to withstand even a single one of his blows. Chu Yunfan’s existence made the Jiangs and the Huangs feel as if they had a fishbone stuck in their throats.","Chu Yunfan had grown up too quickly and was too frightening. It would be best if he did not offend such a person. But now that he has, the best thing to do was to exterminate him.","Since ancient times, there have been many geniuses who have died prematurely. When geniuses died prematurely, they were just ordinary people."]},{"number":613,"title":"Chapter 613 - Why Are You in Such a Hurry? Are You That Eager to Die?!","paragraphs":["At this moment, when Jiang Ruoxu looked at Chu Yunfan again, his gaze changed. His eyes were filled with shocking killing intent.","Jiang Ruoxu had read the information regarding Chu Yunfan. Originally, he was a little puzzled as to why the family would place so much importance on such a lowly junior. To a behemoth like the Jiang family, any kind of genius was meaningless.","This was because the Jiangs did not rely on one or two geniuses to grow. Instead, countless people worked together to form the behemoth of one of the eight great aristocratic families.","Jiang Lingxiao of the Jiang family was to grow up and become the next head of the Jiang family. It was important to the Jiangs, but it could not be said to be indispensable.","Unless Jiang Lingxiao could break through the limits and reach the Divine Abilities Stage, it did not matter what kind of genius he was.","However, after Jiang Ruoxu had a thorough understanding of Chu Yunfan’s information, he was extremely shocked to find that Chu Yunfan had broken through to the Innate Stage in such a short time.","When Chu Yunfan was young, he had also been hailed as an absolute genius. Otherwise, he would not have been able to reach the stage he was in now. However, compared to the current Chu Yunfan, he was much weaker.","When such a person like Chu Yunfan grew up, he would not be able to cause a destructive impact on the Jiang family, but it would be enough to cause the Jiangs to suffer huge losses. Moreover, the family might suffer many huge losses while Chu Yunfan was still alive.","This kind of person had to be killed to serve the long-term interests of the family.","Huang Du was also of the same opinion. However, he considered more. In any case, Chu Yunfan was already a walking dead man. Huang Du had to consider more about the distribution of his assets in the future. He absolutely could not suffer a loss.","Huang Du had never thought that Chu Yunfan actually had treasured possessions that the two big families would value.","Faintly, Huang Du regarded Jiang Ruoxu as his opponent. Although the two families were allies in the issue of killing Chu Yunfan, that was only temporary. In more fields, the Jiangs and the Huangs were still competitors.","After using a lot of healing pills, Gao Hongzhi was now in a better condition. At least he could hold and not die. He opened his eyes a crack and saw Chu Yunfan.","“Why... are you... here... you... shouldn’t have come... it’s a trap...” Gao Hongzhi said with much effort.","“F*ck, if I don’t come, you’ll surely die,” Chu Yunfan said as he rolled his eyes at Gao Hongzhi.","Gao Hongzhi chuckled, grimacing from the pain of his wound. His vision began to blur, and he only had time to say, “Kill them all!”","“You’re all here to deal with just little old me. What a big deal.”","Chu Yunfan laid Gao Hongzhi down, then stood up and looked at the crowd.","“It is indeed a big deal. To be able to die in such a situation, you should be honored,” Jiang Ruoxu said.","“What nonsense are you saying to him? Are you going to hand over the items and commit suicide, or wait for me to break your bones one by one and torture you before you hand them over?” Huang Du said coldly. He was not a very patient person.","“I wanted to chat more with you guys, but now I’m too lazy to talk. Today, all of you will die,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“Hahahaha. Chu Yunfan, do you think you’ll be able to utilize the Demon Descends Illustration here? We know that you have the illustration and have come prepared.” Jiang Feiyan laughed. “The members of the Huang family in the outer area have already formed a great formation. Within this barrier, all demonic treasures will be suppressed and unusable.”","As expected, just as Jiang Feiyan finished speaking, waves of golden light shot out from the sky. A golden barrier was formed, and on the barrier walls, a series of mysterious runes appeared. Unexpectedly, a wave of awe-inspiring righteousness assaulted their faces.","Chu Yunfan had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. He did not even need to try to know that this barrier had completely restrained the Demon Descend Illustration. More accurately speaking, this barrier restrained all demonic treasures like the illustration.","Many magic treasures had all sorts of restraining and suppressant effects. Yin and Yang restrained one another, so did the five elements, and good and evil restrained each other. There were all sorts of magic treasures.","Of course, those that low-level martial artists could come into contact with were not at this level. However, Chu Yunfan knew that the Jiangs and the Huangs had come prepared.","Once the illustration erupted, its power would be extremely great. It might even be possible for Chu Yunfan to escape. Therefore, they had long prepared to suppress it.","As long as the illustration could not play its role, Chu Yunfan would be a lamb waiting to be slaughtered. The worst outcome would not be that he would escape.","“You guys are so cunning. If that was my only trump card, you might really succeed,” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Don’t even think that any one of you will be able to leave here today.”","Chu Yunfan helped Gao Hongzhi up and helped him enter the Mountain River Illustration. The guilt in his heart toward his good friend being implicated by him turned into boundless anger.","“Hmph. Stubborn.”","At this moment, Huang Du suddenly attacked. With a palm strike, the Spirit Energy of nature transformed into a huge hand and grabbed Chu Yunfan.","The Spirit Energy of nature was like a finger, and Huang Du was able to wield it. This was the terrifying power of a high-leveled Innate Stage expert. With a raise of his hand and a raise of his foot, it was as if he had brought the power of Heaven and Earth to crush Chu Yunfan.","Ordinary Innate Stage experts could not do this because their control over the Spirit Energy was limited.","Just as this huge hand was about to grab Chu Yunfan, a huge beast’s roar suddenly appeared out of thin air. Immediately after, this huge hand that had been formed by energy completely vanished into nothingness.","Following that, a huge beast appeared beside Chu Yunfan. This huge beast was at least four meters tall, almost as tall as an entire floor of a building.","This was the Thunder Winged Beast’s true form. When Chu Yunfan first met this creature, it was not even half of its current size. However, after stepping into the Innate Stage, its size had clearly increased by a lot. It had also clearly become even more ferocious.","“What’s the rush? Are you that eager to die?” Chu Yunfan said slowly, but his voice slowly got louder and louder. Finally, it formed a loud shout. “Thunder Winged Beast!”","At this moment, whether it was Huang Du, Jiang Ruoxu, Jiang Feiyan, or Elder Guan, everyone was stunned. No one had expected such a change.","Even though the information mentioned that Chu Yunfan seemed to be raising a Thunder Winged Beast, it did not say that it was an adult one."]},{"number":614,"title":"Chapter 614 - A Breakthrough During Battle, the","paragraphs":["There was a huge difference between an immature Thunder Winged Beast and an adult Thunder Winged Beast. They were two different kinds of creatures.","“Go! Kill them!” Jiang Feiyan bellowed, and the mechas all moved out together.","The long and short guns on these mechas all fired at once. Countless bullets formed a terrifying bullet storm that shot toward Chu Yunfan and the Thunder Winged Beast.","Rumble!","A seemingly endless metal storm swept over. In almost an instant, the entire area was completely overturned. The dirt on the ground was sent flying. Every single one of these bullets was a large caliber bullet. If a person were to be hit by a single bullet, their entire person would instantly be smashed to pieces.","When the bullet storm and the terrifying storm it caused had dispersed, everyone could see that Chu Yunfan and the Thunder Winged Beast were unharmed. Chu Yunfan himself had not moved even an inch.","From the Thunder Winged Beast’s body, two translucent wings unfurled. The wingspan was 25-feet-long, shielding Chu Yunfan and itself within them.","The ground was riddled with bullets, but not a single one of them had broken the wind wings. Ripples flowed through these wings, forming various mysterious runes. It imbued the wings with great power.","This was the natural ability that the Thunder Winged Beast possessed. As long as the beast broke through to the Innate Stage, it would naturally be able to activate these wings.","Once a monster with the potential to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage broke through to the Innate Stage, it would be much more terrifying than ordinary Innate monsters.","Both Huang Du and Jiang Ruoxu had solemn expressions on their faces. Innate monsters were much more terrifying than Innate humans. When monsters attacked the city, the Innate monsters that were mixed within were undoubtedly the most terrifying existences. If they were not careful, they might even be taken down by these Innate monsters.","Usually, humans would need to use heavy weapons to successfully kill these monsters. When faced with these powerful Innate monsters, it was even more of a headache.","“Brother Huang, it looks like the two of us will have to work together to kill that Thunder Winged Beast first. As for Chu Yunfan, we can leave him for someone else to deal with,” Jiang Ruoxu said.","For ordinary people, even though an ordinary intermediate mecha was said to have Innate-level battle strength, it would be very difficult for it to cause fatal danger to the Thunder Winged Beast. Only an expert of their level would be able to do so personally.","Huang Du nodded. The two of them moved slightly, leaving behind only afterimages where they had been standing before. Unknown when they arrived in front of the Thunder Winged Beast.","As for the huge Thunder Winged Beast, it too flew out in an instant. It used its strength to stop these two peak experts.","Instantly, Chu Yunfan’s side was left empty.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re dead meat!” Jiang Feiyan laughed menacingly. Her originally beautiful face was filled with a ferocious smile. She could finally get her revenge. Although there were some accidents, Chu Yunfan still had to die.","Jiang Feiyan, Elder Guan, and dozens of mechas began to surround Chu Yunfan. Their powerful momentum allowed these mechas to surround Chu Yunfan in just a short moment.","And at this moment, Chu Yunfan swallowed a purple-gold pill.","“Fire!”","The mechas opened fire one after another, unleashing a rain of bullets. Although this metal rain had not done anything to the Thunder Winged Beast, a human martial artist would be completely torn apart. This was because the physical qualities of humans and monsters were too different.","However, the moment these metal bullets were about to tear Chu Yunfan’s body apart, a terrifying aura burst out from his body. A violent True Energy swept out crazily.","The moment the metal bullets swept in, they were all repelled!","There was no way to hurt Chu Yunfan, and purple-gold True Energy swept out crazily.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan, who was surrounded, had an unimaginably fierce aura. It was as if a peerless ferocious beast had awakened.","“I’ve said it before. There’s no need to rush even if you wish to die,” Chu Yunfan said coldly. He could feel his body being filled with the terrifying medicinal power of the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill. It was being crazily converted into True Energy or being absorbed by his limbs and bones. He felt as if all the True Energy in his body had exploded. Countless cells in his body had exploded.","Even an ordinary Innate expert would not be able to withstand such a huge explosion of True Energy, let alone someone in the Acquired Stage. Only Chu Yunfan, who had cultivated the Imperial Physique, could withstand it.","Even so, Chu Yunfan could feel that his body was undergoing a terrifying transformation.","Suddenly, a figure flew over. A basic mecha had unknowingly moved to Chu Yunfan’s left, waiting for the opportunity to pounce on him.","Bam!","Before the mecha had the chance to attack, he saw Chu Yunfan clench his fists and throw a punch. The terrifying fist force carried with it a powerful force that could pierce through everything. This one punch pierced through this basic mecha that was strong enough to fight against a peak Acquired or even stronger.","Inside the mecha, the peak Acquired Jiang expert’s eyes were wide open in disbelief. He was at the peak of the Acquired Stage. With the protection of the basic mecha, even an ordinary Innate expert like Elder Guan would not be able to kill him in an instant. And now, Chu Yunfan had only used one punch to pierce through his armor and end his life.","At the same time, the True Energy in Chu Yunfan’s body finally exploded. His cultivation level had finally broken through from the eighth level of the Acquired Stage to the ninth.","And this was not the end. Chu Yunfan’s strength was also rising crazily, and his cultivation level was charging all the way to the peak of the Acquired Stage. The excess medicinal efficacy had turned into True Energy and started charging at the Ren and Du meridians.","Generally speaking, even if one had not cultivated to the peak of the Acquired Stage, one could still attack the Ren and Du meridians. However, no one would usually do that. Before opening up sufficient meridians and strengthening their bodies, forcefully attacking the Ren and Du meridians all the way to the peak of the Acquired Stage—even if one was lucky enough to succeed—the Spirit Energy from nature would rush into the body and the person would be instantly injured. The ones who were seriously injured would die instantly.","This was because the Innate Stage maintained a state of connection with Heaven and Earth at all times. If one’s physical quality was not strong enough, one would not be able to withstand the baptism of nature’s Spirit Energy.","To Chu Yunfan, breaking through to the peak of the Acquired Stage was a true half-step to the Innate Stage. He was just one more step away.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes abruptly, as if he was a hunter who had opened his eyes. The real hunt was about to begin."]},{"number":615,"title":"Chapter 615 - The Prey Becomes the Hunter","paragraphs":["Boom!","True Energy exploded from Chu Yunfan’s body. A purple-gold True Energy surged into the sky.","“What’s going on?” Even Jiang Ruoxu, who had joined hands with Huang Du to deal with the Thunder Winged Beast, was shocked by this.","The terrifying True Energy had reached a certain level, and it was even more powerful than them. It looked extremely terrifying.","This was something they had never expected. They thought that they had already considered all the circumstances and that victory was within their grasp. In the end, Chu Yunfan still exploded with such battle prowess.","However, when they wanted to turn around and help Jiang Feiyan and the others, they discovered when they thought they were joining forces to kill the Thunder Winged Beast, the actual situation was that the creature had been stalling them.","The Thunder Winged Beast was even more difficult to deal with than they had imagined. After entering adulthood, the Thunder Winged Beast was extremely terrifying. The power of the air blades that it spat out was so great that even they had to be careful when resisting it.","In addition, whether it was the Thunder Winged Beast’s thunder attribute or its wind attribute, it had the ability to increase its speed. The Thunder Winged Beast was too fast, and an adult one was definitely the most troublesome monster ranked at the top of the list of monsters.","Now, the Thunder Winged Beast was more than enough to hold them off in a two-against-one fight.","Even though they were anxious, they had no way to escape. If they were not careful, they might get dragged through the mud.","A feeling suddenly rose in their hearts. It seemed that things were starting to get out of hand.","“Go! We can’t let him continue to grow stronger. Otherwise, the consequences will be unimaginable!” Jiang Feiyan shouted. She could feel that Chu Yunfan was getting stronger with every passing second. His aura was continuously rising. If this continued, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Before Jiang Feiyan could finish her words, the experienced Elder Guan had already taken a step forward and pounced toward Chu Yunfan. His Mantis Divine Kick instantly broke through the sky like a bolt of lightning and struck Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","This kick was wrapped in countless amounts of True Energy that could split mountains and rocks. However, Elder Guan realized that his kick could not even reach within three inches of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s terrifying True Energy was already so dense that it had solidified. It formed a protective barrier around Chu Yunfan’s body. It was like powerful armor that could not be broken by anyone.","“The Mantis Divine Kick? With your strength?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He was unbothered. Elder Guan’s kick meant nothing to him.","“Watch carefully!” Chu Yunfan shouted. In an instant, his entire body seemed to have transformed into an incomparably huge mantis. His leg suddenly swept out like a bolt of lightning that tore through the night sky.","“Sh*t!” Elder Guan cried out. He had fought with Chu Yunfan before. Back then, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was already extremely terrifying. However, it was clear that there was a big gap between him and Chu Yunfan. There was simply no way for them to be on the same level.","The current Chu Yunfan gave Elder Guan a feeling as if a gigantic beast from the abyss had emerged from its cave. He felt as if the entire world had been enveloped by the pressure Chu Yunfan exuded.","Elder Guan moved to dodge this kick, but he was unable to keep up with such speed. The kick struck him directly in the chest.","Bam!","Spurt!","Elder Guan let out a blood-curdling scream as he spat out a mouthful of blood. He was sent flying like a cannonball as he fiercely landed on the ground. He struggled for a moment before he stopped moving.","A large hole had appeared in Elder Guan’s chest. It was made by Chu Yunfan’s kick. An Innate level expert had been kicked to death.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan did not look like a human at all. Instead, he looked like a ferocious beast that had finally erupted.","“Fire!” Jiang Feiyan roared. The breastplate on her mecha opened up and two fist-sized missiles flew toward Chu Yunfan.","Facing these two missiles that could blow up a mountain, Chu Yunfan did not even glance at them. He raised his hand, waved it abruptly, and countless amounts of True Energy swept out from his palm.","It turned into a huge wave of True Energy that swept out.","Boom! Boom!","The two missiles had not even gotten close to Chu Yunfan when they were blasted apart by True Energy. The terrifying wave of True Energy swept out and shot up into the sky.","Chu Yunfan too was submerged in this shockwave.","The many experts in the mechas hurriedly turned on their thermal imaging. However, before they knew it, Chu Yunfan had already rushed toward one of the mechas, Ju Que in hand.","“Watch out!” Jiang Feiyan shouted, but it was already too late.","Chu Yunfan brandished the gigantic sword in his hand. With just one slash, he cut the mecha made of the most advanced alloy into two halves. The Jiang expert hiding inside had no time to escape before they were killed by Chu Yunfan with one slash.","After killing one of them with one slash, Chu Yunfan did not stop. With one foot on the ground, he steadied himself. With a sudden step, his body swayed, and in a few steps, he rushed toward another basic mecha.","This basic mecha immediately shot out a rain of bullets, but in front of Chu Yunfan’s True Qi which was so dense that it was almost corporeal, there was no way for it to break through.","All of its shots were blocked!","Bam!","Another sword slashed down, splitting this basic mecha into two on the spot.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s attack speed was too fast. In just a short span of ten breaths, he had defeated all of the basic mechas that had surrounded him.","And those intermediate mechas were chasing closely behind. Although the speed of these intermediate mechas was so fast that it was comparable to the Innate Stage, in front of Chu Yunfan’s speed, they were nothing.","They could not match up to Chu Yunfan’s speed. At this moment, with Chu Yunfan’s astonishing True Energy and cultivation strength combined with the Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations, Chu Yunfan’s speed was truly unleashed to the limit. Everyone only saw a flash of light before he appeared in front of the next person, continuing this massacre.","The offensive and defensive momentum had completely changed.","Originally, they thought they had set up an inescapable net. They thought they would be able to hunt down Chu Yunfan. But now, the hunter and prey had been completely reversed.","Chu Yunfan truly proved that, to top experts, numbers were no longer of any use.","Jiang Ruoxu, who was being held back by the Thunder Winged Beast, let out a roar of anger when he saw this scene. However, he could not do anything about it. He could not even come to their aid.","Jiang Ruoxu could only watch helplessly as Chu Yunfan slaughtered the Jiang family’s elites."]},{"number":616,"title":"Chapter 616 - Peak of the Acquired Stage","paragraphs":["“Surround him! We can’t let him continue to be so despotic!” Jiang Feiyan roared.","The eight intermediate mecha finally surrounded Chu Yunfan.","Jiang Feiyan’s previous plan had completely failed. It was clearly impossible to easily kill Chu Yunfan. He was much stronger and much more difficult to deal with than they had expected.","If they could start over, Jiang Feiyan would definitely come up with a more complete plan, even though this was already an unimaginable luxury to deal with just a mere junior.","No one had ever thought that such a lineup would actually fail to deal with Chu Yunfan. What Chu Yunfan did not know was that in order to deal with him, they had even factored in his most likely reinforcements—Jeang Yuanbin and the Chu family.","After confirming that they would definitely not rush over to provide reinforcements anytime soon only then did they move in to deal with Chu Yunfan. As the saying goes, “all the traps are calculated.” They had calculated every possible situation. They had never thought that in the end, it would come to the core issue of Chu Yunfan.","But at this moment, there was no possibility for them to retreat. If they could not eliminate Chu Yunfan even after paying such a huge price, then the Jiang family would become a laughing stock.","Compared to basic mechas, intermediate mechas were obviously much more terrifying. The intensity of their firepower was not something that basic mechas could compare to.","In an instant, the place where Chu Yunfan stood was covered by a rain of metal bullets. At the same time, these eight mechas were continuously shrinking the range of their encirclement. However, after everything was already submerged in the endless rain of metal bullets, Chu Yunfan suddenly appeared in front of one of the intermediate mechas.","This intermediate mecha was clearly much stronger than those basic mechas. It pulled out the weapon from behind its back. It was a huge blade that was over ten feet long. It suddenly slashed down toward Chu Yunfan and terrifying energy sprayed out from the blade. It was even more terrifying and incomparably sharp than True Energy.","“Mountain Splitter!”","The fearsomeness of an intermediate mecha finally revealed itself. Compared to a basic mecha, not only was its defense stronger but its mobility and firepower were also much stronger. Most importantly, it was able to cooperate with human martial arts to an extent that a basic mecha would not be able to.","Clang!","At some point, Chu Yunfan’s sword appeared in his hand, and he faced this slash head-on.","An incomparably loud boom erupted. With the terrifying collision of weapons, True Energy and mecha energy wrapped around each other and devoured each other.","The Jiang family expert inside this mecha saw the display frequency in front of him. Intense warnings continuously flashed in front of his eyes.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan shouted, “Sky Sword!”","A sword light flashed out. The Jiang expert only had time to use his sixth sense to dodge before a burst of intense pain flooded his mind. Only then did he realize that his entire arm, which was holding on to his saber, had been chopped off.","There were intense explosions everywhere!","“Sh*t!”","At this moment, the Jiang expert wanted to escape, but how could he outrun Chu Yunfan? The Ju Que slashed out, and countless amounts of True Energy condensed into a shocking sword light and suddenly slashed down. The Jiang expert who wanted to escape was split into two halves with a single slash.","A Jiang family intermediate mecha that was comparable to an Innate level expert was instantly killed by Chu Yunfan with a single slash. And all of this was as simple as eating and drinking for the current Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze became colder and colder. The actions of the Jiangs, the Huangs, and these people had thoroughly infuriated him. The two sides were already in a life-and-death relationship. There was no room for mercy.","And at this moment, another intermediate mecha was less than three meters away from Chu Yunfan. This position was practically a step away for an intermediate mecha.","“Die!”","The guy knew that his ordinary attacks might not be able to do anything to Chu Yunfan. He thus pulled out a long spear several feet long from the mecha’s body. The spear moved like a poisonous dragon that pierced through the sky. It was like a shooting star as it swept out horizontally.","Faced with such a situation, Chu Yunfan did not even look at the spear before he suddenly flung his sword.","Bam!","The Ju Que was like a stream of light as it shot out, directly exploding the air. The Jiang expert did not even have time to react before he was pierced through by the sword. He and his mecha were pierced through and nailed to the ground.","Compared to the previous expert from the Jiang family, this guy had ended up in an even more miserable state. He had not even the chance to make a move.","Having two experts killed by Chu Yunfan in a row, the people from the Jiang family were whipped into a frenzy. These experts had been assigned to pilot intermediate mechas, so they were undoubtedly elites within the Jiang family. Losing even one of their numbers was already a huge loss. It was even more serious than all the previous losses added up, not to mention losing two of them in one breath.","At this moment, the remaining six people, including Jiang Feiyan, rushed toward Chu Yunfan in a frenzy.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Countless metal bullets and missiles flew in all directions. All kinds of lasers cut through the air.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was not in a hurry. He either easily dodged these attacks or completely ignored them. Even when the attacks landed on his body, they were deflected by his incomparably dense True Energy. They were unable to cause any harm to him.","Chu Yunfan took a step forward. His figure was like a lightning bolt as he flew over to the mecha that had been nailed to the ground by his sword earlier. With a somersault, he grabbed the Ju Que. His sword slashed out like a dragon, shattering the air. A terrifying sword light swept out.","This speed was too fast. An intermediate mecha seemed to have just accurately calculated it. Then, it directly collided with the Jue Que and was cut into two halves.","All of these coincidences were as if they had just happened to meet. However, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had made the right calculation and killed the mecha with one slash.","“Chu Yunfan!” Jiang Feiyan roared. Her eyes were about to pop out of their sockets. Her roar sounded like it was about to tear her heart out.","“There’s no rush. It’ll be your turn soon.” Chu Yunfan’s gaze was cold. He was grinning, but his grin was indescribably cold.","Jiang Feiyan appearing here openly was enough to prove everything. Even if she was not the mastermind behind this incident, it was probably not too far off.","Thinking about the torture Gao Hongzhi had suffered, Chu Yunfan could not suppress his anger.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan took a step forward. In an instant, the aura in his body finally rose to its peak, and his cultivation level broke through to the peak of the Acquired Stage. The excess medicinal power was either emitted or began to attack his Ren and Du meridians. It was powerful and terrifying."]},{"number":617,"title":"Chapter 617 - Killing People Like Killing Sitting Ducks","paragraphs":["It was impossible for Chu Yunfan to completely absorb the medicinal effects of the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill. A large portion of it would be wasted.","Originally, the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill was not something that an Acquired could digest. If it was not used to break through to the Innate Stage, Chu Yunfan had planned to use it after cultivating to the upper Innate Stage. It would save him a lot of time.","However, Chu Yunfan did not regret using it under such circumstances. Although he could not fully utilize the medicinal efficacy, the portion absorbed was enough for Chu Yunfan to advance further.","After reaching the peak of the Acquired Stage, Chu Yunfan was only one step away from the Innate Stage.","Chu Yunfan could feel waves of True Energy surging through his body. He had to completely release it in order to alleviate the bloating feeling within him.","Chu Yunfan’s figure was like a bolt of lightning as he instantly flew out.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan thought that if he blew up the air, that would be Jiang Feiyan’s problem.","That terrifying aura was like an incomparably powerful fierce beast charging over. That terrifying aura was about to suppress everything.","Jiang Feiyan’s expression was resolute. Chu Yunfan’s terrifying killing speed gave her no time to be afraid.","“Heart Snatching Holy Kill!” Jiang Feiyan shouted. Previously, she had not even made a single move before Chu Yunfan knocked her to the ground. She had suffered great humiliation.","Jiang Feiyan struck out with her palm. It instantly transformed into a powerful spiritual power that charged toward Chu Yunfan. This was clearly an extremely powerful martial skill that could even affect a person’s spirit.","If an ordinary person was not careful, they might fall prey to this attack. This kind of martial skill was perfect in the use of spirit and power.","Unfortunately, the person Jiang Feiyan was going on up against was Chu Yunfan. This level of spiritual attack could not affect Chu Yunfan even in the slightest.","Chu Yunfan simply ignored it.","“King of the Jungle!” Chu Yunfan shouted. The True Energy in his entire body exploded out and gathered in his fist. When he punched out, it was like a terrifying hurricane sweeping out.","The terrifying True Energy swept over and this punch was like a cannonball.","Bang!","With a loud boom, Chu Yunfan’s punch landed on Jiang Feiyan’s palm.","Crack, crack, crack!","The arm of the mecha was shattered inch by inch. Jiang Feiyan let out a miserable cry. As the mechanical arm of the mecha was shattered, Jiang Feiyan’s arm was also shattered inch by inch.","Even though the mecha acted as a shield, there was still a huge gap compared to the astonishing strength displayed by Chu Yunfan at this moment.","“Aaaaah!” Jiang Feiyan screamed. She had never faced such a real life-and-death battle before. The terrifying aura pressed down as if she had met a ferocious beast from ancient times.","Almost instinctively, Jiang Feiyan’s other arm struck out, smashing down toward Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","This strike also came into contact with Chu Yunfan’s fist. Endless True Energy raged, shattering Jiang Feiyan’s other arm bit by bit. It shattered inch by inch, turning into a cloud of blood mist.","Jiang Feiyan cried out in pain as she hurriedly retreated. She could still reattach her arms if she were to lose them, but it would be truly over if she lost her life.","Seeing Jiang Feiyan turn around and run away, the remaining five intermediate mechas surrounded her in an attempt to block Chu Yunfan’s advance.","“With just you guys? You want to stop me?” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly.","“Chu Yunfan, you dare?!”","Jiang Ruoxu’s loud roar could be heard from afar. He was desperately trying to rush over, but the Thunder Winged Beast was holding him back.","On the other side, Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du were desperately trying to hold back the Thunder Winged Beast. For a moment, the entire scene turned into one of mutual delay. The battle was chaotic, and it was difficult to separate in mid-air.","As Jiang Ruoxu watched Chu Yunfan, the gigantic sword in Chu Yunfan’s hand suddenly swung out.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion sounded, like a huge collision. It came from Chu Yunfan who had used the technique of the Buddha statue throwing technique.","Chu Yunfan’s own strength was already shockingly strong, not to mention how terrifying this huge heavy sword would be after he used the Shakyamuni’s Elephant Throwing technique.","Boom!","The Ju Que was like a stream of light that cut through the sky. It set off a terrifying air storm. However, the first one to be pierced was not Jiang Feiyan, but another intermediate mecha.","This intermediate mecha tried its best to stop Chu Yunfan and shield Jiang Feiyan. Although they were all elites, within the Jiang family, Jiang Feiyan’s status was much higher. She was the pillar of the family that would be nurtured in the future.","Otherwise, Jiang Feiyan would not have been able to design such a large ambush for Chu Yunfan. It was impossible to do so without sufficient power and influence.","The guy thought that he could stop Chu Yunfan with the power of his mecha, but in the end, he realized he had underestimated Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s sword contained the Shakyamuni’s Elephant Throwing technique, and it was extremely powerful. The guy tried to catch the sword. When his hands touched the Ju Que, they were immediately turned into a cloud of blood mist.","Then, the momentum of the gigantic sword did not decrease. It pierced through the mecha in an instant, directly leaving behind a huge bloody hole. One could even see the situation on the other side.","Inside the mecha, the guy within was in complete disbelief. He could not believe that he had been seriously injured so easily. His internal organs, including his heart, had evaporated in an instant. It was impossible for him to survive.","After piercing through this mecha, the Ju Que’s momentum did not decrease. It caught up to Jiang Feiyan in the blink of an eye.","Jiang Feiyan could feel the terrifying sound of air braking behind her. She did not dare to turn her head to look. She was so scared that her soul had already left her body.","Jiang Feiyan tried her best to escape, but there was no way for her to dodge.","The sword was too fast. It was as fast as lightning. In an instant, it had pierced through a mecha and chased after Jiang Feiyan.","Stab!","The sword pierced through Jiang Feiyan. Then, with strong inertia, Jiang Feiyan was nailed to the ground. Fresh blood spurted out like a pillar.","It was an instant double kill.","This terrifying killing efficiency made the other intermediate mechas tremble.","And in the distance, when Jiang Ruoxu saw this scene, he was unable to restrain his anger and roared at the sky.","“Chu Yunfan, I want you to die!”","“You want me to die? Then let’s give it a try,” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile. “You want to kill me? I don’t think it’s certain who will kill who today. I’ve said it before, none of you can think of leaving today.","“All of you must die!”","As Chu Yunfan said this, the True Energy in his body exploded again, becoming even stronger."]},{"number":618,"title":"Chapter 618 - And Then There Was One","paragraphs":["The slaughter up until now had completely exceeded everyone’s expectations.","Especially the experts from the Jiang and the Huang families. They had not expected that the originally easy and happy hunting operation would turn out this way.","The prey had suddenly turned into a powerful and terrifying hunter.","Instead, the hunters were completely wiped out. Chu Yunfan has killed dozens of the hunting party in a row, leaving only four intermediate mechas.","Four intermediate mechas were considered a powerful force wherever they went. However, when they faced Chu Yunfan, they could clearly feel how powerless they were.","“None of you will be able to escape,” Chu Yunfan said coldly and indifferently. “With such a lineup, the Jiangs and Huangs can be considered elites. If all of you die here, I think even these two families which have large businesses will feel heartache.”","At this moment, the few remaining mechas looked at each other. They surrounded Chu Yunfan from four directions simultaneously, forming the Four Symbols Formation. Just as Chu Yunfan was prepared to respond, one of them suddenly increased its speed and flew toward Chu Yunfan.","“You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","Although Chu Yunfan did not have the Ju Que in his hand, that did not mean that he did not have the ability to fight back. To the current him, there was not a single part of his body that could not be used as a killing tool.","And this mecha that was flying toward him, before Chu Yun Fan’s attack landed on it, the mecha suddenly emitted a bright red light, and an unparalleled power swept out from within.","‘Sh*t! It’s about to self-destruct!’","Chu Yunfan’s expression instantly turned cold. This was the final method of exterminating the enemy of these intermediate mechas. Intermediate mechas were different from basic mechas. Their driving force was nuclear power, thus avoiding the danger of energy exhaustion. But at the same time, if they self-destructed, their power would be equally shocking.","“Mantis Divine Kick!” Chu Yunfan suddenly kicked out, hitting the body of this intermediate mecha.","Boom!","This intermediate mecha was instantly kicked away. The entire mecha was initially charging toward Chu Yunfan’s direction, but now it was flung away by Chu Yunfan’s kick.","The strength of Chu Yunfan’s kick was extremely terrifying. This mecha was instantly sent flying more than ten meters away.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion erupted. The terrifying power annihilated atoms. From the most fundamental power in the world, a power that could destroy Heavens and Earth was released.","This explosion set off a terrifying tide that engulfed everything. From afar, it looked absolutely terrifying. It was an incomparably huge mushroom cloud that slowly rose up. Everything within a radius of more than ten meters was engulfed by it.","The power of this explosion was strictly controlled within a certain range. This was the final method of exterminating the enemy, but it was not a method of total destruction. On a battlefield, only one mecha needed to self-destruct to completely wipe out all the combatants.","The aftermath of the explosion was spread outwards. The wild wave that was set off made it so that people could not even open their eyes. Countless clouds of smoke rose up wildly.","The remaining three mechas looked at each other. Before they could make a move, a figure suddenly jumped out from the wild tide. It was using this terrifying tide that could destroy people, and in an instant, it appeared in front of one of the mechas.","This mecha had not expected Chu Yunfan to still be alive and could even counterattack. They were completely unprepared.","Seeing Chu Yunfan pouncing forward, they only had time to raise their arms to defend themselves. Following that, they saw Chu Yunfan’s rock-like fist suddenly hurtling over with an unimaginable surge of True Energy.","Bam!","“Argh!”","The expert in this mecha only had time to let out a blood-curdling scream before a large hole appeared in their chest. Even though they had raised their arms, they could not block Chu Yunfan’s punch. Even the mecha’s arms and body were instantly pierced through.","Spirit Energy could greatly increase a person’s various physical qualities to an unimaginable extent. And when Chu Yunfan’s body was filled with an endless amount of Spirit Energy that could not be digested, it was enough to sweep away all the powerful enemies in front of him.","The remaining two mechas were initially trying their best to resist the wild wave of self-destruction and were at full power. But when they saw Chu Yunfan suddenly appear and instantly kill one of them, how could they stay still? They immediately erupted and swept out a rain of bullets toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan stomped the ground and was like an old tree with its roots coiled up. He held firm. No matter how the aftershock of the explosion impacted, he did not waver in the slightest.","Chu Yunfan did not even look at the rain of bullets that swept across the sky. The True Energy on his body was so dense that it was enough to transform into powerful armor. These bullets were unable to penetrate his protective energy shield.","This was originally a technique of the Innate Stage, but Acquired Stage experts could also use this technique. It was a kind of defensive technique. It was able to defend one’s body, but the consumption of True Energy was also at an unprecedented level.","It was very difficult for Acquired Stage martial artists to persevere. At most, they could only use it occasionally.","Only Innate Stage experts could continuously draw Spirit Energy from nature and convert it into their own True Energy. Only then could it be possible to continuously form this protective energy shield to protect their bodies.","And the survival ability of Innate Masters would also greatly increase. They could even withstand a rain of bullets and advance forward unless their True Energy was exhausted or they suddenly exceeded the defense limit of the energy shield.","To defend against the rain of bullets, the consumption of True Energy was unimaginable. However, the medicinal effect of the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill had not dissipated yet, and it was enough to completely provide for all of this consumption.","Slash!","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed. With just a few flashes, he had already appeared in front of one of the mechas. This mecha fired as it retreated, absolutely not giving Chu Yunfan the chance to get close. They had seen the outcome of those who had been approached by Chu Yunfan earlier. They had all suffered fatal blows.","An intermediate mecha that was comparable to the Innate Stage was unable to withstand even a single one of Chu Yunfan’s blows. His blows could tear apart the defense that could defend against the attacks of Innate monsters with his bare hands.","Chu Yunfan was terrifying. He was like a ferocious beast that had come out of its cage. One would die if he crashed against them, and one would be injured if he touched them.","However, the mecha’s speed could not compare to Chu Yunfan who had received countless buffs. In a few flashes, he had already caught up to the mecha.","Without any suspense, Chu Yunfan’s foot pierced through this intermediate mecha like a razor. The Jiang expert inside was killed.","Now, there was only one intermediate mecha left in the field"]},{"number":619,"title":"Chapter 619 - Can You Feel My Rage?","paragraphs":["This slaughter was done at an extremely fast speed. Before the violent storm formed by that earlier mecha self-destructing had completely dissipated, the slaughter was already nearing its end. Only one intermediate mecha was left.","And to the Jiangs, who had been brimming with confidence before, this was undoubtedly a great humiliation.","“Run! Don’t fight him head-on! Come to my side!”","At this moment, Jiang Ruoxu finally broke free from the Thunder Winged Beast’s entanglement and rushed toward the battlefield.","To prevent the Thunder Winged Beast from slaughtering the experts of the Jiang family, he and Huang Du had lured the Thunder Winged Beast away from the battlefield. Therefore, they were quite a distance away from the battlefield. They had good intentions, but they had not expected things to come to this point.","Just as Chu Yunfan had thought before, experts of this level were considered to be pillars of support even within the Jiangs where experts were as numerous as clouds.","Each and every one of them would be nurtured from the beginning to the end, and the expenditure of tens of millions would be minimal. If even one died, decades of effort and millions, or even tens of millions, would be burnt to ashes.","Especially since these were all Jiang Ruoxu’s underlings.","The Jiang family had many experts, and similarly, there were many factions. In the eyes of many in power within the Jiangs, encircling and attacking Chu Yunfan was supposed to be a good job.","Although Chu Yunfan’s strength had already passed the Innate Stage, to a behemoth like the Jiangs, it was nothing.","The items in Chu Yunfan’s possession were treasures that everyone coveted, so this was definitely a good job. Who knew that this good job would turn out like this in the end?","The Jiang expert in that intermediate mecha realized the seriousness of the situation. They did not dare to continue resisting and hurriedly flew toward Jiang Ruoxu’s direction.","“Trying to flee? Now?” Chu Yunfan sneered and walked in the direction of Jiang Feiyan’s corpse step by step. Then, he pulled out his Ju Que.","“Shakyamuni’s Elephant Throwing!”","Chu Yunfan suddenly exerted force. Immediately, the gigantic sword in his hand turned into a streak of light and flew toward the last intermediate mecha.","“You dare?!” Jiang Ruoxu roared. He had seen this scene before. Although this sword was fast and swift, it was not to the point where he could not react in time.","The intermediate mecha had also clearly sensed the sword piercing whistling through the air. But before they could react, they felt a sharp pain pierce through their chest. They had been directly pierced by the sword.","The sword had broken through the sound barrier, surpassing the speed of sound. By the time they heard the sound, it was already too late. This sword had directly pierced through them.","The Ju Que brought with it a powerful force that pierced through this intermediate mecha and nailed it to the ground.","“Perfect!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","“Chu Yunfan, I want you to die!” Jiang Ruoxu’s anger exploded. Chu Yunfan was digging his heels into the ground and mercilessly slapping his face.","“You’re only reacting now? Isn’t it a bit too late? Can you feel my rage?” Chu Yunfan said coldly. Facing Jiang Ruoxu who was flying over, he was not afraid in the slightest.","Boom!","Jiang Ruoxu was fast. In just an instant, he had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. From his hand, a long spear pointed straight at Chu Yunfan instantly shot out like a dragon.","The spear light pierced through the sky. In the blink of an eye, the air exploded. The terrifying spear light instantly enveloped Chu Yunfan.","“Pear Flower Storm!”","Just as it was about to reach Chu Yunfan, Jiang Ruoxu’s spear exploded into countless spear shadows, instantly enveloping Chu Yunfan’s entire body. Chu Yunfan had no chance to escape.","“Hahaha! Just in time!” Chu Yunfan roared without the slightest bit of fear. Then, he took a step forward and clenched his fist, as if he was grabbing the air. Terrifying True Energy seeped out from the gaps between his fingers, and then he abruptly threw a punch toward the spear shadows that filled the sky.","Rumble!","This punch shook the Earth. In an instant, the spear shadows that filled the sky had disappeared without a trace. All of them were smashed into nothingness. The spear light and fist force swept out and collided with each other. With a “boom” sound, everything exploded. In an instant, they formed a terrifying storm.","The punch smashed into the spear.","Jiang Ruoxu was originally very confident with his spear. He had not expected that the spear would not be able to pierce through Chu Yunfan’s fist. On the contrary, it was as if he had crashed into a divine mountain.","Chu Yunfan did not move at all. Violent True Energy rampaged through the spear.","Buzz!","Jiang Ruoxu felt his spear churning and trembling. There was a terrifying power rampaging through it.","Thud, thud, thud!","Jiang Ruoxu was pushed back by Chu Yunfan’s punch. He could feel the terrifying power contained within Chu Yunfan’s punch. It was as if Chu Yunfan’s body contained a terrifying ferocious beast that had been released from its cage.","“Again!”","Chu Yunfan felt that this punch felt extremely good. One punch had sent out a lot of the True Energy that was surging through his body. Without waiting for Jiang Ruoxu to react, he charged in Jiang Ruoxu’s direction once again.","Chu Yunfan did not care about martial arts techniques at all because he knew that his cultivation level was his weakness. He had yet to step into the Innate Stage, but Jiang Ruoxu had already stepped into the seventh level of the Innate Stage.","Even within the Jiang family where experts were as numerous as clouds, Jiang Ruoxu was one of the few people who had the power to make decisions.","However, the enormous medicinal power of the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill was Chu Yunfan’s greatest confidence.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Chu Yunfan attacked. Every punch was like an exploding cannonball. They were like cannon fists.","Jiang Ruoxu was being beaten back. He retreated toward the direction of the Thunder Winged Beast.","On the other hand, without Jiang Ruoxu holding it back, as Huang Du was facing the Thunder Winged Beast alone, the pressure on him instantly increased a lot.","Originally, the two of them could barely suppress the Thunder Winged Beast, but now, one person was instantly suppressed by the creature.","Jiang Ruoxu, who Huang Du had placed high hopes on, was not able to finish off Chu Yunfan and come back to help him. Instead, Jiang Ruoxu was beaten back by Chu Yunfan’s punches.","Chu Yunfan’s fighting style was extremely rough. Relying on his True Energy, it was as if his strength was endless. He did not play tricks with Jiang Ruoxu. It was purely terrifying True Energy coupled with the astonishing combat strength of the Imperial Physique.","One punch after another, Jiang Ruoxu was beaten back.","Watching this scene, Huang Du felt his soul was about to leave his body."]},{"number":620,"title":"Chapter 620 - Are You a Piece of Trash?","paragraphs":["Originally, Huang Du and Jiang Ruoxu were both high and mighty, thinking that they had complete control over the situation. They thought Chu Yunfan would not be able to possibly turn the sky upside down.","But now, Chu Yunfan has turned the sky upside down.","Relying on the shocking medicinal strength of the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill, Chu Yunfan was able to suppress Jiang Ruoxu with a strength that rivaled his.","According to the current situation, Chu Yunfan’s current combat strength was above theirs. Factoring in the Thunder Winged Beast that was restraining them, they no longer had any advantage. Only a complete disadvantage.","And at this time, the people who were holding up the barrier on the outskirts could not withdraw. They knew that Chu Yunfan had one other trump card that he had yet to reveal. The moment he was not suppressed by the barrier, the whole situation would change. Without anything to control, Chu Yunfan would be absolutely terrifying.","Huang Du felt a chill run down his spine. Back then, in order to control Chu Yunfan and kill him, they had lured him to this desolate mountain range. However, it had become their fatal weakness.","Even if they called for help now, it was already too late. Huang Du was shocked to find that all the signals had been blocked. They had made these preparations earlier, but when he removed the signal block, the result was still the same.","Everything was very clear. Someone else had done the same thing, and who else would do such a thing besides Chu Yunfan?","At this moment, Huang Du suddenly realized Chu Yunfan’s thoughts. It was completely different from what they had expected. Previously, they had mocked Chu Yunfan for being overly emotional. Chu Yunfan was led by his emotions, which was how he had been used by them. For such a person, his weakness was too great.","However, it was only now that Huang Du finally realized that Chu Yunfan was completely different from what they had imagined. Chu Yunfan rushing over to save Gao Hongzhi was only one of his goals. The most important thing was to exterminate them completely.","If it was before, Huang Du would not have thought of this outcome. Even if someone told him, he would not have believed it. This was no different from a snake swallowing an elephant. But now, he realized that this was not a snake swallowing an elephant, but another giant beast swallowing an elephant.","Chu Yunfan was not passively dealing with this matter. On the contrary, he had taken the initiative to set up a trap. This trap looked like they were ganging up to kill Chu Yunfan, but in reality, it was Chu Yunfan taking this opportunity to capture them all in one go.","However, Huang Du could not afford to be distracted at this moment. This was because the Thunder Winged Beast standing before him was too powerful. He was suppressed to a very sullen state despite being on the same cultivation level.","Huang Du’s attacks failed to hit the Thunder Winged Beast. They were all blocked by the wind wings on its body. At the same time, the wind wings on the Thunder Winged Beast turned into two steel blades in this close-range combat situation. In long-range combat, it could spit out wind blades which were extremely terrifying.","Huang Du did not dare to divide his attention. A single distraction could result in his head being chopped off.","And in this short period, Jiang Ruoxu was sent flying back to his side by Chu Yunfan’s punches and punches. If it were any other time, Huang Du would definitely mock Jiang Ruoxu. But now, he was not in the mood.","“Jiang Ruoxu, we have no choice but to give it our all. This kid is already so difficult to deal with. If we let him continue to grow, he’ll definitely become a huge threat to our families!” Huang Du roared.","Jiang Ruoxu, who was standing at the side, let out a bitter laugh. What a joke. He too wanted Chu Yunfan to be killed, but this was not something that he could do just because he wanted to.","Yes, yes, yes. Chu Yunfan was much more difficult to deal with than Jiang Ruoxu had imagined.","“Don’t make sarcastic remarks. He is troublesome, but fortunately, he must’ve used a pill to increase his strength. This isn’t difficult to deal with. As long as we delay him, we will see him defeated!” Jiang Ruoxu said loudly. At this point, he had no other choice.","Hearing Jiang Ruoxu’s high-sounding words, Huang Du knew that Jiang Ruoxu was almost at his limit. If there was even a little hope of winning, Jiang Ruoxu would not have said such words.","“It’s the only way now. If I don’t get in touch with the family soon, they will send someone over soon. At that time, we’ll definitely be able to kill this kid,” Huang Du said, “There are an endless number of people who want to snatch the items which are in this kid’s possession. Right now, they are all on their way here. As long as we hold out for a while longer, he’ll definitely die.”","Compared to their previous arrogance, the current Huang Du and Jiang Ruoxu were no longer as high-spirited as before. Their greatest hope was to stall for time and wait for Chu Yunfan to self-destruct or for outsiders to come to their rescue.","This place was too remote. Originally, it was to prevent Jeang Yuanbin from getting the news and coming to Chu Yunfan’s rescue. Now, it has become their enemy.","“You want to wait for reinforcements to arrive?” Chu Yunfan sneered. With a wave of his hand, countless True Energy condensed into a large hand and grabbed the Ju Que at the other end of the battlefield. It instantly turned into a stream of light and flew into Chu Yunfan’s hand.","“All of you will die today.” As he spoke, Chu Yunfan suddenly moved. “World Overlord. Sky Sword!”","The moment the attack was unleashed, the color of Heaven and Earth instantly changed. The Spirit Energy of nature was stirred by this attack. Countless amounts of True Energy gathered into the sword, turning into an invincible force that tore through the air as it ruthlessly slashed down.","However, the sword was not aimed at Jiang Ruoxu, but at Huang Du.","Huang Du was caught off guard. He had not expected Chu Yunfan to cross Jiang Ruoxu to attack him.","The attack missed Huang Du by a hair’s breadth. He quickly took many steps back before managing to dodge it.","After encountering that life-and-death situation, Huang Du cursed, “Jiang Ruoxu, are you a piece of trash? You can’t even beat a kid!”","Jiang Ruoxu’s face turned from green to white as his eyes flashed with fierce killing intent. He had been part of the martial arts world for so many years, but he had never been scolded like this before. Without the cooperation between the two parties, without the threat of Chu Yunfan and the Thunder Winged Beast, he would have long gone to fight Huang Du with his spear. But right now, he could only swallow his anger.","Jiang Ruoxu thought to himself, ‘Just you wait. After I finish off this brat, I’ll definitely make you pay the price for that insult.’","Jiang Ruoxu had never thought that Chu Yunfan would go past him to attack Huang Du.","Just as the two of them were cursing and scheming, the Thunder Winged Beast finally broke free from Huang Du’s entanglement with Chu Yunfan’s help. It turned into a streak of light and ran toward the boundary of the barrier. Its target was the experts of the Huang family who had set up the barrier."]},{"number":621,"title":"Chapter 621 - Sent Flying in Three Swords","paragraphs":["Huang Du and Jiang Ruoxu were both experts who had experienced hundreds of battles. They immediately realized what was happening.","“Stop the beast! We can’t let it destroy the barrier!” Jiang Ruoxu shouted.","Huang Du reacted quickly. He did not need Jiang Ruoxu’s warning. He too knew the consequences of letting the Thunder Winged Beast destroy the barrier.","They had set up this barrier because they were afraid of the Demon Descends Illustration in Chu Yunfan’s possession. Before even employing the use of the illustration, Chu Yunfan was already so terrifying. Once he activated it, the consequences would be truly terrifying.","“You should ask me for permission first before leaving.”","Unbeknown when Chu Yunfan had arrived before Huang Du and blocked the path forward.","Boom!","The aura in Chu Yunfan’s body continued to rise, and terrifying True Energy swept out. It was like a hurricane that continuously swept up the dust clouds that filled the sky.","“I’ve said it before. Today, you will die. The Jiangs and the Huangs are even more shameless than I imagined. Today, I will definitely let you feel the pain that cuts through your skin, just like what I’ve felt!”","Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du could not go after the Thunder Winged Beast. They looked at Chu Yunfan with ashen faces.","The two of them looked at each other. Then, Jiang Ruoxu said, “If we don’t kill this kid, sooner or later, he’ll become a thorn in both our families’ sides. If we don’t kill him, there might be a disaster in the future.”","Huang Du nodded. Before this, he would never have believed that Chu Yunfan could cause such a disaster to both families. But now, they have dropped that opinion. It was obvious that Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying than they had imagined.","Chu Yunfan was not even twenty, and yet he had the ability to make them suffer heavy losses. If he continued to grow, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Sharp killing intent appeared in their eyes. It was different from their previous looks of contempt. At this moment, they truly had the desire to kill. In order to kill Chu Yunfan, even if they had to pay a heavy price, everything would be worth it.","“It will still take some time for the Thunder Winged Beast to destroy the barrier. Before that, we can take the opportunity to kill this beast,” Huang Du said.","The two of them could not kill the Thunder Winged Beast, but they did not believe that they could not kill Chu Yunfan.","“That’s right. Kill him!” Jiang Ruoxu enunciated each word.","“Kill me? Hahahaha, I see that you guys still haven’t figured out the situation.” Chu Yunfan sneered and then laughed out loud. The guilt in his heart toward his good friend had turned into a monstrous fury.","Boom!","Jiang Ruoxu instantly made his move. He launched an attack from Chu Yunfan’s left side. He thrust out a long spear. It was as if the world was about to be torn apart, exploding with an extremely terrifying shockwave.","Chu Yunfan was not the slightest bit afraid. The Ju Que in his hand thrust out with a shocking sword light. It tore the world apart in the blink of an eye and stirred up huge waves.","Bam!","The sword and the spear collided. The two waves of terrifying True Energy collided, sweeping across everything.","On the other side, Huang Du also made his move. Golden True Energy was released from all over his body.","“Buddha Crosses the World!” Huang Du shouted as he brandished the large saber in his hand. It was as if he wanted to convert all the evil in the world.","This was the supreme martial skill of the Huang family. After the great cataclysm, the ancestors of the Huang family obtained this inheritance called the Ksitigarbha Law by chance. This martial skill was taken from the great wish of Ksitigarbha Bodhisattva—hell was not empty and one would never become a Buddha.","Combined with this saber technique, it was called the Vajra Evil Slaying Blade. This saber technique was meant to wipe out all evil in the world—to kill to stop killing and ultimately walk on the great path.","It was an extremely high-quality technique. But used by Huang Du, it was almost laughable because he himself was a great evil.","The blade slashed down, and a powerful saber light swept across. In almost an instant, it had arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","Without a doubt, Huang Du had already immersed himself in this saber technique for many years and cultivated it to an extremely profound level. At this moment, he had practically transformed into a furious-eyed vajra.","“Break!”","Chu Yunfan did not stop. After repelling Jiang Ruoxu, he faced the saber head-on. The Sky Sword slashed down and turned the world upside down. It was as if the most incisive light had cut through the horizon.","Boom!","The sword smashed directly into the saber. In that instant, the saber light intensified and turned into a hell that had turned into a Buddhist kingdom. This was the highest realm of the Vajra Evil Slaying Blade. There was no evil in the world. There was a Buddhist kingdom in the world, and the world was a pure land.","Huang Du had studied this saber technique for many years. It had been at least several decades and had long been close to this realm. However, the moment this Buddhist kingdom was formed, it was destroyed by the Ju Que’s light. Wherever the sword light passed, the Buddhist kingdom collapsed. Nothing could exist in front of this sword. Whether it was an evil ghost or the son of Buddha, all of them turned into nothingness. Any concept that was formed was destroyed in an instant.","When Huang Du’s saber light was destroyed, he instantly felt an unimaginably huge force crash onto his weapon.","Voom!","The saber trembled violently and a terrifying force swept over Huang Du. Only now did he finally understand how Jiang Ruoxu had been beaten back by Chu Yunfan.","Although Chu Yunfan did not seem very strong, after one real battle with him, one would understand how terrifying he truly was. It was as if he had been touched by a ferocious beast. One would get the same feeling while facing a monster when facing Chu Yunfan. Just a casual collision was enough to cause all the bones in one’s body to clatter.","And now, Chu Yunfan was like a fierce beast wearing human skin.","Thud, thud, thud!","With just one strike, Huang Du ended up just like Jiang Ruoxu. He had to retreat several steps before he managed to stabilize himself.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, appeared as if nothing had happened. In just a few brisk steps, he had already arrived in front of Huang Du.","“What a brilliant movement technique!” Huang Du was finally seeing Chu Yunfan. Only when they fought did he realize how difficult it was to deal with Chu Yunfan.","“Sky Sword!”","Chu Yunfan attacked again. He slashed his sword at Huang Du. The sword light tore through the sky and headed straight for Huang Du’s face.","At this moment, Huang Du did not have time to think. He hurriedly raised his saber to resist. Another heavy blow almost made him lose his grip on his saber.","And before Huang Du could stabilize himself, Chu Yunfan’s cold attack swept over again.","“Sky Sword!”","Bam!","“Sky Sword!”","Bam!","Three consecutive strikes, each more terrifying than the last. Huang Du finally could not withstand it any longer. He spat out a mouthful of blood and was instantly sent flying."]},{"number":622,"title":"Chapter 622 - Slashing Huang Du","paragraphs":["Under the support of True Energy formed by the medicinal efficacy of the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill, Chu Yunfan’s power and strength soared to terrifying levels.","Chu Yunfan did not need to play any tricks with them. He lashed out with this completely unreasonable fighting style. With his tyrannical power, he swept away all the powerful enemies in front of him.","Spurt!","Huang Du coughed up a mouthful of blood and was sent flying. He was extremely crestfallen because he had originally planned to use his higher cultivation realm and martial skills advantage to crush Chu Yunfan.","Who knew that Huang Du would be beaten up by Chu Yunfan instead?","Chu Yunfan was about to give chase, but at this moment, Jiang Ruoxu finally made his move. It had only been a moment since he had been pushed back by Chu Yunfan. He had not expected that in this split second, Chu Yunfan would be able to seriously injure Huang Du and force him to retreat.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan did not stop attacking.","Almost instinctively, Jiang Ruoxu thrust his spear in Chu Yunfan’s direction, wanting to stop Chu Yunfan’s advance.","But how could Chu Yunfan let go of this opportunity? Facing the spear that was coming toward him, he acted swiftly.","Chu Yunfan did not hesitate. The Ju Que in his hand suddenly struck out, and the sword struck the spear.","“Get out of my way!”","Clang!","The spear and sword clashed, and a sound that sounded like metal clashing instantly erupted. It turned into a huge humming sound, and the air turned into waves of shockwaves.","Zzt!","Jiang Ruoxu felt his arms tremble violently as an unimaginable force surged through his arms. He was almost flung away in an instant. It was as if there was a huge force boiling inside his chest, and he was about to cough up a mouthful of blood.","Chu Yunfan took advantage of this moment to catch up with Huang Du.","However, Huang Du was a top-tier Innate expert. Even though Chu Yunfan had injured him, he was able to forcefully suppress them and his aura recovered to its peak. For an Innate expert, his control over his body was meticulous and extended down to every muscle. At this critical moment, he had no choice but to use this method to control his injuries.","“Chu Yunfan!” Huang Du shouted. The saber in his hand was like a bolt of lightning that broke through the darkness of the world.","“Buddha Crosses the World!”","The power of this saber was not inferior to the previous one.","“World Overlord, Sky Sword!”","Chu Yunfan’s sword broke through Heaven and Earth. In an instant, the world shook violently, turning into a terrifying wave of air that shattered everything.","Bam!","Huang Du’s blade aura was broken yet again. Before it reached its peak, it was broken by Chu Yunfan’s sword. This destruction far exceeded that of being defeated under normal circumstances.","Slash!","Chu Yunfan’s purple-gold True Energy swept directly onto Huang Du’s body. The injuries that Huang Du had tried so hard to suppress suddenly relapsed, and they instantly worsened.","At the same time, Huang Du could no longer stand on his feet and was sent flying backward like a kite with a broken string.","And at this moment, a stream of light cut through the air and caught up with Huang Du who had been sent flying backward. Then, it pierced through him and nailed him to the ground.","Huang Du instantly felt the life force in his entire body drain away, and everything in front of his eyes became a blur. He struggled to get up, but he was nailed to the ground and was unable to move.","Just now, Chu Yunfan had used the Shakyamuni’s Elephant Throwing technique and nailed Huang Du to the ground with the Ju Que.","Huang Du’s internal organs were completely shattered by True Energy. Though his vitality was as strong as any Innate experts’ and he could survive in many extremely harsh environments, under such circumstances, he still had to die.","If Huang Du had been in his peak condition, Chu Yunfan’s attack might not be able to do anything to him. However, he was now heavily injured and could not defend himself against Chu Yunfan’s sword.","On the other side, Jiang Ruoxu saw this scene and felt his hair stand on end. Huang Du had died just like that. He did not dare to believe it either. Huang Du’s status within the Huang family was similar to his, and Huang Du had risen to fame much earlier than him. Even if he were to make a move, he would at most be able to draw with Huang Du.","And it was impossible for Jiang Ruoxu to kill Huang Du.","And now, in front of Jiang Ruoxu, Huang Du died just like that.","All of Jiang Ruoxu’s previous plans turned into ashes. It was impossible to achieve them now.","But at this moment, Jiang Ruoxu suddenly realized that the True Energy in Chu Yunfan’s body, which was at its peak, was gradually weakening.","‘The medicinal effect of that pill of his is finally reaching its end!’","Upon thinking this, Jiang Ruoxu immediately revealed an ecstatic expression. He clearly knew that Chu Yunfan had consumed a pill to become so terrifying.","Jiang Ruoxu had been extremely shocked by the medicinal effect of that pill. Not only did it raise Chu Yunfan’s cultivation by a level, but it also increased his battle strength by a lot.","However, the medicinal efficacy of that pill had finally reached its limit. After all, it borrowed strength from external forces. It was impossible for it to be used without limits.","“Hahahaha! Chu Yunfan, the Heavens are really smiling at me. Today, you’re dead meat!”","After confirming that the True Energy in Chu Yunfan’s body was indeed weakening, Jiang Ruoxu laughed wildly. This feeling was like riding a roller coaster, flying from Hell to Heaven in an instant.","“I want to see how long you can last. Today, I will get rid of you—the biggest threat to the Jiang family!”","The more Jiang Ruoxu spoke, the more intense the killing intent on his body became, and the fiercer it became as well.","The lethality that Chu Yunfan displayed was too shocking. As long as he was not eliminated, Jiang Ruoxu would not be able to sleep or eat in peace.","‘Looks like the medicinal efficacy of the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill ends here.’ Chu Yunfan too felt that his True Energy was decreasing. After all, the medicinal strength of any pill had its limits. It was impossible for it to support Chu Yunfan’s high-intensity battle without limits.","The battle strength that Chu Yunfan suddenly unleashed was done through the accumulation of countless amounts of True Energy.","“That’s right, you’re dead meat!” Jiang Ruoxu held his long spear and slowly walked forward. He was stalling. He knew that the longer he staved, the weaker Chu Yunfan would become. When that time came, he could easily finish off this opponent.","Suddenly, along with a scream, the barrier began to shake violently and collapsed."]},{"number":623,"title":"Chapter 623 - The Power of the Demon Descends","paragraphs":["This enchantment was one entity. The entire formation would collapse if even one of its parts were broken. It was not like some enchantments that were made up of different parts where if only a part of it was broken, it would not affect the operation of the entire formation.","And after some time, the Thunder Winged Beast had finally broken one of the formation’s cores.","A Huang expert had died at the hands of the Thunder Winged Beast.","As the people who set up the array, the Huang experts were naturally prepared. Those who had set up the barrier were experts. They had set up a defensive barrier around themselves. Even if someone attacked them, it would have been impossible to break it so easily. It could even be said that even an ordinary Innate Stage expert would find it difficult to break it. Otherwise, this suppressing array would be meaningless.","Even the Thunder Winged Beast took some time to break through one of the barriers and kill the Huang expert who was holding up the barrier.","And once this expert died, the entire formation came crashing down.","The entire formation collapsed in an instant.","“Sh*t!” Jiang Ruoxu cursed. He had waited with great difficulty for the effects of Chu Yunfan’s Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill to dissipate. But now that the entire barrier had collapsed, the consequences were indeed unimaginable.","Jiang Ruoxu immediately reacted and retreated several steps back. However, it was already too late. He felt an indescribably demonic and terrifying will lock onto him. The feeling was very difficult to describe. It was as if he was being stared at by an ancient fierce beast. This ancient fierce beast was demonic and terrifying.","Then, massive, demonic energy surged out of Chu Yunfan’s body. Just as Jiang Ruoxu had guessed, the moment the barrier was broken, Chu Yunfan decisively called upon the Demon Descends Illustration.","Soon after, a huge skeleton appeared out of thin air. It was made of endless blood-red demonic energy. It was just a human skeleton, but it was magnified countless times.","Almost immediately, a huge blood-red skeleton that was over 30 feet tall appeared in front of everyone. That blood-red energy swept through the sky and covered the entire battlefield. Countless trees seemed to have their vitality drained as they instantly withered.","From afar, many monsters could feel this extremely demonic energy. It was as if they could hear the cries of countless vengeful souls. They lowered their bodies and growled in a low voice, but they did not dare get close.","Although these monsters were not very intelligent, they could instinctively feel that an extremely terrifying thing had appeared. They did not dare to show their faces.","Chu Yunfan, who was enveloped by the blood-red skeleton, was lifted up into the air. His entire field of vision was suddenly opened up. His eyes were even tinged with the color of blood. His ears were filled with the cries of countless vengeful souls, and his body was filled with demonic energy.","Chu Yunfan had already experienced this feeling once, so this time, he was undoubtedly much more experienced.","Boom!","Terrifying energy once again swept out from the gigantic blood-red skeleton. Even though most of the energy was provided by the spirit stones in the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan still faintly felt that almost all of his life force was about to be sucked away.","The Demon Descends Illustration was indeed a demonic treasure. Unless pushed to the last resort, Chu Yunfan would rather not use such an item because the consequences were too severe.","However, Chu Yunfan was burning with anger. The more he looked like he did not care, the angrier he really was. His anger had reached an unimaginable level. The actions of the Jiang and Huang families undoubtedly pushed his buttons.","“Jiang Ruoxu, do you still think you can kill me now?” Chu Yunfan said in a clear voice.","Following Chu Yunfan’s words, the blood-red energy transformed into a terrifying shockwave and swept out. Before it even got close, Jiang Ruoxu could already feel the energy sweeping over him, and it almost sent him flying.","Jiang Ruoxu’s expression instantly became solemn. The Demon Descends Illustration was in reality much more terrifying than the information had stated.","According to the data collected by the Jiangs, it could be concluded that the blood-red skeleton that Chu Yunfan had released back at the Dao Conference at most could only display the strength of a fifth-level Innate because Chu Yunfan himself was only in the Acquired Stage at that time.","But compared to before, Chu Yunfan had now improved by more than just a little bit. In addition, the number of spirit stones in the Mountain River Diagram was also much more numerous than before. Thus, the blood-red skeleton that he managed to summon was consequently much more terrifying than before.","According to Jiang Ruoxu’s initial estimation, although the power of the illustration had yet to reach the Divine Abilities Stage, it was likely that it had already stepped into the ninth level of the Innate Stage. Although it had not reached its peak, it was very close.","But no matter what, it was still much more terrifying than Chu Yunfan had been just moments ago. Jiang Ruoxu’s decision to use the enchantment to suppress the illustration had indeed been the right decision.","But Jiang Ruoxu did not have the slightest hint of complacency on his face. He already realized where the true problem lay.","Jiang Ruoxu did not dare to stay any longer. He immediately turned around and fled into the distance.","“Trying to escape now? Isn’t it a little too late?” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Then, a large hand suddenly lunged out. From the blood-red skeleton, an incomparably large blood-red skeletal hand suddenly swept out, crossing over 300 feet through the air and swiping toward Jiang Ruoxu.","The speed of this blood-red skeletal hand was incomparably fast, and it caught up to Jiang Ruoxu in a short moment.","Jiang Ruoxu did not have the time to react, and could only turn around and thrust his spear toward this incomparably large blood-red skeletal hand.","Clank!","With a muffled sound, the spear in Jiang Ruxou’s hand was sent flying by a huge force. However, the spear had not even pierced the skin of the blood-red skeletal hand. At this moment, the strength of both sides had been completely reversed.","After sending the spear flying, the blood-red skeletal hand did not lose momentum and slammed into Jiang Ruoxu’s body.","Bam!","Jiang Ruoxu was directly hit by the hand. His chest instantly became a bloody mess and he was sent flying. He wanted to adjust himself and escape in midair, but how could Chu Yunfan give him such a chance? In the next instant, the hand had already grabbed onto Jiang Ruoxu.","Splat!","The skeletal hand grabbed onto Jiang Ruoxu’s chest, and he died tragically in the blink of an eye."]},{"number":624,"title":"Chapter 624 - Shock and Goosebumps","paragraphs":["Jiang Ruoxu was strong, but even he could not fight back against the Demon Descends Illustration. With the power the illustration possessed, it could even crush someone of the same cultivation level, not to mention Jiang Ruoxu who was at a much lower level.","At this moment, the dozens of Huang experts who had set up the barrier had abandoned the barrier and started to run away. They had seen with their own eyes how Chu Yunfan had killed all the Jiang experts and even killed Huang Du, an elder of the Huang family.","Under such circumstances, it was impossible for them to have any thoughts of putting up a fight. Moreover, they were enchantment masters. Setting up enchantments was what they were best at, not fighting.","However, Chu Yunfan’s killing intent had swelled within his heart, and it was impossible for him to give them any chance to escape. If he discounted the fact that they had tortured Gao Hongzhi to such a state, the existence of the Mountain River Diagram absolutely could not be exposed.","Chu Yunfan knew very well that once the diagram was exposed, then all the experts of the Federation would come knocking on his door. Not all experts would be interested in the Demon Descends Illustration or Divine Ability monster’s inner core. However, they would definitely be interested in space equipment.","Those were good items that could not be bought even with money.","As for the Thunder Winged Beast, it did not need Chu Yunfan’s instructions to begin its pursuit. It moved extremely quickly. It caught up to one of the few Huang experts in just a few steps and killed them with a single bite.","The Huang experts in other directions decided to split up and flee. Only in this way could they increase their chances of escaping. If they fled together, that would be the true path of death.","As for who was unlucky to be caught by Chu Yunfan, that would be considered their misfortune. After all, they had all seen the battle earlier. At this moment, Chu Yunfan was like a devil descending into the mortal world. It was simply not something that a human could contend against.","However, how could Chu Yunfan let them escape? He swung his arm, and the finger bones on the gigantic blood-red skeletal hand instantly broke away from the blood-red skeleton and flew out.","These finger bones were like sharp arrows, catching up to these Huang experts.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","These blood-red finger bones were too terrifying. They hit all of its victim’s vital points. In an instant, all of the victim’s life force was absorbed and they died unceremoniously.","With Chu Yunfan and the Thunder Winged Beast cooperating together, all of the Huang experts died in a matter of minutes.","After confirming that all the Huang and Jiang experts had died, Chu Yunfan put away the illustration. Unlike before, he was able to do it with ease this time.","Firstly, Chu Yunfan was much stronger than the first time he used the illustration. Secondly, he had prepared enough spirit stones this time. After such a long time, he had only used up a small portion of them, and it had not been enough to drain his life force.","However, the power of the illustration was indeed shocking. No wonder Wang Qi could not let it go. It was a sure-death situation, but in the end, it was taken by Chu Yunfan.","“Jiang family. Huang family. I want to see the look on your faces when your people arrive and see the corpses on the ground.”","Chu Yunfan looked at everything with a steely gaze. There were corpses everywhere. It looked like a battlefield of gods. Even though the Jiangs and the Huangs had numerous experts, they would still feel heartache losing over a hundred experts in one breath.","‘I have to think of a way to increase my strength as soon as possible. Otherwise, I’ll be too passive,’ Chu Yunfan thought to himself. To him, this kind of revenge was far from enough. However, his current strength was unable to support him any more than this.","The person who was standing in front of Chu Yunfan’s path now was Jiang Lingxiao. This person was said to be the number one person in Federation University at present.","Chu Yunfan did not have much time left. What he had to face was not only Jiang Lingxiao, but also the behemoth Jiang family.","Chu Yunfan summoned the Thunder Winged Beast and hopped onto its back. They then flew off in the direction of Federation University. Gao Hongzhi’s treatment could not be delayed.","Not long after Chu Yunfan left the battlefield, the first batch of people arrived. When they saw the corpses all over the ground, they were shocked.","They could not hide their shocked expressions. All of them were completely shocked.","No one had expected to see such a scene upon arriving here.","After they received the news, they rushed over. To put it bluntly, they were afraid that someone would beat them to it.","Although Chu Yunfan seemed to have killed his way here, breaking everyone’s speculations about his strength, they still had not expected to see such a shocking scene.","“These... These are all experts from the Jiang and Huang families!”","They soon confirmed it. Many of these people were individuals who had once shaken the world. Especially Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du. Experts of this level were on the list of experts from various forces. This kind of list was used to warn the younger generation that some people could not be provoked.","Although Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du were not the most outstanding existences around, even those at the end of this list were terrifying existences like killer gods to ordinary people.","“How could this be? The Huangs and the Jiangs had joined hands to ambush Chu Yunfan!” someone cried out in surprise.","“Looks like there’s no mistake. I was wondering why Chu Yunfan left the Metropolis in such a hurry. Looks like he was attracted here by the Jiangs and the Huangs’ methods. They probably hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to be so terrifying.”","Many of the people present were experienced veterans. Based on the situation at the scene, they were able to deduce most of the situation. Although it was not completely accurate, it was enough to determine what had happened.","Only then did the crowd react. No wonder Chu Yunfan was in such a hurry. It turned out that the main characters of this matter were not them, but the Jiangs, the Huangs, and Chu Yunfan. They were merely small obstacles that they had encountered along the way.","When many people thought of this, they felt their hairs stand on end. The Jiangs and the Huangs were the top forces in the entire Federation. They simply could not imagine what kind of scene it would be like for the two families to join hands to deal with a single person.","What was even more terrifying was that the two families had actually failed to encircle and annihilate Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":625,"title":"Chapter 625 - Shock and Awe","paragraphs":["What was even scarier than the combined efforts of the two families had actually failed.","No one could imagine what kind of situation it would be. Perhaps those top experts of the famous cities could pull off such a feat, but Chu Yunfan was definitely not one of those top experts.","So what were they seeing?","The experts of the Jiangs and the Huangs had all fallen to the ground and turned into corpses.","There were many people they did not recognize, but they knew about the intermediate mechas. Putting aside the basic mechas, those intermediate mechas were comparable to Innate experts. These eight intermediate mechas were comparable to eight Innate experts. With a lineup of dozens of peak Acquired experts, Chu Yunfan had still killed them all.","Soon after, they discovered the corpses of Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du. When they saw the corpses of these two, everyone was shocked and dumbfounded.","As for the others, they could only barely determine their strength. Many of them were the hidden forces of the Jiangs and the Huangs, so they had no way of naming them. However, Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du were different. They were true peak experts.","Although they were not the strongest experts of the Jiangs and the Huangs, they were undoubtedly far stronger than them. Regardless of whether it was Jiang Ruoxu or Huang Du, both of them had the strength to wipe them out.","In the end, they could not be very strong. If they were really strong, they would not have rushed over in such a hurry.","Both Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du had the strength to dominate the entire Federation. Now, they have died miserably here. This was the most terrifying part.","And who was the one who made the move?","There was no doubt about it. It was definitely Chu Yunfan!","And this was the most frightening part. Originally, they were complaining about why they were not able to catch up to Chu Yunfan. But now, they felt a sense of relief. Fortunately, they had not been able to catch up to him. Otherwise, the consequences would have been unimaginable.","The Jiangs and the Huangs had sent out such a lineup of over a hundred elites, more than a dozen Innate lords, and there were even people like Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du among them. Yet, they all died miserably at Chu Yunfan’s hands. They did not have the strength to fight back. If it were them, the consequences would simply be unimaginable.","They would undoubtedly die upon contact.","“Chu Yunfan is no longer someone we can deal with,” someone said as they gulped.","“That’s true. If we continue, the consequences will be unimaginable.” Another person looked at the corpses on the ground and lost all his confidence.","If someone had told them before that they might be scared out of their wits, they definitely would not have believed such nonsense. They had been through hundreds of battles and experienced all kinds of battlefields. How could they be scared out of their wits?","But now, they felt their hairs stand on end.","The reason was simple. From the situation at the scene and the traces left behind, they could tell that this was not a fierce battle. It had been a complete massacre.","Only a short time had passed since they started tracking down Chu Yunfan. The time in between had not been much, but Chu Yunfan had already completed his massacre.","This was the most terrifying part.","An astonishing killing efficiency.","After this group of people left, the next group of people quickly arrived. When they saw this battlefield, they were speechless and did not know what to say. In other words, they were all frightened by Chu Yunfan’s ruthlessness.","The news of Chu Yunfan’s wanton massacre began to spread. Those who were trying to pry away Chu Yunfan’s illustration and inner core began to hesitate. Although the items were very valuable, they had to see if they had the ability to obtain them.","“The Jiangs and the Huangs were wiped out?”","After many people heard the news, their eyes widened in disbelief.","“This kid isn’t easy to deal with. He’s so ferocious!”","“That’s right. The Thunderbolt mercenary group is such a big mercenary group, yet Chu Yunfan slaughtered half of their elites. Even if they said that they could tolerate it, they still suffered a huge loss. I heard that they’ve already given up on finding trouble with Chu Yunfan.”","“There’s also the Dark Blood Pool. They also lost an Innate level young lord. They will probably take revenge. Very few can make them suffer and swallow their pride.”","“I reckon they will. However, I think it will be very difficult to find an opportunity any time soon. An Innate level young lord is one of the elites of the Dark Blood Pool. Other than that young lord, there are also many blood slaves who were killed by Chu Yunfan in a single battle. You guys did not see the entire situation. This alarmed even the Federation Army. According to the information I received, that young lord was killed in an instant!”","All sorts of news spread within a small circle. For many who coveted Chu Yunfan’s treasures, this was undoubtedly not good news.","However, for the majority of people, no one knew what had happened.","Chu Yunfan arrived back at the Metropolis after more than an hour. Fortunately, he had used his medicinal pills on Gao Hongzhi as if they were free.","Therefore, Gao Hongzhi’s condition stabilized. In addition, he did not have to go through the hardships of traveling while inside the Mountain River Diagram. In addition, with the development of modern medical technology, he could be saved.","Even so, Gao Hongzhi’s injuries would require him to rest for two months before he could be discharged. Even with modern medical technology, this was still considered a serious injury. If Chu Yunfan had not arrived in time, Gao Hongzhi would not have been able to hold on even if Jiang Feiyan and the others had not made a move.","Although Gao Hongzhi was saved, this incident alarmed Chu Yunfan. The Jiangs and the Huangs were more shameless than he had imagined. They would do anything.","Chu Yunfan had to improve his strength as soon as possible. He had ruthlessly killed the arrogance of the Jiangs and the Huangs. But given the situation of these two families, they would not let it go so easily.","Just as Chu Yunfan had settled in Gao Hongzhi, Chu Yunfan’s instructor, Jeang Yuanbin, came looking for him.","Outside Gao Hongzhi’s ward, Jeang Yuanbin looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “I didn’t expect them to be so despicable. They used a trick to stall me. You were a little reckless this time.”","“It’s only normal. Since they want to kill me and set up an inescapable net, they will definitely factor in every aspect,” Chu Yunfan said as he shook his head. “I am indeed a little reckless, but I did not have a choice. That is my good brother. I can’t just him die.”","Jeang Yuanbin sighed and said, “Let’s put this matter aside for now. I’ve collected all the medicinal herbs on the list you gave me before. When can you start making pills?”"]},{"number":626,"title":"Chapter 626 - Fighting With All His Might","paragraphs":["Jeang Yuanbin looked at Chu Yunfan. During this period of time, he had done his best and used all the resources and connections that he had to collect the medicinal ingredients on the list that Chu Yunfan had given him.","A medicinal pill that would allow a person to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage was, of course, not something that could be made with ordinary medicinal ingredients.","The medicinal efficacy of a medicinal pill was proportional to the preciousness of the ingredients used. This was the eternal truth of the alchemy world. It was because of this that there were two directions within the field of alchemy that would forever be the mainstream direction of development. One was to study different alchemy formulas according to different needs, and the other was to continuously improve the existing formulas.","But in general, it was unlikely that extremely cheap medicinal ingredients would be used to make heaven-defying medicinal pills. This did not conform to the objective law of item production.","Just like Chu Yunfan’s memories of the Alchemy Emperor. Under the condition that the cost had not changed, the medicinal effect of the pill he produced was doubly effective. This was extremely heaven-defying.","And the person who had made such an improvement was the Alchemy Emperor, a leader within the field of alchemy. Even if the others had spent decades, improving even one pill and increasing its medicinal effect by 10 to 20 percent was already very shocking.","Therefore, what Jeang Yuanbin said about going bankrupt was not a joke. It was true that he had run himself dry. He had even sold that Black Hawk jet that he had spent a lot of effort to buy back then.","Although his heart ached, Jeang Yuanbin did not even blink when he did these things. He clearly understood one thing, and that was what was lost could be regained. As long as he could break through to the Divine Abilities Stage, the money that he had lost would definitely be returned tenfold or even a hundredfold.","Divine Abilities experts were completely different from Innate experts, even if they were at the peak of the Innate Stage.","If Jeang Yuabin did not become a Divine, he would still be just an ant.","And now, everything was finally ready. Jeang Yuabin was just waiting for Chu Yunfan to concoct the Divinity Nourishment Pill. With its help, he was confident that he would be able to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage.","Jean Yuanbin would then become one of the few experts in the world.","Of course, if it failed, Jeang Yuanbin might lose everything. It would take a lot of time for him to accumulate such wealth again.","But Jeang Yuanbin was willing to take a gamble because he believed in Chu Yunfan. He could afford to lose. If he lost, he would lose everything which, to ordinary people, was very scary, but to experts at his level, it was only a matter of time before he made a comeback.","“I’ll start after making some preparations,” Chu Yunfan said.","This incident had rung a warning bell for Chu Yunfan. That was, he really needed a big backer. An ordinary person would not be able to rely on this backer, but the Jiangs and the Huangs hated him to the bone. Now, they had already mobilized a pillar-like figure at the seventh level of the Innate Stage.","If this were to continue, the consequences would be unimaginable.","This time, the Jiangs and the Huangs’ plans had failed. But judging by their character, they would not let this matter rest.","When the time came, there might even be a peak Innate expert. Unless Chu Yunfan’s strength increased explosively, he needed a strong backer.","At this time, Chu Yunfan once again felt the urgency of time. He really needed more time.","“All right. When you’re ready, come to my training hall. When the time comes, I’ll activate all of my defensive measures. Even Divine Ability Stage experts can forget about getting in,” Jeang Yuanbin said.","Jeang Yuanbin’s training hall was the place that consumed most of his resources. From the moment he stepped into the Innate Stage, he had started to build his training hall. This was his nest, and it contained most of his secrets. He had purchased all kinds of defensive equipment one after another. Now, it had become a secret fortress. Even if a fully armed army wanted to take it down, it was not something that could be done in a short period.","For most martial artists, this was the norm. Whether it was cultivation, seclusion, or research, martial artists needed an absolutely safe place.","Of course, to Chu Yunfan, there was no safer place than the Mountain River Diagram. Therefore, he did not need such a training hall. Everything could be accomplished within the diagram.","Chu Yunfan also had to prepare for other things, and that was preparing to break through to the Innate Stage. His cultivation base had been catalyzed by the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill, and he had already stepped into the peak of the Acquired Stage. Moreover, the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill had opened up quite a bit of the Ren and Du meridians in his body. But, there was still a long way to go before he could open them up completely. It would not be an impossible feat to rely on just himself to slowly open them up one by one, but that process would be much longer.","And what Chu Yunfan lacked the most right now was time. His one-year agreement with Jiang Lingxiao was approaching. If he did not increase his strength before then, his chances of winning would be slim. He had to cross the threshold of the Innate Stage to have a chance of winning.","Breaking through to the Innate Stage with just an Innate Pill would be relatively difficult. However, the Three-Stripe Purple-gold Pill had already opened up a little of Chu Yunfan’s Ren and Du meridians. As long as he consumed the Innate Pill, he had at least an 80% chance of breaking through to the Innate Stage.","Having such a high chance was enough for Chu Yunfan to give it his all.","But before that, Chu Yunfan first had to gather all the medicinal ingredients for the Innate Pill. The Innate Pill he was about to make was different from ordinary Innate Pills. Its medicinal effect was several times stronger, and of course, its price was also far from what ordinary Innate Pills could compare to.","The price of an ordinary Innate Pill was over 100 million yuan. The medicinal ingredients for the Innate pill that Chu Yunfan wanted to concoct were over 500 million. And that did not include the price to hire an alchemist who was of the same level as him.","The source of Chu Yunfan’s funds now naturally came from Shanhe Alchemy. After removing the threat of the Jiangs and the Huangs and gaining the protection of the Chus, Shanhe Alchemy expanded and developed at an extremely fast pace.","As the company’s general manager, Lu Qingxuan was extremely busy. After hearing Chu Yunfan’s request, although it placed her in a difficult position, she still managed to think of a way to borrow 500 million yuan from the bank.","With the current development momentum of Shanhe Alchemy, it was easy to borrow 500 million yuan. The banks were afraid that Shanhe Alchemy would not take a loan, not that they were afraid that Shanhe Alchemy would not be able to repay the debt.","The patented Qi Replenishing Pills were the biggest guarantee and confidence of Shanhe Alchemy repaying the debt.","A week later, Chu Yunfan finally finished purchasing all the medicinal herbs needed to make the Innate Pill. Only then did Chu Yunfan rush to Jeang Yuanbin’s training hall to meet up with him."]},{"number":627,"title":"Chapter 627 - The Ambition of an Alchemy Expert","paragraphs":["At this moment, Jeang Yuanbin had already prepared many medicinal ingredients in the alchemy lab. The equipment in his lab was the most advanced available. There were many that had yet to be released to the public. Jeang Yuanbin obtained them through his personal connections to increase the success rate of concocting the pill.","Jeang Yuanbin could afford to lose this battle, but he had to give it his best to win.","“I’ll stand guard outside for as long as you need to make the pill. I’ll personally protect you,” Jeang Yuanbin said.","“All right,” Chu Yunfan said.","The Divinity Nourishment Pill was very important to both of them. Although Chu Yunfan had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he was not one. If he was an alchemy emperor, then there would naturally be no problems. It would have been impossible for him to fail in concocting a pill of this level.","However, Chu Yunfan was, at the end of the day, not an alchemy emperor. Just based on the memories of an alchemy emperor, Chu Yunfan had a seventy to eighty percent chance of success.","Why would an alchemy expert be an expert in martial arts? During the process of making pills, there were many minute changes that could not even be detected by the most sophisticated scientific instruments. It all depended on the alchemist’s perception.","If the alchemist was just a mortal, he naturally would not have the ability to sense such changes. Therefore, this required the alchemist to be an extraordinary top-notch expert. It had to be so.","However, just as Chu Yunfan was about to start making the pill, Jeang Yuanbin had a visitor.","It was a man who looked about fifty years old. His face was somewhat sinister. Upon seeing Jeang Yuanbin, he immediately said, “Jeang Yuanbin, are you planning to make a medicinal pill that can help you break through to the Divine Abilities Stage?”","“How did you know?” Jeang Yuanbin instantly became defensive as he looked at the man. “Master Lu, you’re quite well-informed!”","Jeang Yuanbin had never mentioned this matter to anyone, and this person had directly pointed out his biggest secret. How could he not be defensive? Moreover, he had heard of this person’s character, and his vigilance instantly shot up.","From behind Jeang Yuanbin, Chu Yunfan also recognized this Master Lu. This person was mentioned in the encyclopedia. He was on par with Bai Hong the alchemy expert. In fact, this man was a little more famous than that.","He was the alchemy expert, Lu Yongning.","In the alchemy world, aside from the high and mighty Alchemy King, there were also some top alchemy masters. Every one of these people had significant influence within the Federation. It was no exaggeration to say that they could call upon the wind and summon the rain. Their status even surpassed peak Innate experts like Jeang Yuanbin.","Alchemy experts of this level were many times rarer than Innate experts like Jeang Yuanbin. Moreover, these people often used medicinal pills to befriend experts from all over the world. No one knew exactly how many connections they had with top experts.","This was why alchemists were always ranked as the top profession that was not to be trifled with.","“Jeang Yuanbin, don’t be like this,” Lu Yongning said with a smile. However, his originally sinister expression now looked even more sinister.","“Did you really think you were being very secretive? I’m afraid that the news of you making a medicinal pill to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage has long spread,” Lu Yongning said.","When Chu Yunfan heard this, he immediately understood where the problem lay. It was the medicinal ingredients. Although the main ingredient of the Divinity Nourishment Pill was the Divine monster’s inner core, the remaining supplementary herbs and medicinal ingredients were extremely precious.","The price of each medicinal herb was enough to cause ordinary Innate experts to go bankrupt. The whereabouts of these medicinal herbs were definitely something that many people’s spies were keeping an eye on.","If Jeang Yuanbin’s speed of purchasing medicinal herbs was relatively slow and had been divided into several years, it might not have been so eye-catching. However, he had purchased the medicinal herbs too quickly. He had spent all his money on them. Basically, he had bought the medicinal herbs at all costs.","If Jeang Yuabin had slowly purchased the medicinal herbs over a few years, he would have spent at least 30% less.","However, neither Jeang Yuanbin nor Chu Yunfan could afford to wait for so long.","As long as Jeang Yuanbin stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage, he would definitely get back ten times or even a hundred times more money than he had spent.","It was impossible for such an action to not attract attention. An ordinary person would not be able to discern anything, but those experienced alchemy experts, even though they did not know exactly what kind of pill Jeang Yuanbin was planning to make, could make an educated guess.","With Jeang Yuanbin’s current strength and status, it was not difficult to guess what was going on since he had bought medicinal ingredients in such a hurry, regardless of the price.","Therefore, Jeang Yuanbin’s actions would definitely attract the attention of many. Especially the attention of many large factions. Every time an expert with divine abilities was born, it would cause a great shuffle within the Federation.","However, the reason why they had not made any moves yet was that the success rate of making this medicinal pill was very low. Even if the Alchemy King were to make a move, the success rate would only be 30%. The success rate of making a medicinal pill that could increase the bonus of breaking through to the Divine Abilities Stage was only 20-30%.","Adding these two factors together, in the eyes of many, the success rate of Jeang Yuanbin’s move was not very high. This was not just a guess. In the past many years, many experts at the peak of the Innate Stage had already tried it. There were some who succeeded, but most of them failed.","“So what?” Jeang Yuanbin said indifferently.","Now that everything was ready, and Chu Yunfan was in the training hall, even a top-tier expert with divine abilities came, Jeang Yuanbin had the confidence to defeat the other party.","“You don’t have to do this. I came here just to ask. Since you’ve already bought the ingredients, you must’ve obtained an ancient pill formula. However, the candidate to make the pill should not have been chosen yet, right? In that case, I’d like to recommend myself. How about it?” Lu Yongning said slowly. He had finally stated his biggest purpose for this trip, which was to concoct this pill.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood Lu Yongning’s true purpose.","Lu Yongning had rushed over after receiving the news. Clearly, he wanted to fight for this opportunity to concoct the pill.","For Jeang Yuanbin, this was a matter of life and death. And for a great alchemist like Lu Yongning, it was also an extremely rare opportunity.","For an alchemist to advance, they needed a large amount of experience. They did not lack the opportunity to make ordinary pills. However, pills of this level were something that even the Alchemy King rarely encountered. Ordinary alchemy experts might not even get the chance to make such a thing more than a few times in their lifetime.","Their experience was lacking. If they wanted to become an Alchemy King, this was a necessary path. The more experience they had, the more likely they were to break through and become the next Alchemy King."]},{"number":628,"title":"Chapter 628 - You’ll Regret It","paragraphs":["This was exactly the situation with the current Alchemy King, Du Qingtao. In the early years, Du Qingtao was a free man and did not belong to any faction. Compared to other alchemists who were supported by other large factions, Du Qingtao’s path to the top had obviously been much more difficult.","Because alchemy required countless resources and money, he had thought of other means to improve. In order to improve his alchemy skills, he helped others make pills for free. No matter what big faction or individual, as long as they sought him out and provided him with the ingredients, he would make the pills for them.","At that time, alchemists were not within a system yet. Each family had only cared about themselves. Du Qingtao’s actions naturally attracted the attention of countless people.","Especially many martial artists who did not have money or power. On one hand, it allowed Du Qingtao to make friends from all over the world. On the other hand, his alchemy level also rose rapidly.","In the end, Du Qingtao managed to stand out from the many alchemy experts and became the publicly acknowledged Alchemy King of the generation.","Afterward, there were many who wanted to adopt this model. Normally, it was fine, but for alchemy experts, there were not many opportunities to make pills that could help one break through to the Divine Abilities Stage.","In particular, there was the possibility of seeing a pill formula from the Ancient Zenith Civilization to enrich their knowledge. It could be said that they could kill many birds with one stone.","Therefore, this undoubtedly became a great opportunity. All the alchemy experts had spies inside the Alchemist Association. As long as there were any signs, it would instantly attract their attention.","Just as Lu Yongning said, Jeang Yuanbin had successfully attracted the attention of many, and Lu Yongning was just one of them.","“You? Hehe, I don’t trust you,” Jeang Yuanbin said as he sneered and stared at Lu Yongning.","If it was an ordinary alchemy expert, Jeang Yuanbin would not have said such words. However, Lu Yongning was different.","Lu Yongning did not have a very good reputation. This was because he had once stolen the medicinal pills that his employer had made. This was the biggest taboo in the hearts of many experts. It was not easy for them to go bankrupt to collect medicinal ingredients, and it was not easy for them to successfully make the resulting pill. In the end, it was stolen by others.","Without a doubt, this was a taboo in the entire circle.","If it was not for Lu Yongning’s strength and the support of many, as well as the fact that he was a vice-president of the Alchemist Association, Jeang Yuanbin would probably have used a broom to chase him away.","Lu Yongning’s expression sank. Of course, he knew that his reputation was not the best, but there were not many who dared to speak so bluntly in front of him.","However, Jeang Yuanbin was too strong. Even among peak Innate Stage experts, he was a famous presence and was not afraid of Lu Yongning.","If it were any other time, Lu Yongning would have left with a flick of his sleeves and thought of a way to deal with Jeang Yuanbin from behind the curtains. But now, he endured it because this opportunity was very important to him.","If it was not for the fact that Chu Yunfan happened to have the inner core of a Divine monster, an ordinary peak Innate expert would not have the opportunity to come into contact with such a pill of this level even if they were to go bankrupt. To Jeang Yuanbin, such an opportunity was very rare.","Lu Yongning was certain that as long as he succeeded, his chances of breaking through to the level of an Alchemy King would increase by at least 30%. Even if he failed, his chances of success would increase by 10%. Most importantly, if he failed, the one who would lose money would be Jeang Yuanbin, not him.","“Jeang Yuanbin, among all the alchemy experts, I’m one of the best. Unless you manage to invite an Alchemy King, there’s no more suitable candidate than me,” Lu Yongning said with certainty. The reason why he had not left was that he was very certain of this point.","Among all the alchemy experts, Lu Yongning was one of the best. In other words, in the entire Federation, he did not dare to say that he was number one because of the existence of the Alchemy King. However, he was at least one of the top three alchemists.","If not for that, with his previous bad record, how could there have been any strong existence that welcomed Lu Yongning? His reputation would have long been ruined and everyone would be calling for his head.","Lu Yongning knew how important this pill was to Jeang Yuanbin. Even if it only increased the success rate by one point, it was still extremely important.","And Lu Yongning just happened to have such confidence.","“And as far as I know, the Alchemy King was invited by the President to participate in a mysterious research project. At least one-third of the alchemy experts have gone along with him. As far as I know, among the remaining alchemy experts, you have not invited any of them,” Lu Yongning said, “Among the remaining people, who’s more suitable than me?","“I know you don’t like me very much, but this matter is a win-win for both of us. I’ll be getting experience, and you’ll be getting the pill you want,” Lu Yongning continued, “You don’t have to be worried that I’ll pull some sort of trick. After all, this is your training hall. If I were to do something, wouldn’t I be courting death?”","At this point, Lu Yongning became more and more confident. He was going to seize this opportunity. Even if the others got the news, they would not fight with him for this opportunity.","However, who would have guessed that Lu Yongning would only hear Jeang Yuanbin reject him without hesitation?","“I’m sorry. I refuse.”","“What? You’re refusing me? Jeang Yuanbin, are you crazy? Who in this world is more suitable than me?!”","Lu Yongning almost shot up. He had not expected Jeang Yuanbin to reject him even after that whole spiel. Jeang Yuanbin did not afford him even the slightest regard.","“Could it be that you want to invite the Alchemy King? He’s currently focused on researching the alchemic reaction formula. Why would he be distracted by your matter? That’s important research funded by the Federation Government. It concerns the strength of the entire human society. You have no chance at all.”","Lu Yongning thought for a long time. If there was anyone more suitable than him, it would naturally be the legendary Alchemy King.","“It’s not the Alchemy King either. I’ve already found someone to make the pill.” Jeang Yuanbin looked toward Chu Yunfan.","Lu Yongning looked at Chu Yunfan with an expression of total disbelief. Of course, he knew Chu Yunfan. Among the recent juniors, Chu Yunfan was the most famous. However, he was only a junior. Moreover, Chu Yunfan was famous not because of his alchemic skills although he was indeed a student of Federation University’s alchemy department.","“Are you crazy? Although this kid is a student of the alchemy department, he’s not even an alchemy trainee. How could he refine such a pill? I think you are crazy!” Lu Yongning said as he stomped his feet. He never thought that the truth would be like this.","“Whether I am crazy or not, that’s not for you to decide,” Jeang Yuanbin said, “You can leave now.”","Jeang Yuanbin immediately gave Lu Yongning the order to leave.","When Lu Yongning saw Jeang Yuanbin’s firm stance, he knew that Jeang Yuanbin was not joking. Immediately, he said coldly, “Very well. Jeang Yuanbin, you’ll regret this. And you. Your name is Chu Yunfan, right? I’ll remember you.”","With that, Lu Yongning turned around and left Jeang Yuanbin’s training hall."]},{"number":629,"title":"Chapter 629 - Causing a Sensation","paragraphs":["“This guy thinks that he’s so great when, in fact, his reputation has long been ruined,” Jeang Yuanbin said disdainfully.","If it was not necessary, Jeang Yuanbin would not offend an alchemy expert. Not every alchemy expert’s cultivation was as good as his, but they had powerful connections. Even he was not willing to provoke them so casually.","However, it was just that Jeang Yuanbin was not willing to casually provoke them. If it was necessary, he was not afraid of such alchemy experts.","In this world, it was ultimately a matter of strength. Although alchemy experts held great influence, it was also their biggest weakness. If someone wanted to deal with an alchemy expert at all costs, it was certainly possible. It was just that the price was too high, and not everyone was willing to pay it.","“What Lu Yongning said is indeed a problem. These alchemy experts are relatively simple. If any one of them had gotten the opportunity to concoct this pill, it would be fine. However, the one who got the opportunity is you. I’m afraid that once word gets out, those people will have some bad thoughts,” Jeang Yuanbin said.","“I’m fine with it. No matter what, they can’t do anything to me. It’s impossible for them to use their connections to deal with me. However, they won’t have such scruples when it comes to you.”","“It doesn’t matter. The most important thing right now is to make the Divinity Nourishment Pill. As long as the pill is successfully made, they won’t have anything to say. On top of that, you’ll have a great chance of stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage by then, Mr. Jeang.” Chu Yunfan shook his head indifferently, “When that time comes, there will be a Divine expert standing behind me as a backer. What’s there for me to be afraid of?”","Looking at Chu Yunfan, Jeang Yuanbin smiled and said, “You’re pretty confident.”","As Jeang Yuanbin said this, he temporarily let go of the worry in his heart about whether Chu Yunfan could successfully make this Divinity Nourishment Pill or not. Since it had already reached this stage, there was no point in worrying anymore.","“I sure am.”","Chu Yunfan did not hesitate any longer. Whether Jeang Yuanbin could successfully make a breakthrough depended on his subsequent plans. And the root of all of this depended on this Divinity Nourishment Pill.","After entering the alchemy lab that Jeang Yuanbin had specially prepared, Chu Yunfan saw all sorts of medicinal ingredients piled up high like a mountain.","The entire room was filled with the rich fragrance of medicinal ingredients.","And in the middle of the alchemy lab stood an alchemical furnace that was inscribed with an ancient design. Its quality was extremely high and was already close to the level of a magic tool. Only a person of Jeang Yuanbin’s level was able to obtain an alchemical furnace of such a level.","It would be impossible to refine the Divinity Nourishment Pill with an ordinary alchemical furnace. It would certainly collapse halfway before it was done. The higher the grade of the pill, the higher the requirements of the alchemical furnace itself.","“I’m going to start now. The key to victory.”","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath, opened the lid of the alchemical furnace, and lit the fire. It was as if he had practiced it countless times—accurate down to the very seconds.","Although Chu Yunfan had never made a Divinity Nourishment Pill before and had never even heard of it before, after obtaining the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, it was as if Chu Yunfan had practiced it many times over. There was absolutely nothing to be afraid of.","The Divinity Nourishment Pill was made in an orderly manner following certain steps.","Compared to Chu Yunfan’s peaceful alchemy career, the craze that Chu Yunfan had stirred up in the outside world had merely started.","Previously, Chu Yunfan had left the Metropolis and killed people like they were sitting ducks. He had killed all those who had tried to stop him because of their interest in the Divine monster’s inner core and the Demon Descend Illustration.","As long as they made a move, as long as they stood in front of Chu Yunfan, they would all die. Not a single person survived. This was what shocked everyone.","There were many who wanted to get their hands on the items in Chu Yunfan’s possession. However, there were not many who actually made a move. Most did not even have the time to make a move before everything was over. They had missed out on the action.","However, after the news that the experts of the Jiang and Huang families had been slaughtered by Chu Yunfan spread, it instantly caused an uproar. No one had expected Chu Yunfan would actually dare do such a thing. What made everyone completely blind was that he had actually done it.","Regardless of whether it was Huang Du or Jiang Ruoxu, they were considered powerful existences. Yet, they had been killed by Chu Yunfan just like that.","From the powerful demonic energy left behind at the scene, it was not hard to guess that the Demon Descends Illustration had unleashed its might and killed all of these people.","However, regardless of how Chu Yunfan did it, what he did was a fact. Regardless of whether one was willing to admit it or not, at this moment, Chu Yunfan, who was holding onto the Demon Descends Illustration, had become a rather troublesome character.","Even the Jiangs and the Huangs, who were huge figures, felt extremely troubled.","There had been many within the Jiangs and the Huangs who advocated taking tough actions against Chu Yunfan. Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du were only the representatives.","Originally, they all thought that this was a sure thing. It should have been a piece of cake, and there would be huge gains to be made.","Therefore, they had fought over the opportunity to execute this task. Jiang Ruoxu and Huang Du had paid a huge price to obtain this opportunity. However, the real price was death.","The Jiangs and the Huangs explored the market and came to the same conclusion. Other than Chu Yunfan using the illustration, there should have been another expert at the scene.","After all, judging by the situation, although the illustration had been used, it had only been used to kill Jiang Ruoxu and the Huang experts.","As for Huang Du and most of the Jiang experts, they had died at the hands of another martial arts expert. This martial arts expert’s strength was extremely terrifying. Otherwise, he would not have been able to kill Huang Du.","It was not like they had not considered it to be Chu Yunfan. However, Chu Yunfan’s strength was well-known. It was already a good thing that he was compared to an Innate Stage expert. He’d have to rely on the illustration to kill someone like Huang Du and Jiang Ruoxu. Only then would he have a chance of victory.","The facts proved that Jiang Ruoxu had died at the hands of the illustration, while Huang Du had been beaten to death.","With Huang Du’s strength being at the seventh level of the Innate Stage, it was not easy to kill him. If it was not for his alibi and the fact that the Jiangs and the Huangs had delayed him, the first person they would have suspected was Jeang Yuanbin.","The existence of this unknown expert instantly made the Jiangs and the Huangs afraid to act. This bought Chu Yunfan the most important thing he needed—time."]},{"number":630,"title":"Chapter 630 - Divinity Nourishment Pill","paragraphs":["Those who had ill intentions temporarily gave up on finding trouble with Chu Yunfan. It was not only because Chu Yunfan’s strength was unknown, but also because he acted strangely. More importantly, he had wantonly slaughtered the experts of the Jiang and Huang families.","The Jiang and Huang families would definitely not let this matter rest. At this moment, it was no longer just a dispute of interests, but it involved the prestige of the two families.","The rest had moved aside. Even if they wanted to make a move, they would not make a big one.","No one wanted to stand in the way of the Jiangs and the Huangs. Facing the two furious families, anyone who dared to fight them would be like a mantis trying to stop a chariot.","Many people understood this point, and this was not good news for Chu Yunfan. The Jiangs and the Huangs would definitely not let this go.","And to Chu Yunfan, this was a rare period of relative calm. Time passed by quickly. More than a month slipped quietly through his fingers like quicksand.","To the people in the outside world who were paying attention, a month was enough to cause a ruckus, but Chu Yunfan was completely devoted to concocting the Divinity Nourishment Pill.","This was the highest grade of pill that Chu Yunfan had refined so far. Although he had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, and Chu Yunfan was very confident, making this pill was far different from all those before. It was related to his future.","Unlike the past, when Chu Yunfan could prepare several sets of ingredients, he now only had one chance.","Outside the training hall, Jeang Yuanbin sat cross-legged on the ground. He seemed relaxed as if he was resting. However, the moment he was activated, he would instantly erupt like a ferocious beast.","Chu Yunfan had been concentrating on concocting the Divinity Nourishment Pill inside the training hall for an entire month, while Jeang Yuanbin had been on guard outside for an entire month. Usually, there would be no need for this. This entire base was designed by Jeang Yuanbin, and he had full confidence in its defenses.","As long as he was at the base’s center, Jeang Yuanbin could mobilize all the resources within the base. However, he was uneasy because the Divinity Nourishment Pill was of too much importance to him.","Therefore, Jeang Yuanbin had chosen to stand guard around the clock.","It was naturally impossible for an ordinary person to keep this up for a whole month. Their essence, energy, and spirit would have long collapsed. However, it was different for martial arts experts. Their physical limits far exceeded that of ordinary people, especially Jeang Yuanbin who was at the peak of the Innate Stage. He was only half a step away from gaining divine powers and attaining incredible strength.","Though Jeang Yuanbin had not eaten or drink in a month and was sustaining himself only on fasting pills, he was still able to maintain an extremely vigorous spirit.","Finally, the automatic door of the training hall behind Jeang Yuanbin finally opened. Chu Yunfan, who had lost a lot of weight, walked out.","Jeang Yuanbin quickly got up and stared at Chu Yunfan with a look of concern in his eyes.","“I did it. I’ve lived up to expectations,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan had worked around the clock for one month. It had been a great test on his willpower. This was why all alchemy experts were martial arts experts. Without such superior physiques, they would not be able to hold up.","After one month, Chu Yunfan successfully produced the Divinity Nourishment Pill. The training hall was filled with a strong medicinal fragrance. Although the pill he had made was meant to promote one at the peak of the Innate Stage to step into the Divine Abilities Stage, its fragrance alone afforded Chu Yunfan a huge benefit.","Just by continuously inhaling the medicinal fragrance of the pill, Chu Yunfan could feel his own cultivation base becoming more and more pure.","“That’s great!”","Even though he was usually calm, Jeang Yuanbin could not help but be overjoyed at this moment. Although he believed that Chu Yunfan would not lie to him about this, even the Alchemy King had only a 30% chance of success with a pill of this level. An ordinary alchemy expert would only have a 10% chance at most.","Under such odds, whether Chu Yunfan could succeed or not was up to fate.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan had succeeded in the end.","Chu Yunfan handed a medicine bottle to Jeang Yuanbin. Inside it sat the Divinity Nourishment Pill.","Jeang Yuanbin opened the bottle, and sure enough, one orange pill was lying quietly inside. A shocking medicinal fragrance assailed his nostrils. Upon taking a whiff, his entire body instantly relaxed.","“You rest well. I’m going into seclusion.”","At this moment, Jeang Yuanbin did not stand on fanfare with Chu Yunfan and went into seclusion.","This matter had dragged on for too long. With the help of the Divinity Nourishment Pill, Jeang Yuanbin was confident that he could step into the Divine Abilities Stage and come to stand at the peak of the human race.","Chu Yunfan did not say anything in retaliation, because he too had to seize this time to enter seclusion. In this one month, not only had he made the Divinity Nourishment Pill, but he had also made an Innate Pill for himself.","Half of Chu Yunfan’s Du and Ren meridians had already been opened up, but now, they were finally fully opened. The Innate Stage was right before his eyes. Once he stepped into that level, everything would be completely different.","“Jiang Lingxiao. You can just sit and wait for me to come to kill you.” Chu Yunfan said as he looked ahead, a cold smile on his lips.","The Jiangs and the Huangs thought they would be able to bring Chu Yunfan down, but in the end, they were slapped in the face by him time and time again.","Jeang Yuanbin went into seclusion. Before he left, he gave Chu Yunfan permission to go anywhere in the base aside from a few restricted areas. Chu Yunfan then chose a training room and began his own seclusion.","Chu Yunfan had not eaten or drank in a month. The Stellaris Fasting Pills were indeed extraordinary. One pill would not only provide all the nutrients he needed, but he could also take it over a long time. All the impurities in his body were removed in the form of sweat. His physical body was now even stronger than before.","No wonder the ancient cultivators were well-known for their fasting practices and were unwilling to touch food. It was because food not only provided nutrients, but it also became a form of poison.","Therefore, although Chu Yunfan had lost a lot of weight, his body was now purer and was brimming with energy.","Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged and started to circulate the Emperor Method. Suddenly, all the power in his body was mobilized, and they started to attack his Ren and Du meridians.","If the True Energy of an ordinary peak Acquired Stage expert was like a small stream, then Chu Yunfan’s True Energy was like a great river.","Chu Yunfan’s True Energy was at least several times more than that of an ordinary peak Acquired Stage expert, and its purity was also much higher.","But even so, there was nothing Chu Yunfan could do against the stubborn Ren and Du meridians in his body. If it was an ordinary person’s meridians, they would probably open up within minutes. Only he would not easily budge.","And when Chu Yunfan sensed that the True Energy in his body was a little lacking, he took out the Innate Pill that he had made and swallowed it.","Immediately, the Innate Pill turned into a huge wave of medicinal power that turned into terrifying True Energy. It spread crazily through Chu Yunfan’s limbs and bones, rushing toward the Ren and Du meridians like a flood that was about to destroy a dam.","Everything was happening right at this moment!"]},{"number":631,"title":"Chapter 631 - Finally Entering the Innate Stage","paragraphs":["The huge amount of True Energy formed by the Innate Pill started to crazily attack the meridians in Chu Yunfan’s body.","It was fortunate that Chu Yunfan cultivated the Imperial Physique. An ordinary person would not be able to withstand such a terrifying attack and their meridians would be ruptured. From then on, they would become a cripple.","Even with modern medical technology, the injuries on one’s meridians were still very difficult to treat.","Under the impact of this huge surge of True Energy, the originally stubborn Ren and Du meridians finally began to loosen up.","The Ren and Du meridians were connected to nature. To the human body, they were like two big doors, blocking the connection between the human body and nature. At the same time, they also protected the weak meridians within the human body,","And now, Chu Yunfan was about to break through this threshold.","This threshold was like two chains, locking Chu Yunfan tightly to the ground and rendering him unable to transcend.","Chu Yunfan was like a trapped dragon. And now, he was finally about to break out of the abyss. This was the first step to transcending the mortal world.","The impact was repeated over and over again. Even though he had long been prepared, Chu Yunfan still felt an incomparably intense pain spread throughout his entire body. But he could only endure it. He knew that this was the most critical moment. If he gave up, everything would have been for nothing.","Therefore, no matter how uncomfortable Chu Yufan felt, he could only hold it in.","This secluded cultivation lasted for a full ten days. During these ten days, Chu Yunfan did not eat or drink. He relied on the Stellaris Fasting Pills to maintain the energy needed for his body to function.","As Chu Yunfan’s True Energy continued to surge, the medicinal strength formed by the Innate Pill attacked the Ren and Du meridians bit by bit.","The Ren and Du meridians were being opened up under the repeated attacks.","Boom!","Finally, Chu Yunfan’s meridians finally opened up after countless attacks. A terrifying surge of True Energy surged out of his body, and the Spirit Energy between Heaven and Earth started to tremble.","This was the effect of the human body’s Heaven and Earth connection being opened up. After opening up the connection, the Spirit Energy within nature could affect the human body. But similarly, the human body could also affect nature. It could borrow the power of nature.","This was the power of the Innate Stage!","Chu Yunfan opened his eyes, and everything in front of him was completely different. When he looked at a mountain, it did not seem like a mountain anymore, and neither did water look like water.","The world that Chu Yunfan was used to seeing looked so different now.","“The door of cultivation finally opened today!” Chu Yunfan said.","In the cultivation system of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, the Innate Stage was the beginning of the Great Dao. Cultivation had changed from the strength of exploiting the treasures of the human body under the Innate Stage to the use of the power of nature.","This was a huge leap because human strength was limited, but the power of nature was endless. No matter how strong human strength was, it could not compare to the power of nature.","From the limited to the infinite. This was the true essence of cultivation.","Suddenly, in front of Chu Yunfan, a huge hand that was about half the size of a person materialized. This was the power of the Innate Stage.","In the past, although Chu Yunfan could also perform this fear, it was made using his own power. It consumed a lot of True Energy, and ordinary people could not use it at all, not to mention that the energy source could not be too far away from one’s body.","But now, it was different. Chu Yunfan only needed a bit of True Energy to be able to guide the power of nature. This was not something Acquired experts could compare to.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan deeply felt the power and terror of Innate experts. Just a bit of True Energy was enough to launch an attack that Acquired Stage experts needed to exhaust all their strength to be able to use.","Therefore, Innate experts could no longer be surrounded and killed by a large number of Acquired experts.","Other than monsters like Chu Yunfan, who could slaughter Innate masters at the Acquired level, any Innate Master could easily take down ten or eight peak Acquired masters.","Chu Yunfan restrained the True Energy and aura in his body. He could feel that his whole body was undergoing a transformation.","Ever since Chu Yunfan entered the Innate Stage, the Spirit Energy of nature had been pouring into his body continuously. The Spirit Energy of nature was the purest. It could subtly modify the body, and after a long time, the effects would be apparent.","Therefore, Innate masters had no weakness in their bodies. They were all superhumans. Moreover, the Spirit Energy of nature could enter their bodies without any hindrance. Not only was their physical quality great, but they could also prolong their lives.","Even if they did not take various tonics, they could naturally live for a very long time. The essence of cultivation was to transcend and evolve. However, only when they reached the Innate Stage would the true meaning of this sentence be revealed.","Chu Yunfan casually threw out a punch and the air in the training room instantly collapsed with a visible force. It was as if the air had transformed from formless to tangible before it was destroyed by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","‘Now that my strength has improved, I believe experts up to the third level of the Innate Stage are no match for me,’ Chu Yunfan thought to himself.","Chu Yunfan had finally stepped into the Innate Stage, and his combat strength had soared once again from this foundation. Ordinary third-level Innate experts were no match for him.","“I still have time. Two months, two months!”","After stepping into the Innate Stage, Chu Yunfan’s next step was to continue refining the Imperial Physique.","Chu Yunfan had only cultivated the Imperial Physique into the Skin Stage. Now that he had stepped into the Innate Stage, he could try to reach the Flesh Stage. As for the Bone Stage, he would have to wait until he reached the Divine Abilities Stage.","Only then would Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique be considered to have truly reached its peak.","In fact, it was extremely difficult to temper one’s body to the point where it could enter the Flesh Stage. The more powerful one’s physique was, the more difficult it would be to advance to the next level.","The Imperial Physique was extremely powerful, so it would be even more difficult to advance it to the next level. Although it was impossible for one’s cultivation to advance by leaps and bounds in a short period, one’s battle prowess was different.","Chu Yunfan roughly estimated that with his current martial arts, he would be able to suppress his peers. Dong Fanghao, Mei Haiyun, and the others, whom he had previously regarded as unreachable, were now no match for him.","After entering Federation University for a year, the gap between the two sides did not decrease. Instead, it was further widened by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was now even fearless against those seniors in the third and fourth years of university. Ordinary Innate instructors were now no match for him.","Instructors like Jeang Yuanbin and Zhu Bumie, who were at the peak of the Innate Stage, were as rare as phoenix feathers and unicorn horns within Federation University.","From the lowest level of the entire university back then, to the present day, Chu Yunfan had leaped up and become one of the few Innate experts.","“Jiang Lingxiao, I don’t know how much strength you—the number one person in the entire university—have.”"]},{"number":632,"title":"Chapter 632 - Getting Guidance From Senior Chu","paragraphs":["After gaining complete control over the power of the early Innate Stage, Chu Yunfan left the training room.","There were still some medicinal effects of the Innate Pill left in Chu Yunfan’s body that he had not completely refined, but that was no longer a problem. He only needed to spend a little more time to completely refine them. At that time, Chu Yunfan should be able to step into the peak of the first level of the Innate Stage.","Chu Yunfan’s foundation was much stronger than the average person’s. It was much more difficult for him to break through, but at the same time, once he succeeded, his starting point would also be much higher.","With this kind of power, Chu Yunfan now had the ability to go up against Jiang Lingxiao. At this moment, he understood why Jiang Lingxiao had looked down on him so much back then. With his level of strength from a year ago, Jiang Lingxiao indeed had reason to be disdainful of him.","This was normal and natural, but even the most imaginative person would not have imagined that Chu Yunfan would be able to grow to this extent in just a year.","Outside the training room, Chu Yunfan discovered that there were people lingering outside of Jeang Yuanbin’s base. And the leader was none other than Sha Peng.","Behind Sha Peng stood about five people. It was a group of three women and two men. They were about the same age as him, but one could tell at a glance that they were newcomers.","A year had passed. Compared to before, Sha Peng had shed his youth. Not only had his strength increased, but his experience and knowledge had also increased in all aspects.","Entering Federation University was an impossible feat for the average person. It was not just a simple statement.","When Chu Yunfan stepped out of the base, Sha Peng was instructing those few in their training.","“Captain Chu!”","When Sha Peng saw Chu Yunfan, he subconsciously straightened his body and stepped forward to speak.","“Who are these people?” Chu Yunfan asked with slight puzzlement.","“These are the disciples that Mr. Jeang has accepted this year. They’re our juniors. Mr. Jeang is currently in seclusion and has no time to deal with them. I’m going to show them around first,” Sha Peng said with a grin.","Only then did Chu Yunfan come to a realization. After one year, they had changed from the tender freshman to the university’s sophomores. And Federation University had accepted another batch of new rookies—just like when they entered the university last year.","No wonder they had access to Jeang Yuanbin’s base. Although it was only in the outer area, this was very rare indeed.","“Not bad. They’re good seedlings.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","These few each carried a valiant aura. The weakest among them had stepped into the peak of the Energy Refinement Stage. Among them, the strongest youth who looked like he was eighteen or nineteen was a warrior in the Acquired Stage.","The requirement to graduate from Federation University was only to be in the Acquired Stage. If it were at any other famous university, they would be a strong contender for first place in the grade. Even if such a seedling was nurtured well, it was very likely that he would reach the upper levels of the Innate Stage or even the peak.","And this person had entered this stage before even getting into Federation University. There were certainly already many pairs of eyes paying close attention to him. He had not expected to be accepted by Jeang Yuanbin. It was indeed different from last year.","However, what the guy did not know was that this matter was tied to Chu Yunfan. It was because Jeang Yuanbin had managed to bring up a monster like Chu Yunfan last year that Jeang Yuanbin’s reputation within Federation University soared.","Strength was only one aspect of the competition between instructors. In the end, the competition was still about the ability to teach and educate people. It was useless to just brag about it. On top of that, Chu Yunfan’s battle record from last year was a solid foundation. So, Jeang Yuanbin’s influence naturally greatly increased.","That was how Jeang Yuanbin had been able to snatch such a good seedling from the hands of many other instructors.","Although it was only a year apart, Chu Yunfan felt like he was looking at the younger generation. It was as if a lifetime had passed.","Sha Peng nodded as well. These few students were not inferior to the group from last year. They were probably even stronger. Of course, that would require eliminating a monster that was Chu Yunfan, the team captain.","Chu Yunfan was far too strong. He could not be considered an ordinary person.","Although Chu Yunfan was the team captain, they had not actually worked together many times over the past year. Sha Peng, who was called the vice captain, was the actual captain.","However, Chu Yunfan’s teammates had no qualms over this. This was because they knew that the gap between them and Chu Yunfan was far too big. They forced themselves to work together. In the end, it was either Chu Yunfan who would take care of them or they would participate in Chu Yunfan’s dangerous affairs.","This was not good for either side.","While the two of them were talking, the few rookies looked at Chu Yunfan curiously. They did not know who this person was. They had been busy cultivating with Sha Peng these last few days. From the very beginning, they were not convinced. This was because they were all outstanding people of the same age from various high schools, and even from various cities.","Age was nothing. The adults they had defeated previously were all seniors.","But later, they had been taught a lesson by Sha Peng. Although they were very talented and their future prospects were limitless, they were still far from being comparable to their second and third-year seniors.","Freshmen were better off tucking their tails between their legs and behaving themselves. Not everyone could be as heaven-defying as Chu Yunfan.","They knew very well that Sha Peng was a proud person. However, toward a youth like Chu Yunfan who looked about the same age as them, he had a completely subservient look on his face.","Who was this person?","What was his background?","Although they did not say a word, they understood the meaning behind each other’s eyes. They were astonished by what they were seeing.","“I’m only temporarily taking the place of Mr. Jeang in leading them. They’re all rookies from various schools. If I don’t beat them down, they will think that they’re all that.”","Sha Peng looked like he had been through this before. He recalled that he had been exactly the same last year. There should have been a senior from a higher grade to carry out this task. However, it was Jeang Yuanbin’s fault for having them as his first batch of students, so in the end, it was Chu Yunfan who took on the task of showing them the ropes.","“People have to have pride, but they can’t have too much of it. This is a good thing,” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Indeed.” Sha Peng nodded in agreement.","“Captain, do you happen to have time to help me guide them in their training?” Sha Peng asked.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the new students, then said, “Forget it. These are all good seedlings. All of them have solid foundations. As long as they work hard, their cultivation will naturally improve like a boat going along with the current.”","Suddenly, at this moment, the leader of the new students—the Acquired Stage one—suddenly said, “You’re the legendary Senior Chu Yunfan, right? I’m Ding Yin. I’d like to learn a few moves from you, senior!”"]},{"number":633,"title":"Chapter 633 - Unable to Block Even a Single Move","paragraphs":["Ding Yin’s words instantly attracted everyone’s attention. The other new students also finally recognized who this person in front of them was.","They had constantly heard of this name since they had entered the university. In just a short period, this name had become a name that resounded like thunder.","It was the first seat of last year’s freshmen, Chu Yunfan!","It was said that Chu Yunfan had defeated an Innate Stage expert last year. His strength was unfathomable. Just based on the strength that he had displayed last year, he was already one of the best students in the entire school university. Someone who could stand shoulder to shoulder with him was as rare as a phoenix’s feathers or a qilin’s horn.","The battle for the position of number had risen abruptly. Chu Yunfan’s sword was pointed at the number one person in the university, Jiang Lingxiao.","Chu Yunfan was the champion of the Dao Conference and the number one of last year’s freshmen.","In their eyes, these events were no longer legends. They were simply myths that no one could achieve.","“It’s Senior Chu.”","“Oh my God. I can’t believe I’m actually meeting him in person. I just don’t know how much of those rumors are true.”","“But seeing how Senior Sha looks like he’s willing to submit to him, I’m afraid that even if the rumors are exaggerated, they’re not that far off.","The freshmen discussed animatedly. Although they were like the other students who had gone through a lot of trouble to get into Federation University, they were not the strongest people in the university.","Everything else could be faked, but the first seat of the grade could not. That person had to be the strongest in the entire grade.","Who would dare to use a title like this on themselves? Would that not be courting death?","Although it was a little strange that Chu Yunfan, who was the first in the grade, was not the top scorer in the college entrance examinations, it was still a fact.","Sha Peng looked at Ding Yin and made no move to stop him. He could not help but think of himself and the others back then. They too were like this—unwilling to admit defeat. In the end, Chu Yunfan had bested them all. Only then did they realize that there was always someone better than themselves out there.","Some people were born to break the rules.","Sha Peng grinned. Ding Yin was the most talented of this batch of juniors. Being one step ahead in the Acquired Stage was not as simple as being one step ahead. The gap between the juniors would only grow bigger and bigger. People like Chu Yunfan, who could catch up to the others even though he was a late bloomer, were the exception, not the norm. They could not be used as examples.","Even when facing Chu Yunfan in the flesh, Ding Yin was not willing to admit defeat. And now, he wanted to challenge Chu Yunfan. This kind of thought was normal indeed. To be young is to be naive.","Chu Yunfan looked Ding Yin in the eyes and only smiled. “You want to learn a few moves from me?","“How about this? If you can take just one of my moves without going down, I’ll give you some pointers,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","When Ding Yin heard this, not only was he unhappy, he was furious. His cultivation was revered back in his city. He had even defeated a senior who was one year older than him.","Such a character could be said to be the chosen one of Heaven. But after entering Federation University and witnessing Sha Peng’s strength, and he restrained himself a lot, Chu Yunfan’s attitude still made him unhappy.","One move?","Could he really not block even one move from Chu Yunfan?","“Senior, please enlighten me,” Ding Yin said in a stiff tone as he cupped his hands.","Chu Yunfan could see that Ding Yin was not convinced, but he did not take it to heart. He only said, “All right then. Watch yourself.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, Ding Yin did not see him make any big moves. Chu Yunfan merely pointed out with one finger. In an instant, the sky and earth were turned upside down. Countless amounts of Spirit Energy gathered toward Chu Yunfan’s finger at a speed visible to the naked eye. The finger was not moving very fast at all, but with every inch of advancement, its terrifying aura increased by one point.","In just a short moment, it had formed a thousand-pound force.","And this terrifying aura barrelled down on Ding Yin.","Ding Yin instantly felt this aura. If the aura of an Acquired Stage expert could be considered to be amazing and a great deterrent, then an Innate Stage expert was completely different. Their aura could cause all of nature’s Spirit Energy to move together. They could crush an enemy below the Innate Stage with just their aura alone.","Ding Yin felt that the entire world was repelling him. A terrifying pressure came from all directions as if it was going to crush him completely. His body, which had been tempered for a long time, began to change shape. Even his bones were starting to rub against each other.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan increased his speed ever so slightly. And that was the last straw that broke the camel’s back. Ding Yin finally could not hold out any longer and he collapsed onto all fours. Using his arms to support himself, he panted heavily as large amounts of cold sweat dripped onto the ground.","At this moment, everyone realized that Ding Yin’s entire body was drenched in a cold sweat.","The freshmen were baffled. Chu Yunfan had merely pointed out with one finger and not even touched Ding Yin. And yet, Ding Yin seemed to have suffered a heavy blow.","It was just one blow.","However, they could tell that Ding Yin was definitely not faking it. On top of that, after interacting with him for the past few days, they absolutely did not believe that the proud Ding Yin would cooperate with Chu Yunfan to put on such a show.","“Aura... It’s aura!”","Finally, they reacted. After all, they were some of the best among the students. All of them had at the very least stepped into the peak of the Energy Refinement Stage Although they had never seen an Innate master make a move before, it was not a difficult guess to make.","“With Ding Yin’s strength, even if we joined hands, we would be no match for Chu Yunfan. However, I had not expected that Ding Yin would not even be able to block Senior Chu’s aura!”","The freshmen were all dumbstruck and were in complete disbelief. After all, Chu Yunfan was only one year older than them. It was natural for him to be stronger than them, but he had barely even made a move. Just relying on his aura to defeat Ding Yin was beyond their understanding.","Sha Peng, who they originally thought was very strong, seemed to be not worth mentioning when compared to Chu Yunfan.","“It’s just a difference of one year. Could there really be such a huge difference?”","“Could all those legends be true?”","However, they were more excited than anything. The difference of one year was not that big. The only possibility was that Chu Yunfan’s strength had improved by leaps and bounds within one year because he had entered Federation University.","Did that not mean that they could also improve by leaps and bounds within a year?","Federation University was indeed extraordinary.","Unlike these new students, Sha Peng, who had long entered the Acquired Stage, could indeed feel the power contained within Chu Yunfan’s finger. It seemed ordinary, but it was unstoppable.","It was like a flood that could destroy everything. Without any aces, anyone who dared to confront it would be destroyed and turned into nothingness.","‘F*ck, Captain is becoming even more and more of a freak,’ Sha Peng thought. He knew what the freshmen were thinking, and could only smile bitterly. What a joke. If everyone could become such a freak after just a year at Federation University, the Federation would have long conquered the Kunlun Realm.","The reason why Chu Yunfan was so strong was that he was Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":634,"title":"Chapter 634 - Innate Might","paragraphs":["Compared to a year ago, Sha Peng had undergone a complete transformation. He had successfully stepped into the fifth level of the Acquired Stage. This speed was already akin to riding a rocket. In the future, it was very likely that he would step into the Innate Stage. To the family that Sha Peng belonged to, an Innate expert was enough to lead the family.","However, compared to Chu Yunfan’s speed of advancement, it was child’s play. Based on Sha Peng’s estimation, he was already no match for Chu Yunfan half a year ago.","And now, Sha Peng could no longer determine Chu Yunfan’s strength. He knew that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was definitely above Innate level. After all, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had defeated the vice president of the student council, Wang Qi.","To Chu Yunfan, this was nothing out of the ordinary. Ding Yin had only just entered the Acquired Stage, while Chu Yunfan had already stepped into the Innate Stage. Chu Yunfan’s battle prowess was far beyond the Acquired Stage by now, so defeating Ding Yin was a matter of course.","On the other hand, Ding Yin had an incredulous expression on his face. Although he had already prepared for Chu Yunfan to be stronger than him, he never thought that Chu Yunfan would be that much stronger than him. That single exchange had made him feel that the gap between them was like an endless ocean. It was not something that could be made up with hard work.","Although Ding Yin was not Sha Peng’s match now, he was confident that he would surpass Sha Peng sooner or later. He only needed time. However, Chu Yunfan gave Ding Yin a feeling that he was absolutely unbeatable","How could an ant defeat a divine dragon?","“Thank you for the lesson, Senior Chu. I was too arrogant,” Ding Yin said with a bitter smile.","“No need to look so forlorn. Although I’m only one year older than you, my experience is not something you can imagine. It’s only natural that there’s a gap between us. With your talent and Mr. Jeang’s guidance, your future is bound to be limitless,” Chu Yunfan said.","With those words, Chu Yunfan felt like he was teaching a junior. However, no one present felt that there was a problem. In fact, they felt that this was very normal. Of course, if it was not for his overwhelming strength, it would not be like this.","“Oh, right. Captain, there’s an invitation for you.” Sha Peng went forward and handed an invitation to Chu Yunfan. You were in seclusion when this came in, so I accepted it on your behalf!”","Chu Yunfan took the invitation and saw that it was a gilded invitation. There was even a faint fluctuation of Spirit Energy on it.","The material of this invitation was extraordinary.","Ever since Chu Yunfan made a name for himself, it was no exaggeration to describe the number of invitations he received every day. However, they had all been electronic invitations. In this era, everything was done this way now. There were very few who used physical invitations. It was troublesome and not environmentally friendly.","However, this one was clearly different. From just a cursory glance, Chu Yunfan could tell that the value of this invitation was probably more than 100,000 yuan.","Who had spent so much money on this piece of paper?","Chu Yunfan put away the invitation. He then nodded and left.","Looking at Chu Yunfan’s gradually receding figure, the new students finally let out a sigh of relief. The pressure that Chu Yunfan gave them was just too great.","“He’s so strong. As expected of the first seat of the sophomores!” a girl said as she patted her chest.","“Say, how strong do you think Senior Chu is now? Has he stepped into the seventh level of the Acquired Stage?” another student asked.","“You idiot.” Ding Yin said as he got up off the ground. If Chu Yunfan was only a seventh-level Acquired martial artist, even though Ding Yin would still be no match for him, Chu Yunfan definitely would not have been able to crush him with just his aura. It was obvious that Chu Yunfan had already stepped into the Innate Stage.","Ding Yin did not even bother looking at the others and directly walked toward the training room. Today’s matter was too much of a shock to him. His self-righteous pride was completely crushed by Chu Yunfan. Even if he was the number one high school student who dominated a city, he was still nothing in Federation University which was filled with experts.","Chu Yunfan left the base. It was a relatively remote place in the Metropolis. Jeang Yuanbin’s base was located within the Metropolis where he could receive its protection. It was the safest place.","After leaving the base, Chu Yunfan finally looked at the invitation.","[Mr. Chu Yunfan, you are invited to the celebration of the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s 180th birthday. It will be held on the 13th day of the 11th month at the Heavenly Dragon Villa. We hope to see you there.]","Heavenly Dragon Villa? The Heavenly Dragon Elder?","Chu Yunfan was stunned. He read from Federation University’s encyclopedia that the Heavenly Dragon Elder Villa was one of the few experts in the federation who had stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage. He had risen to fame more than a hundred years ago. And since stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage, his reputation only grew and he had established the foundation of the Heavenly Dragon Villa. In terms of strength and foundation, he was not inferior to the Chus, the imperial family, or the Jiangs.","The Heavenly Dragon Elder was one of the most powerful forces in the Federation. It could be said that such a figure had such influence that even the Federation President had to treat him seriously.","However, Chu Yunfan had never had any interaction with the Heavenly Dragon Villa. Why would the Heavenly Dragon Elder invite him for their 180th birthday?","This was something that Chu Yunfan could not fathom. He had been in secluded cultivation for some time now, and it seemed like many things had gone out of sync. He did a little research on the Internet and discovered that this small invitation had already stirred up a huge wave. Especially among the younger generation.","Chu Yunfan looked into it further and immediately understood why this invitation had stirred up such a huge storm. The Heavenly Dragon Elder was one of the strongest experts in the world. Such a title in itself was already very attractive, not to mention that their birthday celebration would only be held once every ten years. And every time, it would become a grand ceremony for the Federation.","All people who were invited were bigwigs and celebrities of the Federation. Even the vice president of the Federation had personally attended the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s birthday celebration the last time.","One could imagine the prestige of the Heavenly Dragon Elder. Compared to the other Divine experts, the Heavenly Dragon Elder especially liked to promote and enlighten the younger generation. Over the years, many of the people who had been promoted by him had reached high positions within the Federation.","And every time the Heavenly Dragon Elder celebrated his birthday, he would send out invitations to many young and talented people. And from among them, the outstanding ones would receive the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s personal guidance. When that happened it was no problem for their cultivation to advance by leaps and bounds.","Therefore, many young geniuses viewed this as a stage for them to stand out. It was a rare opportunity.","The price of the invitations could be hyped up to sky-high prices.","Yes, this invitation could be sold, because the Heavenly Dragon Villa only recognized invitations and not people. As long as one held an invitation, they could enter the venue."]},{"number":635,"title":"Chapter 635 - Geniuses of the Era? Don’t Let Me Down!","paragraphs":["Among these invitations, gilded invitations like the one Chu Yunfan received were the most special. Not everyone who went to the celebration would receive guidance from the Heavenly Dragon Elder.","Only those who held gilded invitations would have the chance to receive guidance from the Heavenly Dragon Elder.","Thousands of celebrities would be attending the birthday celebration, but only ten of these gilded invitations were given out.","Therefore, this invitation card was called Heaven’s Pride Invite. If one were to receive this Heaven’s Pride Invite, it would undoubtedly become a symbol. Not only was it a hidden opportunity, but it also represented a kind of reputation.","An invitation that could only be obtained by top-tier geniuses.","There were many people who wanted these invitations, but there were only ten of them in existence. Therefore, every time a Heaven’s Pride Invite was sent out, it would set off a frenzy.","Because Heavenly Dragon Villa only recognized invitations and not people, it stimulated many people’s desire to fight for the invitations. Over the generations, many who had received these invitations had them snatched away by others.","However, the Heavenly Dragon Villa seemed to be indifferent to this situation and even faintly encouraged it. This left many people puzzled. Some guessed that this was the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s strategy to increase the value of the invitations. No matter who received the invitation at the beginning, the person who was able to attend the banquet, in the end, was undoubtedly the final victor.","Regardless of whether it was by relying on their strength or on the power of the clan or sect behind them or if they were lucky enough to get their hands on one somehow, it did not matter. In cultivation, regardless of whether it was their individual strength, the power behind them, or luck, each of them was a crucial factor.","Using one invitation to select the most outstanding genius of every decade. This method of trading a pen for a house was indeed breathtaking. However, the Heavenly Dragon Elder continuously promoted the younger generation over the years. Through such a method, he was able to accumulate such prestige. If it was an ordinary person, this would have been impossible.","Even on Federation University’s online forum, the Heaven’s Pride Invite had stirred up a commotion. From the list released by the Heavenly Dragon Villa, there were only ten Heaven’s Pride Invites this year, and two of them had landed at Federation University.","Once this news was released, it caused a huge wave.","Even Federation University, which was known as a place where geniuses were in plentiful numbers, rarely received the Heaven’s Pride Invites. More often, they had not received even a single one.","This was because the students of Federation University were too young. Even though their talents were outstanding, it was very difficult to make up for the disadvantage of their age. They were often considered to be still naive.","The maximum age for those holding on to the Heaven’s Pride Invites was 25 years old. This was the period after that they graduated from university. A few years older than they were now.","The disadvantage in age was a gap that was difficult to bridge.","If Federation University was like this, it was even more so for other universities. It was rare for any of them to ever get a turn.","But this year, two Heaven’s Pride Invites landed at Federation University. One could imagine the sensation it caused. One of them had undoubtedly been given to the current number one in the fourth year of Federation University, Jiang Lingxiao.","As one of the top veteran experts of Federation University, Jiang Lingxiao’s reputation was something that even new students who had just entered the university would have heard of. It was like a divine mountain that was pressing down on everyone’s heads. It could be looked up to but could not be surpassed.","Nobody was surprised. After all, if there was such an invitation, then it could only be Jiang Lingxiao.","The one who really surprised everyone was the owner of the second invitation. It was Chu Yunfan who had just stepped into his second year of university.","Chu Yunfan was also the youngest person ever to receive an invitation. The Heavenly Dragon Elder’s birthday celebration had been held more than ten times, and over a hundred invitation card owners had appeared. And among these people, Jiang Lingxiao, who was less than 22 years old, was the youngest among them. However, as the saying goes, the stronger the better. Chu Yunfan received an invitation before he was even 20 years old. He had broken all the records since these Heaven’s Pride Invites had started.","Originally, two invitations had fallen into the hands of Federation University. It was a great honor, especially since they were both students of Federation University. This itself was also a recognition of Federation University’s teachings.","At this moment, everyone recalled Chu Yunfan and Jiang Lingxiao’s one-year life-and-death battle that had almost been forgotten. Jiang Lingxiao and Chu Yunfan were not just competitors. They were mortal enemies that had to settle these matters through a life-and-death battle.","Many student council members began to clamor on the internet. It was natural for their president, Jiang Lingxiao, to receive an invitation. However, on what ability did Chu Yunfan have to receive such an invitation?","There were even some who advised Chu Yunfan to give up the invitation card as soon as possible. To them, this was tantamount to rushing the situation. The owner of each invitation would have to face countless challenges. There were many who had overestimated their abilities and ended up being crippled in the end.","But although the student council was rich and powerful, there were also many who disliked them. Although they were not sincerely supporting Chu Yunfan, at this moment, they threw all their support behind him.","Even though Jiang Lingxiao was a veteran expert and his strength was without a doubt, Chu Yunfan’s battle results were also enough to blind the eyes of a whole generation. He was the champion of the instructor competition and the champion of the Dao Conference. Among those he had defeated, there was no lack of Innate level experts.","It was enough to prove that Chu Yunfan had already stepped into Innate level combat strength before he was even twenty. No matter where such a person was placed, he would be an outstanding person. What was there to talk about being immoral and incompetent?","In an instant, Federation University’s forum was filled with arguments between the two sides.","On the other hand, Jiang Lingxiao and Chu Yunfan, who were at the center of public opinion, did not say a word. Although he did not know what Jiang Lingxiao thought of this matter, Chu Yunfan had no interest in participating in this argument.","Looking at the gilded invitation in his hand, Chu Yunfan smiled and said, “Looks like this has become a hot treasure. And I do like hot treasures!”","Chu Yunfan did not care about the so-called pressure from the outside world. To him, they were just tiny ants. Firstly, he possessed the Demon Descends Illustration. Secondly, he had the inner core of a Divine monster. It was unknown how many covetous eyes he had already attracted, and now that he had such an invitation, what was the big deal?","“It just so happens that I just came out of seclusion, and my strength has greatly improved. I want to see how powerful the geniuses of this era are.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Don’t let me down.”"]},{"number":636,"title":"Chapter 636 - It Was Time for Them to Know","paragraphs":["In the eyes of many, this invitation was a supreme honor. But at the same time, it was also a huge problem. In the past, there had been many who had lost their invitation after receiving it.","After all, the invitation was sent out by the Heavenly Dragon Villa. However, there was always someone stronger among the strong, so everything was hard to say.","Just within Federation University, there were many strong competitors.","Chu Yunfan was within Federation University. Ordinary people did not dare to come in and cause trouble. The whiskers of Federation University were not something that ordinary people could afford. However, if it was someone within Federation University, it might not be the case.","Just as everyone was waiting for Chu Yunfan’s reaction, an invitation letter was sent to Chu Yunfan’s doorstep.","The Fall Symposium of Federation University’s The Fraternity!","If an outsider were to hear of such a seemingly ordinary symposium, they would definitely be confused. However, to the students of Federation University, it was like thunder striking their ears.","The students of Federation University were elite students from all over the Federation. There was not a single one of them who was not a talent in the eyes of outsiders. These people would often pay great attention to building up all sorts of connections. Organizations of all sizes were constantly emerging within Federation University.","This included the Imperial Palace that Chu Yunfan had established. As Chu Yunfan’s performance became more and more astonishing, the prestige of the Imperial Palace also rose. Recently, quite a number of people have joined. This was considered a steady development.","Federation University’s Fraternity was a unique organization. The members of this association came from students of all grades within Federation University. However, the requirements for those wanting to join were harsh.","When it was established in the early days, The Fraternity would only recruit martial arts class students in the Innate Stage or above. There were not many students in the university who were qualified to join. However, this small network of connections had spread throughout the entire university.","Many of the first students to graduate from The Fraternity were ranked highly within the Federation.","The students who graduated from Federation University were at least middle-class and above figures in society, and those who were able to enter the Innate Stage and above during their university days were almost 100% able to become upper-class figures in the Federation. Even one of the presidents of the Federation had been a member of The Fraternity.","Therefore, those who did not know about it were fine. Those who knew about The Fraternity were just in awe. However, ordinary people were not qualified to be invited. Although there had been a trend of expansion in recent years, the martial arts students were no longer limited to the Innate Stage and above. However, they still needed to be at the peak of the Acquired Stage to be qualified to join. They were considered temporary members and were not full-fledged members yet.","With Chu Yunfan’s strength and his amazing performance this year, it was normal for him to receive an invitation letter from The Fraternity. However, it was pretty interesting that he had received it at this sensitive time.","“Interesting. No matter what tricks you have, bring it on.”","Chu Yunfan looked up information about this Fall Symposium on his terminal. On the Internet, there was a lot of information about the Fall Symposium. Combined with the information in the encyclopedia, everything soon became clear to Chu Yunfan.","This symposium was divided into two parts—spring and fall. Not every Innate level student would attend the symposium. After all, these students were very busy. They would not attend every single time. However, even if they did not attend it, they would still send their most capable followers to attend it.","Originally, this was just a gathering of the top few students of Federation University. However, it slowly developed into a grand event that attracted quite a lot of attention within the university.","It was not just the most elite students of Federation University who were at the peak of the Acquired Stage who would be in attendance. There were also elite students from the other top ten universities of the federation participating in this event. The number of students who were qualified to participate in this event could not be compared to the number of students from Federation University. However, the total number of students participating in this event was quite large. In addition, there would be many young geniuses from overseas sects and reclusive aristocratic families.","Therefore, the Fall Symposium was a grand event for the younger generation. They would spar with each other and exchange knowledge. This was the foundation of the symposium.","There were also many celebrities who would appear. The leaders of some large corporations and the elders of large families would also attend. They would look for outstanding talents to recruit into their own organizations.","Students of various Innate levels would often appear. Bringing the top experts of their own organizations to attend the event was like a small martial arts grand gathering.","Moreover, it was also a good opportunity to attract the elite experts of other schools. For example, the student council of Federation University. Their influence was extremely huge. They even had branches in other schools. It could be said that they were extremely powerful.","Naturally, such actions would inevitably lead to the retaliation of the local powers. Unless it was a dragon that crossed the river, ordinary powers would not be able to span several or even dozens of universities.","Since he had received the invitation, Chu Yunfan was not afraid of this. This time, he wanted to amaze everyone with a single feat. Not only his strength but also the strength of the Imperial Palace that he had established. Although it was still very weak, it was because of this that he wanted to recruit even more talents.","This would also be a good time for Chu Yunfan to establish his prestige. Forget about those old innate expert students. For someone like him, this was a perfect opportunity.","Chu Yunfan called Gao Hongzhi. At this moment, Gao Hongzhi had just been discharged from the hospital. Compared to before, he was clearly much more composed. After going through such an experience, this was the first time that he had come to realize the dangers that Chu Yunfan always faces.","Gao Hongzhi had always been envious of Chu Yunfan’s rapid improvement. But now, he realized that what Chu Yunfan had encountered behind the scenes was not something that ordinary people could imagine. And what he had encountered that day was just the tip of the iceberg.","Although Gao Hongzhi had been implicated by Chu Yunfan this time, he had not uttered a single word. That was not within his nature.","“In other words, you want me to bring the Imperial Palace to this symposium,” Gao Hongzhi said, “But we don’t have the qualifications to attend.”","“I have an invitation letter. You can just use my name. Moreover, this symposium only has qualifications for those who go on stage. It doesn’t have many requirements for others,” Chu Yunfan said, “This is a good opportunity to expand the Imperial [alace. It’s also time to let them know that another organization has risen.”","“All right then, no problem. Thanks to you, the Imperial Palace recruited dozens of Acquired Stage experts last year. Among them, there are three seniors who have stepped into the seventh level of the Acquired Stage. I’ll bring them along to the symposium” Gao Hongzhi said.","“Great.” Chu Yunfan nodded. In this aspect, he was very assured of Gao Hongzhi’s opinion."]},{"number":637,"title":"Chapter 637 - Bumping Into an Old Classmate at the Symposium","paragraphs":["In this aspect, Chu Yunfan did not interfere much. Most were afraid that they would be sidelined, but he was not worried.","On one hand, this was based on Chu Yunfan’s trust in Gao Hongzhi. On the other hand, it was based on his understanding of reality. For an organization like the Imperial Palace, they would be nothing without him. He could build a bigger organization within a minute.","Chu Yunfan was the core, and nobody could take that away.","Furthermore, Chu Yunfan had always felt that those who achieved great things did not care about minor details. This was not because they had high ambitions but low talents. It was just that there was a limit to a person’s time. Naturally, they had to attend to more important things. He did not have time to waste on micromanaging.","As long as Chu Yunfan could ensure that his cultivation continued to improve and make a name for himself, that would be his greatest contribution to the Imperial Palace.","Gao Hongzhi, on the other hand, was different. Although he had Chu Yunfan’s help, he was only at the peak of the Sea Qi Stage and had yet to enter the Acquired Stage. His achievements in martial arts could not be compared to Chu Yunfan’s, and naturally, could pay more attention to the Imperial Palace.","The Imperial Palace was built by Gao Hongzhi, and its future contribution to his career was immeasurable.","Gao Hongzhi knew very well that the hundreds of millions of people in the Federation were not all martial arts experts. That was unrealistic.","Tongshan City, which was named after the nearby Tongshan Mountain Range, was one of the newly built cities in recent years. Compared to other satellite cities, it did not have a large population. It only had two million citizens.","In the past few days, many young people have ventured to the outskirts of Tongshan City. These people were all equipped with unique skills and looked like martial arts experts. The nearby residents were curious about what they were up to and only found out after asking. It turned out that the Fall Symposium of Federation University’s Fraternity was to be held there.","They did not know much about what was going on, but at the mention of Federation University, the nearby residents felt awe and respect. For so many years, the prestige of Federation University had long been deeply rooted in everyone’s hearts. Those who were able to enter Federation University were all regarded as geniuses.","On this day, in the residential area where the Fall Symposium was to be held, an eighteen or nineteen-year-old youth arrived at the scene. He had a slender figure and a delicate and pretty face. He left behind a faint feeling of being in harmony with nature wherever he walked.","In the bustling center of the symposium, he seemed to be a little out of place.","“The person who organized this symposium is such a talent.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the sea of people in front of him. He estimated that there were at least tens of thousands of people here. Other than a portion of the students who actually came to participate in the symposium, there were also many socialites and residents who came from nearby to witness the symposium.","In the beginning, the symposium was where just a few people gathered to chat and compare notes. Now, it has become a flourishing event. Although the scale was not particularly large, it possessed considerable influence.","As far as Chu Yunfan knew, every year during the symposium, many leaders of the various satellite cities came to try to get more people to settle down in their respective cities. For this, they did not hesitate to offer a large number of preferential conditions. By doing so, they naturally had their own demands. It was like back in the Common Era, when various countries competed to hold the Olympics and various other events, symposiums, and forums.","The Fall Symposium was not that big, but its impact was enough to make the local leaders of the satellite cities happy.","Chu Yunfan smiled. The students of Federation University were all elites. Those who were able to organize this kind of event were one of the few Innate-level big shots. This kind of thing was just a small matter.","This symposium had already gone on for a few days. However, the true big shots had yet to appear. Today was the day when the various universities, sects, aristocratic families, and Innate level experts would make their move.","It was also the climax of the entire symposium. It was only at this moment that Chu Yunfan had come. However, just as he was about to meet up with Gao Hongzhi who had arrived a few days ago, he suddenly heard a voice from behind him.","“Chu Yunfan!” He turned his head and saw that it was a young girl who looked about eighteen or nineteen years old. She was striding over.","This young girl was quite beautiful. She was tall and slender and wore a martial arts suit which attracted the attention of the surrounding people.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes revealed a somewhat puzzled expression as he said, “And you are?”","“Chu Yunfan, it’s only been a few years and you’ve already forgotten all about me. It’s Yang Lili,” the young girl said in surprise as she took off her sunglasses.","“It really is you. When I looked from afar just now, I thought I was mistaken. You’re much thinner than before.” Chu Yunfan finally came to a realization. This young girl’s name was Yang Lili, and she was his classmate in junior high school. At that time, she was the class belle of their class and had many suitors. Although she could not compare to Tang Siyu, Bai Ling’er, and some others, she was still considered quite a beauty.","However, it had been more than four years since Chu Yunfan had graduated from junior high school. Yang Lili had changed a lot. He could not recognize her for a moment.","Chu Yunfan had also changed a lot. In the past, his figure looked more muscular. However, after harnessing the Imperial Physique, his muscles became tenser, and he looked slimmer now.","When Yang Lili saw Chu Yunfan, she was pleasantly surprised. When they were in junior high school, their relationship was only average. At that time, Yang Lili was already the class belle, and Chu Yunfan was just mediocre at that time, so they naturally would not have any interactions.","Since they were old classmates, they were naturally more intimate when they met.","“I didn’t expect to see you here,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","“Are you here to watch the Fall Symposium?” Yang Lili asked.","“Yeah, I guess so.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “Why? Are you also here to watch the symposium?”","“I was admitted to Tongshan University and happened to be nearby, so I came here to take a look with my classmates,” Yang Lili said, “Did you come alone?”","“Yeah,” Chu Yunfan said as he nodded.","“Great. Why don’t you come with us? It’s rare to meet old classmates. I’m pretty familiar with this place, so I’ll take you around,” Yang Lili said. Without another word, she pulled Chu Yunfan to the center of the venue.","Chu Yunfan could not help but laugh bitterly. Yang Lili had always been like this, and she had not changed much. However, she was a good person. From the beginning, she had not put on any airs despite being the class belle. As a result, she had been extremely popular among the boys in the class. She could be said to be the first dream goddess of many boys.","“Let me tell you, you came to the right place today. Federation University’s Fall Symposium will reach its climax today. I heard that there will be Innate level student experts appearing. Oh my god! Innate-level experts! Even the mayor isn’t that powerful!”"]},{"number":638,"title":"Chapter 638 - Chu Yunfan? That Sounds a Little","paragraphs":["As Yang Lili spoke, a yearning expression appeared on her face. For an ordinary person like her, an expert at the Innate Stage was an important figure at the edge of the horizon.","Although the Federation was known as the era of great cultivation for humankind, most people would only be able to reach the Energy Refinement Stage. Not only was there a difference in talent, but there was also a huge difference in cultivation resources. This caused most people to be unable to advance further.","The Federation could not do anything about this. Compared to hundreds of years ago, the current situation was already considered pretty good. Hundreds of years ago, only one in ten thousand could reach the Energy Refinement Stage.","The big shots who reached the Divine Abilities Stage were legends. The Divine that was most often seen by the public was the president of the Federation. And that was only through the television. The other Divines were only heard through rumors from time to time.","To them, becoming Innate experts were already big shots that they could only dream of. Even in the current era where everyone was equal, the ranks between people were still clear and had never disappeared.","However, Yang Lili would have never guessed that she was dragging along an Innate expert with her. Her impression of Chu Yunfan was still stuck in her middle school time. Back then, Chu Yunfan had been very ordinary in all aspects.","If it was not for the fact that they had not seen each other for a long time and it could be said that they had met in a foreign land, Yang Lili would not have shown such enthusiasm.","At the same time, in a private room in the center of the venue, two young men in their twenties were sitting opposite each other. One of them had short hair and wore a martial arts suit. He looked tall and strong and had an imposing aura.","The other one looked gentle and elegant. He was wearing a long robe that fit him well. He looked extraordinary.","“Are you sure he’ll come?” the tall and strong young man asked.","“Of course. Didn’t he establish his own organization, the Imperial Palace? I’ve received information that several representatives of the Imperial Palace have come. This means that he’ll definitely come,” the gentle and elegant young man said slowly, “The Imperial Palace has only been around for a year, and he doesn’t have any capable experts. If he doesn’t come himself, why would he let his people come here? Is he asking to be humiliated?”","“Won’t he be suspicious?” the short-haired young man continued.","“That doesn’t matter. What’s important is that he’s already here,” the gentle-looking young man said, “He has the right to be invited. This is also in line with the standard operating procedures of The Fraternity. Other than this method, do you have any other ideas? If he hides in his villa and goes into seclusion until Heavenly Dragon Elder’s birthday, do you have any ideas to lure him out?”","“That’s true. If he hides and acts like a cowardly turtle, we won’t have any way to lure him out. It wouldn’t be good if we attacked him directly while at the university. That teacher of his, Jeang Yuanbin, isn’t someone to be trifled with. It would be troublesome if we provoked him. But now that he’s out of the turtle shell, there’s nothing to worry about,” the short-haired young man said with a smile.","From his words, it was clear that he looked down on Chu Yunfan. On the contrary, Jeang Yuanbin was a much stronger deterrent. Although Chu Yunfan had once defeated Wang Qi who was in the Innate Stage, in front of this guy, Wang Qi was nothing.","Chu Yunfan was just a newbie in their circle. Defeating Wang Qi was not enough for him to be on the same level as them.","“You’re not afraid of offending him, I see. But I know this kid. He’s very strong and highly talented. His future is limitless, and he even has the Chu family backing him up. He’s not someone to be trifled with,” the short-haired youth continued.","The gentle and refined youth immediately shed his previous gentleness, and his gaze became fierce as he said, “How can a man cower in fear when doing things? I’m determined to obtain that invitation. Based on the information I received, Jiang Lingxiao seems to have just obtained an inheritance from the Ancient Zenith Civilization. When the time comes, he’ll surely be much stronger. I’ve fought with him for so many years. Don’t tell me that I should admit defeat now.","“Moreover, so what if I have offended Chu Yunfan? So what?!” The mild-mannered young man sprung to his feet, “He has a life-and-death duel agreement with Jiang Lingxiao. Based on my understanding of Jiang Lingxiao, if Chu Yunfan hadn’t proposed a life-and-death duel, Jiang Lingxiao might still put on an act and not kill him. But since Chu Yunfan has proposed this life-and-death duel, he’s courting death. Jiang Lingxiao isn’t a kind person. If Chu Yunfan doesn’t die, how can Jiang Lingxiao convince the masses?","“Besides, I, Qi Shaohua, am not one to be scared,” the gentle and refined youth proclaimed, “So what if I offend Chu Yunfan? There has never been any peaceful coexistence on the Great Dao. We always have to fight for more. Opportunities are limited, so I have to fight for them!","“Now, we have to be wary of others who are trying to get their hands on this invitation. Zha Hanhai, this time, we’ll work together. I will give you what I’ve promised you.”","When the short-haired youth, Zha Hanhai, heard this, he smiled and said, “That’s only natural. Since the invitations were sent to Federation University, it’s only right that they stay at Federation University. If other people want to extend their hands, they’ll die by our hands.”","Zha Hanhai was very satisfied with what Qi Shaohua had said. He was even willing to be Qi Shaohua’s assistant in this matter. From his words, Qi Shaohua clearly did not think that this matter was that difficult. He was already thinking about how to deal with the aftermath after snatching the invitation.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan and his old classmate, Yang Lili, had arrived in front of three young people who looked like students.","The young man in the lead looked to be in his twenties. He had a somewhat arrogant expression. Behind him were a man and a woman. The two of them looked very intimate. It was obvious that they were lovers.","When the arrogant youth saw Yang Lili pulling Chu Yunfan over, displeasure flashed through his eyes. However, he did not show it on his face, but Chu Yunfan naturally saw everything.","When the girl among the two lovers saw Yang Lili, she immediately asked, “Lili, who’s this?”","As she spoke, the girl glanced at the young man in the lead as though she was afraid that he would get angry.","Yang Lili did not seem to notice. She simply said, “Let me introduce you guys. This is my classmate from junior high. His name is Chu Yunfan. I didn’t expect to see him here. It’s been many years since we last met. As one who’s familiar with this place, I brought him over. Now, everyone has a companion.”","At this moment, the couple hurriedly looked at the youth in the lead, only to see that he had a frown on his face.","Chu Yunfan? That name sounded familiar."]},{"number":639,"title":"Chapter 639 - Would You Like to Try Going Up","paragraphs":["The youth in the lead frowned slightly. This name sounded a little familiar. However, he instantly felt relieved and did not take it to heart.","He paid a lot of attention to Yang Lili. He was originally a little unhappy, but when he saw that Yang Lili and Chu Yunfan were not intimate, he instantly heaved a sigh of relief.","Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary classmate. After all, Chu Yunfan and Yang Lili had not seen each other for a few years. This was pretty normal. Thinking of this, the youth took a closer look at Chu Yunfan. There was not so much hostility in his expression anymore.","“So, he’s your old classmate. Nice to meet you. My name’s Du Yue’er,” the girl offered.","“Chu Yunfan, let me introduce you. This is my good friend, Du Yue’er, and her boyfriend, Ma Wu,” Yang Lili said, “And this is my amazing senior. He’s a top student of Qinghua University, Senior Jia Taihua.”","“Hello.” Chu Yunfan nodded in greeting. No wonder this young man had an arrogant look on his face. It turned out that he was a disciple of a famous university.","Federation Univerisity was not the only top university within the Federation. Although Qinghua University was slightly inferior to Federation University, it was still a famous university that had existed for hundreds of years. The outstanding disciples that came out of there had spread throughout the entire Federation.","“Since you’re Lili’s old classmate, let’s stick together,” Jia Taihua said.","Du Yue’er and Ma Wu let out a slight sigh of relief. The two of them clearly wanted to act according to Jia Taihua’s mood. Students who graduated from Qinghua University were undoubtedly high and mighty to them, and they could not afford to provoke them.","Now that they saw Jia Taihua did not seem to be angry, they let out a sigh of relief. How could the two of them not see Jia Taihua’s feelings toward Yang Lili? They had even been trying to play matchmaker for Jia Taihua and Yang Lili.","Fortunately, they could see that Chu Yunfan did not seem close to Yang Lili. They were just ordinary classmates.","Jia Taihua could not recall why the name Chu Yunfan sounded familiar, so he simply stopped thinking about it. After all, Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary classmate.","Chu Yunfan looked somewhat noncommittal. He was just here to humor his old classmate. Otherwise, he would not have bothered to pay attention to Jia Taihua.","They quickly made their way toward the center of the venue.","The four friends were happily chatting away. On the other hand, Chu Yunfan, who was trailing behind them, was neglected. Only Yang Lili would occasionally turn around and talk to him, while he would give short responses. He really did not mind at all.","They started to observe the center of the venue. The venue center was made up of a few arenas. Right at the center was an arena with a radius of about two to three hundred square meters. There were even chairs placed on top of it. It was obvious that this was the core of this symposium, and also the seats for the Innate level disciples.","The reason why these arenas had been prepared was that this symposium was not a simple discussion of Dao. In the end, there would be sparring matches and a showdown.","Other than this core arena, there were many small arenas with a radius of dozens of square meters. In the smaller arenas, there were quite a number of people fighting on them. Around the arenas, there were quite a number of people watching the matches taking place. There were even large screens that were broadcasting live.","Many youths were eager to give it a try. To them, this was undoubtedly a good opportunity to become famous.","In this society, keeping a low profile was not advocated. The more famous one was, the more support they would receive from all aspects. If one displayed enough talent and strength, there would naturally be people willing to sponsor them.","And for cultivators, resources were extremely important. They could not afford to be lacking in them.","The center of the venue was lined with private rooms. There were already many socialites stationed inside. And among them, there were also many big shots from various financial groups, families, and sects.","These young students were eager to try and attract the attention of these big shots. Not everyone could be like Chu Yunfan, who was able to kill his way to this stage almost all on his own.","However, Chu Yunfan swept a glance at the scene and immediately lost interest. To the outside world, these students were indeed outstanding. All of them were less than twenty years old and had already entered the peak of the Energy Refinement Stage or even the Acquired Stage, but in front of him, they were nothing.","However, to Yang Lili, Ma Wu, and Du Yue’er, Acquired Stage experts were like mythical experts. They had yet to step into the Energy Refinement Stage, which was naturally a very high level for them.","On the contrary, like Chu Yunfan, Jia Taihua did not seem too impressed.","“Senior Jia, do you want to go up and show us your skills? Lili admires that kind of martial arts expert very much,” Du Yue’er said as she gave him an imploring look.","Jia Taihua seemed to be waiting for this. He looked at Yang Lili and she seemed to be looking forward to it. He immediately said, “In that case, I’ll go up and give it a try.”","Chu Yunfan saw everything. Jia Taihua probably wanted to pursue Yang Lili, while Ma Wu and Du Yue’er were matchmakers.","In front of Yang Lili, Jia Taihua naturally had to perform well.","As he spoke, Jia Taihua took advantage of the gap at the end of an arena battle to go up the stage and introduce himself.","“I’m Jia Taihua of Qinghua University. Who here would like to teach me a lesson?”","Although Jia Taihua was a little arrogant, he had some skills. He swept away everyone who went up to challenge him, and almost all of them were experts at the peak of the Energy Refinement Stage. In front of Jia Taihua, there was clearly a big gap.","Chu Yunfan could tell that Jia Taihua had stepped into the Acquired Stage.","Jia Taihua easily defeated all his opponents. Then, he stepped out of the ring.","“Senior Jia, you were amazing. You looked like you were chopping melons and vegetables,” Du Yue’er said a little exaggeratedly.","Admittedly, it was not entirely an exaggeration. They had not entered the Energy Refinement Stage, yet Jia Taihua had already entered the Acquired Stage. The difference was like Heaven and Earth.","“That was kind of boring. The difficulty level was too low,” Jia Taihua said arrogantly with a wave of his hand. “It doesn’t even compare to the internal sparring in my university.”","“That’s right. Qinghua University is second only to Federation University. The students in it are all geniuses!” Ma Wu took the opportunity to say this.","Jia Taihua looked at Yang Lili and saw that she seemed pretty excited. He immediately thought to himself that his performance just now had not been in vain.","However, Jia Taihua suddenly noticed Chu Yunfan’s indifferent expression. He seemed to have thought of something and said, “Chu Yunfan, I see that you seem to have a plan in mind. Why don’t you go on stage and give it a try?”"]},{"number":640,"title":"Chapter 640 - He Had No Interest in","paragraphs":["“That’s right. Chu Yunfan, why don’t you go on stage and give it a try?” Du Yue’er echoed.","“Nah.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. He was not being pretentious. With his current cultivation level, would he not be bullying others if he went on stage?","It would be meaningless.","“Don’t make things difficult for him,” Yang Lili stepped forward and said. She remembered that Chu Yunfan had not been very outstanding in class back then. Although her memory of that time was a little fuzzy. It had been many years after all.","However, there was one thing that was obvious. If Chu Yunfan’s talent had been outstanding at that time, she surely would have been remembered. Forcing Chu Yunfan to go up on stage would be akin to bullying.","“It’s a pity. This is a good opportunity. Who knows how many CEOs, elders, and other celebrities are watching? If you perform well, you might even have a chance to be noticed by them,” Ma Wu said with a look of pity.","Chu Yunfan secretly laughed. There were countless CEOs, elders, and others who wanted to curry favor with him. He did not think very highly of them. But to ordinary people, these CEOs, elders, and the like were huge figures.","“But it’s normal. Not everyone can be as outstanding as you, Senior Jia. You’ve already entered the Acquired Stage, right? I heard that one of the graduation criteria of Federation University is only to be in the Acquired Stage!” Du Yue’er said in a fawning manner.","Jia Taihua simply nodded his head in a reserved manner. There was a hint of pride on his face. Although the graduation standard of the Acquired Stage could only be considered ordinary for Federation University, for the people from other universities, it was as difficult as ascending to the heavens.","To be able to reach the Acquired Stage before graduation was simply unimaginable. And for those who were able to do so, after graduation, their future prospects might be on par with those from Federation University.","It was very normal for Jia Taihua to have such pride.","“I will graduate next year, and I’ve already started my own company. In the future, if you’re looking for a job, you can look for me. With our friendship, it’s just a matter of words,” Jia Taihua said arrogantly. As he spoke, he looked at Yang Lili. As expected, when Yang Lili heard this, her eyes immediately lit up.","It was very common for students of the top ten famous universities to start a company when they were still students. For students of ordinary schools like them, this was very impressive.","“Thank you, Senior Jia. The two of us will ride on your coattails in advance, right, Lili?” Du Yue’er said with a smile.","Suddenly, a young man who looked like a student walked out from the crowd.","When he saw this person, the originally arrogant Jia Taihu instantly slapped a respectful expression onto his face. He quickly stepped forward and bowed slightly, saying, “Greetings, Senior Nie.”","Senior Nie barely looked at Jia Taihu and only nodded slightly. However, he caught a glimpse of a figure in the corner of his eye and instantly stopped in his tracks. His spirit was shaken.","In the corner of Senior Nie’s eyes, a young man wearing a black robe was just quietly standing there with a faint smile on his face. He felt that the person looked very familiar. Then, he felt as if a bolt of lightning that could tear apart the night sky flashed through his mind. He suddenly remembered who this person was, and his entire body trembled.","F*ck! How was this god of death here?!","Almost immediately, Senior Nie remembered who this young man with a faint smile was. Was this not the god of death of this new generation, Chu Yunfan, who was currently in the limelight?","As Chu Yunfan had only risen to prominence recently, naturally not everyone recognized him. Even among the students of the top ten universities, many had only heard of his name and did not know much about him. It was even more unlikely that they knew what he looked like.","This was the reason why Jia Taihua had felt that Chu Yunfan’s name was a little familiar previously.","Almost immediately, Senior Nie turned around and walked in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Jia Taihua had not expected Senior Nie to turn around and walk over toward them. After all, Senior Nie was an influential figure.","Jia Taihua had entered the Acquired Stage before graduating, so he was quite famous at Qinghua University. However, compared to Senior Nie, he was far inferior. He could only greet Senior Nie from afar and did not dare to approach him.","Now that Senior Nie was striding over, Jia Taihua could not help but feel a little nervous, not to mention Yang Lili and the others. Although they did not know this guy, they thought that someone who could make Jia Taihua so nervous must be a big shot.","Du Yue’er even winked at Yang Lili. See? Such a big shot thinks so highly of Senior Jia. This guy has a bright future.","However, no one expected that Senior Nie would walk past Jia Taihua and stop in front of Chu Yunfan who had been trailing behind them.","“Are you Chu Yunfan?” Senior Nie asked with some uncertainty. It would not be strange if he only saw Chu Yunfan. However, how did Chu Yunfan get together with these students who were obviously ordinary people?","Just like how Jia Taihua did not take Chu Yunfan seriously before, Senior Nie also did not take Jia Taihua, who was boasting in front of others, seriously.","“Why? Do we know each other?” Chu Yunfan said as he raised his eyebrows.","Chu Yunfan was not surprised that someone had recognized him. This symposium was full of experts, and there were many people who knew about him. After all, he had caused such a big commotion recently.","“No, no. We don’t know each other.” Senior Nie’s face revealed a crestfallen expression. “I just heard Junior Ziying mention you before. I didn’t expect to see you here.”","“Nice to meet you.” Chu Yunfan said this, but he did not look impressed by Senior Nie. He knew that this Junior Ziying was Situ Ziying. It seemed that Senior Nie had some relationship with Situ Ziying.","Senior Nie was a little embarrassed, but the awkward smile quickly disappeared. Since Chu Yunfan did not want to reveal his identity and did not want to say anything more, he did not want to bang his head on a cold wall.","Senior Nie did not say anything more and left.","After Senior Nie left, Jia Taihua and the others looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief as if they had seen a ghost.","“Why are you looking at me like that?” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","“Do you know Senior Nie?” Jia Taihua asked quickly.","“No,” Chu Yunfan said firmly, “Why? Is he very powerful?”","“Of course! He’s one of the top 100 experts at Qinghua University!” Jia Taihua said quickly. Although he was proud, he knew the gap between himself and Senior Nie.","“Top 100?” Chu Yunfan was stunned. Although he knew some of the experts at Qinghua University, it was only limited to a few in Qinghua University like Situ Ziying. He had no interest in remembering the top 100."]},{"number":641,"title":"Chapter 641 - Dispute","paragraphs":["To Chu Yunfan, the people in the top 100 of Qinghua University were not important figures. He had no interest in remembering them whatsoever","However, to Yang Lili, it was a whole different matter.","Jia Taihua, who was ranked beyond 1,000 at Qinghua University, was an important figure in their eyes. A figure in the top 100 was definitely an important figure. They might even become big shots in the Federation.","Although it could not compare to Federation University, in front of other universities and forces, Qinghua University was still a colossus.","“Senior Nie must be very powerful to have entered the top 100 in Qinghua University,” Du Yue’er said.","“Yeah, Senior Nie is one of the few experts at Qinghua University,” Jia Taihua said. Even someone as proud as him had to lower his head.","As if he was afraid that everyone did not have a clear understanding of Senior Nie’s strengths, Jia Taihua continued, “Among the seniors at Qinghua University, Senior Nie is ranked in the top 50. Among the top students, his future is limitless.”","Du Yue’er, Ma Wu, and Yang Lili looked incredibly impressed. However, their gazes quickly turned to Chu Yunfan. How could such a formidable figure know him?","However, they quickly disregarded it. After all, Chu Yunfan was so ordinary, and it was possible that Senior Nie had only heard of him by chance, so they did not find anything strange about this.","“Quick, look! Senior Nie has entered the ring!” Du Yue’er suddenly pointed at a ring in front of them.","They saw Senior Nie, who had been talking to them just moments ago, step into the ring.","Chu Yunfan looked over and started to ponder. This symposium was held over a few days, but today was the real highlight. Over the past few days, there had been many going into the rings to spar.","Among these people, some were doing it for their own fame, while some were doing it for the sake of the organization they were in. And Senior Nie should belong to the latter category.","With the elite experts among the students taking action, it naturally attracted the attention of many.","Chu Yunfan followed the stream of people and watched from afar as Senior Nie’s actions were broadcasted to the big screen. Compared to Jia Taihua, he was indeed much stronger. He had stepped into at least the sixth level of the Acquired Stage. Although it was not enough to compare to the geniuses Chu Yunfan had seen in the past, to an ordinary person, it could be said to be the height of a mountain.","Senior Nie easily won several rounds. There was even elite Acquired Stage students from Northern University who were no match for him.","“This level of battle is just a small matter to Senior Nie. It’s not as intense as the sparring in the university.” Jia Taihua had a proud expression on his face. Clearly, he was honored to have such a senior.","In reality, if the Federation University had not been a colossus that was pressing down on the other famous universities, Qinghua University would be able to contend for the number one ranking among the various universities within the Federation.","Chu Yunfan watched from afar. Senior Nie had won a few matches in a row, yet he did not have the slightest intention of stopping. His lips revealed a triumphant smirk.","Senior Nie was definitely going to get in trouble. In a place like this, it was fine if he won a few rounds. But if he continued to occupy the ring and refused to give it up, he would soon attract true experts.","Of course, it was not impossible to occupy the arena. It really depended on the situation. If he, Chu Yunfan, wanted to go on stage, no one would dare to say anything even if he won a hundred rounds in a row. However, although this Senior Nie was pretty strong, there were too many experts present. And although Qinghua University was a resounding name, it had many opponents and enemies.","As expected, a beautiful figure floated onto the stage. Chu Yunfan took a look and realized who it was. It was an old acquaintance, the first seat of the freshmen of Northern University, Le Yuzhu.","Compared to half a year ago, Le Yuzhu’s aura was clearly much more stable now. Although she had lost to Chu Yunfan, to others, she was still a genius.","“I, Le Yuzhu from Northern University, am here to exchange a few moves.”","“Le Yuzhu? Why is she here?” Jia Taihua frowned and thought for a long time before he finally remembered who Le Yuzhu was.","“What’s wrong, Senior Jia? Is this Le Yuzhu very powerful?” Ma Wu asked.","“I’ve heard of her. She’s the first seat of the sophomores at Northern University,” Jia Taihua said. The students of Qinghua University had a better understanding of the students of Northern University as compared to the students of Federation University. After all, they had been competing with each other for hundreds of years.","“Senior Nie should be fine, right?” Du Yue’er looked a little worried.","If it was just an ordinary Northern University student, it would not be a big deal. However, Jia Taihua had mentioned that she was the first seat of the sophomores at Northern University. No matter how ignorant Du Yue’er was, she knew what it meant to be in the first seat of a year at a university like Northern University. Le Yuzhu was practically one of the strongest people of their generation","With the grudges between Northern University and Qinghua University, Le Yuzhu definitely would not go easy on Senior Nie now that she had personally stepped into the ring.","“There shouldn’t be a problem. Even though Le Yuzhu is in the first seat of the sophomores, she’s still too young. Senior Nie definitely won’t have any problems,” Jia Taihua said with certainty. Age was the greatest advantage, especially at their age. It was the stage where they were advancing by leaps and bounds.","“That’s right. There shouldn’t be a problem. After all, age has the advantage.”","Du Yue’er and the others thought for a moment and came to the same conclusion.","Chu Yunfan listened and shook his head slightly. Age was indeed an important aspect, but it was not the only factor that determined the outcome. Especially for a genius like Le Yuzhu.","“What’s the matter, Chu Yunfan? Do you think otherwise?” Jia Taihua glanced at Chu Yunfan who was shaking his head and immediately asked with some displeasure.","Originally, Chu Yunfan was too lazy to reply, but Jia Taihua’s attitude made Chu Yunfan uncomfortable. If it were not for his old classmate, he would not have bothered with him.","“I’ve met Le Yuzhu before. She’s very strong and definitely not an ordinary person. I’m afraid Senior Nie is no match for her,” Chu Yunfan said bluntly.","“Ridiculous. What do you know? How can a person like you guess the strength of people of that level? And you even said it with such confidence. You’ve met Le Yuzhu before. Would Le Yuzhu even recognize you?” Jia Taihua finally could not hold it in anymore and said disdainfully.","Jia Taihu had no respect for Chu Yunfan. If it were not for Yang Lili’s relationship, he would not have interacted with Chu Yunfan at all. It was already condescending for him to have to talk to Chu Yunfan, but this brat actually dared to go against him. This was simply outrageous.","“Chu Yunfan!” Yang Lili had not expected Chu Yunfan to be so disrespectful. More importantly, she felt that Jia Taihua’s words were more convincing.","Seeing that they did not believe him, Chu Yunfan was too lazy to defend himself. He just said, “The match is about to start. We’ll know when the results are out.”"]},{"number":642,"title":"Chapter 642 - You Should Be Able to Admit Your Loss","paragraphs":["Seeing that Chu Yunfan was not about to give in and instead continued to act tough, Yang Lili tugged at the corner of his shirt, signaling for him to lower his head.","In Yang Lili’s opinion, offending Jia Taihua was not a wise choice. What surprised her was that Chu Yunfan did not give in to her obvious hint.","From what Yang Lili could recall, Chu Yunfan had never seemed to have such a strong personality. What she did not know was how much Chu Yunfan had changed in the past few years. Even the Jiangs and the Huangs could not make him lower his head, let alone mere Jia Taihua.","When he saw what Yang Lili was doing, Jia Taihua’s expression became even more unsightly. He smiled coldly. The person he had pretended to be in front of Yang Lili had been thrown to the back of his mind.","From what everyone had said along the way, Jia Taihua was under the impression that Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary student. He usually would not even look at such a person, but now Chu Yunfan had actually dared to contradict him.","“Very well. How about this, Chu Yunfan? Let’s make a bet. If Senior Nie wins, how about you kneel down and tell me that you’re wrong?” Jia Taihua said with a cold smile.","Meanwhile, Yang Lili, Du Yue’er, and Ma Wu looked at the aggressive Jia Taihua in surprise. They knew that Jia Taihua had been completely enraged.","“Chu Yunfan...” Yang Lili wanted to persuade him, but Chu Yunfan simply raised his eyebrows and put his hands in his pockets. Then, he said, “Interesting. What if Le Yuzhu wins?”","“Do you think I will lose?” Jia Taihua said angrily, feeling that Chu Yunfan was against him at every turn.","Jia Taihua would not be so angry if it were someone with the same status as him. However, he had looked down on Chu Yunfan from the beginning, which was why he was especially angry. He could not allow Chu Yunfan to continue to be so stubborn.","Chu Yunfan was very familiar with the mentality of such people. Some people were proud to be seen as geniuses. They were shrewd, but they were also easily angered. They would not allow any ants to provoke them.","People of the same level could tolerate abuse, even insults, and take revenge after the fact. However, if these low-level ants dared to jump around, they would be trampled to death.","Chu Yunfan had seen this kind of person many times and was unfettered. He just sneered and said, “This won’t do. If I lose, I will kneel down for you. If you lose, will it be over just like that? Are you trying to take advantage of me?”","“Okay, if I lose, I will kneel down to you instead!” Jia Taihua sneered. He instinctively felt that something was not quite right because Chu Yunfan was too calm. He was too calm to be reasonable. Something was not quite right.","What exactly did Chu Yunfan have to be so arrogant for?!","However, Jia Taihua immediately threw this doubt to the back of his mind. He was very confident in Senior Nie. How could Senior Nie possibly lose to a little girl of the same age?","Seeing that both sides were at daggers, Yang Lili, who was in the middle, also felt very awkward. She felt that her old classmate was now a little different. Not only had his figure become thinner, but there were also definitely many changes in him that she did not understand.","On the other hand, Ma Wu and Du Yue’er had complicated looks in their eyes. They felt that Chu Yunfan simply did not know the immensity of Heaven and Earth. He probably rarely even saw Acquired experts. He actually dared to talk about the outcome of a battle between people of that level.","At this moment, the battle between Senior Nie and Le Yuzhu had already begun. Quite a number of Northern University and Qinghua University students had gathered around the ring.","The students of the two universities had a long history of enmity. There was no need to sow discord between them and they would readily enter a confrontation.","In the beginning, Jia Taihua had a confident look on his face. However, his expression quickly turned ugly.","Senior Nie, whom Jia Taihua had placed high hopes on, indeed displayed extremely astonishing strength. However, even though Senior Nie displayed strength above the sixth level of the Acquired Stage, when he made his move, he was still completely suppressed.","In reality, Senior Nie only managed to gain the upper hand the first time he made his move. After that, he was completely suppressed by Le Yuzhu.","After not seeing her for more than half a year, Le Yu Zhu’s strength had increased by quite a bit. Chu Yunfan casually swept his gaze over her, and surprisingly, she had already stepped into the eighth level of the Acquired Stage. According to this speed, there was a great chance for her to step into the Innate Stage in her senior year.","Le Yuzhu was the first seat of a year at Northern University, so it was natural for her to have such strength. Although she could not compare to Chu Yunfan, it was already shocking enough.","Although Senior Nie was pretty strong, it was clear that there was a big gap between him and Le Yuzhu. He was easily suppressed.","The two sides had only exchanged ten moves before Senior Nie was defeated. It was difficult for him to even parry because there was quite a big gap between the two sides in terms of strength.","Seeing this, Jia Taihua’s face was livid, while Ma Wu, Du Yue’er, and Yang Lili kept looking at Chu Yunfan with looks of complete disbelief. Chu Yunfan had actually hit the nail on the head.","How had Chu Yunfan foreseen this outcome? Could it be that he really knew Le Yuzhu?","However, even if Chu Yunfan knew Le Yuzhu, he should not have been able to predict it so easily, right? At this moment, they thought of the way Senior Nie had talked to Chu Yunfan before. They did not feel it before, but now, they suddenly felt that something was not right.","Thinking about it, Senior Nie had seemed like a bit of a lackey, while Chu Yunfan had been completely indifferent.","Before, they thought that it was because Chu Yunfan and Senior Nie were not familiar with each other, and that was why the scene had been a bit cold. Now that they thought about it, they felt that there were many suspicious points.","Yang Lili suddenly felt that she did not really know this old classmate of hers. Chu Yunfan’s earlier indifferent expression had not seemed ignorant or stubborn. It was just complete indifference.","Just as everyone’s thoughts were running wild, the outcome of the battle had already been decided. Le Yuzhu easily won and defeated Senior Nie.","The crowd was in an uproar, especially the students from Qinghua University. They had not expected Senior Nie to lose so easily.","“Hmph!” Jia Taihua snorted coldly and turned around to leave.","“Wait a minute,” Chu Yunfan called out.","“What do you want?” Jia Taihua said as he stared fiercely at Chu Yunfan.","“What do I want? I only have a few words for you. If you’re willing to bet, you should be willing to admit defeat.” Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows and sneered.","Chu Yunfan was not an aggressive person to begin with. In other words, if he was not provoked, he had no desire to be an aggressive person.","Originally, for Yang Lili’s sake, Chu Yunfan would have tolerated Jia Taihua. However, Jia Taihua actually wanted to bet with him. The bet was to make him kneel.","Chu Yunfan would never show mercy to those who bullied him."]},{"number":643,"title":"Chapter 643 - Your Overestimated Yourself","paragraphs":["If you’re willing to bet, you should be willing to admit defeat.","These words sounded like a matter of course, and no one could say anything against it.","It was fine if it was just a normal matter, but the content of the bet required one to kneel down. Without a doubt, this was a huge humiliation.","“Chu Yunfan, if you can forgive others, forgive them. You don’t have to be so aggressive, right?” Ma Wu said.","“Aggressive? I wasn’t the one who brought this up. No matter what, I can’t be considered the aggressive one,” Chu Yunfan said calmly, “I don’t have any superfluous requests. I just need him to accept his loss. If you can’t afford to lose, don’t gamble. If you gamble, you have to be able to afford to lose.”","“Chu Yunfan, this is your fault. Senior Jia was just joking. Why do you have to be so serious?” Du Yue’er chimed in. She also had a somewhat displeased expression on her face.","“That’s right, Chu Yunfan. Why don’t we just forget about this?” Yang Lili said with a somewhat worried expression. She knew Jia Taihua’s strength. He might not be the best, but to ordinary people like her, he was unattainable. She was afraid that Chu Yunfan would suffer a loss.","After all, Yang Lili was the one who had brought Chu Yunfan to their group. She did not want things to turn ugly. But seeing Chu Yunfan’s stubborn appearance, she was somewhat helpless.","“Am I in the wrong? Was it really just a joke? If I had lost, would you guys just take it as a joke and forget about it?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","Du Yue’er, Ma Wu, and Yang Lili were all choked by Chu Yunfan’s words. What he said was true. If the one who had lost was Chu Yunfan, Jia Taihua probably would not let him go either. If Jia Taihua was so broad-minded, he would not have proposed such a bet.","It was clear that Jia Taihua wanted to find an opportunity to punish Chu Yunfan. It was not that they did not know about this, but they did not feel that there was anything wrong with it before. However, the way Chu Yunfan was acting now made them feel as if he was offending their superiors. That was why they were especially unable to accept it.","“You want me to kneel to you? Who do you think you are?” Jia Taihua looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. His eyes flickered with a cold glint. “Looks like you won’t understand the immensity of Heaven and Earth if I don’t teach you a good lesson!”","Jia Taihua already had the intention to teach Chu Yunfan a lesson. Thus, he used this opportunity to display his strength and threw a punch straight at Chu Yunfan.","As an Acquired Stage expert, Jia Taihua’s attack was like a thunderbolt. His punch shattered the air and set off a terrifying airwave.","“Petty tricks. Kneel!” Chu Yunfan let out an explosive roar.","An incomparably terrifying might spread out. Jia Taihua instantly felt that the Chu Yunfan in front of him was no longer human. Instead, Chu Yunfan was a terrifying fierce beast. A terrifying feeling struck Jia Taihua’s heart.","According to rumors, the gaze of a true martial arts expert could kill a person. Just one look at a person could kill a person.","Chu Yunfan naturally could not reach such a level. However, with his current might, it was not something that an ordinary person could withstand. Jia Taihua was completely unprepared and fell to his knees.","Bam!","Du Yue’er, Ma Wu, and Yang Lili were dumbfounded. Jia Taihua’s attack had been too fast. They did not have time to react. They thought that Chu Yunfan was going to suffer a big loss.","However, who knew that with a mere shout from Chu Yunfan, Jia Taihua actually knelt?","Jia Taihua was kneeling in front of everyone.","When they looked toward Chu Yunfan again, their gazes had completely changed. Although they did not know how Chu Yunfan had done it, there was no doubt that this very ordinary classmate that Yang Lili had mentioned before, harbored a big secret.","Looking at Yang Lili’s somewhat incredulous look, Chu Yunfan said, “This fellow is of bad character. If he pursues you, you should consider carefully whether this kind of person is worthy of being entrusted with your life.”","Upon hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Yang Lili’s small face instantly flushed red. Although she was ignorant, she was not stupid. A class belle like her had been hit on countless times since she was young.","The number of times Yang Lili was confessed to in a month was probably more than the number of times that many would be confessed to in their lifetime. How could she not know that Jia Taihua was interested in her?","Yang Lili initially thought that Jia Taihua was pretty great. Whether it was his looks, strength, or education, he was pretty good in all aspects. Now that Chu Yunfan had exposed him, she could not help but feel embarrassed and angry.","“What did you say?!”","Jia Taihua, who had been belittled, grew even more furious. He had not recovered from the earlier shock. He did not know why he had suddenly knelt. He had clearly wanted to teach Chu Yunfan a lesson, but Chu Yunfan had instead forced him to kneel with just a shout. On top of that, it was under everyone’s watchful eyes. It was a great humiliation.","Jia Taihua felt the gazes of those around him sweeping over him. He was extremely furious. With a loud shout, he erupted and launched an attack. He pounced on Chu Yunfan.","“Stubborn.” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and slapped Jia Taihua. Although he was a few meters away, his terrifying energy force swept up and landed on Jia Taihua’s body.","Bam!","Jia Taihua immediately let out a muffled groan and was sent flying at a faster speed than when he came. He crashed onto the ground. He fell into a daze and spat out a mouthful of blood.","Everyone was dumbfounded, especially Yang Lili. This situation completely overturned her worldview. If it was the complete opposite, and Chu Yunfan was sent flying while spitting out blood, it would have been normal.","That would have been in line with Yang Lili’s understanding, but the current situation turned out completely different","Chu Yunfan’s performance was too shocking.","How did this classmate of hers become so terrifying in just a few years? The previous shout that made Jia Taihua kneel was not a coincidence. It was probably the embodiment of true strength.","Like Yang Lili, Du Yue’er and Ma Wu, who were originally full of confidence in Jia Taihua, were completely dumbfounded. This scene should not have played out like this.","At this moment, the people around them were in an uproar. This was especially so when they saw the armband on Jia Taihua’s shoulder. It was obvious that he was someone from Qinghua University.","Although Qinghua University was not Federation University, there was no doubt that it was not easily bullied. If someone were to injure a student from Qinghua University here, they would immediately attract a backlash.","“You overestimated yourself.” Chu Yunfan said these words coldly as he placed both his hands in his pockets.","In Yang Lili’s eyes, this old classmate of hers had become completely unfamiliar and did not dare to associate herself with him."]},{"number":644,"title":"Chapter 644 - Unfamiliar, Chu Yunfan’s Might","paragraphs":["From what Yang Lili could recall, Chu Yunfan had been a very ordinary person. He was gentle and he was not as strong back then as he was now.","Although Jia Taihua seemed very strong earlier, the difference between the two was now very obvious. Jia Taihua seemed strong, but he was not. It was arrogance—the kind that came from the depths of one’s soul. It was just that he had concealed it very well, so no one had noticed it.","The difference between Jias Taihua and Chu Yunfan was immediately apparent.","Chu Yunfan’s strength carried a kind of grandeur. The difference could be seen at a glance. Jia Taihua’s strength was completely set off by an air of arrogance, making people feel disgusted.","But as far as Yang Lili knew, Chu Yunfan was never like this. This was completely unreasonable. What exactly had Chu Yunfan experienced in the past few years after he graduated from junior high school?","At this time, the balance in Yang Lili’s heart was starting to lean toward her old classmate. After all, Chu Yunfan was mostly silent, while Jia Taihua had an aggressive look on his face.","Although it was Jia Taihua who was now defeated, if Chu Yunfan had lost, the consequences would be even more serious.","“Chu Yunfan, hurry up and leave. Otherwise, we’ll be in trouble when those from Qinghua University arrive!” Yang Lili said in a panic.","The students from the top ten famous universities were not to be trifled with. It was not only because of their strength but also because of the famous universities standing behind them. If Chu Yunfan did not leave now, the troubles to come would surely be endless.","Chu Yunfan smiled. Seeing that his old classmate was concerned about him, his heart warmed slightly. Then, he said, “It’s okay. I want to see who they’ll send.”","“Chu Yunfan, if you have the guts, Don’t leave!” Jia Taihua said fiercely as he wiped away the blood from the corner of his mouth.","Jia Taihua was clearly calling for backup. Chu Yunfan looked at Jia Taihua and shook his head slightly. Jia Taihua’s attitude was not as good as earlier. He was just golden on the outside and rotten on the inside.","“I’m not leaving. You may call anyone you like,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer. He was not afraid of causing trouble. Moreover, he had been long prepared for a conflict when he decided to participate in the Fall Symposium.","“Good. You have guts!” Jia Taihua shouted","More and more people started gathering around them. Seeing that someone had provoked Qinghua University and was still standing there, Jia Taihua knew that they would call for help. It was going to be another big conflict.","Many of the people present were students from the other top ten universities, and they could not wait to see Qinghua University suffer.","And now, Yang Lili, Ma Wu, and Du Yue’er also realized that something was wrong. Previously, they thought that Chu Yunfan did not know the immensity of Heaven and Earth. But now, it seems this was not the case. The reason was very simple. Chu Yunfan’s fearless look signaled that he was not a simple person.","Du Yue’er quickly pulled Yang Lili to the side and asked, “Lili, what’s the background of this old classmate of yours?”","Yang Lili did not know whether to laugh or cry. She said, “I don’t know either. Back in junior high, he had been very ordinary. I don’t know much about him now.”","What Yang Lili said was the truth. If Chu Yunfan had been any more different, Yang Lili probably would not have known him even if she passed him on the street.","If Chu Yunfan had been a brilliant genius since the beginning, then all of this would have been understandable. Yang Lili would never forget such a person.","And now, Chu Yunfan had become unfamiliar to Yang Lili. Even back in junior high, the aura of the most talented student she knew was less than one-tenth of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was like those top experts in the videos Yang Lili had seen on the virtual network. They looked down on the world and stood above all living things.","Chu Yunfan had not fully reached that stage yet, but he was already in the starting stages.","“Are you serious?” Du Yue’er looked at Yang Lili suspiciously. If she had not known Yang Lili well, she would have suspected that Yang Lili was lying.","Chu Yunfan’s current attitude was completely different from his usual calm manner. His gaze was so sharp that nobody could look him straight in the eye.","How could such a person be so calm back during his third year of junior high?","“I’m not lying. I have no impression of him at all from our third year of junior high. I didn’t know he was so powerful,” Yang Lili said with some annoyance.","Without a doubt, Chu Yunfan was a good match for her. She just had not noticed it before.","“But no matter how powerful Chu Yunfan is, I’m afraid he won’t be able to stop the many experts from Qinghua University,” Du Yue’er said.","Although Chu Yunfan’s performance earlier had been stunning, after comparing Chu Yunfan to a colossus like Qinghua University, they still felt that Chu Yunfan stood no chance of winning.","“Do you think I’ll be able to persuade him otherwise?” Yang Lili said with a bitter smile. She was not stupid. How could she not see that it was Chu Yunfan who had given face to this old classmate of hers?","“Who dares to make a move on a student of Qinghua University?!” At this moment, a cold shout came from nearby. Then, a young man around twenty strode over. The crowd parted like the Red Sea.","Everyone looked over. This young man who was striding over had a dignified appearance. When Jia Taihua saw him, he was pleasantly surprised.","“It’s Situ Ziying!”","Someone immediately recognized this person. Was this guy not the first seat of Qinghua University’s sophomores?","After one year, Situ Ziying was no longer a rookie who had just entered university. Naturally, he had made quite a name for himself. Someone quickly recognized him.","“Junior Ziying, you have to get justice for me. Someone bullied those of us from Qinghua University,” Jia Taihua said with a forlorn look as he hurriedly got up.","Seeing Jia Taihua like this, Situ Ziying’s face revealed a look of disgust. For a dignified student of Qinghua University to look like this was simply embarrassing.","“Speak properly,” Situ Ziying said.","“So it’s Situ Ziying who came. Looks like there’s about to be a good show. Situ Ziying is amazing.”","“That’s right. In the entire Qinghua University, there are only a few students who can compare to him in terms of importance. I’m afraid that Situ Ziying stepping into the Innate Stage in the future is a foregone conclusion.”","“The strongest people in his generation are not inferior to those from Federation University.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. All kinds of rumors about Situ Ziying came flying from all directions.","And after hearing the rumors and identity of Situ Ziying, Yang Lili, Du Yue’er, and Ma Wu’s faces changed."]},{"number":645,"title":"Chapter 645 - Rattling Swords","paragraphs":["Situ Ziying was the first seat of Qinghua University’s sophomores. They were not unfamiliar with the concept of the first seat. Not to mention that Le Yuzhu had just given them a good example.","Even if one was ranked within the top 100 of Qinghua University, in front of Le Yuzhu, even if one had the advantage in age, one would still be beaten to a pulp.","This was the strength of the first seat.","Le Yuzhu was already so strong, let alone Situ Ziying. And it probably was not because of his IQ.","Although Chu Yunfan’s performance was very strong, he was still far from being a match for someone like Situ Ziying.","After offending such a person, would Chu Yunfan be able to gain any advantage?","Yang Lili, in particular, had an anxious look on her face. She hurriedly gave Chu Yunfan a look and told him to leave, but Chu Yunfan acted as if he had not noticed. He just stood there with his hands in his pockets, completely ignoring Situ Ziying.","Situ Ziying finally noticed Chu Yunfan. He had not come because of Chu Yunfan. He just heard that Le Yuzhu had just taught a student of Qinghua University a lesson in the ring. That was why he had rushed over.","Qinghua University and Northern University. These two prestigious institutions had been in competition for hundreds of years. They had competed against each other for quite some time. Le Yuzhu and Situ Ziying were both the first seats of the sophomores of their respective universities, so they were naturally the most direct competitors.","It would have been fine if it had been anyone else, but Le Yuzhu had made a move. Since Situ Ziying was here, he could not just let it go. Otherwise, Qinghua University would certainly lose face.","However, when Situ Ziying arrived, he realized that the first thing he had to deal with was not Le Yuzhu, but someone else. When he saw the scene, his expression instantly became solemn.","The person who stood there with a completely unhurried appearance was Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had left a deep impression on Situ Ziying. Chu Yunfan was in the first seat of the freshmen of Federation University. He was definitely a genius—a dragon among men.","Situ Ziying’s sights had always been set on Mei Haiyun. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would suddenly appear out of nowhere and sweep through everyone?","No matter who was standing before Chu Yunfan, he swept them all away. None of them had been a match for him.","And Situ Ziying himself had been no match for Chu Yunfan. It was a great humiliation to him. Although more than half a year had passed, the scene of him being swept away by Chu Yunfan was still vivid in his mind.","“It’s you,” Situ Ziying said through gritted teeth. He forced himself to remain calm which caused his muscles to twitch.","“It’s been a long time!” Chu Yunfan’s expression was relaxed as he said with a faint smile.","Only then did everyone realize that Chu Yunfan seemed to be acquainted with Situ Ziying.","Chu Yunfan was not like what many people had guessed at the beginning—that he did not know the immensity of Heaven and Earth and thus dared to provoke Qinghua University.","Yang Lili and the other two were stunned. Chu Yunfan knew Situ Ziying, and they were not just acquaintances.","Moreover, from Situ Ziying’s expression, it seemed that he had suffered some losses at the hands of Chu Yunfan before.","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan just reached another level. Who exactly was he? Situ Ziying was undoubtedly one of the top few people of his age, and Chu Yunfan actually knew such a person.","In that case, it now seemed very normal for Senior Nie to recognize Chu Yunfan.","“What exactly is going on here?”","If it was anyone else, Situ Ziying would have made a move long ago. But it was Chu Yunfan. He knew that Chu Yunfan was not to be trifled with.","“I just made him admit his loss,” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","“You. Tell me. What’s going on here?” Situ Ziying’s sharp gaze fell on Jia Taihua.","Facing this junior who was two years younger than him, Jia Taihua did not dare to hide anything. He knew very well that Situ Ziying was his only hope.","Immediately, Jia Taihua told him everything. He did not dare to add fuel to the fire.","“You fool!”","Situ Ziying felt a headache coming on. Jia Taihua had dared to bet with Chu Yunfan. To geniuses like them, if this was not a direct challenge, what was? To be fair, if someone dared to bicker with him, he would probably be even more ruthless than Chu Yunfan.","However, Situ Ziying could not deal with this using his usual methods. After all, this concerned the face of Qinghua University. Was Qinghua University afraid of Federation University?","“How about it, Situ Ziying? Do you want to seek justice for him?” Chu Yunfan asked.","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, everyone burst into an uproar. Facing a figure like Situ Ziying, who was almost certain to step into the Innate Stage in the future, Chu Yunfan still dared to be aggressive.","Just who was this person?","Suddenly, just as Situ Ziying was having a headache, a group of people walked over. The person in the lead was none other than Situ Ziying’s real target, the first seat of Northern University, Le Yuzhu.","When Le Yuzhu saw the two people who were confronting each other, her expression immediately changed. She had heard that Situ Ziying was here, so she came personally to accept the challenge. Who knew that she would see the killer god the moment she arrived?","The moment Le Yuzhu saw Chu Yunfan, she recalled the time when they had ganged up to attack Chu Yunfan but got beaten up instead. It was simply a nightmare. Before that, she had always been invincible. She had never suffered such a huge loss.","Le Yuzhu had almost been instantly killed by Chu Yunfan.","Le Yuzhu had never forgotten that battle. And now that Chu Yunfan had appeared in front of her once again, she instinctively became nervous.","A group of Northern University students followed Le Yuzhu from behind. When they suddenly saw her stop, they felt it was strange. They did not know what she was doing, but they could feel it. Her entire body tensed up, and she entered into a state of alert.","Le Yuzhu’s arrival had obviously attracted the attention of everyone present. Many people knew of her identity.","“Le Yuzhu is also here. This is going to be lively. There are two high-profile students from Northern University and Qinghua University here. Just who is this guy to have to attract so many people?”","“I heard that Situ Ziying is here to look for Le Yuzhu. Now that they’ve met, there’s probably going to be a fight!”","The atmosphere was tense."]},{"number":646,"title":"Chapter 646 - One-Second Situ Ziying","paragraphs":["“What’s going on between the two of you?” Le Yuzhu broke the silence after a pause.","The moment Le Yuzhu opened her mouth, everyone understood that even she knew Chu Yunfan. This made them look at Chu Yunfan. They were truly stumped as to who he was.","“This is none of your business. Don’t stick your nose where it doesn’t belong,” Chu Yunfan only said coldly.","When she heard this, Le Yuzhu’s face turned green and then white. Nobody had ever talked to her in that way. However, at this moment, she could only endure it.","“Situ Ziying, I’ll ask you one more time. Do you want to stand up for him?” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Everyone’s gaze turned to Situ Ziying. He took a long breath, then said, “It’s only right to admit defeat. However, Chu Yunfan, you’ve gone too far in bullying Qinghua University today. I will not sit idly by.”","Chu Yunfan?","Many of the students present felt that this name sounded very familiar. It was as if they had heard it somewhere before.","“Chu Yunfan? H-He’s the first seat of Federation University’s sophomores!”","At this moment, someone recalled why the name Chu Yunfan sounded so familiar. Almost immediately, they thought of the legendary first seat of Federation University’s sophomores.","“He’s Chu Yunfan?”","Many people sucked in a breath of cold air. There were many rumors regarding Chu Yunfan, but there was no doubt in any of the rumors. Chu Yunfan was definitely not a good person. He had great strength, and his attacks were vicious and merciless.","Chu Yunfan had killed numerous people at the Dao Conference alone. They could not even estimate how many. Those who were able to attend the Dao Conference were the elites of various universities and sects. However, Chu Yunfan had killed many of them as if he had been cutting melons and vegetables.","Thinking of this, the way they looked at Chu Yunfan changed.","Although Yang Lili and the others still did not know what Chu Yunfan’s name meant because their university was far from these influential people, from their expressions, it was not difficult for them to guess that Chu Yunfan was not a kind person and that he had a great background.","Before, they thought that Chu Yunfan had overestimated himself by offending Jia Taihua, but now that they thought about it, it had been a real joke.","“Hahahaha, that’s good. I’d very much like to see how much you’ve grown in the past half a year,” Chu Yunfan said with a laugh.","“Chu Yunfan, don’t be too proud. Half a year ago, I was inferior to you, but that doesn’t mean that I’m inferior to you now,” Situ Ziying said slowly.","The aura in Situ Ziying’s body began to gather together. He knew how terrifying the person in front of him was. A casual blow would not be able to hurt him. It would only be possible to defeat Chu Yunfan if he gave it his all.","“Chu Yunfan, you’ve humiliated my university. As a student of Qinghua University, I will not sit idly by. Do you dare to take my punch?”","“Let’s go,” Chu Yunfan said.","Everyone held their breath and focused their minds as they looked at the two. Le Yuzhu, in particular, looked as if she was facing a great enemy. This was because the two people in front of her were powerful enemies in her mind. If she wanted to become the number one person in her generation, then she’d have to defeat these two.","“Here I go!”","All of a sudden, Situ Ziying’s aura changed. He was extremely agile. Almost all of the aura in his body was released. All of the True Energy in his body burst out, and his whole body instantly seemed to become much straighter, He looked like a divine mountain.","“Double Dragon Emperor Hidden Fist!”","Situ Ziying roared and flew out like a cannonball. Then, he opened his arms and clenched his fists. His fists were like two long dragons, fiercely surging toward Chu Yunfan.","The True Energy from Situ Ziying’s fists splashed out, sweeping out a terrifying power. The strong wind that was stirred up made Yang Lili and her friends, who were relatively weaker, feel as if their whole bodies were being crushed by powerful pressure. They had no choice but to retreat.","Their eyes were filled with incomparable shock. They had never dared to imagine that someone could have such a shocking might. They had seen it in videos, but never in person.","“The ninth level of the Acquired Stage!”","Le Yuzhu’s expression instantly changed. She and Situ Ziying were both the number one sophomores in their respective universities. They were of the same age and had always been compared to each other. She had stepped into the peak of the eighth level of the Acquired Stage with great difficulty. It would be impossible for her to step into the ninth level within a few months or even half a year.","The higher the cultivation, the more difficult it was.","And now, Situ Ziying had actually taken a step ahead of her and stepped into the ninth level of the Acquired Stage. This was a huge blow to Le Yuzhu, who had always been competing with Situ Ziying.","At this moment, when that terrifying aura completely enveloped Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan simply swept out with his leg.","Chu Yunfan seemed to have instantly turned into a mantis as his leg sweep tore through everything.","It was the true Mantis Divine Kick!","This kick tore apart Situ Ziying’s fist force, and his attack turned into nothingness. Then, Chu Yunfan’s leg fiercely collided with Situ Ziying’s two fists.","Bam!","It was a clean sweep, and this leg directly tore through Situ Ziying’s two fists, instantly sweeping toward his chest.","Spurt!","Situ Ziying spat out a mouthful of blood and he flew away like a cannonball.","This Situ Ziying, who had once swept through his peers at Qinghua University and was quite famous in all the top universities, was unable to block even one move from Chu Yunfan and was instantly defeated.","Situ Ziying crashed fiercely onto the ground. Although Chu Yunfan did not use his full strength in this attack, as an Innate expert, it was not something that Situ Ziying could easily defend against.","At this moment, Jia Taihua was completely dumbfounded. He could not believe that the savior he had high hopes for was defeated by Chu Yunfan with one kick.","Situ Ziying was absolutely no match for Chu Yunfan.","No matter how slow Jia Taihua’s reaction was, he could instantly tell that the two sides were not on the same level. That guy he had looked down on was so terrifying.","At this moment, Jia Taihua finally remembered who Chu Yunfan was. No wonder his name had sounded so familiar. Chu Yunfan was the killer god.","Chu Yunfan’s name had been mentioned a little too frequently as of late. It was just that that level was too far away for Jia Taihua, so he did not take the name too seriously.","When Jia Taihua felt Chu Yunfan’s gaze sweep over him, he felt a chill run down his spine. How could he have been so blind to provoke such a fellow? No wonder Situ Ziying had called him an idiot earlier.","Everyone was immersed in the terror of Chu Yunfan’s kick.","It was absolutely terrifying."]},{"number":647,"title":"Chapter 647 - Fearless Threats","paragraphs":["“Is this a battle between top students?” someone asked in fear.","Situ Ziying’s punch was undoubtedly at its peak and had the power to move mountains and rivers. Even so, against Chu Yunfan, it was still broken by just a single kick.","This was what made Chu Yunfan absolutely terrifying.","“He’s really strong. Chu Yunfan really lives up to his reputation,” someone said.","Le Yuzhu, who was standing among the crowd, saw everything. In fact, she was the only one who could keep up with the speed of the fight, and her face was ashen.","Situ Ziying was stronger than Le Yuzhu. If it was her, it would be difficult for her to remain undefeated in a fight against Situ Zhiying, not to mention defeating him in one move. Chu Yunfan’s strength was truly unfathomable.","Was Le Yuzhu already so far behind her peers?","If Situ Ziying was already this strong, what of Mei Haiyun, Dong Fanghao, and the others who were even above him? In her eyes, Chu Yunfan had transformed into a super monster.","Le Yuzhu was quite proud of herself. She felt that she was strong enough, and there was definitely a chance for her to step into the Innate Stage before graduation. If it were in the past eras, she would definitely be able to sweep through all her peers.","However, Le Yuzhu had to admit that the strength of the Federation was increasing every year. There were more and more new people appearing, and each generation was stronger than the last.","The scene just now had left Le Yuzhu completely shocked!","At the side, Du Yue’er had an incredulous expression on her face as she held Ma Wu’s hand. She said, “Pinch me. Is this real? This world is too crazy. Lili, your old classmate is actually such a formidable person!”","“I wasn’t expecting it either!” Yang Lili said bitterly.","While everyone was talking about it, Situ Ziying got to his feet with much effort. Chu Yunfan had not killed him. Otherwise, he would have died long ago.","“Chu Yunfan, I lost to you, but that doesn’t mean that Qinghua University lost to you. You’ve insulted Qinghua University. Someone will come to settle the score with you. There are many experts attending this symposium. Just wait!” Situ Ziying said as he clenched his teeth.","Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows in disgust. What did Situ Ziying mean that he had insulted Qinghua University too much? Could it be that they were allowed to bully others?","If others fought back against Qinghua University, would it be considered bullying?","Chu Yunfan was speechless.","“Let them try,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","Having said that, Situ Ziying had no intention of sticking and continuing to humiliate himself. With the help of others, he limped away from the scene, devoid of any trace of the imposing manner he had at the beginning.","Jia Taihua could not stay any longer. He was not so heavily injured and quickly left the scene, not daring to look at Chu Yunfan again.","On the other side, Le Yuzhu saw Chu Yunfan looking over at her and immediately left with the North Side University students. She did not want to fight with Chu Yunfan at this time.","Martial artists had the courage to advance and were fearless. However, knowing that they were no match for Chu Yunfan and continuing to charge forward would be asking for humiliation.","The crowd watched as the students from all walks of life left the scene. There was nothing more to see, so they reluctantly left as well. However, the power of Chu Yunfan’s kick had been imprinted in their hearts. They could not forget it even if they wanted to.","At this moment, Yang Lili finally walked up to Chu Yunfan. She did not know how to face her old classmate. It seemed that she had been too cold to him before. The little sense of superiority and thoughts that she had in her heart disappeared.","At first, Yang Lili thought that Jia Taihua was a good match for her. But now that she looked at him again, it was not the case at all. The divine dragon in the sky would not have any interaction with the reptiles on the ground. Although this analogy was a little cruel, it was the truth.","However, before Chu Yunfan and Yang Lili could say anything to each other, he suddenly received a message on his terminal. He took a look and his eyebrows went up slightly. Then, he raised his head and said to Yang Lili, “I’m sorry, Lili. I have something else to attend to. I have to leave. Let’s meet again when we have time in the future.”","“It’s okay. Go do your thing,” Yang Lili hurriedly said.","After seeing Chu Yunfan leave, Yang Lili and the others finally let out a sigh of relief, especially Du Yue’er and Ma Wu. They felt that the mountain-like pressure from before had finally disappeared.","Only after truly realizing Chu Yunfan’s might did they realize how much danger they had been in previously. If Chu Yunfan had not said anything for Yang Lili’s sake, they would really be in danger now.","With Jia Taihua and Situ Ziying as precedents, how could they dare to doubt Chu Yunfan’s strength?","“He’s finally gone. The pressure is so great. Oh my god, I never believed that people had auras in the past. I believe it now,” Du Yue’er said exaggeratedly. She used to think that it was just a psychological effect. Now, she truly understood how great the pressure was when faced with people with powerful auras. Especially when Chu Yunfan taught the number one of Qinghua University a lesson in front of them. This matter would probably be imprinted in her heart for the rest of her life.","“Lili, your old classmate is amazing. I didn’t expect such a divine dragon to fly out of that small place of yours. It’s really amazing!” Du Yue’er said. Standing beside her, Ma Wu also hurriedly nodded. He looked like a lackey, but she was his girlfriend after all.","“Yeah, I’m afraid that nobody had expected it.”","Yang Lili could not help but feel a sense of loss. She felt that she had lost something, and perhaps she would not have many interactions with Chu Yunfan in the future.","‘No. I must post this on my moments, or it will be a loss,’ Du Yue’er thought and she did just that.","Yang Lili had no strength to complain about this.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had already rushed to another direction of the venue. There were already people waiting for him.","This person was none other than Gao Hongzhi. And beside him were three other experts. All of their auras were extremely powerful, and their auras were linked. They had already stepped into the Acquired Stage.","They were the three strongest experts from the Imperial Palace that Gao Hongzhi had brought with him.","But at this moment, they appeared to be in a sorry state. One of them was clearly injured. However, when they saw Chu Yunfan, everyone’s spirits lifted. Their true backbone had arrived.","Although Chu Yunfan was not around often, there was no doubt that he was the backbone of the Imperial Palace"]},{"number":648,"title":"Chapter 648 - I’m Here to Correct Your","paragraphs":["After Chu Yunfan, the seventh-level Acquired students were the strongest experts in the Imperial Palace.","They were all seniors, and they were the outstanding ones among all the fourth-years. Originally, experts like them would not join newly established small organizations like the Imperial Palace. This was, without a doubt, the result of Chu Yunfan’s charisma.","When they saw Chu Yunfan, they got very excited.","Looking at everyone’s appearance, Chu Yunfan could not help but frown and said, “How did this happen?”","Chu Yunfan felt it was a little strange. With the strength of these experts, as long as they were careful and did not cause trouble, they should be more than capable enough to protect themselves.","“It was the Danxia Association,” Gao Hongzhi said through gritted teeth.","“The Danxia Association?” Chu Yunfan was slightly startled. He was familiar with this name. Before coming here, he had done his homework and checked some information in the encyclopedia.","The Danxia Association was a veteran student organization within Federation University. Although it could not compare to a behemoth like the student council, it still had a deep foundation. Especially this year’s Danxia Association. It was an organization that was second only to the student council.","This was because the current president of the Danxia Association was very powerful. It was said he was second only to Jiang Lingxiao, Qi Shaohua.","This name was like thunder within the Federation University. After Jiang Lingxiao from the student council, Qi Shaohua from the Danxia Association was regarded as the most powerful. Although he was not the founder of the Danxia Association, he was the person who had truly brought the Danxia Association to its peak.","Qi Shaohua was the only other person at Federation University other than Chu Yunfan who dared to challenge Jiang Lingxiao.","The Fall Symposium of The Fraternity was coordinated by the Danxia Association. This was one of the rules of The Fraternity. The symposium would be coordinated by organizations that had Innate level experts that acted as their overseers.","After all, this was a grand gathering. If the organization was not strong enough, it would not be able to suppress all the heroes in attendance.","Since Chu Yunfan knew that the Fall Symposium this time would be a feast, how could he not investigate it?","“What happened?” Chu Yunfan quickly began to heal everyone’s injuries. It was one of the many miraculous effects of the Emperor Method.","Soon, everyone’s condition stabilized. There was no serious injury. Just some superficial ones.","“The booth in the center of the venue that we had previously decided on was supposed to be ours. In the end, the Danxia Association suddenly went back on their word and gave our booth to someone else,” Gao Hongzhi said through gritted teeth, “We weren’t willing to give it up, so there was a conflict. In the end, they chased us out.”","Meanwhile, the other experts from the Imperial Palace had furious looks on their faces. Being chased out in public was simply a great humiliation.","They had wanted to use Chu Yunfan’s name to recruit some talents, but they never thought that they would be chased out, causing them to lose face. How could they go on recruiting talents in their sorry state?","It was not easy to get students interested in joining the Imperial Palace, but under such circumstances, they retreated one after another. Those who had already been recruited earlier had also withdrawn their application.","They had suffered heavy losses.","“It doesn’t matter. It’s useless to recruit people with weak wills.”","Chu Yunfan did not care at all about those who had withdrawn their application. It was useless to recruit them. However, he knew that the Danxia Association was not targeting Gao Hongzhi and the others. In other words, they were targeting him.","“Hehe, they’re plotting against me.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Can you guys move?”","“We can,” Gao Hongzhi and the others quickly said. They knew that Chu Yunfan was going to counterattack.","“Then follow me to destroy the venue,” Chu Yunfan said. Then, he turned around and headed toward the center of the venue, toward the booth of various organizations.","Gao Hongzhi and the others looked at each other and quickly followed. They could finally vent their anger.","At this moment, the area around the center of the venue was extremely lively. All the organizations were trying their best to recruit people. At the same time, there were many students from various universities who were wandering around, waiting to be sold on something.","It was like a talent market. In fact, there was no difference. These students also knew very well how important it was for them to join a good organization after they graduated. If the organization was strong, they could have a huge guarantee whether it was in starting their own business or getting a job.","These booths were separated from one another. Some of them were very big, while others were much smaller. They were clearly separated according to the different strengths of each organization.","Among them, the organizations with Innate Masters were naturally enjoying the best treatment.","When Chu Yunfan brought Gao Hongzhi and the others over, he attracted the attention of the entire crowd. This was because of the conflict that had just erupted. Gao Hongzhi and the others had just been chased away. At this time, Gao Hongzhi and the others had returned together with someone. It did not take much guessing to know why.","“Isn’t that the organization called the Imperial Palace that was chased out just now?”","“That’s right. They went to call for reinforcements.”","“What’s so strange about that? Which of these organizations doesn’t have a backer? The person in charge from before, that fatty, is obviously not the true backer.”","“I remember now where I’ve seen him before. Isn’t that the famous person from Federation University, Chu Yunfan?”","At this moment, some of those in the crowd recognized Chu Yunfan. This caused a massive outroar to break out. Chu Yunfan had clearly been quite famous recently. Although not everyone knew what he looked like, there were many who had heard of him.","“That’s right, It’s really him!”","Only now did many understand that the backer of the Imperial Palace was actually Chu Yunfan. However, they did not think much of it. Chu Yunfan was only the first seat of Federation University’s sophomores, not the number one person at Federation University. The difference between the two was too great.","Although they were both in first place, there was still a huge difference between them.","If it was Jiang Lingxiao, who would dare to neglect him? That would be impossible. Just saying Jiang Lingxiao’s name would be enough to intimidate all the small fries.","However, Chu Yunfan’s name was clearly not enough to achieve such an effect. To many people, he was just a junior. It was not his turn to make the decision for Federation University.","But today, Chu Yunfan was going to correct their old and stubborn worldview.","Some situations should have changed long ago."]},{"number":649,"title":"Chapter 649 - Collusion, Targeted","paragraphs":["Though the students from other universities and Federation University knew that Chu Yunfan was not to be trifled with, it was just that. It was best to avoid provoking him.","The current Federation University was not a place where Chu Yunfan could make decisions.","Perhaps Chu Yunfan would one day rule over Federation University, just like Jiang Lingxiao did now. With just his name, Jiang Lingxiao could make everyone bow down.","But that would only happen two years from now when Chu Yunfan was in his fourth year of university. If he forced his way out at this time, there would naturally be people who would come out and teach him the rules.","But clearly, their thoughts were only their thoughts. Chu Yunfan had long understood what the rules were. Only people with big fists were qualified to set rules.","Just like in The Fraternity, only the strongest Innate experts had the right to set rules.","And now, Chu Yunfan was here to tell everyone that some beliefs should have been changed a long time ago.","Chu Yunfan quickly found the booth that was supposed to belong to the Imperial Palace. Because everything had happened so suddenly, the banner and signboard had not been removed yet. However, it was clear that someone was already occupying it.","A group of youths around the age of twenty was tidying up the display stand and putting up their banners.","It was the student council of North Side University.","North Side University was one of the top ten universities in the Federation. Although it was not ranked near the top and could not be compared to the top three universities—Federation University, Qinghua University, and Northern University—it was still a university with an illustrious history.","Similar to Federation University, North Side University had been established during the cataclysm. It was formed by the many universities in the north. From the moment it was established, it had occupied the title of one of the top ten universities in the Federation.","Like all universities, the student council of North Side University was the most powerful among the student organizations there.","When they spotted Chu Yunfan and the others walking over, the student council members of North Side University immediately became nervous. Clearly, they were not completely ignorant of what had happened before. In fact, they had participated in it.","“Chu Yunfan, what are you trying to do?” From among the members, a tall young man who looked to be in his twenties walked up to Chu Yunfan and stopped him.","“You know who I am?” Chu Yunfan asked as his eyebrows went up.","From this person’s reaction, Chu Yunfan could guess that the Danxia Association had suddenly broken their agreement and given the Imperial Palace’s booth to someone else not because of their own will, but because of someone else’s interference.","Chu Yunfan did not believe that these North Side University students did not know about what was going on.","The air around the booth was tense. After all, there were many universities that had come to participate in the symposium. But no matter how worried they were, they would not have to be so worried that there would be no booth for the student council of North Side University, which was one of the top ten universities in the Federation.","The universities were divided into different grades, and so were the different student organizations. The student council of North Side University was obviously one of the first-rate student organizations. No one dared to ignore their existence.","However, now that the Imperial Palace’s booth was taken away and then given to the student council of North Side University, things had to be reconsidered.","It was very clear that the Danxia Association was targeting Chu Yunfan. And under such circumstances, the student council of North Side University was willing to be the Danxia Association’s lackey. This in itself was already a sign of something.","Just as Chu Yunfan had guessed, there was always something hidden under the guise of a good thing.","There were likely to be many who had come to target Chu Yunfan at this time, and there were also many who thought of him as a soft persimmon. If he did not want to be treated as a soft persimmon, then he had to express his wishes.","“You’re Chu Yunfan. The first seat of Federation University’s sophomores and also the champion of the Dao Conference. You’re known as the number one person in your age group. Who doesn’t know that?”","The tall youth spoke rudely to Chu Yunfan. Although he was talking about Chu Yunfan’s glorious deeds, he had a mocking expression on his face.","Chu Yunfan’s reputation was indeed resounding, but so what? In the end, he was just a rising star.","The difference in age was still there. Chu Yunfan was a genius, and he was not that great. What was there to be afraid of?","If Chu Yunfan wanted to make decisions, he would have to wait for a few more years.","“Looks like you guys really are colluding with the Danxia Association,” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","“What did you say? I don’t understand,” the tall youth said.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze became increasingly sharp as he said straightforwardly, “Don’t play around with me like this. You guys colluded with the Danxia Association to seize my Imperial Palace’s booth. Are you going to pretend that you have no clue? Or do you think that I’m easy to bully?”","“The booth matters are arranged by Danxia. It’s none of our business,” the tall youth said.","“Hahaha, this is really interesting. You’re acting so shamelessly in front of me!” Chu Yunfan’s brows raised as his anger surged. He was being treated as a soft persimmon that was easy to bully, right? Anyone would dare to step on him.","At this moment, the surrounding students were in an uproar.","“They’re really at it. This is really something. Chu Yunfan is just like the rumors. He’s not a good person. He just got slapped in the face, and now he’s here to get revenge for his people.”","“How can he be a good person? I heard that he killed a large number of people at the Dao Conference. He killed until blood flowed like a river!”","“However, I’m afraid that the student council of North Side University came prepared. Although their president has yet to appear, the vice president, Tang Xingye, is already an expert who has been famous for several years. It’s said that he’s only half a step away from stepping into the Innate Stage and becoming a true big shot.”","Many discussions from the surrounding people floated into Chu Yunfan’s ears. It turned out that the person in front of him was a vice president of North Side University’s student council—a peak Acquired expert.","No wonder this tall youth was so arrogant. Such a figure was rare even at Federation University. At North Side University, he might even be ranked in the top ten.","“Why are you acting shamelessly? I only know that we’re doing things according to the rules.” Tang Xingye revealed a faint sneer.","Chu Yunfan had a big reputation, but Tang Xingye did not take him seriously. Half a year ago, Chu Yunfan’s performance was stunning, but that was only compared to the freshmen. Now, only after half a year, how strong could he be?","“First, you guys didn’t want to talk about the rules, but now you turn around and want to talk about the rules?” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile. Although he had long been prepared to be targeted, anger still rose within him.","“You’ve probably been high and mighty for too long, so you’ve probably forgotten. There are some people you can’t afford to offend, and some things can’t be explained by rules.”","“If you can still stand and talk after taking a punch from me, come and tell me your rules then.”"]},{"number":650,"title":"Chapter 650 - Defeated in One Punch","paragraphs":["“What did you say? One punch?” Tang Xingye looked as if he had just heard the funniest thing.","Tang Xingye looked down on Chu Yunfan’s reputation. In fact, there was even a hint of jealousy in his heart. Everyone knew the value of being the champion of the Dao Conference.","Although Tang Xingye felt that he could look down on Chu Yunfan now, Chu Yunfan would certainly come to dominate the world when he reached Tang Xingye’s age if he continued at the development speed he was at now. Dominating the countless students of Federation University was not just empty words.","As much power as Jiang Lingxiao had now, Chu Yunfan would have as much power in the future, if not more. This was because even Jiang Lingxiao was not as powerful when he was Chu Yunfan’s age.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan had set a record. He was the youngest person ever to receive the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s special invitation.","Tang Xingye was a little jealous, and he hid it well. But now, Chu Yunfan’s words had completely enraged him, and he completely underestimated Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan, do you understand the position you’re in? Who do you think you are? The title of ‘Dao Conference champion’ must have blinded you. You’re just a rising star. If you want to dominate the world, you’ll have to wait a few years.”","In his fury, Tang Xingye had no scruples. He would graduate next year anyway. In his mind, Chu Yunfan’s rise would have no effect on him.","“You’re the one who doesn’t understand the position you’re in. Do you think that the invitation I got was fake? You’re just being used as a tool and you don’t even realize it. You’re a fool!” Chu Yunfan shouted. He did not know what to say to such an idiot.","Chu Yunfan clenched his fists. In an instant, a terrifying surge of True Energy exploded from his body, forming a terrifying wild tide. However, this wild tide was controlled within three inches of his body. His control over his True Energy had reached the peak of perfection.","Boom!","It was just a simple punch, but it held great power. The True Energy shot out and turned into a powerful cyclone that swirled around Chu Yunfan’s arm like a huge tornado.","At this time, Tang Xingye was shocked and angry. He had not expected Chu Yunfan to disregard the rules and attack him directly.","Only when Chu Yunfan attacked did Tang Xingye realize that his previous notions were completely wrong.","Extremely wrong.","Originally, in Tang Xingye’s opinion, Chu Yunfan was already considered a genius to be able to step into the peak of the Acquired Stage and stand on equal footing with him.","It was rare to find someone who had stepped into the ninth level of the Acquired Stage.","However, Chu Yunfan’s strength had far exceeded Tang Xingye’s expectations. In all his previous speculations and information, he had never thought that Chu Yunfan would be this strong.","In a fight between true experts, one could tell the difference between strength and weakness with a single move.","At this moment, Tang Xingye no longer had any other thoughts. This was because he realized that the punch that Chu Yunfan had mentioned was not a joke.","Tang Xingye hastily retreated, but he suddenly realized that someone had locked onto him. No matter how much he retreated, he would definitely not be able to dodge Chu Yunfan’s punch.","This feeling was absurd. There was clearly some distance between Chu Yunfan and Tang Xingye, but it was as if Chu Yunfan had charged right in front of his eyes.","At this point, Tang Xingye could only go all out.","Tang Xingye gritted his teeth. Instead of retreating, he advanced and took a step forward. Then, he threw a punch in Chu Yunfan’s direction. He wanted to clash head-on with Chu Yunfan.","In Tang Xingye’s opinion, this was the best method. However, he instantly knew that he had made the wrong choice.","Bam!","The two fists fiercely collided. In an instant, True Energy collided with each other and swallowed each other, forming a terrifying wild tide that erupted out.","“Aaah!” Tang Xingye instantly let out a miserable cry. It was just a single collision, but he felt that his fist had not collided with another fist. On the contrary, it had collided with a huge mountain, and a terrifying force rebounded back.","That terrifying force rolled back and spilled onto his body, causing Tang Xingye to no longer be able to stand on his feet. He was instantly sent flying. He even knocked into a few North Side University students before he finally stopped.","All of this took a long time to describe, but it actually happened in an instant. In everyone’s eyes, it was as if Chu Yunfan had made a move and sent Tang Xingye flying.","In a flash, everything was over and all everyone saw was Tang Xingye being defeated.","All of them were in complete shock, especially the students of North Side University. They even forgot to help. Tang Xingye had a high prestige among the students of North Side University—second only to the president of the student council.","Tang Xingye was one of the strongest in the entire university.","They had never expected Tang Xingye would be defeated so easily, and that he would be so powerless to fight back.","After a long while, someone finally reacted.","“This... This is way too strong. Tang Xingye is one of the top student experts at North Side University. He even surpasses many of the instructors. Yet, he was defeated with a single punch. How is this possible?”","“I heard that Tang Xingye’s cultivation is already at the peak of the Acquired Stage. He’s just a step away from entering the Innate Stage, yet Chu Yunfan was able to defeat him with a single punch. Could it be that Chu Yunfan has already entered the Innate Stage?”","“That’s impossible. He’s only a few years old. How could he have stepped into the Innate Stage?”","“What’s impossible about that? After all, he received the invitation to the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s birthday banquet. Have you ever seen anyone under the age of twenty get that invitation before?”","While everyone was discussing, a student from Federation University finally spoke up, he said, “Is this strange? The vice president of our Federation University’s student council, Wang Qi, was also defeated by Chu Yunfan in one move. Furthermore, it’s said that Wang Qi has broken through to the Innate Stage.”","Hearing this, everyone was in an uproar, especially the students from North Side University. If they had known that Chu Yunfan had such a formidable battle record, they would not have come here to humiliate themselves.","Especially the vice president of Federation University’s student council. In terms of strength, Wang Qi was even stronger than Tang Xingye. And even he had suffered a crushing defeat, so how could Tang Xingye have any chance of winning?","Originally, this had been an act to suppress Chu Yunfan. But now, it had become a complete joke. Instead of using Chu Yunfan to establish his authority, Tang Xingye had instead become Chu Yunfan’s target used to establish his authority.","No wonder Chu Yunfan had previously said Tang Xingye was a fool that did not even realize he was being used.","As for what that Federation University student had said, that Wang Qi might have entered the Innate Stage, Tang Xingye did not believe it. After all, seeing was believing. However, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was ridiculously strong.","At this moment, a flurry of footsteps could be heard. At the center of this incident, members of the Danxia Association finally appeared."]},{"number":651,"title":"Chapter 651 - The Strong Set the Rules, and the","paragraphs":["After a flurry of footsteps, the Danxia Association who was in charge of coordinating this symposium finally arrived.","Led by one of the middle-sized students, they surrounded Chu Yunfan.","“It was him! He’s the one who injured Senior Tang!”","Seeing that reinforcements had finally arrived, the student council members of North Side University could no longer hold themselves back.","Before this, they had all been stunned by Chu Yunfan’s terrifying and fierce methods. They never expected Chu Yunfan’s explosive power to be so terrifying.","Tang Xingye, who was at the peak of the Acquired Stage, was actually so weak that he could not withstand a single blow. He had been easily defeated by Chu Yunfan with a single punch.","Even the president of their student council probably could not do such a thing.","Tang Xingye was lying on the ground and crying out in pain. They did not dare to go up to help because they were frightened by Chu Yunfan. But now that they finally saw the Danxia Association coming, they felt that they were safe.","The Danxia Association members surrounded Chu Yunfan and his gang. Only when they surrounded them did they realize who he was.","Even though many of the people from other universities knew of Chu Yunfan, they only knew his name. However, among the students from Federation University, more than half of them knew of Chu Yunfan’s appearance.","Chu Yunfan had become popular recently. One news after another, his name would appear on the main page of the campus forum. Even if they did not want to pay attention, they could not help but notice his name. They were well aware that Chu Yunfan was no ordinary person, nor was he some soft persimmon.","The Danxia Association was not aware that the person who had caused trouble was Chu Yunfan. However, it was a little difficult for them to back down now. Their gazes turned toward the middle-sized young man who was leading them.","That young man’s expression was somewhat unsightly. He was none other than the vice president of the Danxia Association, Li Fu. He was the person who was directly in charge of handling the matters of this symposium. The other members of the Danxia Association might not be clear about the ins and outs of this matter, because the Danxia Association and Chu Yunfan had never had any interactions before, let alone a grudge.","However, Li Fu was well aware that depriving the Imperial Palace of the booth they had reserved and giving it to the student council of North Side University was his doing. He had intended to give Chu Yunfan a good show and suppress Chu Yunfan’s imposing manner.","The people under Li Fu did not know this, but Li Fu knew that Qi Shaohua was targeting Chu Yunfan. Since they were about to fall out, there was no harm in doing what he did. He had never expected that Chu Yunfan would charge forward without any scruples.","The vice president of North Side University’s student council had been defeated. Although Li Fu did not know that Chu Yunfan had defeated him with a single punch, he could tell from the situation that Chu Yunfan had probably defeated Tang Xingye with ease.","Unlike Tang Xingye, who did not know anything, the news of Chu Yunfan defeating Wang Qi spread all throughout Federation University. According to the rumors, Wang Qi had entered the Innate Stage.","Most people thought it was just a rumor, but Li Fu knew that it was not. Qi Shaohua had always treated Jiang Lingxiao as his rival, and as Qi Shaohua’s assistant, Li Fu’s target was naturally Wang Qi.","Originally, the two of them could be said to be neck and neck. Who knew that Wang Qi would step into the Innate Stage and be one step ahead of him? This was a great blow to Li Fu.","However, Wang Qi, who had already stepped into the Innate Stage, had lost to Chu Yunfan. How could this not shock Li Fu?","Although Li Fu did not know how Chu Yunfan had done it, it was an indisputable fact that Chu Yunfan had defeated Wang Qi.","Li Fu wanted to use the rules of The Fraternity to suppress Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan was only a rising star and would only be able to endure it. Or so Li Fu thought.","Now, Li Fu realized that he had been sorely mistaken. Some people were just born to not endure humiliation, and he now realized that he did not have the right to make Chu Yunfan endure it.","“You’re the vice president of the Danxia Association, Li Fu?” Chu Yunfan asked. Since he knew about the Danxia Association, how could he not know about its vice presidents?","“Was it your decision to cancel the Imperial Palace’s booth?” Chu Yunfan asked coldly.","Seeing Li Fu open his mouth as if he wanted to deny it, Chu Yunfan said directly, “You don’t have to deny it. This must be your doing. Not Qi Shaohua’s.”","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan curiously. How could Chu Yunfan be sure that it was Li Fu’s handiwork and not Qi Shaohua’s handiwork?","Even Li Fu himself did not quite understand.","“Since Qi Shaohua sent me an official invitation, he must have understood my strength and knew that I was qualified. That’s why he sent the invitation. He wouldn’t pull such underhanded tricks,” Chu Yunfan said confidently, “He knows that such tricks are useless against me. He would just be disgracing himself.”","Everyone was enlightened. But from Chu Yunfan’s words, they understood another thing. Chu Yunfan and Qi Shaohua were on the same level, so they would not pull such a trick to test each other because they knew it was useless.","To be able to step into the Innate Stage while in university. What kind of concept was that? It meant that they would be the future elites of humanity, and they would not lack intelligence.","“Chu Yunfan, don’t go too far. You’re breaking The Fraternity’s rules. This is a rule that has been set for generations. Do you think you can contend against The Fraternity alone?”","At the mention of The Fraternity, Li Fu felt his confidence returning. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan could never go against The Fraternity. No one could go against them.","In a sense, the influence of The Fraternity was even greater than that of the student council.","“Rules? I don’t think you understand yet. The rules are set for the weak to follow by the strong. So you can follow the Fraternity’s rules while I’ll set out some new rules,” Chu Yunfan said proudly as he stood with his hands behind his back.","“Using The Fraternity to suppress me is really ridiculous. Tang Xingye robbed me of my booth, and I gave him back a punch. Since you dare to plot against me, how can I not teach you a lesson.”","“You dare?” Li Fu said in a stern voice.","“Why wouldn’t I? Qi Shaohua set up this banquet just to lure me out. Now that I’m here, I want to see what tricks he has.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he suddenly locked onto Li Fu and instantly made his move. He threw out a punch that was like a cannonball. A terrifying fist force swept out.","It transformed into a terrifying gale and blasted toward Li Fu’s direction."]},{"number":652,"title":"Chapter 652 - One Punch to Li Fu’s Knees, and Qi","paragraphs":["Boom!","To Chu Yunfan, it was just a simple punch. But to Li Fu, it was as if the sky and the earth had collapsed. When this punch was thrown out, the entire world collapsed, and everything disappeared. Only Chu Yunfan’s punch was left.","Vaguely, Chu Yunfan seemed to have turned into a fierce tiger, roaring toward the sky and devouring everything. Li Fu was familiar with this. It was fist force. Only those who had truly cultivated martial skills to a very high level would be able to condense their attacks in such a way.","At this moment, Li Fu was enveloped by Chu Yunfan’s fist force. He finally understood why Tang Xingye had been defeated so miserably earlier.","‘I have to go all out,’ Li Fu thought to himself. This feeling made him despair. If he even had the slightest intention to resist, he would feel a sense of defeat. He could not understand how Chu Yunfan, who had just entered his second year of university, could be so powerful.","When Li Fu was in his second year, he could not even compare to this. And at this moment, he was not allowed to think too much. He could only let out a long howl and try to break through Chu Yunfan’s fist force.","But it was completely useless. He only had the time to organize a single punch before it was completely broken. Chu Yunfan’s fist force was sent flying several feet, right into Li Fu.","Bam!","Li Fu let out a miserable cry as he was sent flying. Even though he was not struck by Chu Yunfan’s fist, just the fist force alone was already terrifying enough.","It was an instant defeat.","All of this took a long time to describe, but to outsiders, it seemed to happen in a split second. Chu Yunfan’s first move had been awe-inspiring, and everyone knew that he was an expert from Federation University. Just like that, Li Fu suffered a crushing defeat at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","“Two consecutive defeats. Two experts at the peak of the Acquired Stage. They’re all so famous that even I’ve heard of their names before. Yet, they suffered such crushing defeats!”","“Chu Yunfan is ten times more powerful than the rumors say. Could it be that he has stepped into the Innate Stage?”","“How could he be so powerful? He isn’t even twenty yet.”","Chu Yunfan had defeated Li Fu with another punch. Regardless of whether it was the members of North Side University’s student council or the members of Federation University’s Danxia Association, all of them felt as though they were keeping quiet out of fear, Chu Yunfan was far more powerful than they had imagined.","As for the members of the Imperial Palace, their faces were filled with excitement. With their strength, they could not be considered weak. They could be said to be the elites of Federation University. In fact, they had a very high chance of stepping into the Innate Stage in the future.","It had not been easy to convince them to join the Imperial Palace. The reason why they had chosen to join was in large part because of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s performance was outstanding, and his future was boundless. Everyone knew that following Chu Yunfan would bring them unimaginable benefits in the future.","There was no love for no reason, nor was there hatred for no reason. They had thought hard about their long-term future, and Chu Yunfan was almost certain to be one of the major characters that could influence the entire Federation in the future. If they were to rely on themselves, they would at most become one of the ordinary upper-class elites of the Federation. But if they followed Chu Yunfan, then the situation would be completely different.","They might even be able to go one step further in the future.","Although Jiang Lingxiao also had the potential to do this, he had become famous early on and had countless followers by his side. Experts like Wang Qi who had stepped into the Innate Stage were all his followers.","Moreover, there were too many of those at their level at the student council. It would simply be impossible for them to be placed in important positions. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had just risen to power and his future was limitless. If they joined him now, they would become great contributors to his cause.","And now, it looked like Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying than what they had previously speculated. The big shots that even they had to look up to, Tang Xingye and Li Fu, were defeated just like that. They were sent flying with a single punch.","Furthermore, Chu Yunfan had not hesitated in the slightest to help them regain their dignity. He had not hesitated to contend against such an enormous power as The Fraternity. Such a person who protected his men was worthy of them following him.","Seeing how excited they were, Chu Yunfan nodded to himself. This was his goal. Establishing his might was not only for those who were stirring trouble outside but also for those experts who wanted to follow him. If he allowed his subordinates to be bullied and did not care, then the Imperial Palace would not be able to attract any true experts to follow him.","Ptui!","Li Fu spat out a mouthful of blood. He felt a powerful fist force wreaking havoc all throughout his body. A look of disbelief could be seen in his eyes. Just a single punch had shattered all of his defenses. This strength was simply shocking.","Li Fu knew about Qi Shaohua’s plan. At that time, he felt that it was almost certain. However, from the looks of it now, it was not that simple.","“Chu Yunfan, you actually dared to injure my people at the symposium! How dare you!”","At this moment, a long howl came from afar. From it, one could hear extreme anger.","Chu Yunfan’s expression turned cold. He knew that the true master had arrived. Li Fu was merely a pawn.","Although saying this was downgrading, in the eyes of outsiders, Li Fu already held a high position of authority. Regardless of whether it was his talent or his family background, Li Fu was the best choice.","But in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, he was just a pawn.","“What are you pretending for? Since you’re here, then show yourself,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","Everyone was completely shocked. The fence sitters had already guessed who it was. Was it not the president of the Danxia Association, the second strongest person in Federation University, Qi Shaohua?","Sure enough, a moment later, Qi Shaohua’s seemingly gentle and refined figure appeared in the center of the venue. Although he looked gentle and refined, there was a fierce aura about him that made people dare not approach him.","“That’s it. Qi Shaohua is here. Chu Yunfan is in big trouble this time.”","“Yeah, Chu Yunfan is too arrogant. This is the first time Qi Shaohua is in charge of coordinating this symposium. Chu Yunfan causing trouble at this time is just provoking Qi Shaohua head-on.”","“If I were Qi Shaohua, I wouldn’t let this matter rest.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. On one side was a veteran powerhouse, while on the other side was a rising star. They both looked powerful.","However, there was no doubt that the scales in their hearts were in favor of Qi Shaohua. He was an expert at Federation University that was second only to Jiang Lingxiao. Other than Jiang Lingxiao, no one else had ever heard of anyone being able to defeat Qi Shaohua.","The discussions caused Gao Hongzhi and the others from the Imperial Palace to become worried. It was not that they were not confident in Chu Yunfan, it was just that Qi Shaohua’s reputation was too great, especially those experts who knew very well how terrifying Qi Shaohua was.","Qi Shaohua walked to the center of the scene and faced Chu Yunfan from afar.","A true battle was about to break out at any moment."]},{"number":653,"title":"Chapter 653 - The Gathering of the Four Innate Experts","paragraphs":["“Chu Yunfan, you sure are brave,” Qi Shaohua said with a malicious expression.","“You’ve finally appeared. And I thought you were just gonna sit around and watch,” Chu Yunfan replied with a sneer.","“You’ve caused a huge ruckus and broken The Fraternity’s rules. I won’t stand for this,” Qi Shaohua said with an icy look.","“Broken the rules?” Chu Yunfan said, “Although Li Fu had not done what he did through your explicit instruction, you instigated it. I’ve always known that there’s no such thing as a free lunch. Do you think I would come here unprepared?”","“Hahahaha, very good. Chu Yunfan, you’re more sensible than I expected you to be!”","Qi Shaohua laughed and did not bother to hide anything as he knew that it would be too boring to continue pretending since his real intentions had already been aired.","“You’re here for that invitation card from the Heavenly Dragon Elder, right?” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","“That’s right. I’m determined to get that invitation,” Qi Shaohua said without hesitation, “I’ve fought with Jiang Lingxiao for so many years. Now that I’m about to graduate, it’s time to decide the winner. I know that you and Jiang Lingxiao have a life-and-death battle agreement. If you hand over the invitation, I will protect you. Then, even Jiang Lingxiao won’t be able to do anything to you.”","“Protect me? Hahaha. With just you?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer, “Seems like you haven’t figured out the situation ye.!”","No one knew what Chu Yunfan was thinking. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan’s challenge to Jiang Lingxiao was nothing more than a shot at fame. Other than that, they could not find any other reason for him to challenge Jiang Lingxiao.","In their opinion, it was already good enough if Chu Yunfan could protect himself. They did not know that Chu Yunfan actually wanted to kill Jiang Lingxiao.","“If you want my invitation, then come and get it. However, I’m afraid that you alone won’t be enough,” Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back as he said indifferently.","“Chu Yunfan, aren’t you being a little too arrogant?” Another cold voice sounded.","Soon, they saw a familiar figure walk out from the crowd.","“It’s Wang Qi. The vice president of Federation University’s student council!”","Some people instantly recognized the person in front of them. He was also a famous big shot.","A person who held the position of vice president of the student council in a place like Federation University was already considered a legend.","“So it’s you—my defeated opponent. You still dare to come out and embarrass yourself?” Chu Yunfan looked at Wang Qi without the slightest change in expression. It was as if Wang Qi was no big deal.","Only then did many non-Federation University students know that the two sides had fought before. And it seemed like Chu Yunfan had won.","Chu Yunfan had defeated Wang Qi who was a famous existence in other universities","“According to rumors, Wang Qi has already stepped into the Innate Stage. Is this true?”","“I’m afraid they aren’t. If he has already stepped into the Innate Stage, how could Chu Yunfan possibly defeat him?”","The crowd discussed animatedly.","“As expected, there’s no such thing as a free meal. However, even if this is a trap, the scale is too small. Qi Shaohua, do you really expect him, whom I’ve defeated before, to be able to defeat me?” Chu Yunfan said loudly as he looked in Qi Shaohua’s direction.","The crowd was in an uproar. Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan was still arrogant. No one knew what his true strength was.","“But I’ve heard of you before. You’ve never done anything that you’re not confident of. You’ve been going against Jiang Lingxiao for many years, but he has never managed to completely suppress you. You’ve always done things in a methodical manner. I’m sure this isn’t the end of what you can do. What other tricks do you have? Use them all,” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","Qi Shaohua threw his head back and laughed uproariously. He then said, “Hahaha, I didn’t expect you to be so straightforward.","“Chu Yunfan, we don’t want to have a feud with you. As long as you hand over the invitation, we’ll let this matter go. How about it?” Another young man with a strong physique walked out from the crowd.","At this moment, the crowd was even more shocked.","“It’s him! It’s Zha Hanhai!”","Many people started shouting on top of their lungs. It was speculated that Wang Qi might have stepped into the Innate Stage, but many did not know if this was true or not. However, Zha Hanhai was different. Everyone knew that he had already stepped into the Innate Stage.","“If we include Wang Qi who might’ve already stepped into the Innate Stage, there are now three Innate experts. Chu Yunfan is dead meat!”","“This lineup is a little too exaggerated!”","“Federation University’s student council has always been at odds with the Danxia Association. On top of that, Jiang Lingxiao and Qi Shaohua have been rivals for many years. I didn’t expect Wang Qi to actually join forces with Qi Shaohua. Could Jiang Lingxiao have instructed him to do this?","“That’s not impossible. Chu Yunfan has publicly challenged Jiang Lingxiao’s authority. I’m afraid it’d be impossible for Jiang Lingxiao to let it slide. Otherwise, how would he be able to convince the public in the future?”","Everyone discussed animatedly. At this moment, in their eyes, Chu Yunfan’s defeat was obviously impossible. Qi Shaohua and the others were not arrogant enough to dare to challenge the Federation’s laws. However, Chu Yunfan would definitely lose face this time. This was undoubtedly a huge blow to a junior like him.","This was in line with the wishes of a portion of the senior students. This new kid, Chu Yunfan, was really too arrogant.","“Not enough. Not enough.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “If you want to force me to lower my head, I think this lineup is still far from enough.”","“Chu Yunfan, you are indeed as arrogant as the rumors say. You can forget about escaping unscathed today. I will take back some interest on behalf of the fallen hero of my family.”","At this moment, another cold snort came from afar. A tall and thin young man had joined the fray. He had flown down from a nearby private room.","“State your name,” Chu Yunfan said straightforwardly as looked at the young man.","“President, you’re finally here!”","Upon seeing this person, the North Side University student council members immediately exclaimed in joy.","They had been scared out of their wits by Chu Yunfan’s punch that sent Tang Xingye flying. Now that their pillar of support had finally arrived, how could they not be elated?","Chu Yunfan connected the dots and immediately understood why the student council of North Side University, who clearly had no enmity with him previously, would cooperate with Li Fu and the others to embarrass him. Turns out North Side University’s student council president was backing him up.","And now, North Side University’s student council president had revealed an important piece of information. He was an expert from the Huang family.","All of it made sense now."]},{"number":654,"title":"Chapter 654 - The Attention of the Entire Crowd","paragraphs":["North Side University’s student council president was a member of the Huang family. Everything was just as expected. It was very normal for the members of the Huangs to come looking for trouble.","With the grievances between Chu Yunfan and Jiang Lingxiao, coupled with the fact that Chu Yunfan had slaughtered the experts of the Jiang and Huang families one after another, it caused both families to now share a common enemy.","No matter how many internal conflicts they had with each other on a daily basis, they were consistent when facing the outside world. They knew that they could do whatever they wanted to the outside world. To a large extent, they had relied on their family’s reputation.","Now that someone had provoked the two families, it endangered the foundation of their survival. It was certain to provoke their hostility.","After knowing this, Chu Yunfan did not find it strange anymore.","“So it’s you, Huang Jianjun.”","Chu Yunfan easily found out this person’s name through the encyclopedia on his terminal. It was this Huang Jianjun, a senior student at North Side University. He was also the current number one expert at North Side University.","In fact, the four youths present were all senior students. Against someone like Chu Yunfan, who had stepped into the Innate Stage when he was still in his first year of university, this was unprecedented.","Even the senior students would barely manage to step into the Innate Stage, not to mention the third-years. Even so, they were considered top figures within their peers. In the future, these people stood a chance of reaching the peak of the Innate Stage.","“Not bad!”","Huang Jianjun walked over. He was dressed in a long martial arts robe and had a slender figure, and there was an inexplicable aura about him.","“You keep saying that it’s not enough. Then count me in. Is it enough now?”","Huang Jianjun looked at Chu Yunfan with an unconcealed look of disgust. As a member of an aristocratic family, he was the biggest beneficiary of the rules. Therefore, he had always hated Chu Yunfan who had broken the rules and risen to prominence.","This had nothing to do with emotions. It was purely the bottom that determined the top. Huang Jianjun’s class determined that he had to do this.","One was a member of an aristocratic family, while the other was a wild weed. Although Chu Yunfan had a mysterious background, it could not conceal the fact that he was indeed a wild weed.","Huang Jianjun did not hide any of his killing intent.","At this moment, everyone was in an uproar. This Fall Symposium had brought together a few Innate genius students. All of them were big shots. And now, four of them had stood out to deal with Chu Yunfan. No wonder Chu Yunfan said that this had been a trap.","If this was not considered a trap, then what was?","Chu Yunfan smiled slightly and said, “Now that everyone’s here, there’s no need to say anything further. But I don’t think this place will be able to withstand our fight. Coincidentally, the symposium is about to begin, so let’s go into the ring and settle it there.”","After saying that, Chu Yunfan took a few quick steps, and his entire body seemed to turn into an afterimage as he moved toward the center arena.","“Stop right there!”","“Don’t leave!”","Behind him, Wang Qi and the others erupted with terrifying auras as they chased after Chu Yunfan.","“Innate experts. They’re all Innate experts!” someone exclaimed in shock.","If it was just a small portion of people’s guesses previously, then it could now be confirmed that these experts were really Innate experts. The four Innate experts were targeting Chu Yunfan.","Such a lineup would even be considered a magnificent lineup within the Federation, much less among university students.","Everyone hurriedly followed behind. It was rare for four great Innate experts to attack a single person.","And these four were all equipped with unique skills. In just a short moment, they had surrounded the huge arena at the center of the venue.","At this moment, the three experts of the Imperial Palace looked at each other. Their faces revealed worried expressions. If it was just one of those four, they would not be worried. After all, Chu Yunfan had easily defeated Wang Qi, who had already stepped into the Innate Stage.","But now, with the four of them working together, it was undoubtedly a dead end for Chu Yunfan.","If Chu Yunfan was defeated, it would be a heavy blow to the Imperial Palace which had just started to take root.","They turned their gazes to Gao Hongzhi. Although Gao Hongzhi’s cultivation was not the highest, he was definitely the leader.","Gao Hongzhi frowned slightly, but soon, his brows relaxed as he said, “Don’t worry. Chu Yunfan is a very methodical person. He has done many things that he isn’t sure of, but he’s definitely not a reckless person. Since he’s here, he must be confident.”","In dangerous situations, Chu Yunfan had done many things that he was not sure of. But in similar situations, he would definitely come because he was confident he would be able to do them. Gao Hongzhi knew Chu Yunfan’s character very well.","In essence, Chu Yunfan was definitely not a person who would get carried away just because he had some achievements.","The three looked at each other and saw that they were a little worried. However, at this point, they had no other choice. Everything could only depend on Chu Yunfan.","This turn of events undoubtedly attracted the attention of the surrounding company bosses and elders.","“Isn’t that Qi Shaohua?”","“There’s also Zha Hanhai, Wang Qi, Chu Yunfan, and Huang Jianjun!”","These bosses could easily call out the names of these people. After all, they were all influential figures in the current student stage and could become influential figures in the Federation within the next thirty years.","“They seem to be targeting Chu Yunfan. Could it be because of that invitation?” someone mused. Of course, they knew about the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s ten special invitation cards. Back in their younger days, those same invitations had caused a great commotion many times within the city.","It was just that this matter had little to do with the current them, so they did not really care about it.","“This is interesting. Forget about the others that we’ve been observing for at least a few years. Only Chu Yunfan can be considered to have just appeared recently. Some people even say that he’s some rare genius that will only appear every one hundred years. Now, we’ll get to see just how good he is,” one of the big bosses said with a faint smile.","The attention of the entire venue was attracted to the center arena. The large screens around them began to broadcast the situation in the ring.","“Lili, isn’t that Chu Yunfan?” At this moment, Du Yue’er, who was in a corner of the venue, pointed at the large screen.","Yang Lili and Ma Wu turned their heads and saw that it was indeed so. At this moment, on the large screen, Qi Shaohua and the other three were positioned in four different directions, surrounding Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":655,"title":"Chapter 655 - Establishing One’s Might With a Single Battle","paragraphs":["Seeing this scene, Yang Lili instantly cried out in surprise. She did not know who those people were, but she knew that they were absolute experts.","Even though it was just through the big screen, their tyrannical auras were enough to suppress the entire scene. Any one of them could be said to be an absolute expert.","The aura that they emitted, even if it was just a glance from afar, could make someone tremble.","The aura of an Innate expert had started to connect with nature, so it was completely different from that of an Acquired expert. Even the slightest hint of it could display the difference.","That was why Innate experts had extremely high statuses within the Federation.","Because humans were extraordinary, it was not until they reached the Innate Stage that they truly began.","“Those people...” Enlike Yang Lili and Du Yue’er, Ma Wu, as a male, had always paid attention to these matters. He instantly recognized the identities of those who were surrounding Chu Yunfan.","All of them were famous and had established their reputations over the past few years. Most importantly, they were all Innate level experts.","“How could this be?!” Yang Lili covered her mouth with her snow-white palm and exclaimed. Only after Ma Wu’s introduction did she know what kind of people these four were.","Du Yue’er had a complicated expression on her face. Not only was she shocked that Chu Yunfan was targeted by four Innate level experts, but more importantly, she knew that Chu Yunfan’s level could be deduced from his opponent’s level.","It was impossible for an ordinary person to offend four Innate experts at once because they would not be on the same level.","A divine dragon would not care about the provocation of an ant. If the dragon was unhappy, it would just crush the ant.","At this moment, under everyone’s gaze, Chu Yunfan stood in the center of the ring with his hands behind his back and said, “This is more like it. You can go all out now. You don’t have to worry about destroying anything.”","“Chu Yunfan, you’re still so confident even now. I admire you just because of this. However, it’s useless to pretend to be calm at this moment,” Zha Hanhai said.","Among the four of them, only Zha Hanhai did not have any personal grudges toward Chu Yunfan. He had come to help purely for the benefit that Qi Shaohua had mentioned. Only he still had the mood to praise Chu Yunfan’s calmness.","“What a lively scene.”","At this moment, a delicate reprimand was heard from afar. Soon after, a graceful figure flew over. This white figure rushed into the ring. Only then did everyone realize that it was a young girl wearing a long white robe. She looked to only be about twenty years old. She was slender and tall, and her face was as pretty as a peach blossom. However, she carried a sense of authority without any hint of anger.","“Is the symposium starting early?” The young girl came onto the stage and said this in the face of this already tense situation.","“Ah, it’s my goddess. It’s Liu Qingqing!” someone below the stage cried out in surprise. That person had instantly recognized the young girl. She was known as the number one campus beauty at Northern University. She was beautiful and powerful at the same time. She had already been verified and had truly stepped into the Innate Stage.","On the virtual network, Liu Qingqing possessed an unimaginable amount of popularity. At the same time, she was also one of the Innate level big shots who had come to participate in this symposium.","“Liu Qingqing is here as well? Could it be that she’s also here to besiege Chu Yunfan? He’ll be in big trouble if that happens.”","This doubt arose in the hearts of many people. There were only a few big shots who had come to participate in this symposium. If they were all here to besiege Chu Yunfan, the situation would become even more unfavorable for Chu Yunfan.","“Why? Are you also here to cause trouble for me?” Chu Yunfan said to Liu Qingqing with a smile.","Liu Qingqing responded with a kind smile and then said, “Your matters have nothing to do with me. I’m just here to participate in the symposium.”","No one knew if Liu Qingqing was really not interested in that invitation, but they now knew that at least she did not want to participate in it at the moment. This made Qi Shaohua heave a sigh of relief.","To Qi Shaohua, taking down Chu Yunfan was a matter of certainty. He was just afraid that other people would come and fight him for the invitation.","Whether it was Wang Qi or Huang Jianjun, they were obviously targeting Chu Yunfan. If the person who attacked was someone else, they would definitely not get involved.","“But is it really good for you to start sparring now? As far as I know, there are still quite a few who have yet to arrive,” Liu Qingqing said slowly.","“This matter has nothing to do with the symposium. Consider it my personal matter. When I’m done with him, the symposium will go on as usual,” Qi Shaohua said as he shook his head.","“Then you guys go ahead. I’m just here to watch the show.” Liu Qingqing acted as if she was just here to watch.","However, Liu Qingqing kept looking at Chu Yunfan. She knew Qi Shaohua very well. She knew that he would not do anything that he was not confident in. However, to send out such a lineup to deal with Chu Yunfan clearly reflected how difficult it was to deal with Chu Yunfan.","Liu Qingqing wanted to know if this rising star, who had recently become famous, was indeed of such a lineup.","“Since no one else wishes to join, I won’t hold back,” Chu Yunfan said as he grinned. Until now, he still looked relaxed and at ease.","“Who should I start with first? Hmm... I’ll start with you first, Wang Qi!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and he released a terrifying surge of True Energy. The Spirit Energy of the whole world started to surge and he looked like the center of a huge storm.","“The Innate Stage! He has really stepped into the Innate Stage!”","At this moment, everyone was shocked. Many had guessed that Chu Yunfan had already stepped into the Innate Stage. Otherwise, Qi Shaohua would not be so serious.","When Chu Yunfan truly unleashed his Innate Stage strength, many were shocked.","Everyone instantly felt a terrifying Innate pressure that was several times larger than the range of an ordinary Innate expert enveloping the entire arena.","Since Chu Yunfan had already decided to accept the invitation, he no longer held back his strength. There was no better opportunity than this to establish his might.","No one had expected that when these four Innate experts surrounded Chu Yunfan, he would not think of protecting himself, but of defeating them to establish his might.","“Chu Yunfan, do you really think I’m still the same as before?!” Wang Qi roared. His voice turned into a terrifying shockwave.","In terms of strength, Wang Qi was much stronger than when he had fought Chu Yunfan back then."]},{"number":656,"title":"Chapter 656 - nstantly Defeating Wang Qi","paragraphs":["Faced with Chu Yunfan who had finally unleashed his true strength, Wang Qi’s expression turned solemn.","Wang Qi knew very well back when Chu Yunfan had defeated him, Chu Yunfan had yet to step into the Innate Stage. That had been obvious. Being in the Innate Stage and not were two completely different things.","Anyone could easily sense the difference between the two.","Although Chu Yunfan was already terrifying back then, he was still not in the Innate Stage. And now, after stepping into that stage, as expected, his strength had become even more terrifying.","The entire venue could feel the great pressure radiating from Chu Yunfan.","However, compared to back then, Wang Qi was no longer an ignorant fool. Back then, he had just stepped into the Innate Stage and did know how to make full use of his powers yet.","Now, things were completely different.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan was going to make Wang Qi his first opponent, it was obvious that Chu Yunfan had treated Wang Qi as a soft persimmon.","The anger in Wnag Qi’s heart immediately rose.","“Thunder Fire Seal!”","Boom!","From Wang Qi’s hands, one exploded with a thunder seal, while the other exploded with a fire seal. With the two combined together, the power of the attack was endless. Countless Innate True Energy counterattacked, and the surrounding Spirit Energy also surged over, turning into a huge seal that smashed toward Chu Yunfan.","Wang Qi knew that Chu Yunfan was extremely terrifying and difficult to deal with, so the moment he attacked, he launched out with his ultimate skill and did not hold back in the slightest.","Facing the Thunder Fire Seal True Energy that swept over, Chu Yunfan was not flustered and said, “Petty tricks. You’re toast!”","Swoosh!","Chu Yunfan’s leg suddenly swept out, and an intense wind swept out like a hurricane. His entire person exploded with a terrifying intent. Like a mantis, it was as if he could shatter an archaic divine mountain with a single kick.","With just a simple kick, Chu Yunfan smashed into the endless Thunder Fire Seal before everyone’s eyes. Countless amounts of True Energy exploded.","Originally, under the control of the Thunder Fire Seal, the proportion of True Energy within the seal was just right. But now, Chu Yunfan had shattered it with a single kick.","The terrifying True Energy from the Thunder Fire Seal instantly exploded, drawing in the surrounding Spirit Energy to form a billowing air wave that spread out in all directions.","“Sh*t!”","At this moment, Wang Qi felt a terrifying backlash sweep toward him. His Thunder Fire Seal had been broken, and the surge of True Energy came biting back at him.","And at this moment, after breaking the Thunder Fire Seal with one kick, Chu Yunfan’s momentum did not decrease. His leg force formed by the kick swept over like a hurricane, and in an instant, it smashed into Wang Qi.","Compared to before, Wang Qi had indeed experienced a huge improvement. He had charged into the peak of the first level of the Innate Stage, and his strength was now incomparable. Compared to before, his strength had increased by at least a fewfold.","However, Chu Yunfan’s strength had not increased by a fewfold, but by severalfold. In short, the gap between Wang Qi and Chu Yunfan’s strengths had not shrunk. On the contrary, it had widened even further.","“D*mn it!”","At this moment, Qi Shaohua and the others realized that things were not looking good. Although they knew that Wang Qi had once lost to Chu Yunfan, they did not know exactly how he had lost. They thought that Wang Qi was an Innate master and was not so weak that he could not withstand a single blow. But now, they realized that he was exactly that—weak.","In just one blow, Chu Yunfan defeated Wang Qi.","As the other three were surrounding Chu Yunfan from different directions, it was too late for them to save Wang Qi They could only watch helplessly as the kick hit Wang Qi.","Bam!","At that critical moment, Wang Qi gritted his teeth and crossed his arms in front of his chest, forming a defensive stance. Chu Yunfan’s kick landed directly on his arms, but it did not hit his chest head-on.","Zip!","With a sharp sound, Wang Qi was sent sliding a few feet back. His legs were firmly nailed to the ground, like the roots of an old tree. Countless True Energy was released from the soles of his feet. Like huge hands, the True Energy grabbed onto the ground tightly.","It was not until he had slid a few feet back that Wang Qi managed to stabilize himself. Suddenly, he felt like his entire body was about to fall apart. His eyes filled with a sense of disbelief. The strength of Chu Yunfan’s kick was even more terrifying than before. Chu Yunfan has cultivated The Mantis Divine Kick to the Perfection Stage.","Just being swept by the wind from the kick made Wang Qi feel as if all the bones in his body were about to fall apart. A metallic taste crept into his mouth and spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Eh, you didn’t manage to block it?” Chu Yunfan felt this a little strange. “But that’s all.”","“Stop him!” Qi Shaohua roared. Huang Jianjun and Zha Hanhai immediately surrounded Chu Yunfan from both sides.","Compared to Wang Qi, Huang Jianjun and Zha Hanhai were much stronger. They had stepped into the second level of the Innate Stage and were clearly not on the same level.","However, when they pounced on Chu Yunfan, they realized that he had disappeared. They had only pounced on an afterimage of him.","On the big screen, Chu Yunfan, who had disappeared, suddenly appeared in front of Wang Qi.","“Sh*t!”","Wang Qi instantly felt a terrifying pressure sweep over him that instantly enveloped his body. He instinctively wanted to defend, but he was too slow. There was no time. Immediately after, a long straight leg swept over like a razor.","From afar, the entire air looked like it was torn into two halves. It was if the entire sky had been cut into two.","The kick was so strong that one could imagine the power of this attack.","Bam!","The kick hit Wang Qi head-on. Like a kite with its string cut, he was instantly sent flying.","Spurt!","Wang Qi could not hold on any longer. He spat out another mouthful of blood and it splattered everywhere. His entire person was sent flying like a cannonball.","Boom!","Wang Qi fell to the ground. He felt as if all the bones in his body had been broken.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it ended within a few breaths. The crowd was totally immersed in Chu Yunfan’s sudden burst of Innate Stage strength. The battle happened when the crowd was not ready yet, and the outcome shocked the crowd even more.","With just two kicks, Wang Qi, who had stepped into the Innate Stage, was defeated. He was kicked out of the ring and was instantly heavily injured, losing all his fighting strength.","All of this happened in the blink of an eye. It was not until Wang Qi was defeated and sent flying out of the ring that the crowd finally came back to their senses.","The situation where four Innate experts were besieging Chu Yunfan had taken a corner."]},{"number":657,"title":"Chapter 657 - King-Level Strength","paragraphs":["It was only now that the spectators below the arena finally came back to their senses.","Wang Qi, one of the four Innate experts, had already been defeated.","“That... That was too fast!”","“So strong/ Chu Yunfan is so terrifying. No wonder even a big shot like Qi Shaohua needs three other Innate experts to help him deal with Chu Yunfan.”","“That was so fast! I didn’t even see what happened before it all ended!”","Many people had yet to digest what had transpired. It was completely different from the battle that they had imagined. The majestic and intense battle between Innate experts that they had imagined did not happen.","This completely overturned many people’s worldviews and perceptions. However, there were some people who thought even deeper. There was only one reason why the expected intense battle did not happen—Chu Yunfan was overwhelmingly stronger than Wang Qi.","Wang Qi could not be said to be weak. The might unleashed by his Thunder Fire Seal was something that everyone could feel. However, against Chu Yunfan, Wang Qi was still no match for him. It was a completely one-sided defeat. It could not even be said that there was any true meaning to this battle.","“Chu Yunfan, who had made such a big name for himself, is indeed not easy to deal with.”","“In this battle, even if Chu Yunfan loses in the end, he was still able to take down Wang Qi with just a few moves. This level of strength is enough to shock anyone.”","At this moment, Yang Lili did not dare believe it. The awe-inspiring person on the stage who was able to take down an Innate expert in just a few moves was the ordinary Chu Yunfan that she knew.","This feeling was like a dream. It was completely inconceivable.","The image of the ordinary Chu Yunfan in Yang Lili’s mind had been shattered. After not seeing him for a few years, he had actually transformed into such a beast.","Even if Yang Lili did not care for the affairs of the world, she understood what it meant for Chu Yunfan to be able to defeat an Innate expert. It could be said that his future was limitless.","“This Chu Yunfan is too awesome. No wonder he was looking down on Jia Taihua. It seems that Jia Taihua and we are nothing but clowns in his eyes,” Du Yue’er said with some dissatisfaction. If he was so awesome, why did he not say it earlier? By not saying anything, was he not just watching them make a fool of themselves?","If it were not for this big battle, they would have been kept in the dark and would have been complacent. Only now did they realize how wrong they were.","At this moment, Liu Qingqing, who was sitting on the stage, was absolutely shocked. She almost jumped up from her chair at the edge of the stage.","Wang Qi was by no means weak. Although Liu Qingqing was confident that she could suppress Wang Qi, it would be difficult for her to defeat Wang Qi without first executing several hundred moves, not to mention have Wang Qi suffer such a crushing defeat. It was practically impossible.","But Chu Yunfan had somehow easily done it, displaying a battle prowess that was almost at the level of a king.","At this moment, Liu Qingiqing was glad that she had not participated in the encirclement. It was not that she did not desire the invitation card. It was just that she was still uncertain of the situation and was waiting for an opportunity to act.","Looking back, Liu Qingqing realized that it had been a wise move. Such a person would have outright killed her. If he was injured and not killed, he would become a huge threat. She would then have to be careful of his revenge for the rest of her life.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan stabilized himself. He sneered and said, “Once I’ve dealt with another, you’ll be next.”","Chu Yunfan turned his head and looked at Qi Shaohua.","Qi Shaohua crossed his arms and looked at Chu Yunfan with a sneer.","“I admit that I have indeed underestimated you. However, you can only blame your strength. It’s enough to defeat Wang Qi, but it’s still far from enough to compete with me.”","At this moment, Huang Jianjun pounced on Chu Yunfan.","Shiing!","Huang Jianjun unsheathed a sharp sword and released an unimaginable sword ray. The sword ray slashed down at Chu Yunfan like a storm.","Compared to Wang Qi, Huang Jianjun was undoubtedly stronger. He had stepped into the second level of the Innate Stage and was obviously much stronger.","Every level of the Innate Stage was like a threshold.","“You’re going to go with this method?” Chu Yunfan said coldly and grabbed out with one hand. A faint jade light radiated from his palm.","Then, everyone watched as Chu Yunfan grabbed the sword light with one hand. He wanted to contend against the sword light with his bare hands.","“Impossible. Why is he doing this?!”","Many people cried out in surprise. Their first reaction was that Chu Yunfan had gone insane. Otherwise, why would he dare to fight against the sword light with his bare hands? No matter how strong his body was, he was still just an ordinary person. How could he fight against a divine weapon?","But now, Chu Yunfan was going to overturn all their previous notions.","Chu Yunfan’s palm grabbed onto the sword light. Immediately after, there was a burst of metal clashing sound. Then, everyone saw a burst of True Energy explode out from Chu Yunfan’s palm.","Then, Chu Yunfan grabbed ahold of the shocking sword light and shattered it inch by inch in front of everyone’s eyes.","It was like Chu Yunfan’s hand was made of steel and iron bones. He forcefully grabbed the sword light and caught it with his hand.","“He actually did it. Is he a monster?”","“A monster. He’s definitely a monster!”","“That’s it? It was flashy but impractical. You should be ashamed of yourself for using a high-tier sword skill like this.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","After he tore the sword light apart, Chu Yunfan suddenly shouted. Then, he swung his arm and flung out the sword light in his hand. It turned into a sword rain that swept toward Huang Jianjun.","Huang Jianjun was shocked. He never thought that his attack would be blocked in such a way. Was Chu Yunfan’s body made of steel?","However, Huang Jianjun had no time to think about this. After his Innate sword light was caught by Chu Yunfan, it was reflected right back at him.","“Flying Rainbow Sword!”","Huang Jianjun roared and stabbed out with his sword. His body turned into a shocking sword light as it swept out. Wherever the sword light passed, it forcefully cut through the sword rain formed by the sword light that he had swept out earlier.","Rumble!","True Energy collided and devoured one another, forming a series of explosions that exploded in the air like brilliant fireworks.","Huang Jianjun had just heaved a sigh of relief when he saw Chu Yunfan barrelling down on him."]},{"number":658,"title":"Chapter 658 - The Arrow That Instantly Defeated Zha Hanhai","paragraphs":["At this moment, Huang Jianjun truly felt the feeling that Wang Qi had felt earlier. Chu Yunfan’s attacks were like a storm that came without any pause.","“Flying Rainbow Sword!”","Being forced to the front, Huang Jianjun had no other choice but to thrust his sword forward. It transformed into a rainbow that swept through its surroundings.","Just as Chu Yunfan had said before, there was no doubt that the Flying Rainbow Sword was an extremely high-quality sword technique. With just one sweep, it instantly enveloped the entire surrounding area within a rainbow.","“Hmph!”","Facing Huang Jianjun’s attack, Chu Yunfan did not panic and simply threw out a punch. His fist force was like a huge drill that spun and shattered everything. The sword light of Huang Jianhun’s attack landed on Chu Yunfan’s fist and was instantly shattered. Wherever the fist force passed, everything shattered into pieces.","“You can’t even withstand a single blow,” Chu Yunfan casually commented.","Meanwhile, Huang Jianjun’s face was ashen. If Chu Yunfan easily shattering his sword light the first time was an accident, then this second instance was enough to prove that this was definitely not an accident. Chu Yunfan was definitely not just lucky.","Chu Yunfan truly was powerful.","Wang Q being unable to withstand a single blow was not because he was too weak. On the contrary, it was because Chu Yunfan was too strong.","But before Chu Yunfan could further attack, Zha Hanhai’s attack finally arrived from the other side of the ring. But unlike the close combat Huang Jianjun, Zha Hanhai wielded a crossbow, He stretched it taut and shot out an arrow. The entire sky was torn apart. Even gold and stone would have been torn apart.","This was the first time Chu Yunfan was meeting an expert in the field of crossbows. There were not many experts like this within the Federation.","Humans had many long-range means. They were now even developing interstellar missiles. There were even various types of sniper rifles to choose from. However, those who specialized in crossbows were relatively few.","Everyone was stunned by this arrow. After firing his shot, Zha Hanhai felt that his essence, energy, and spirit had been depleted. This was because that arrow had consumed a large amount of his essence, energy, and spirit.","Zha Hanhao knew that Chu Yunfan was not easy to deal with. That was why he had not immediately made his move. Instead, he secretly transmitted his voice to Huang Jianjun, asking him to restrain Chu Yunfan and make an opening for him to shoot this arrow.","And at that moment, that was definitely not the best opportunity, but Zha Hanhai had no other choice. Huang Jianjun had already been forced into a corner.","“Petty tricks!”","Chu Yunfan instantly felt a terrifying edge lock onto him. It was able to close in on one’s essence, energy, and spirit. This was without a doubt a high-quality archery technique. But against Chu Yunfan, it was completely useless.","The edge entered the depths of Chu Yunfan’s soul and disappeared without a trace like a clay ox entering the sea.","“Hmph!”","Chu Yunfan let out a cold snort and immediately conjured up shockwaves that swept out. These shockwaves transformed into walls of air. The arrow broke through the walls of air and flew toward Chu Yunfan’s face.","However, upon reaching this stage, the arrow was now much slower as compared to when it was first fired. As the saying goes, an arrow will ultimately reach the end of its flight. To an ordinary person, it might not be any different. However, to Chu Yunfan, it was enough.","Chu Yunfan extended his hand and caught the arrow. The body of the arrow rubbed against Chu Yunfan’s skin, causing sparks to fly. It was as if metal and metal had collided with each other. However, Chu Yunfan firmly held onto it.","“Shakyamuni’s Elephant Throwing!”","When he caught the arrow, Chu Yunfan did not hesitate and threw it back in Zha Hanhai’s direction.","The arrow turned into a ray of light and swept toward Zha Hanhai’s face.","“Sh*t!”","Zha Hanhai immediately realized that something was wrong. This ray of light was too fast. It was even faster than his shot. The terrifying power of the Shakyamuni’s Elephant Throwing technique was fully unleashed at this moment.","Zha Hanhai used all his strength and released all the True Energy within his body, forming a shield in front of him.","However, just like how the arrow had broken through several walls of Chu Yunfan’s airwaves, Zha Hanhai’s energy force was like paper before this shot. They were instantly penetrated and the arrow hit Zha Hanhai directly in the chest.","The arrow beam did not penetrate Zha Hanhai’s body as he was wearing inner armor. At the critical moment, the inner armor protected him. However, the terrifying force spread throughout his entire body. It was as if a terrifying explosion had gone off.","Bang!","Zha Hanhai was instantly sent flying, and he landed on the ground with a heavy thud. He could not help but cough up a mouthful of blood.","In just one attack, Zha Hanhai had already lost all his fighting ability. It was impossible for him to continue the battle. Or rather, it was more appropriate to say that he had lost at his own hands.","With a bang, everyone broke into an uproar. Everything had happened too quickly. It was as if they were dazzled.","Chu Yunfan easily broke through Huang Jianjun and Zha Hanhai’s combined attack. Moreover, a single strike had heavily injured Zha Hanhai.","This astonishing battle efficiency made them dumbfounded.","‘This is too brutal!’","This word—brutal—involuntarily flashed through everyone’s minds. Without a doubt, this was far different from the Innate level experts that they had seen before, even on the virtual network.","There was no evenly matched strength, nor was there an intense battle. It was just pure crushing strength. No matter what kind of attack it was, Chu Yunfan was able to receive it with his bare hands. This astonishing battle method, other than the word “savage,” there was no other more appropriate adjective to describe it.","“Another one has fallen!”","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had easily dealt with another one of his opponents, the situation where the four Innate experts were besieging was instantly resolved by half. Liu Qingqing, who was sitting upright in her chair, gripped tightly onto the chair’s handles. She was feeling very lucky right now. Fortunately, she had not joined in on this battle. It was clear that it would have been difficult for her to gain any advantage.","Liu Qingqing was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s battle prowess. It was fine that the first-level Innate Wang Qi was no match for him, but even Zha Hanhai, who had stepped into the second level of the Innate Stage, was killed in an instant.","And at this moment, in Liu Qingqing’s mind, Chu Yunfan’s true strength was undoubtedly a true mystery. No one had been able to force out his true strength yet.","Could that person do it?","Liu Qingqing’s gaze swept over to Qi Shaohua who had yet to make a move."]},{"number":659,"title":"Chapter 659 - The Weak Huang Jianjun","paragraphs":["At this moment, although Qi Shaohua still had his arms crossed and looked confident, his expression was not as good as before.","Qi Shaohua had absolute confidence in his strength. In his heart, his only opponent would always be Jiang Lingxiao. No one else could match up to Jiang Lingxiao in his eyes. If he could not even deal with a mere Chu Yunfan, how would he ever defeat Jiang Lingxiao?","But strength was strength, and Chu Yunfan’s was completely beyond Qi Shaohua’s expectations.","As a junior, Chu Yunfan was no doubt a little too powerful. Even someone as proud as Qi Shaohua had to admit that when he was in his second year, he was far from being as powerful as Chu Yunfan was now. At that time, he had barely stepped into the peak of the Acquired Stage.","Chu Yunfan was indeed more talented and powerful than many had imagined. But so what? It still was not Chu Yunfan’s turn to make decisions right now.","After Chu Yunfan defeated Zha Hanhai with one arrow, although Qi Shaohua could still stand idly by, Huang Jianjun could not.","Although Zha Hanhai had helped Huang Jianjun attract Chu Yunfan’s attention and allowed him to escape, he still felt a chill down his spine. Any thoughts he had of taking revenge for the Huang family had disappeared. He had heard of Chu Yunfan’s massacre, but he thought Chu Yunfan had just been relying on his Demon Descends Illustration. How would Chu Yunfan dare use such a demonic treasure here?","And now, Huang Jianjun realized that he had made a huge mistake. Even without the illustration, Chu Yunfan was still terrifyingly powerful.","“Qi Shaohua, how much longer are you going to just stand there and watch?!”","Huang Jianjun’s furious roar attracted everyone’s attention. At this moment, they finally realized how much Huang Jianjun, the number one at North Side University, had been forced into a corner.","The North Side University students were dumbfounded, especially the members of the student council. Not only was the vice president, Tang Xingye, forced into a corner, but even the president had suffered the same fate.","How terrifying was this Chu Yunfan? Just how savage was he?","At this point, Qi Shaohua could no longer stand idly by. He finally took a step forward. With a bang, terrifying True Energy was released from his body. It was absolutely terrifying. A wild wave swept out with his body as the center.","Terrifying Innate pressure swept out, and it caught up to Chu Yunfan.","This was the current second of Federation University, Qi Shaohua, who was second only to Jiang Lingxiao.","“Chu Yunfan, since you refuse to do this the easy way, then don’t blame me for being impolite.”","The people watching from below the arena felt extremely excited. A world-shaking battle was about to break out. The geniuses from the various universities, as well as the bosses of various companies, were quivering with excitement. Innate battles of this level were not something that could be seen every day.","“Qi Shaohua, stop talking nonsense. I’ll deal with you after I’ve dealt with this last stumbling block.”","Qi Shaohua finally made his move, but Chu Yunfan still acted as if he did not care. In the blink of an eye, he pounced on Huang Jianjun.","“D*mn it!”","Huang Jianjun instantly felt the terrifying aura that swept over like a landslide and a tsunami. He wanted to escape, but he realized that Chu Yunfan had already locked onto him. It was as if he could not escape no matter where he hid. There was a pair of eyes following him everywhere he went.","The terrifying suppression made Huang Jianjun feel as if his heart was about to stop pumping. He and Chu Yunfan were both Innate experts, but he was suppressed to this extent by Chu Yunfan’s might. There was no need to say anything.","“I’m going to give it everything I have!”","Huang Jianjun’s aura burst out, and the aura of an Innate expert swept out. In an instant, he broke through Chu Yunfan’s suppression and regained his composure.","“Swan Sword!”","This attack swept out, and in an instant, the sword light swept out. A flash of light headed toward Chu Yunfan, heading straight for his face.","“Petty tricks.” Chu Yunfan sneered. In an instant, the sword light had already swept toward his face.","At that critical moment, Chu Yunfan simply clenched his five fingers into a fist and punched out. His fist smashed toward the sword light.","Clang!","There was a resounding sound of metal clashing. Chu Yunfan’s fist force swept through everything, and the sword light was shattered into pieces.","Huang Jianjun turned pale with fright. He had not expected that his attack would not even slow Chu Yunfan’s movements in the slightest.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had already arrived before him.","“King of the Jungle!”","As Chu Yunfan roared, he seemed to have turned into a fierce tiger. This tiger roared from his seat in the jungle. It was the king of the world. Its terrifying aura suppressed everything and crushed everything.","This was the true essence of the Devilish Tiger Punches. They were originally simple punch techniques of the Qi Sea Stage, but under the urging of Chu Yunfan’s tyrannical strength, they now exploded with unimaginable power.","There were differences in the level of different punch techniques. However, the real deciding factor was one’s strength.","The fist force from this punch swept across and devoured everything in its path. Huang Jianjun’s sword light and sword intent were shattered into pieces. He hurriedly retreated, trying to avoid the power of the fist force. However, it was useless. He felt it surround him.","The crowd felt that Chu Yunfan had turned into a fierce tiger that roamed the jungle. When it went down the mountain in search of food, its might shook the world. For a few brief seconds, they were overcome by this illusion as Chu Yunfan’s fist force was too shocking.","“Chu Yunfan, you still dare to be so arrogant!”","Qi Shaohua was infuriated. He had wanted to attack Chu Yunfan, but who knew that Chu Yunfan would completely ignore him and attack Huang Jianjun and simply cast him aside? It was too embarrassing.","This was utter disrespect!","Chu Yunfan was completely uncooperative.","But just as Qi Shaohua wanted to attack, it was already too late. Chu Yunfan’s punch landed squarely on Huang Jianjun.","Huang Jianjun let out a blood-curdling scream as he was sent flying out of the ring like a meteor. Just like Wang Qi, he lost with a simple punch.","Qi Shaohua thought that he had completely grasped Chu Yunfan’s strength. However, he did not know that even before Chu Yunfan had stepped into the Innate Stage, an opponent at Huang Jianjun’s level was already a piece of cake to him.","After stepping into the Innate Stage, Chu Yunfan’s strength had increased by leaps and bounds, and Huang Jianjun could no longer compare to him.","“You can’t even withstand a single blow.”","After the dust settled, Chu Yunfan coldly spat out these words, which made the already heavily injured Huang Jianjun even more depressed as he coughed up a mouthful of blood."]},{"number":660,"title":"Chapter 660 - The Power of a Third-Level Innate","paragraphs":["Chu Yunfan defeated Huang Jianjun, and Huang Jianjun had not been able to block even a single punch. This was undoubtedly a huge blow to Huang Jianjun, who had always thought highly of himself.","In the end, Huang Jianjun had to be evaluated by Chu Yunfan as someone who could not even withstand a single blow. This was simply a ruthless slap to his face. His self-esteem suffered a heavy blow as well.","Chu Yunfan’s defeated opponents looked absolutely miserable, but Chu Yunfan did not have the slightest bit of sympathy for them. These people wanted to seize the opportunity that had been given to him.","It seemed like a chance to receive guidance from the Heavenly Dragon Elder, but in reality, that was not the case. If one did not advance on the path of cultivation, one would fall behind. If one fell behind once, one would continue to fall even further and further. This kind of situation was too common.","“There’s only one left!”","Many people were shocked. In just a blink of an eye, the situation where the four Innate experts were surrounding Chu Yunfan had turned into a one-on-one situation. Wang Qi, Zha Hanhai, and Huang Jianjun were defeated almost instantly.","Even blind people could see that there was a huge gap between their strength and Chu Yunfan’s. Thinking back to Chu Yunfan’s extremely confident look, no one would think that Chu Yunfan was too proud, and no one would think that he was blindly confident.","Chu Yunfan indeed had the tyrannical strength to suppress his peers.","“Another one has lost. Is Chu Yunfan’s strength so unrivaled?”","Liu Qingqing’s pretty face revealed a bitter smile. No matter what the final outcome was this time, Chu Yunfan would become famous, and his fame would be extended to the entire student community. It would not be limited to just his year.","Chu Yunfan was about to become famous by stepping on the shoulders of Wang Qi, Zha Hanhai, and Huang Jianjun. It might even include Qi Shaohua. At this moment, Liu Qingqing was uncertain of Qi Shaohua winning this battle.","This made Liu Qingqing, who was also a senior, feel a little sad. The juniors were too strong. To her, this was a little too close for comfort.","After defeating Huang Jianjun with one punch, Chu Yunfan looked toward Qi Shaohua and said, “Well, no one can take the bullet for you now. It’s your turn.”","“What a joke. Do you think I need someone to take the bullet for me?” Qi Shaohua felt that this was extremely funny. “Chu Yunfan, you’ve completely infuriated me. Today’s matter is not something that you can end just by handing over that invitation card.”","“It doesn’t matter. I’m not going to hand over the invitation anyway. If you want it, let’s see if you have the ability to take it,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly as he stood with his hands behind his back.","“Chu Yunfan is way too strong. Originally, we had thought of roping him in. Now, it seems that it’s impossible to do so. I’m afraid that it will be very difficult to rope in someone like him.”","“That’s right. With his strength, he can naturally develop and become a magnate martial artist all on his own.”","“I heard that the Jiangs and the Huangs have been trying to deal with him in secret. I think that he’s dead for sure. No one can survive offending two great families. Even if big associations throw their support behind him, they can’t always send powerful experts to protect him. If he dies, will the Chus fight two great families for one dead person?”","“From the looks of it, even without the support of the Chus, he still has the strength to protect himself.”","“Now I believe that he had once massacred the experts of the Jiang and Huang families. There is indeed such a possibility.”","“Great! Great!” Qi Shaohua laughed coldly. As he spoke, his hand grabbed toward the air, and an ancient halberd flew in from outside the stage. It was called the Crane Control Technique.","Even from such a great distance, Qi Shaohua was still able to easily call on the halberd. It was clear how powerful Qi Shaohua’s martial art was.","Qi Shaohua laughed coldly as a terrifying wave of energy swept out from his body. The density of his True Energy was so dense that it could be seen with the naked eye.","Voom! Voom! Voom!","The halberd in Qi Shaohua’s hand emitted waves of trembling sounds. Some True Energy exploded out from the top of it. Immediately after, he waved the halberd and slammed it directly down on Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The entire air was instantly sliced apart. This terrifying might caused the crowd below the stage to widen their eyes. It was as if a cannonball had exploded.","There were many ways to use a halberd. Compared to swords and spears, it had many more tricks up its sleeves. It could be said to be the overlord of the military. However, there were not many who could use it well. And those who could leave behind an illustrious history.","It was clear that the power of the halberd that Qi Shaohua displayed at this moment had reached an extreme.","Ordinary people would not choose to go head-to-head with a martial artist who used a halberd. It would not be worth it. However, Chu Yunfan was an exception. Although he had not brought along his Ju Que sword, or rather, the Ju Que was currently inside the Mountain River Diagram. It was not convenient for him to bring it out in public at this moment.","Chu Yunfan also grabbed at the air with his hand. One of the students who was carrying a sword below the stage suddenly felt that the weapon in his hand was no longer under his control.","Then, it turned into a stream of light and flew out, landing in Chu Yunfan’s hand.","“Lend me your sword!”","That student was completely dumbfounded, but he did not reject it. On the contrary, he felt extremely excited. He had felt Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength.","In this world, one still had to speak with absolute strength in the end. Chu Yunfan’s strength had long subdued these students. Other than a few hostile students, most of the students were very willing to help, even if they were to participate in this world-shaking battle in just this small way.","The student said with excitement, “It’s all right. Use it as you wish!”","However, it was clear that other than himself, no one else had heard it.","After obtaining a sword, Chu Yunfan faced the halberd that was barrelling down toward him. Without the slightest hesitation, he stabbed out. The sword light tore through the sky like a cannonball, shattering everything in its path.","“World Overlord, Sky Sword!”","The sword light tore through everything and collided with the halberd. Powerful True Energy from both sides instantly burst forth, engulfing everything in its path.","The True Energy from both sides had nowhere to go after colliding with each other. All they could do was go upwards, turning into a pillar of energy that shot into the sky.","Compared to earlier, the battle had clearly reached a whole new level.","Both Chu Yunfan and Qi Shaohua were much stronger than Wang Qi, Huang Jianjun, and Zha Hanhai.","“The third level of the Innate Stage. Qi Shaohua is actually ahead of us,” Liu Qingqing said with a bitter smile."]},{"number":661,"title":"Chapter 661 - Unscathed, Terrifying","paragraphs":["Liu Qingqing was a little displeased with Chu Yunfan. Unlike Qi Shaohua who was the same age as her, Chu Yunfan’s strength was far above her own.","Liu Qingqing and Qi Shaohua were from the same year. Four years ago, when they had participated in the Dao Conference together, she had lost to Qi Shaohua. Over the next few years, they competed against each other many times, so they could be considered to be very familiar with each other.","It could be said that they were one of the few competitors. Even in the Federation, which was currently filled with talents and geniuses, there were only about twenty or so people of the same age who could be their opponents. They were people from various schools, and every single one of them was very familiar with each other.","Now that Liu Qingqing was witnessing her competitors whom she had gone head to head with for years being completely suppressed right before her eyes, the bitterness in her heart began to spread. This was especially so when she thought about how Qi Shaohua, who had already stepped into the third level of the Innate Stage, was still firmly suppressed by Jiang Lingxiao and thus was only the second strongest within Federation University,","It could be imagined that Jiang Lingxiao’s strength was unrivaled among his peers. Back then, someone had evaluated him as a peerless genius that would only appear every ten years. Thinking about that again, it had certainly been no exaggeration.","This battle made Liu Qingqing realize that in the competition between her peers, she had already been left behind.","While Liu Qingqing was thinking about the battle between Heaven and man, the confrontation in the ring intensified. The terrifying auras of the two soared toward the sky, almost blotting out the Sun. The surrounding Spirit Energy was drawn in by their aura, and it caused a strange phenomenon.","In the private rooms in the distance, many company bosses, sect elders, and the like, could not believe what they were seeing. They had seen a lot, and although there were not many battles at the Innate level, they had seen enough.","However, they never expected this battle to be so intense, especially since Chu Yunfan and Qi Shaohua were so young. The older Qi Shaohua was only twenty-two, and Chu Yunfan was not even twenty.","Back when these important people were young, they too had been regarded as geniuses. But compared to these two, they were like peanuts","Below the stage, Jia Taihua was forced back a few steps by the Innate aura of these two. His eyes were filled with incomparable shock. Originally, he still harbored a hint of hatred in his heart, but now, this mentality had completely disappeared.","Only now did Jia Taihua truly realize the gap between himself and Chu Yunfan. Not to mention easily making him kneel down, if Chu Yunfan really intended to kill him, he could have easily done it. It would not be much harder than chopping melons and vegetables.","On the stage, Qi Shaohua’s expression became solemn. Chu Yunfan was much more difficult to deal with than he had imagined.","“How about it, Qi Shaohua? Do you still think you can take me down?” Chu Yunfan asked loudly, “Do you regret not joining hands with the others to deal with me earlier?”","In the face of Chu Yunfan’s mockery, Qi Shaohua’s expression darkened as he gave no reply. He did not regret it as the others had wanted to deal with Chu Yunfan on their own. They had already joined hands to surround Chu Yunfan, so naturally, he did not care about this.","Qi Shaohua originally wanted Huang Jianjun, Zha Hanhai, and Wang Qi to join hands to pin down Chu Yunfan. If they could take him down, that would be for the best. If they could not, then he would be the one to launch a thunderous attack.","However, the reality was much crueler than Qi Shaohua had imagined. It was as if Chu Yunfan had sensed their intentions. Chu Yunfan had not even waited for them to launch an attack before he made his move.","Originally, this would have been nothing. When Innate level experts attacked, it was uncertain that the person who attacked first would win. There was also no such logic in this world.","However, the truly terrifying thing was that Chu Yunfan had suppressed Huang Jianjun and the others without any difficulty. One move. Two moves. One move.","By the time Qi Shaohua reacted, the whole situation had changed. Chu Yunfan had turned the tables all by himself.","From this perspective, even Qi Shaohua had to admit that the backup that he had never taken seriously before was indeed shrewd and scheming. Chu Yunfan’s attacks were now even more ruthless.","This oppression made Qi Shaohua think back to when he had fought against Jiang Lingxiao—that great figure that had oppressed all his peers.","“Even if you are able to stand shoulder to shoulder with the Jiang Lingxiao after the past, so what? I’m not the same person as I was back then.”","This aroused pride in Qi Shaohua’s heart.","“Chu Yunfan, I have to admit that your strength is indeed beyond my expectations. But just based on this level, you will still lose today,” Qi Shaohua said with a cold smile.","At that moment, Qi Shaohua launched his attack. A halberd light swept out like a full moon, sweeping toward Chu Yunfan’s neck, almost killing Chu Yunfan on the spot.","The halberd seemed to have cut through everything—cutting off Chu Yunfan’s Innate aura. Qi Shaohua was indeed terrifying.","“I’m going to lose? Qi Shaohua, you underestimate me too much. I will now show you the gap between us!”","The sword in Chu Yunfan’s hand instantly exploded with a shocking sword light.","The sword in Chu Yunfan’s hand could only be considered ordinary. It could not compare to the Ju Que. And compared to the halberd in Qi Shaohua’s hand, there was a clear difference between the two weapons.","But at this moment, Chu Yunfan’s hand had undergone a complete transformation. The body of the sword emitted a terrifying sword light.","Below the stage, the original owner of this sword was dazzled. He never knew that his sword could erupt with such power. Only now did he understand that while divine weapons were important, what was more important was the increase in one’s own strength. If one relied too much on divine weapons, there would ultimately be a drawback.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s True Energy, which had already turned into Innate True Energy, instantly burst out, shining in all directions. Compared to the halberd light that Qi Shaohua slashed out, it was much more terrifying.","In the blink of an eye, it wiped out the full moon halberd light that Qi Shaohua slashed out, and then it swept toward Qi Shaohua.","Qi Shaohua’s eyebrows went up. The density of Chu Yunfan’s Innate True Energy was almost overwhelming him. It was much more terrifying than him. Chu Yunfan was so much younger than him, but his true Qi was much denser than his. He could not understand how Chu Yunfan was so much stronger than him. But at this moment, he could not ponder too much over this.","“Reincarnation Halberd. One halberd, one reincarnation!”","Forced to this point, Qi Shaohua finally unleashed his true trump card. This attack was almost as terrifying as reincarnation. This attack broke through Chu Yunfan’s sword light and soared through the sky.","It instantly devoured Chu Yunfan. The terrifying True Energy set off a wild wave that swept through everything in an instant. This terrifying gale forced everyone to keep their eyes closed.","“What happened? Has Chu Yunfan lost?”","Many people widened their eyes, paying rapt attention to the outcome of this strike.","At this moment, the strong wind finally dissipated, revealing Chu Yunfan who was within. His chest and clothes had indeed been slashed open, revealing the jade-like skin on his chest that was glowing with a mysterious light.","Chu Yunfan had managed to withstand the attack!"]},{"number":662,"title":"Chapter 662 - Qi Shaohua Was Defeated in Just One Strike","paragraphs":["The halberd light swept through the sky. Everyone who saw it had no doubts about powerful it was.","It was not something that human strength could withstand. Even an intermediate mecha would be torn apart if it was hit by this halberd light.","In today’s world, science and martial arts were both important. However, when human strength was at the beginner level, it could not compare to science and technology. An ordinary person could be killed with just one shot from a gun. However, the further one progressed, the more powerful one became.","For example, at Chu Yunfan and Qi Shaohua. Even bullets of this era could hardly hurt them. Not to mention that their five senses were terrifyingly sensitive. The bullets would not be able to lock onto them. Even if they were seriously injured, it would be very difficult for them to cause fatal damage.","As for top-notch experts like Jeang Yuanbin, who was at the peak of the Innate Stage, he could even fight against a missile by himself without much difficulty. Even that snake monster that Chu Yunfan had encountered back did not die when it was hit by that tactical nuclear bomb. Chu Yunfan and Qi Shaohua clearly had not reached that stage yet, but it was nonetheless terrifying.","However, Chu Yunfan was able to take such a terrifying attack head-on without sustaining any injuries. Other than his clothes being torn apart, not even his skin was damaged.","“How is this possible? What kind of physique is that?!”","Many people widened their eyes in disbelief, especially the students. Although they had yet to see many things in life, they were able to learn a lot thanks to the Internet.","They knew that in the ruins of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, there were many records of such instances. There were some who specialized in cultivating their physical bodies and cultivated extremely powerful and terrifying physiques.","It was hard to hurt those people with swords or sabers.","However, the methods to cultivate one’s physique were very rare and incomplete. It was hard to discern them to their fullest. Moreover, even if it could be deciphered, there were not many who could cultivate it. Those who could were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns.","If a special physique was so easy to cultivate, then it would not be considered special.","In fact, during the Ancient Zenith Civilization, there were people who were born with special physiques. That was an incredible miracle of life. It was said that there were gods and devils’ physiques in their bodies, possessing all kinds of incredible power.","And now, they were finally seeing one.","This was obviously no ordinary physique. They had seen people with divine godly power, and it was not unheard of for those with the talent to cultivate as fast as riding a rocket. However, they had never seen a physique that could withstand an attack at the Innate level.","Otherwise, inner armors and light armors would not be so popular.","Thinking of this, the crowd sucked in a breath of cold air. Many originally thought that Chu Yunfan had risen quickly and was born to a family of nobodies, so he should not have any background.","However, they now realized that Chu Yunfan must have had a great fortuitous encounter. He had obtained such a special physique cultivation method, and he had even mastered it. It was simply inconceivable.","‘No wonder he dared to go up against them alone. He knew that this was a trap, yet he still dared to come. Turns out he has such a trump card.’","This thought crossed their minds at this moment, and they finally understood the many things that they previously did not.","So this was Chu Yunfan’s true backing.","With such a physique, Chu Yunfan was practically invincible. Trying to pierce through him would be like piercing through a turtle’s shell.","Qi Shaohua’s expression turned grave, but he did not despair. His halberd’s True Energy could not break Chu Yunfan’s skin, but that did not mean that Chu Yunfan would be fine after being slashed by the halberd. After all, the power of a divine weapon was unimaginable. If a sword light that was casually swept out could be comparable to a divine weapon, then there was no need for everyone to think of ways to obtain a divine weapon.","If Chu Yunfan knew what he was thinking, he would definitely scoff. Qi Shaohua’s knowledge was so too shallow. During the Ancient Zenith Civilization, there were many special physiques that were comparable to metal and stone. Although they could not be compared to the Imperial Physique, it was still difficult for blades and swords to harm them.","Of course, Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique was not fully formed yet, but it had already shown its initial power.","“Chu Yunfan, I didn’t expect you to have such a trump card. But even so, you still have no chance of winning,” Qi Shaohua said coldly.","“Still unwilling to give up?” Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at Qi Shaohua.","“With your level, you want me to admit defeat? Even Jiang Lingxiao has no way to make me admit defeat!” Qi Shaohua said loudly. His gaze had always been on Jiang Lingxiao. Even Jiang Lingxiao could not force him to admit defeat, let alone Chu Yunfan. It was simply impossible to make him admit defeat.","“I might be able to do what he can’t.” Chu Yunfan sneered. And then, he took a step forward. In an instant, the Spirit Energy of the world gathered toward him.","Chu Yunfan had already made up his mind. He wanted to establish his might in front of everyone. If the Imperial Palace was to develop, this was the only way. And Qi Shaohua was the best stepping stone to establish his might.","Qi Shaohua himself did not know that he had actually become the best stepping stone in Chu Yunfan’s eyes!","“Watch carefully!”","Boom!","A terrifying surge of True Energy swept out. Soon after, a terrifying aura swept out from his body.","At this instant, Chu Yunfan seemed to have transformed into a true treasure sword. Sword lights shot up into the sky. That instant of light shocked the entire arena. The sword intent that spread out in all directions even made the people outside the arena feel a sense of sharpness.","Slash!","After this sword intent had been brewed to its limit, Chu Yunfan finally made his move. He thrust out his sword. It looked like a slow attack, but it looked fast at the same time. There was no way to dodge it.","At this moment, Qi Shaohua truly felt a great terror within his heart. All the hairs on his body were standing on end.","Chu Yunfan had already mastered the Overlord Sword a few months ago. It was only now that Chu Yunfan had stepped into the Innate Stage that the power of this sword technique was truly unleashed.","Previously, even though Chu Yunfan’s battle prowess had been comparable to the Innate Stage, he was still not at the Innate Stage. There were many amazing aspects that he could not display.","If one was not at the Innate Stage, then they were not at the Innate Stage!","Zzt!","Everyone could clearly see that the air on the stage boiling like water.","This sword attack turned the world upside down, and the Spirit Energy of Heaven and Earth gathered within it.","“To go hell!”","Qi Shaohua was not willing to show weakness. Under this sword attack, he felt suppressed. Even when facing Jiang Lingxiao, he did not have this kind of feeling. However, he was not willing to give up. The ancient halberd in his hand immediately displayed the Reincarnation Halberd technique and met the attack head-on.","Kaboom!","With a loud boom, the sword and the halberd collided. The shockwaves that were created drowned everything, making it difficult for people to stand properly.","On the stage, Liu Qingqing’s expression changed. She had no choice but to use her internal energy to prevent herself from being blown away.","“Who won?”","Just as everyone was overcome with shock, a figure was blown out from the shockwaves. Everyone focused their eyes and looked at this figure.","It was none other than Qi Shaohua."]},{"number":663,"title":"Chapter 663 - Radiant Light, the Most Sought-","paragraphs":["At this moment, Qi Shaohua was in a miserable state. His chest had been blasted into a bloody mess, and he was heavily injured from that single sword strike. The inner armor that he wore under his clothes was also blasted into pieces.","Qi Shaohua coughed up a mouthful of blood. All his internal organs were heavily injured. In fact, if not for his inner armor blocking most of the damage, this strike would have been fatal.","Qi Shaohua’s eyes were filled with incomparable shock. Chu Yunfan stood in front of the crowd like a raging tidal wave. With his sword in hand, he looked like a heavenly god.","Chu Yufan was able to suppress the entire crowd with just his aura. Even a character like Qi Shaohua was stunned by this.","Previously, everyone was trying to figure out who would win and who would lose. However, now that everything was about to be settled, they began to feel uncomfortable.","In a situation that no one had expected, Chu Yunfan, who had fought alone, had defeated Qi Shaohua and the other four experts. Moreover, he defeated them without much effort.","Chu Yunfan had swept through all of them. None of them could last more than a few moves.","This ended the idea some people had of wanting to take advantage of the situation. The Heaven’s Pride Invite was something that many people wanted to obtain, but after seeing Chu Yunfan perform like a god, everyone ceased to think this any further.","At first, many were puzzled as to why the Heavenly Dragon Elder would send an invitation to Chu Yunfan. This was the first time in history that a person who was less than twenty years old had been invited. Now, it seemed that Chu Yunfan indeed had the qualifications. No one could compare to him.","“Qi Shaohua actually lost. He really lost!” Liu Qingqing said with a shocked expression and somewhat bitter expression on her face.","There were still Qi Shaohua and Jiang Lingxiao, who were experts of the same generation, in front of Liu Qingqing. From behind her, Chu Yunfan had caught up with her with lightning speed, and even surpassed her.","Among the billions of people in the human race, Liu Qingqing’s talent was top-notch. She could be called a genius. However, there were times when geniuses were inferior because some people were just monsters.","For example, Chu Yunfan was one of those monsters. Even if Liu Qingqing did not want to admit it, she had to. Some people really could not be measured by common sense.","If even Liu Qingqing had these thoughts, let alone others. She was in complete shock and could not calm down.","“He really won. He became famous after one battle. He really became famous after one battle!”","“From now on, he’ll be invincible among his peers!”","Situ Ziying, Le Yuzhu, and the others were even more dumbfounded.","With their talent, they could naturally step into the Innate Stage. The only difference was that they had reached that stage only in their fourth year. This became their only criterion to measure everything.","However, even though they had stepped into the Innate Stage, it was clear that there was no comparison between them and Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had already surpassed them and reached a level that they needed to look up to.","From the battle between him and Qi Shaohua, it could be seen that even among Innate Stage experts, Chu Yunfan was definitely not weak.","No one knew just how strong Chu Yunfan had become.","They were unwilling, but they had to admit that it might be very difficult to surpass Chu Yunfan in the future. Even Mei Haiyun and Dong Fanghao were not enough to make them have such thoughts.","Though talent was born, how could someone like Chu Yunfan who could suppress a whole generation exist?","“Lili, this old classmate of yours is so powerful!” Du Yue’er said as she looked at Yang Lili. She could not believe that there was such a powerful existence among Yang Lili’s old classmates.","Although Du Yue’er did not quite understand the meaning behind Chu Yunfan’s instant kill of Qi Shaohua, she could understand how powerful and terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","“Lili, you don’t have a boyfriend. If you can catch this old classmate of yours, you won’t have to be afraid of anything in the future,” Du Yue’er urged. Chu Yunfan was so dazzling at the moment. If she did not have a boyfriend—and if was not because their relationship was very strong—she was afraid that even her heart would have changed.","An outstanding girl could attract countless men to throw themselves at her like moths to a flame, and an outstanding man exactly was the same.","“Stop seeing with me!” There was a bitter smile on Yang Lili’s pretty face. Chu Yunfan had not been good enough for her in the past, but she knew herself well now. Although she was good-looking, she was not a great beauty. How could she be good enough for the current dazzling Chu Yunfan?","“We have to befriend him!”","If these students were shocked, then the CEOs of various companies and the elders of various sects only had one thought, and that was to befriend Chu Yunfan.","Befriending such an expert would only bring benefits. There would certainly be no disadvantages.","With Chu Yunfan’s stunning performance, he definitely had a chance to reach the top. How could frosted cake be more effective than sending charcoal in the snow? As the saying went, rare goods could be reaped. Since ancient times, countless people who invested in these peerless experts would reap unimaginable returns in the future.","What was fate? This was fate. As Chu Yunfan became stronger and stronger and defeated more and more experts along the way, a huge force would form behind him. This was the grand trend.","This was why no one dared to relax in the competition among their peers. Once one fell behind, one would only continue to fall. The stronger a person was, the more disasters they would face. Consequently, the faster they grew, the more people would come to protect him, and the harder it would be to compete with him.","In middle school and high school, many had started from the same starting point. It could be said that geniuses were like salmon swimming upriver. There was almost no difference between them. However, the further one got, the fewer people were qualified to compete. Finally, one person would reach the top and dominate the world.","And now, Chu Yunfan was that person. He was just like Jiang Lingxiao from before. No, it should be said that he was even more dazzling.","This was especially so in the eyes of the various people present. This was because Chu Yunfan had no background and did not have a deep connection with the Chus.","No matter how they invested in Jiang Lingxiao, they would only receive some returns. After all, Jiang Lingxiao, the next clan leader of the Jiang family, was a member of the Jiangs at the end of the day.","But Chu Yunfan was different. He was a nobody and no one supported him. At this time, investing even one percent would naturally result in a twenty percent return.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was not aware of the changes in everyone’s hearts. He only said, “Qi Shaohua, you’re as famous as Jiang Lingxiao, yet you’re so weak. You couldn’t even withstand a single blow.”","Chu Yunfan thought that Qi Shaohua was as famous as Jiang Lingxiao and was known as the twin prodigies of Federation University. Although Qi Shaohua was slightly weaker than Jiang Lingxiao, he should have been quite the character.","However, Qi Shaohua turned out to be so weak."]},{"number":664,"title":"Chapter 664 - Awe-Inspiring. Something Happened at Home","paragraphs":["Upon hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Qi Shaohua coughed up another mouthful of blood. It was one thing for him to be defeated by Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan was humiliating him.","However, what Qi Shaohua did not know was that Chu Yunfan had no intention of humiliating him at all. Or rather, he could not be bothered. He was just disappointed. He thought that he could rely on Qi Shaohua to measure Jiang Lingxiao’s strength.","As the saying goes, know yourself and know your enemy. Only then can you win every battle.","However, it was a pity that compared to Jiang Lingxiao, Qi Shaohua was far weaker.","However, Chu Yunfan did not notice that compared to two years ago, his mentality had completely changed. He could no longer compare to Jiang Lingxiao in such a way. At that time, he was just a pursuer. But now, he was a true top expert of the new generation.","“You...” Qi Shaohua was almost angered to death.","Chu Yunfan returned the sword to it to its original owner. The student was extremely excited. Chu Yunfan had used his weapon to defeat Qi Shaohua. This made him feel a sense of honor.","The student was so excited that he could barely control himself.","“If anyone still wants this invitation, I’ll be waiting for you,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan’s voice spread throughout the entire venue, and for a moment, it caused those students and upper-class people who were immersed in shock to come back to their senses.","“He’s actually issuing a challenge!”","“Isn’t he afraid that others will come and snatch it?”","“Seems like he isn’t afraid at all. With his strength, there aren’t many of the same age as him who can stand shoulder to shoulder with him.”","Chu Yunfan slowly stepped down from the arena and said to Gao Hongzhi and the others, “Let’s go.”","At this moment, Gao Hongzhi was still steady because he and Chu Yunfan were like brothers. No matter how great Chu Yunfan’s halo was, to him, he was just the ordinary Chu Yunfan from back then.","However, the experts from the Imperial Palace that Gao Hongzhi brought along were looking at Chu Yunfan with excitement. They had confidence in Chu Yunfan and felt that his future was simply limitless, and thus, the future of those who followed him was also limitless.","However, there had never been a time when they felt that the limitless future was so close before their eyes.","“Aren’t we going to wait for the symposium to end?” Gao Hongzhi asked.","“There’s no need. The purpose of us coming to the symposium has already been achieved,” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile. He had wanted to use this symposium to raise the reputation of the Imperial Palace. And now that his purpose had been achieved, there was no need for him to stay.","Chu Yunfan took the lead and left the venue without so much as a backward glance. He then sent a letter to Yang Lili, explaining that he had left.","After Chu Yunfan left, the entire venue exploded. It was as though a pot had exploded.","Everyone was still immersed in the battle. It was simply inconceivable. This Fall Symposium was definitely the most legendary symposium they had ever attended.","This was supposed to be a sparring session between the strongest experts among the university students. Every symposium would have some experts who would become famous for a moment. However, no one had ever been like Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had single-handedly defeated the entire Federation University’s Fall Symposium. It was believed that it would not be any different even if a few more people came.","Under everyone’s tacit agreement, unless Jiang Lingxiao came, there was no one who was a match for Chu Yunfan.","And now that Chu Yunfan had easily defeated Qi Shaohua, it meant that the others would basically be delivering themselves on a silver platter if they were to go against him.","This one battle had established Chu Yunfan’s supreme reputation.","“After this battle, how many would dare to look down on him? With his cultivation level, he’s already comparable to some of the elders of those medium-sized sects!”","“He’s not even twenty, yet he already has such a cultivation level. His talent is so high that it’s truly rare!”","“A peerless genius that’s only seen every ten years. This is absolutely not an exaggeration!”","Many people even praised Chu Yunfan as a once-in-a-decade genius. With the number of peerless geniuses produced by the Federation every year, once-in-a-year geniuses were considered absolute geniuses, and a once-in-a-decade genius was the greatest compliment.","Such a person even had the hope of stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage in the future. Only then would one be truly invincible—one of the few giants in the entire Federation.","Just as Chu Yunfan left the venue and was about to return to the university, he suddenly received a call. The person who called was his father, Chu Wencheng.","When Chu Yunfan answered, Chu Wencheng did not say much. He only said, “Come back quickly!”","Seeing that Chu Wencheng was in such a hurry, Chu Yunfan did not dare delay. He hurriedly asked Gao Hongzhi to bring the experts back to Federation University while he himself took the nearest shuttle back to his home in Jinghai City.","When Chu Yunfan arrived back home, he found that apart from his parents, his Third Uncle, Chu Wenxuan, and his Third Aunt, Liu Silin, were there as well.","The two of them were clearly anxious.","As soon as Chu Yunfan entered, he felt that the atmosphere was not quite right.","“What’s wrong?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Yunfan, you have to help your cousin!”","At this moment, Liu Silin hurriedly went up to Chu Yunfan. Her eyes were bloodshot. It was obvious that she had been crying. It was completely different from the impression Chu Yunfan had of his third aunt from back when he was young.","“Third Uncle, Third Aunt, what happened?” Chu Yunfan asked as he looked at the people gathered. He already understood why his father had called him back in such a hurry. It was probably because of Third Uncle, Third Aunt, and Chu Yunfei.","“Ahem. Let me tell him,” Chu Wenxuan said. He did not look very well. He looked like had not slept for two days.","Only after Chu Wenxuan’s explanation did Chu Yunfan realize that it was indeed as he had imagined. This matter was indeed related to his cousin, Chu Yunfei.","After Chu Yunfei entered university last year, he quickly got a girlfriend named Zhang Sisi. This would have been nothing, but nobody knew that Zhang Sisi was actually a disciple of the Qingyang sect.","This sect did not approve of Zhang Sisi being together with Chu Yunfei, so they took Zhang Sisi away a few days ago. After Chu Yunfei learned of this news, he went to Qingyang with a few of his friends to seek an explanation. Then, he disappeared and was unreachable.","“How dare they,” Chu Yunfan said with a frown. However, he knew that this sort of situation was very common within the Federation.","Although the freedom of marriage was emphasized, these sects and clans would often interfere. Even the Federation Government would find it difficult to do anything about it.","This was because the freedom of marriage did not have a clear boundary. They would always have a way to make these disciples obey.","Just like what the Tang family did to Tang Siyu. Even the government could not control it. However, Chu Yunfei had gone missing after going to seek an explanation. Without a doubt, this was a violation of the law."]},{"number":665,"title":"Chapter 665 - Beat Them Until They Hand Them","paragraphs":["“This Qinyang sect actually dares to hold people captive?” Chu Yunfan blurted out. However, he immediately realized that they really did dare.","These sects looked like they abided by the laws of the Federation. Once they broke the law, even their sect leader would be arrested and sent to prison. However, the prerequisite was that they had to be able to produce evidence.","“Have you called the police?”","“Yes, we have. However, Qingyang claims that no one has entered their place. Also, the police searched all of Qingyang but didn’t find anyone,” Chu Wenxuan frowned and said in a heavy voice.","Chu Yunfan frowned too. He was no longer the naive child he used to be that still believed that the government could control and solve everything.","Every year, countless people would disappear from the Federation. If Qingyang was really holding Chu Yunfei captive, there would be plenty of places to hide. It was too common for sects and families to privately set up torture chambers. As long as one was not caught red-handed, there was nothing to be afraid of.","Even the police had to consider the implications. It was impossible for them to search all of Qingyang for Chu Yunfei. This was a realistic matter. The common folk and upper-class society were of two different worlds.","“Because the police could not find anything, your uncle and I have no other choice but to ask for your help,” Liu Silin’s eyes were red and swollen. “You’ve been admitted to Federation University, so you’re the most outstanding one in our family. Do you have any friends who can help us? Yunfei is the only child we have. If something were to happen to him...”","As Liu Silin said this, her eyes turned red again. Chu Yunfei was her treasure, and she had pampered him for twenty years since he was young. At the thought of him getting into an accident, she could not help but shed tears.","Chu Yunfan’s mother, Yang Yayun, was a very emotional person. Her eyes turned red as well.","“Yunfan, if you have a way, help your third uncle. He’s also your cousin,” Chu Wencheng said.","“I beg you, Yunfan, please help him,” Chu Wenxuan said as he suddenly kneeled before Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan did not dare to accept this grand gesture. He hurriedly helped Chu Wenxuan up and said, “Third Uncle, what are you doing? Are you trying to make me die of shame?”","Chu Yunfan felt sorry for Chu Yunfei’s parents. His father, Chu Wenxuan, had looked down on him and his sister before. But now, his third uncle was kneeling before his nephew for the sake of his son.","After soothing Chu Wenxuan and Liu Silin’s emotions, Chu Yunfan said, “I think I have a clearer picture of what’s going on now. Yunfei entered Qingyang, and now they’re holding him captive, correct?”","“Yes, that’s right. They’ve been denying it, but I know he’s there!” Liu Silin said and she hurriedly nodded.","“Reporting to the police would be useless unless they conduct a large-scale search. However, we don’t have enough evidence to prove that Yunfei went to Qingyang. Moreover, if Qingyang really has him, they might’ve already moved him to a different location. Even if the police conduct a large-scale search, I’m afraid they won’t be able to find him,” Chu Yunfan said as he shook his head.","There was no doubt about the power of the Federation’s laws. No one dared to belittle them. However, the prerequisite was that there was sufficient evidence. The law could not be used to convict people based on guesses, and this provided many with the opportunity to take advantage of the law.","Of course, if the person being detained was a big shot, there would naturally be a way for them to use their connections at the top to exert pressure from the bottom. However, Chu Yunfan lacked the ability to do such a thing.","“You’re right.” Chu Wencheng and Chu Wenxuan nodded. They too had come to the same conclusion, which was why they had come to Chu Yunfan and asked if he knew anyone who could solve this problem.","“Leave this to me. I’ll solve it,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Thank you! Thank you, Yunfan!” Liu Silin was overjoyed. She had never in her life thanked Chu Yunfan as much as she did today. For her son, she would do anything.","“Don’t worry, we’re family. And you’re welcome,” Chu Yunfan said.","“How do you plan to solve this?” Chu Wencheng said worriedly. No matter how big or small Qingyang was, it was not something ordinary people like them could deal with.","“Since they refuse to hand over the person, then we’ll beat them until they comply!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Without the slightest hesitation, Chu Yunfan set off. This matter was of great importance, so there was no time to delay. Chu Yunfei’s situation would become direr with every passing minute.","Chu Yunfan knew how sinister the methods of these sects were. If he got there too late, Chu Yunfei might never come back.","After leaving the house, Chu Yunfan started looking into Qingyang’s background. He had never heard of this sect before. There were so many sects in the Federation, so he only knew of some of the more reputable ones.","Fortunately, through the Intelligence Division of Federation University, which was also the force behind the university’s encyclopedia, he quickly found some information about Qingyang.","The Qingyang sect had been first established just over a hundred years ago. It was considered relatively young among the many sects in the Federation and was relatively small in numbers. It could only be considered a small sect. According to the information, their sect leader was merely a peak Acquired expert.","Of course, to ordinary civilians, even a small sect was a huge figure. However, to the current Chu Yunfan, it was nothing.","Two hours later, the shuttle arrived at Xihua City where Qingyang was located. Most of these small sects were located inside the cities of the Federation and would not choose to build their base out in the wilderness. Although the wilderness would afford them more freedom, the danger level was also much higher. Even a sect that had been established for decades, or even centuries, could be destroyed in a minute in the face of a monster tide.","At the edge of Xihua City, at the foot of Mount Qingyang, a figure dressed in black robes arrived.","Looking up, Mount Qingyang was extremely tall—like a treasured sword piercing into the sky. Although it had undergone some modern modifications, its ancient appearance had been preserved","From time to time, one could see people walking on the mountain path. The steep terrain of the mountain did not have any effect on those who practiced martial arts.","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath and bellowed, “I, Chu Yunfan, from Federation University, am here to visit. Leader of Qingyang, I hope you’ll be willing to meet with me.” His voice was as loud as a bell as it raced up Mount Qingyang."]},{"number":666,"title":"Chapter 666 - Fighting His Way up the Mountain","paragraphs":["Chu Yunfan’s voice was like a great bell. It turned into a surging wave that swept toward Mount Qingyang. Countless birds were instantly alarmed.","Almost immediately, six disciples guarding the mountain were alarmed and immediately surrounded Chu Yunfan.","“Who are you?” the leader of the group, who looked to be less than thirty years old, asked with an unfriendly expression on his face.","“Is there something wrong with your hearing?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s unfriendly demeanor, the leader instantly became furious. “Kid, I think you have a death wish. Where do you think you are to be so impudent?”","“Impudent?” Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows. “I’ll make this short. I don’t know what Qingyang wants to do, but I advise you to release my cousin, Chu Yunfei, before I get angry.”","“You’re Chu Yunfei’s cousin?”","Hearing Chu Yunfei’s name, the disciples’ faces changed. They indeed knew Chu Yunfei. In fact, a few days ago, the local police of Xihua City came to ask about him. They had searched the mountain, but they did not find anything. So of course, they knew about this matter.","Moreover, they also knew some inside information. They knew that Chu Yunfei had indeed come here. After he went up the mountain, he never came down again.","“What Chu Yunfei? We’ve never heard of this person.” the leading disciple reacted quickly and denied that such a person had come.","A few days ago, the police station had come to inquire about Chu Yunfei and they had given the same answer. And now, it was even more impossible for them to change their words. Moreover, this was not the first time that Chu Yunfei’s family members had come to cause trouble.","So what? Chu Yunfan was just another one of those clowns.","The leader gave a look to the other disciples as a fierce look flashed through his eyes. Chu Yunfei’s family members came to visit them endlessly. He had to teach this brat a good lesson.","“I had wanted to talk about this nicely and solve this problem amicably.” Chu Yunfan noticed the looks that these disciples were giving each other. He was instantly furious that he laughed instead.","These people were holding Chu Yunfei captive. They actually dared to commit a crime and were truly lawless. They were used to being local tyrants in Xihua City. They had little regard for the laws of the Federation.","When encountering unreasonable people, Chu Yunfan naturally was not bothered to reason with them. Since they were not willing to hand Chu Yunfei over, then he would beat them until they were willing to hand him over.","“Go. Break his legs!” the leader roared. Those few disciples understood and instantly pounced on Chu Yunfan.","As he spoke, the leader took the lead and charged forward. His strength was indeed the highest among these few disciples. He was already at the peak of the Sea Qi Stage and was only half a step away from stepping into the Acquired Stage.","In an ordinary faction, the leader would have been considered an expert. To an ordinary commoner, he was an existence that was difficult to match. Thus, he was used to being arrogant. With Qingyang’s reputation, who would not be afraid? In the remote areas of Xihua City, he had really become a tyrant.","Unfortunately, the leader had to meet Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan merely sneered. A fierce light flashed through his eyes as he shouted, “You’re courting death!”","As he said this, Chu Yunfan directly pointed with his finger. He aimed it at the leader.","The leader instantly felt as if his soul had left his body. He could not explain why, but he was overcome by a terrifying sense of fear. It was as if he was facing a peerless ferocious beast.","The finger that Chu Yunfan extended seemed slow but was actually fast. In an instant, it had touched the body of the leader. He did not even have the time to react before he was hit.","Bam!","It was as if the leader had been hit by a cannonball. His chest was flattened to a degree visible to the naked eye, and he was sent flying like a kite with a broken string.","The leader’s entire sternum was broken by Chu Yunfan’s finger. He fell to the ground and ceased to move.","Chu Yunfan did not even spare the leader a glance. He knew that the leader would not die. It was impossible for Chu Yunfan to kill people without any scruples while in the Federation’s territory.","However, this attack severely injured the leader and he would not be able to move for at least a few months.","The rest of the disciples were scared out of their wits. They thought that Chu Yunfan was just a kid who did not know the immensity of Heaven and Earth.","They understood that Chu Yunfan’s attack was ruthless. It only took a moment for him to take down their leader.","Although they were ruthless, that was only toward ordinary people. They knew what it meant to be a tough nut to crack when facing a real expert.","‘This is a sticky situation. Run!’ This thought ran through their minds. They looked at each other and understood the meaning in each other’s eyes. They quickly ran away to find the sect elders.","“Trying to run away? Is there still time for that?” Chu Yunfan sneered. Streams of True Energy shot out from his hand, turning into streams of sword light. It was very difficult to hurt a real expert with this method, but for these people who had barely crossed the Qi Sea Stage, it was a hundred percent lethal.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The sounds of collisions rang out. Chu Yunfan knocked down all the disciples in mere seconds.","Bodies lay all over the ground, struggling in pain. Although they were not dead, they were still heavily injured. Even their internal organs were damaged.","“Since you don’t want to talk nicely, then let’s fight until you obey.” Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked up the mountain. There were all kinds of cameras on both sides of the mountain path, so Qingyang must have noticed the situation.","Chu Yunfan had long understood that reasoning was useless in the face of such tyrants. They believed that the one with the biggest fist was the king, so he could only use his bigger fists to fight until they obeyed.","Dong!","Dong!","Dong!","On Mount Qingyang, a series of hurried bell sounds rang out, as if it was summoning the Qingyang disciples. The quiet environment on the mountain path was instantly broken, and the sound of hurried footsteps could be heard coming down the mountain.","Many Qingyang disciples were gathering. With such a large scale, even an expert at the peak of the Acquired Stage would have to flee in fear.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He was not afraid. In a flash, he took out his Ju Que sword from the Mountain River Diagram. Then, he walked up the mountain path and headed toward Qingyang’s base atop the mountain.","“Who are you? How dare you barge in here!” With a shout, a group of Qingyang disciples blocked Chu Yunfan’s way."]},{"number":667,"title":"Chapter 667 - Unstoppable Rampage up the Mountain","paragraphs":["A wide road circled around Mount Qingyang. At this moment, on this wide road, a group of Qingyang disciples had stepped into Chu Yunfan’s path.","These disciples rushed over to stop Chu Yunfan after receiving the warning message. In addition, more footsteps could be heard in the distance. More people were coming.","Although Qingyang was not a particularly large sect, it still had two to three thousand members. Disciples of all sizes were here to train hard.","For the current Federation, public education was divided into stages. The education of the average person in martial arts went on until they graduated from university.","After graduating from university, the average person would join various companies to work. Those who wanted to further develop their martial arts would choose to join various pioneer groups, mercenary groups, sects, or the army.","Although Qingyang was not a particularly large sect, apart from the disciples who had graduated, it still had a few thousand disciples. Although not everyone was present, the number was still quite large.","Moreover, this area was still within the city. Unless Xihua City was invaded by monsters, they would not encounter any danger. Moreover, this was a society governed by law, so it was very rare for them to encounter any danger.","However, upon hearing the warning bell, they reacted quickly and rushed over.","“Get out of my way. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being impolite,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","This group of more than twenty Qingyang disciples looked at each other as if they had heard the most unbelievable thing. They were a group of people while Chu Yunfan was alone. Yet, he had actually said such words.","“Everyone, let’s attack together. Teach him a lesson. Let him know what kind of place this is. It’s not a place for him to be impudent!” the leading disciple said loudly, “It doesn’t matter even if we beat him to death. He’s trespassing on private land. Even if he dies, it will be in vain!”","Upon hearing this, the disciples revealed fierce expressions.","It was indeed true. Chu Yunfan could be considered to have trespassed on someone else’s property. Even if they killed someone, the government would not pursue the matter.","“You’re overestimating yourself.” Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at these Qingyang disciples.","“Charge!” one of the disciples shouted, and these people charged forward one after another.","Chu Yunfan suddenly unsheathed the Ju Que which was on his back. With a “voom” sound, sword light burst out.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Facing these Qingyang disciples who were charging forward, Chu Yunfan did not show the slightest bit of fear. The Ju Que in his hand field the sky with sword lights.","This was the first time Chu Yunfan was using the Ju Que since stepping into the Innate Stage. There was doubting the power of the sword. Although Chu Yunfan had restrained its power, the Ju Que was a huge piece of metal, and its power was unimaginable.","Those who were hit by the sweep were heavily injured and were sent flying. They could not even block a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","More than twenty people could not stop Chu Yunfan’s advance for even a moment.","In the blink of an eye, they were all sent flying.","The disciples who were sent flying were in complete disbelief. Chu Yunfan had struck them and sent them flying before they could even react. Almost all the bones in their bodies were broken. It was impossible for them to have the strength to stand up and continue fighting.","They had never heard of such a terrifying expert before.","Only now did they finally react. This time, Qingyang had really provoked a top expert.","Chu Yunfan has the confidence to challenge the mountain alone. It was impossible to break the rules that two fists were no match for four hands. But if his strength was indeed much higher, then it was possible.","Chu Yunfan had just finished off a group of Qingyang disciples. Without stopping, he strode in the direction of Qingyang’s base.","More and more Qingyang disciples received the warning and swarmed toward Chu Yunfan. Of course, these people could not hold him off. Chu Yunfan defeated all of them.","After a few waves of attacks, Chu Yunfan had heavily injured hundreds of Qingyang disciples. Qingyang finally realized the seriousness of the problem, and they did not dare to take him lightly anymore. The small groups of people that were charging at him earlier completely disappeared.","When Chu Yunfan got higher up the mountain, hundreds of Qingyang disciples stood in front of him. The aura of these few hundred soared into the sky like a mighty army.","Unlike ordinary people, each and every one of them had a cultivation base. Compared to the people Chu Yunfan had met at the foot of the mountain, these disciples were much stronger. The leader of the group was a middle-aged man with a very high cultivation base who had already stepped into the seventh level of the Acquired Stage.","Behind this man stood more than twenty Acquired Stage disciples, all of whom were outstanding disciples of the Qingyang sect.","“Who are you? How dare you trespass our mountain and injure our disciples? Even if the great Hercules came today, he wouldn’t be able to save you!” the middle-aged man shouted.","“Elder, it’s him. He injured the seniors and juniors at the foot of the mountain!” a disciple pointed in Chu Yunfan’s direction and said indignantly.","However, the middle-aged man did not act rashly. He knew that this young man was not someone to be trifled with.","Ordinary people would not have the courage to charge all the way up the mountain. And along the way, Chu Yunfan had easily injured hundreds of their disciples. In the many years since Qingyang was established, there had not never been such a crisis.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Are all the rats and snakes of Qingyang like this?”","“What did you say?!” the Qingyang elder roared as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“I said, you’re all rats and snakes. But I can’t be bothered to talk to you. You’re holding my cousin, Chu Yunfei, hostage. You’d better hand him over now. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being impolite,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","The expression on the Qingyang elder’s face changed. He instantly understood who Chu Yunfan was talking about.","Some time ago, Qingyang had indeed detained Chu Yunfei and his friends. This matter had caused quite a stir in the upper echelons of Qingyang.","In the current Federation, it was no longer the dark era where they could do whatever they wanted. Doing such a thing was very risky.","Therefore, the elder knew of this matter very well. However, when the family of that student came to cause trouble, they were unable to find any evidence. Initially, he thought that this matter had already ended. Who would have thought that it had attracted a dark cloud?"]},{"number":668,"title":"Chapter 668 - Fear","paragraphs":["To hold someone captive was certainly a big deal in this era. Not only would the government severely crack down on this matter, but anyone found guilty would be arrested and sent to prison. The foundation of Qingyang would be uprooted.","Not to mention, many people had powerful backers these days. Once they attracted these powerful backers, things would not be easy to clean up.","However, according to the intelligence they had gathered from Donghua City, Chu Yunfei came from an ordinary family. He was not a descent of a big family, and there was no sect behind him.","That was why they dared to hold him without worry. Who knew that such a guy would appear now?","“What Chu Yunfei? We’ve never heard of him. Now that we’ve called the police, you won’t be able to escape. If you surrender now, we won’t make things too difficult for you. Otherwise, we’ll make you regret being born!” the Qingyang elder said loudly.","“Stubborn.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Since you insist on being so, don’t blame me for being ruthless.”","After saying that, the brave Chu Yunfan launched a counter-charge against the group. In the blink of an eye, he had already charged into the midst of the Qingyang disciples.","The Ju Que swept out like a mountain range. It was so powerful and terrifying.","Clang!","Clang","Clang!","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","At this moment, they truly felt Chu Yunfan’s terrifying and strange power. Even though the only thing of Chu Yunfan that came into contact with them was his weapon, they still felt a strage power sweeping through them from the sword. In an instant, they were heavily injured and were sent flying.","Chu Yunfan held the Ju Que in his hand. It was as if he was cutting grass. Wherever he passed, he would sweep across. As long as those people were hit, even if was only slightly, they would still be heavily injured.","And after being heavily injured, they could no longer get up.","Dear readers! you are reading on our content copy site.Please copy and search this link \" https://bit.ly/3NSnQtR \" to support us","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, looked like he was taking a leisurely stroll in the garden. He walked among the Qingyang disciples. Their attacks could not even land on him.","Chu Yunfan’s figure would turn into several afterimages. When these people’s attacks landed on him, they would just go through these afterimages. Even if teh attacks landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, they were not be able to break through his Innate True Energy.","They could only passively take a beating. Moreover, Chu Yunfan’s attacks were too terrifying. If they were hit by his attacks, it would be as if they were hit by a heavy hammer. One strike was enough to make them lose all ability to resist.","In just a short moment, more than a hundred people had already been severely injured. At this moment, everyone truly felt how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","Chu Yunfan pierced through these ordinary disciples along the way and directly headed in the direction of the Qingyang elder.","To catch a thief, one must first catch the leader. Chu Yunfan was not stingy with his ruthless attacks, but he was not addicted to killing. At this moment, he was worried about Chu Yunfei.","Chu Yunfei had already disappeared for a few days. The longer Chu Yunfan delayed, the more danger he would be in.","“Go, stop him. We can’t let him continue!” the Qingyang elder finally reacted. It was not that his reaction was too slow, but that Chu Yunfan was too fast. In just a moment, more than a hundred Qingyang sect disciples had been seriously injured.","The several Acquired Stage Qingyang sect elders looked at each other and then shouted loudly. They formed a powerful sword formation and charged at Chu Yunfan.","“You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan sneered. The sword in his hand suddenly burst out with a terrifying sword light. Then, the sword light swept out and was dozens of feet long.","The Qingyang sect elders turned pale with fright. Chu Yunfan was too fast. They raised their swords to resist.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The sound of metal clashing could be heard continuously. Only now did they truly feel what the ordinary disciples had felt.","Why did those ordinary disciples of Qingyang turn into a block of tofu after encountering Chu Yunfan? They were completely defeated, and they were no match for him at all.","The elders let out muffled groans. They simply could not resist this enormous strange force. Even though they had already entered the Acquired Stage, they were still far from the current Chu Yunfan.","They were severely injured and were sent flying.","Even the leader of Qingyang elders was hit by Chu Yunfan’s sword light. He was sent flying like a cannonball until he crashed into a tree. This time, he slid down. His eyes were wide open. He could not believe it. He could not block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","The leader’s previous worry had finally come true. They had finally attracted a dark cloud because of Chu Yunfei. Even the sect leader would not be able to send this group of Acquired Stage experts flying with a single attack.","Chu Yunfan’s attack was too terrifying. A beam of sword light pierced through everything and swept through everything. The Qingyang disciples who had not been severely injured were scare witless.","Although they were loyal to Qingyang, it was not to the point where they would sacrifice their lives for the sect.","Moreover, the person in front of them was tall and slender. He looked harmless, but his attack was extremely ruthless. In front of Chu Yunfan, numbers lost their meaning.","“I’m only here to find my cousin. I don’t want to start a massacre, but anyone who stands in my way will die.” Chu Yunfan’s cold gaze swept across the crowd before he took another step up the mountain.","The Qingyang disciples exchanged glances and looked at each other in dismay. Chu Yunfan had already taken care of the bravest of their group. The remaining people no longer had the courage to go against Chu Yunfan. They could only watch helplessly as Chu Yunfan passed through the crowd and headed toward the top of the mountain.","After they could no longer see Chu Yunfan’s figure, the sounds of panting could be heard. Many only realized now that under the pressure of Chu Yunfan’s aura earlier, they had found it extremely difficult to breathe.","It was not until Chu Yunfan left that they realized it. They hurriedly panted.","“How is he so terrifying? Who is this person?”","“He’s so young, yet he possesses such strength. He definitely isn’t a nobody. This time, the elders couldn’t have really kicked an iron plate, right?”","“It’s over. With his strength, even the elders might not be able to deal with him.”","“If he walks too much at night, he will sooner or later meet a ghost!”","These disciples instantly exploded into a discussion like a boiling pot."]},{"number":669,"title":"Chapter 669 - No One Can Stop Him","paragraphs":["At the same time, on the peak of Mount Qingyang, in an ancient welcoming hall, the sect leader of Qingyang was wearing a long green robe and was sitting on the main seat. Sitting on the lower seat was an old man who looked to be in his fifties or sixties.","The sect leader looked to be middle-aged. He had a square and white face that was without a beard. He was speaking to the old man with a slightly fawning expression.","“Elder Tie, those kids have already been locked up. You can take them away at any time.”","The old man nodded and said, “You did well. The young master is very satisfied and has spoken. He will allow you to pick a few books about the insights of our sect’s Innate level experts. When that time comes, the probability of you breaking through to the Innate level will greatly increase!”","“That’s great!” The sect leader was overjoyed.","For those who had sufficient talent and resources, it was only a matter of time before they would break through to the Innate Stage. However, for the sect leader, it had been a huge problem.","Although there were many Innate Stage experts in the Federation currently, the number of people who were stuck at the peak of the Acquired Stage was definitely tens of times more than that.","Even though he was the leader of a sect, the sect leader’s cultivation was only at the peak of the Acquired Stage. For this reason, he had to think of ways to improve his cultivation.","Once the sect leader crossed the Innate Stage, the situation would be completely different. Once he entered the upper echelon of society, the world would open up to him.","However, the truth was that other than the founder of the Qingyang sect, no one else had crossed this line. According to the current division of the Federation, Innate experts were a standard measure.","Without Innate experts, no matter how many people there were, Qingyang could only be considered a small-scale power. A sect with Innate experts would be considered a medium-scale power, and a sect with peak-Innate experts could be considered a superpower.","Meanwhile, Divine experts were the only measure of a superpower’s potential. Whether it was a sect, guild, family, or financial group, all of them would be judged according to this rule.","Although modern weapons could pose varying degrees of lethal threat to human experts, and some of them could even pose a massive threat to peak Divine experts, these weapons were in the hands of the Federation. It was impossible for ordinary powers to obtain such large-scale weapons of mass destruction. Even if they developed some of these weapons in private, they would not dare to bring them into the public.","And the treatment that these different forces received was naturally varied according to the different levels. Although small-scale forces were already existences that ordinary people could not look up to, they were still at the bottom of the Federation’s many public organizations.","From the moment he became the leader of the Qingyang sect, he had always wanted to break through to the Innate Stage. Once he reached the Innate Stage, not only him, but even Qingyang would reap the benefits.","It was the same logic for one person to achieve the Dao and for the chickens and dogs to ascend to Heaven.","However, if one wanted to reach the Innate Stage, one could not lack talent, opportunities, and resources. Talent was innate, and one could not force one’s luck. Thus, the only thing one could pursue was resources.","There were many types of cultivation resources. Innate Pills were treasures that could help people greatly increase their chances of breaking through to the Innate Stage. However, the owners of these pills would hold on to them tightly and not easily let go of them.","Therefore, all the sect leader could ask for was the comprehension of others from when they had broken through to the Innate Stage. These things were also top-secret among the various factions.","Even at Federation University, there were a large number of instructors who were unable to break through to the Innate Stage. One could imagine how precious this was.","To to get all this, all the sect leader had to do was hand over one disciple and a few foreign brats.","To the sect leader, this was a small price to pay.","Of course, the sect leader knew that to the other party, these secret manuals that contained the comprehension of Innate masters seemed to be worth a lot, but in reality, they did not cost much.","The cooperation between the two sides was in itself a happy outcome. As for that disciple and those brats, no one cared.","“Sir, we have a problem!” a Qingyang disciple exclaimed as he strode in from outside the main hall.","“What’s the matter? Why are you in such a panic?” The sect leader frowned.","“An outsider is fighting their way into the sect!” the disciple said in a panic.","“Who’s fighting? Aren’t the elders taking care of them?” the sect leader said with a slight frown.","Of course, the sect leader had heard the alarm that rang out across the mountain earlier, but he had not taken it to heart. The reason was very simple. The news he received was that a single person had broken into the mountain.","One person was trying to shake the foundation of Qingyang?","Was that not a joke?","But now, after so much time had passed, there were still disciples who came to seek help. The problem had probably already exceeded his initial expectations.","“Sir, the other party is too powerful. We simply couldn’t stop him. He has even defeated a few Acquired Stage elders!” the disciple said as he looked at the sect leader nervously.","When the sect leader heard this, his entire face became even more solemn.","Even the Acquired Stage elders had been defeated. This person was obviously no ordinary person. His previous predictions were wrong.","“I’m sorry, Elder Tie. Someone had broken into our terrritory. I need to deal with it,” the sect leader said as he stood up.","The sect leader was furious. He had to let the intruder know how powerful he was. After all, he had been embarrassed in front of Elder Tie. The huge Qingyang sect could not even stop a single person. This embarrassed him to no end. He had to personally see to this.","“Go ahead.” Elder Tie gave a slight nod.","The sect leader glanced at the disciple who had come in to report the news and said, “Call the four elders. How dare this guy barge into our mountain. We shall have him die where he stands!”","Qingyang had been defeated in their own territory. If they did not let hang his body at their gates, how could they intimidate the people in Xihua City?","On the other side of Mount Qingyang, Chu Yunfan was leisurely strolling up to Qingyang’s base. Along the way, he defeated over at least a hundred disciples. They could not slow his footsteps for even a moment.","Chu Yunfan charged his way to the gates of the main hall. He beat down these Qingyang disciples until they were terrified and did not dare to get close.","They did not dare to fight against Chu Yunfan. They only dared to follow him from a distance and did not dare to stop him.","“How dare you trespass into Qingyang’s territory!”","The sect leader arrived. Behind him were four middle-aged or senior martial arts masters. Their auras formed a line and swept toward Chu Yunfan like a landslide."]},{"number":670,"title":"Chapter 670 - Breaking the Formation With a Single Strike","paragraphs":["Including the leader of the Qingyang sect, there were a total of five experts at the peak of the Acquired Stage. This was the true peak-level combat strength of Qingyang—when all of them gathered together.","It was as if they were facing a great enemy.","“This kid is finished. Let him continue to be arrogant!”","“The sect leader is finally here. He’s finished!”","“Is he finally going to stop?”","A large group of Qingyang disciples were following Chu Yunfan from behind. When they finally saw their leader, their faces revealed a hopeful light.","“Who are you exactly?” the sect leader’s face was frighteningly cold. He stared icily at Chu Yunfan, wanting nothing more than to tear him into pieces. If it was not for Chu Yunfan, he would not have lost so much face in front of the other sect elders.","“My name is Chu Yunfan,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at the sect leader. “You’re holding Chu Yunfei captive. Hand him over now. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being impolite.”","“What Chu Yunfei?” The sect leader raised his eyebrows when he heard this name. “Stop pestering us. If you surrender now, you won’t suffer as much.”","“Very well. It seems that you don’t intend to hand him over. Then, I will beat you until you hand him over,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","“Arrogant. Go. Get him!” the sect leader shouted.","The five experts instantly rushed toward Chu Yunfan. The five peak Acquired Stage experts connected their auras and formed an overwhelming aura, which was even comparable to the aura of Innate Stage experts.","They had clearly practiced this more than once. As a sect without Innate Stage experts, this was the only way they could contend against Innate Stage experts.","This might be useful to ordinary Innate Stage experts, but against Chu Yunfan, it was completely useless. To an expert like him, it was completely useless.","“Stubborn!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly as the sword in his hand struck out. The sword light turned into a pillar of light and swept out.","Boom!","The sword light that Chu Yunfan launched out swept into the aura of these five people and their collective aura was broken in an instant. As it broke, this rainbow-like aura disappeared without a trace.","“Sh*t!”","At this moment, the sect leader felt a chill run down his back. This sword seemed to have swept down from the Heavens. There was absolutely no way to dodge it.","The sect leader originally thought that Chu Yunfan was only so-so. However, at that moment, Chu Yunfan completely broke their collective momentum. Then, they were instantly locked onto.","Immediately following this sword ray came a huge sword aura.","“Innate! He’s an Innate expert!”","The sect leader finally realized the seriousness of the problem. This seemingly unremarkable guy was actually an Innate expert.","This was absolutely terrifying.","Offending an Innate expert was not scary. The key was that Chu Yunfan was still so young. That was what was terrifying about it.","As everyone knew, the younger one was, the more potential one had.","In the blink of an eye, countless thoughts flashed through the sect leader’s mind. However, in the next second, Chu Yunfan’s sword light swept across their bodies.","Boom!","The sword light exploded, sweeping out a huge shockwave that soared into the sky.","“Sir!”","The Qingyang disciples cried out in surprise. Then, they saw the five peak Acquired experts, including their leader, cough up blood and fly away.","The five of them had joined hands, but even they could not block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Before this, they had only regarded Chu Yunfan as very strong. But now, they finally understood how strong he truly was.","‘Innate! He’s an Innate expert!’ this thought arose in their minds. To be able to instantly injure a peak Acquired expert, Chu Yunfan must be unimaginably strong.","The Innate expert had finally shown his true might.","At this moment, many people felt the air in their lungs freeze over. Before this, they had not felt anything. But now that they truly understood Chu Yunfan’s strength, everyone was terrified.","The terror of offending an Innate master was now fully displayed. One person was enough to topple their entire sect. There was no point in having numbers in front of Chu Yunfan.","Having fewer people was like delivering vegetables. So was having more people. In essence, there was no difference.","Spurt!","The sect leader spat out another mouthful of blood. He had took most of Chu Yunfan’s attack. Although the sect leader’s cultivation was the deepest, his injuries were also the deepest.","“Tell me. Where is my cousin?” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“I don’t know what cousin you’re talking about. You’re finished. We’ve already called the police. When the police arrive, you’ll be dead meat. You won’t be able to leave even if you want to!”","The sect leader gritted his teeth and refused to say anything more. He knew very well that if he said anything, the consequences would be unimaginable. At that time, he would be the one holding the hostage.","“Yes, you’re dead meat!” the few elders behind the sect elader shouted as they panted.","“Looks like you guys are really stubborn,” Chu Yunfan said coldly. As he spoke, he suddenly swung the sword in his hand. A stream of sword light swept out and instantly cut off one of the sect leader’s arms.","Spurt!","Fresh blood sprayed out like a pillar.","Although the sect leader immediately controlled his muscles to stop the bleeding, his face instantly turned pale. When he looked at Chu Yunfan again, there was a trace of fear in his eyes.","Chu Yunfan had attacked without any hesitation. This was the scariest part.","“Sir!” the Qingyang disciples cried out in surprise. When they looked down to Chu Yunfan, they looked as if they were looking at the devil.","“Hand over Chu Yunfei. Otherwise, you’ll suffer even more,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“Chu Yunfan, you used your cultivation to do evil and do whatever you want. You’ll get your retribution. The government will never let you off.” The sect leader was pale, but he hgeld his tongue nonetheless. He knew that he could not say anything at this time. Otherwise, he would be done for.","The sect leader had never expected that capturing a few brats would cause such a big incident.","“So calm in the face of death. Do you really think that you can do anything to me?” Chu Yunfan said as he looked the sect leader coldly.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan formed a hand seal, and a stream of True Energy shot out from his fingers and entered the sect leader’s body.","The sect leader, who looked like he was ready to die just a moment ago, instantly screamed and collapsed to the ground."]},{"number":671,"title":"Chapter 671 - The Reason for This Lawlessness","paragraphs":["Everyone stared at the sect leader with dazed looks on their faces. Everyone could guess what the sect leader had planned. He wanted to hold on until the police arrived. When the police arrived, Chu Yunfan would be finished. Moreover, within the city, Chu Yunfan would not dare to kill anyone.","Even if one’s arm was cut off, it was not a big deal. With current technology, it could be reattached in a minute. If the sect leader did not even have this bit of willpower, he would not be able to become their leader.","The crux of the matter now was that the sect leader could not admit that he was indeed holding Chu Yunfei hostage.","The disciples looked at Chu Yunfan with a cold glint in their eyes. This was a society ruled by law. For running amok like this, Chu Yunfan would definitely have to pay the price.","But now, after just being hit by a single strand of Chu Yunfan’s True Energy, the sect leader was in so much pain that he was rolling across the ground. His entire body was covered in a cold sweat. All of his previous fortitudes had been completely defeated by this strand of True Energy and he completely collapsed.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. They did not know what method he had used. Only he himself knew that he had used a unique interrogation technique from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","Back in the Ancient Zenith Civilization, there were many such unique interrogation techniques. In that era, martial arts had developed to an extremely brilliant stage, and there were many captives that were martial arts experts with strong wills. Ordinary punishments were completely useless against them.","The body was a bag of skin, but the spirit was eternal.","Without these interrogation techniques, it would be very difficult to get information from them.","And the kind that Chu Yunfan had used allowed True Energy to infiltrate every nerve of his target. The target would be in incomparable pain. Even people with strong wills would not be able to endure it for long.","Moreover, there were even more advanced interrogation techniques that could strike the soul. That pain was not something that this modern society, which had just started developing a few hundred years ago, could imagine.","Everyone saw that the sect leader was completely drenched in just a moment.","“I’ll talk!”","The sect leader only managed to hold out for a short while before he broke. His voice was not as full of energy as before. Instead, it was filled with a sense of weakness. It was as if he had exhausted all of his life force in that short period.","When everyone looked at Chu Yunfan again, they felt terror. The sect leader had such a strong will, yet he had completely surrendered after only holding out for just a few minutes. Everyone could imagine how much pain and torture he had suffered.","And Chu Yunfan had been the cause of this pain.","“Good.” Chu Yunfan nodded and then gave the sect leader a moment of relief. “A wise man submits to circumstances. Which one of you will go get them?”","Dear readers! you are reading on our content copy site.Please copy and search this link \" https://tinyurl.com/39hpcn6j \" to support us","“Go. Bring them over,” the sect leader said weakly.","Since even the sect master had spoken, the Qingyang disciples naturally did not object. Some of the disciples who knew the inside story quickly ran into the hall.","“Tell me. Why are you holding my cousin hostage?” Chu Yunfan asked as he looked at the sect leader.","The sect leader had lost all his pride and confidence. He was now so weak that he could not speak. He could only let the elder beside him explain the situation to Chu Yunfan.","That elder did not dare to hide anything. Everything came pouring out like a cut sack of beans. Even the disciples of Qingyang were just finding out why the sect would provoke a super-killer God like Chu Yunfan.","This was an Innate master. To a small force like them, no Innate master was someone they could afford to offend. If they had known that Chu Yunfei had such a powerful backer, they would not have chosen this path.","After listening to the elder’s explanation, Chu Yunfan realized that this had a lot to do with one of their disciples, Zhang Sisi.","Zhang Sisi was a disciple of their sect. After she was admitted to university, she went and got to know Chu Yunfei. The two of them quickly fell in love.","Originally, this was only between the two of them and had nothing to do with anyone else. However, one of the sons of the Tianluo sect’s leader took a fancy to Zhang Sisi.","While they were at the university, the young master of Tianluo was unable to best Chu Yunfei. Out of humiliation and anger, he pressured Qingyang.","Tianluo was a large-scale force. Their sect leader was a peak Innate master. How could they reject the request who came from a young master with such a huge backing?","Moreover, they wanted to use this opportunity to connect with the Tianluo sect and join them. Therefore, they quickly decided to betroth Zhang Sisi to the young master.","Originally, the matter had ended here. Who knew that the young master would be angry at the humiliation Chu Yunfei had given him? Not only did he request Zhang Sisi, but he also wanted Qingyang to capture Chu Yunfei and let him do whatever he wanted.","This had led to the matter of Chu Yunfei going missing and being captured by Qingyang.","Regarding this request, although Qingyang had been somewhat hesitant, they quickly made a decision. Compared to the young master of the Tianluo sect, Chu Yunfei, based on the information they received from Donghua City, was just an average university student from an average family.","There are so many such people in the Federation that if they died, things would calm down after a while. Therefore, they decided to take the risk and captured Chu Yunfei. However, no one had expected that the Chu family, which was just an ordinary family, would have such a powerful Innate expert.","And the expert was Chu Yunfei’s cousin.","Qingyang had kicked a hornet’s nest.","The sect leader of Qingyang suddenly felt regretful. He had wanted to use this opportunity to align himself with the Tianluo sect. He had not expected to kick a hornet’s nest in the process.","“Lawless!” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “Where are they now?”","“They haven’t been sent away, but a Tianluo elder has come to pick them up,” the sect leader said weakly.","Although they would end up offending Tianluo, they had to protect themselves at this time first. Otherwise, how could they even take care of the Tianluo sect’s matters? They had to send this killer-god away first.","No one knew better than the sect leader how terrifying the torture he had felt.","“We have a problem, sir. Elder Tie has forcefully taken the captives out of the city!” a disciple ran over and reported.","“What?” The expressions of all the disciples and elders of Qingyang changed. They had not expected such an accident to happen.","“Which direction did they go?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That way!”","The disciple pointed in a direction, and Chu Yunfan disappeared like a gust of wind."]},{"number":672,"title":"Chapter 672 - One Person Suppresses a Sect","paragraphs":["After Chu Yunfan disappeared from Qingyang, the entire sect finally heaved a sigh of relief.","They looked at each other in dismay. They could see the shock in each other’s eyes. In the past, they had only heard rumors about how one person could suppress an entire sect.","Those were rumors, but now, someone had really done it in front of them. The Qingyang disciples finally understood why an Innate master was so important to a sect.","An Innate master was enough to suppress a small sect like theirs that did not have an Innate master.","However, today’s trouble was far more than that. Not only was Chu Yunfan able to suppress the entire scene, but the sect leader had even been interrogated by Chu Yunfan about Chu Yunfei’s whereabouts.","This time, they could not use the government to their advantage. On the contrary, Qingyang was in big trouble this time. And all of this was brought about by their leader.","The sect leader seemed to have aged ten years. Qingyang had suffered a huge blow this time around.","“We’ve found his information. Tsk. He’s the number one of Federation University’s sophomores. He’s also the youngest person in history to receive a Heaven’s Pride Invite from the Heavenly Dragon Villa. He is also the champion of last year’s Dao Conference!” Some of the disciples had finally found Chu Yunfan’s information based on his self-introduction.","When they heard of these titles, the Qingyang disciples sucked in a breath of cold air and felt like they were about to faint. Just what kind of monster had they provoked?!","They did not have much of an impression of Chu Yunfan before. It was just like how most people in the Common Era would not care about who the top scorer of this year’s college entrance examination was. Other than a specific circle of students, most adults were completely indifferent.","After all, the Federation held university examinations every year. Every time, there would be a top scorer and a bunch of young geniuses. Some people had already experienced this a dozen times and were already numb to it.","However, their indifference did not mean they did not know what these titles meant. With just any one of these titles, they already meant that Chu Yunfan’s future was boundless.","Whether it was politics, business, the military, or establishing a sect, Chu Yunfan was an existence that they could not contend against. If they still had the thought of settling scores later, this thought now completely vanished.","What a joke. If it was an ordinary person, they could still use their connections to seek revenge. However, Chu Yunfan’s identity as a student of Federation University was already the biggest protection. Compared to a behemoth like Federation University, Qingyang was just an ant-like existence. Any random Innate instructor could easily overthrow their sect.","“This is a blessing, not a curse. We wouldn’t have been able to avoid a curse, especially after provoking such a character.”","“Who would have thought that Chu Yunfei would have such a high-profile cousin.”","“It’s over, it’s over. We’ve passed this test.”","The entire Qingyang felt as if a skyscraper had collapsed on them. One person had suppressed all of them.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan flew in the direction that disciple had pointed out. In just a short moment, he had exited the city. As Qingyang itself was at the edge of Xihua City, they quickly passed the city limits.","After exiting the city wall that protected Xihua, Chu Yunfan spotted a flying car stopped in the open wilderness. A group of people alighted from the car. The person in the lead was a tall old man. That man was Elder Tie of the Tianluo sect.","Behind Elder Tie stood a few young men and women who were staggering behind him. And among these young men and women, the leader was none other than Chu Yunfei.","Chu Yunfei looked dispirited. However, there were no obvious wounds on his body. It was just that he had been imprisoned for a long time.","“Behave yourselves.” Elder Tie cast a glance at these young men and women. Although he had absolute confidence, he did not wish for any unnecessary complications to arise.","Chu Yunfei and the others remained silent. These past few days of imprisonment had allowed them to understand many things. They thought that the laws of the Federation would be able to govern every single place. However, reality showed them that the government could not control every single place.","This world was far darker than they had imagined.","“We’re not going to die, are we?” one of the girls said as she sobbed softly.","“I don’t want to die, I don’t want to die!” another girl said as she shook her head/","Although the boys were a little stronger, they had already sunk into deep despair.","“It’s not certain whether you guys will die or not, but this kid is dead for sure. He had dared to snatch our young master’s woman.” Elder Tie glanced at Chu Yunfei.","The boys and girls did not feel relieved as that meant they might still die.","“This has nothing to do with them. I’m the one your young master wants,” Chu Yunfei said through gritted teeth. He had nowhere to run and would most certainly die. The woman he loved had been taken away. His heart was already as dead as ash. However, he was unwilling to let his good friends die as well.","“Hmph. This isn’t up to me to decide. The young master has already received the news and has come personally. Your outcome will be decided by the young master with a single word,” Elder Tie said coldly.","Elder Tie did not understand why the young master wanted this kid dead. After all, Chu Yunfei was just an insignificant small fry. However, since it was an order from the young master, Elder Tie could only follow it.","Everyone felt even more despair!","“All of you better be obedient. Not even the gods can save you now,” Elder Tie said with a cold smile. “In this wilderness, if you die, your corpse will never be found. I don’t want to waste my energy, so don’t force my hand.”","Suddenly, Elder Tie felt a shocking aura flying over. His body tensed up and entered a state of vigilance. He turned and saw a black-clothed youth flying over from afar with a huge sword on his back.","That youth was not one of them!","Elder Tie quickly made a judgment. All the aura in his body gathered together and he was ready to attack at any time.","In just a short moment, the black-clothed youth was already standing before them. His footsteps were profound, seemingly slow but actually fast. He had caught up with Elder Tie and the others at an astonishing speed."]},{"number":673,"title":"Chapter 673 - An Innate Expert? Who Wasn’t One?!","paragraphs":["In just a short moment, Chu Yunfan had already caught up with Elder Tie and the others.","“I’ve finally caught up to you.”","Chu Yunfan managed to steady himself after just a few breaths. The recovery ability of the Imperial Physique was fully displayed here.","“Cousin!”","Chu Yunfei, who was originally in complete despair, had a look of disbelief in his eyes when he saw Chu Yunfan appear. He looked pleasantly surprised.","It was as though he had never expected Chu Yunfan to appear!","Chu Yunfei’s eyes, which were originally filled with despair, were once again filled with hope.","Chu Yunfei had already accepted his fate. He thought he would not be able to escape. He had not expected Chu Yunfan to appear when he was in such despair.","“I’ve finally caught up to you. Otherwise, I wouldn’t know how to explain myself to Third Aunt!” Chu Yunfan looked at Chu Yunfei and grinned.","The relationship between Chu Yunfan and Chu Yunfei was not exactly cordial. However, Chu Yunfan had long jumped out of his original circle. Looking back, it was just a group of children fighting over their feelings.","Chu Yuntian, Chu Yunfan, and Chu Yunfei were all born in the same year. They were very close in age, so it was inevitable that they would compete with each other.","Hearing Chu Yunfan mention his mother, Chu Yunfei, who had been clenching his teeth for the past few days and had not cried, could not help his eyes from turning red.","However, Chu Yunfei quickly said, “Yunfan, leave. Quick. This old fellow is an Innate expert. You’re no match for him. Quickly leave and avenge me in the future!”","Chu Yunfei clearly knew Elder Tie’s strength. An Innate expert. Just these words had crushed any thought of resistance. That was an existence that he could not contend against.","“It’s a little too late to leave now.” Elder Tie sneered.","“There’s a path to heaven but you didn’t take it. You just barged into Hell!” Elder Tie said with a sinister smile.","Although Chu Yunfan had concealed his strength and aura, Elder Tie could see that Chu Yunfan was much stronger than Chu Yunfei. There were too many uncertainties in the future for such a person. In that case, it was better to kill Chu Yunfan as soon as possible.","In this remote desert, if Chu Yunfan died, so be it. No one would be able to track him down.","“Since you’re already here, then don’t leave!” Elder Tie shouted coldly. The aura within his body was instantly released. The aura that belonged to the Innate Stage instantly blotted out the sky and covered the Sun.","Chu Yunfei and his friends felt as if they had been struck by a heavy blow. They immediately felt the suppression of the terrifying aura. The reason why they followed obediently and did not resist was because of the Innate Stage aura Elder Tie had displayed earlier.","Just Elder Tie’s aura alone was enough to suppress these students who had not reached the Acquired Stage.","However, Elder Tie was shocked to discover that Chu Yunfan was completely unmoved. The Innate Stage aura formed by an Innate expert drawing the power of nature had no effect on Chu Yunfan at all.","“No wonder he’s so unrestrained. So he’s an Innate expert,” Chu Yunfan said without any change in his expression.","Chu Yunfan was still gratified that Chu Yunfei was still able to think of letting him escape in the end. After all, although he had already let go of some laughable grudges in the past. If he were to save this ungrateful wretch, there was no doubt, Chu Yunfei would feel very uncomfortable in his heart.","“However, who isn’t an Innate expert?”","As soon as Chu Yunfan’s words fell, an extremely terrifying Innate aura was instantly released from his body. Chu Yunfan’s Innate aura soared into the sky and the Innate aura released by Elder Tie was instantly shattered.","Elder Tie’s expression changed abruptly. An Innate expert. Chu Yunfan was actually an Innate expert. Moreover, just based on the aura he released, one could sense that Chu Yunfan’s strength was above that of a second-level Innate Stage expert such as himself.","Elder Tie was completely in disbelief. How old was Chu Yunfan? He looked like he was not even twenty. Yet, he had already stepped into the Innate Stage.","If Elder Tie was only worried about the threat that Chu Yunfan would pose in the future, then that fear had now been brought to the present.","A fierce killing intent flashed through Elder Tie’s eyes. It was best not to offend such a person. But once he did, he would definitely eradicate the root of the problem.","“This... Yunfei, your cousin is actually an Innate expert?” The few young men and women were scared silly by this sudden change.","To ordinary civilians like them, Innate experts were simply like myths and legends. Usually, they might not even have the chance to see them once in a few years. Other than on the virtual network, it would be hard for them to meet an Innate expert in real life.","And now, two of them had appeared in one go. Chu Yunfei’s cousin looked to be about the same age as them, but he was an Innate expert. This completely overturned their understanding. Even the chancellor of their university was only a peak Acquired, not an Innate.","Chu Yunfei’s cousin was actually more powerful than the chancellor of their university. How was this possible?","“I... I didn’t know either.” Chu Yunfei smiled bitterly. His eyes were filled with incomparable shock. Others did not know the situation, so they were only shocked by Chu Yunfan’s strength. Chu Yunfei was even more shocked by Chu Yunfan’s growth speed.","Two years ago, Chu Yunfan was agonizing over whether he could get into the martial arts class. After that, he improved at a speed that was akin to riding a rocket. Not only did he get into the martial arts class, he even got into the focus class.","After that, Chu Yunfan went even more out of control. He got into Federation University. It had been almost two years since he and Chu Yunfei had last met. And in such a short period, Chu Yunfan had stepped into the Innate Stage.","This was, without a doubt, a miracle.","Chu Yunfei recalled that after Chu Yunfan rose up, his family had come to the conclusion that Chu Yunfan he been enlightened. Even so, Chu Yunfei had never heard of anyone becoming so heaven-defying.","From the Physical Stage to the Innate Stage in two years. If Chu Yunfei was not absolutely certain before that Chu Yunfan was in the Physical Stage back then, he would not have believed it. He felt that Chu Yunfan must have hidden his strength before.","“Why does your cousin look about the same age as us? Or is he actually in his thirties or forties, but he just looks young?” one of Chu Yunfei’s friends looked at him and said. That would have been something they could accept.","Unexpectedly, Chu Yunfei shook his head and said, “He’s the same age as us.”","When everyone looked at Chu Yunfan again, their eyes had completely changed.","What a monster!"]},{"number":674,"title":"Chapter 674 - Instant Defeat of an Innate","paragraphs":["Chu Yunfan was the same age as them, but he was already an expert at the Innate Stage. This was a myth that overturned their worldviews.","In their university, even after many years, there were not many who were able to step into the Acquired Stage. And those students who had were now part of the amazing alumni of their university. They were existences that were like thunder in their ears.","As for those who were of the same age as them and were able to step into the Innate Stage, they were no longer existences that were like thunder in their ears. They were purely legends. A legend that was impossible to realize.","However, this legend had now appeared before their very eyes.","With their level, it was naturally impossible for them to understand this. Even at Federation University, there were not many freaks like Chu Yunfan. However, they knew that this cousin of Chu Yunfei’s was simply awesome.","Chu Yunfei felt the gazes of his friends on him. He was absolutely shocked. If he had not seen it with his own eyes, he would not have dared to believe it. As far as he knew, his older cousin, Chu Yuntian, was far inferior to the current Chu Yunfan.","Although Chu Yuntian was very strong and had entered the Acquired Stage long ago, Chu Yunfei was well aware of this. Chu Yunfan’s current strength had completely trampled on Chu Yunfei’s worldview.","After the initial shock, they were incomparably excited. Finally, a savior had appeared. As they were in despair, Chu Yunfan appeared like a ray of hope. After experiencing a life-and-death experience, they finally understood what it meant to be in a life-and-death situation.","“Thank god. We’re saved!”","“We won’t have to die!”","At this moment, Elder Tie’s expression was extremely grave. Chu Yunfan’s aura alone was enough to suppress him. It would be almost impossible for him to defeat Chu Yunfan.","This was Elder Tie’s intuition, but he trusted it. His intuition had saved him countless times. The only thing he could do now was to stall for time until the young master and the others arrived.","Thinking of this, Elder Tie’s steeled himself. He had heard Chu Yunfei’s words. Chu Yunfan had reached the Innate Stage, and he was only around twenty years old. Once such a person matured, he could even destroy the foundation of the Tianluo sect.","They had to restrain Chu Yunfan. Whether he was a genius or a monster, he had to grow up first. If he died, he would only be an ordinary corpse.","Voom!","Thinking up to this point, Elder Tie immediately released his aura. It collided with Chu Yunfan’s aura.","At this moment, Elder Tie made his move. He pulled out a long whip from his waist and swept it out. It was like a long dragon with True Energy attached to it. Like a burning flame, it flew toward Chu Yunfan’s face.","It was better to strike first. Since he had already sensed that Chu Yunfan’s strength was above his, Elder Tie naturally would not give up such an opportunity.","“Watch out!” Chu Yunfei noticed the whip. It shattered the air and then turned into a wave of air that spread out in all directions.","When an Innate expert attacked, their movements were naturally shocking. Chu Yunfei only had time to see Elder Tie launch his attack. Then, his eyes screwed shut against the strong wind that swept out.","Chu Yunfei wanted to warn Chu Yunfan, but it was already too late. And just as he was extremely worried, Chu Yunfan stepped out from within the chaotic storm. His hand was holding tightly onto the whip.","“Is this all you’ve got?” Chu Yunfan walked step by step toward Elder Tie. “If this is it, I’m afraid it’s not enough to kill me.”","Chu Yunfan had seen the killing intent in Elder Tie’s eyes. This man wanted nothing more than to tear him into pieces.","Meanwhile, Elder Tie felt cold sweat beading his forehead. Chu Yunfan’s strength was astonishing. No matter how hard he pulled, he could not pull back his whip from Chu Yunfan’s grasp.","Elder Tie was shocked. He knew very well the power of his whip. Even gold and iron would be smashed into pieces by his whip that was imbued with True Energy. However, not only did Chu Yunfan not dodge, he even grabbed the whip.","And Chu Yunfan’s hand was not broken. This was proof of the problem.","Chu Yunfan was more powerful and difficult to deal with than Elder Tie had anticipated.","Seeing Chu Yunfan walking toward him step by step, Elder Tie showed an expression that his plan had succeeded. Suddenly, his leg was like a sharp blade as it swept toward Chu Yunfan’s head.","The whip from before was just a smokescreen. This kick was Elder Tie’s true killing move. His kicking technique was even more astonishing than his whip technique.","This was Elder Tie’s true trump card. He did not know how many people he had defeated by relying on this hidden trump card. He had schemed against and brought down many powerful enemies who were originally stronger than him.","This kick carried the power of Heaven and Earth and formed a mighty force. The power of Heaven and Earth gathered into this attack and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","This attack hit Chu Yunfan’s body without any hindrance.","But the smile that had just gathered on Elder Tie’s face suddenly froze. He realized that Chu Yunfan had managed to block his attack.","How terrifying was the full-strength attack of an Innate expert? Even though Elder Tie was not the strongest among all the Innate Stage experts, the power of his horizontal sweep was comparable to the power of a cannonball from the Common Era.","This was the miraculous power contained within the human body. Even an intermediate mecha would be destroyed by a single kick if it was not prepared.","However, when this strike landed on Chu Yunfan, it did not cause him to waver even in the slightest. It was like a gentle breeze brushing against his face.","This was the most terrifying part.","“So this is your trump card? What a pity. Even if I have not stepped into the Innate Stage, this attack of yours can’t pose a threat to me. Furthermore, I’ve stepped into the Innate Stage.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","All of a sudden, Chu Yunfan attacked. A white palm pierced through the air and grabbed Elder Tie by the neck.","Elder Tie tried to stop it, but he could not block it at all. This close distance was within the range of his kick, but it was also within the range of Chu Yunfan’s attack.","With just one attack, Chu Yunfan grabbed Elder Tie’s neck. And the tighter it got, the more Elder Tie lost his fighting strength.","Instant defeat!","Chu Yunfan had subdued another Innate expert in the blink of an eye.","Chu Yunfei and his friends looked at the scene before them in complete shock."]},{"number":675,"title":"Chapter 675 - The Admiration of the Crowd","paragraphs":["A crushing defeat. Elder Tie had made two consecutive moves, but he was unable to shake Chu Yunfan in the slightest. However, Chu Yunfan had casually made a move and instantly trapped Elder Tie.","The difference between the two sides was clear at a glance.","There was no doubt about Chu Yunfan’s strength. Just by looking at Elder Tie, who was easily subdued in an instant, one could tell.","Chu Yunfan held Elder Tie’s body in place. He lifted Elder Tie up like he was lifting a chicken.","Elder Tie felt extremely humiliated. He was completely caught off guard.","Chu Yunfan’s hand was like an iron hoop, and Elder Tie could not break free.","“Rrragh!”","Elder Tie let out a furious roar. The True Energy in his entire body exploded out, forming a terrifying shockwave that swept toward Chu Yunfan, attempting to send him flying.","However, with the current strength of Chu Yunfan’s body, his feet were as steady as Mount Tai, rooting him firmly to the ground.","Then, Chu Yunfan made his move. He gently placed his fingers on Elder Tie’s body.","Elder Tie instantly stopped moving. All the True Energy in his body was withdrawn as if a ferocious beast had been locked in its cage.","“Acupoint?” Chu Yunfei and his friends lit up when they saw this scene. This was just like the acupoint in novels. Of course, with the great development of martial arts in modern society, there were people who explored the way of acupoint. But in the end, it had all proven to just be nonsense.","Modern martial artists were different from the high and mighty people in novels.","The masters in novels all practiced internal strength from the beginning of their cultivation journey. Very few had practiced their external strength. Even if they did, they usually only practiced a part of their body, such as the palm, the leg, and so on.","In other parts, they were no different from ordinary people. Even a top-tier expert would be pierced by a sword.","However, modern martial artists were different. The path of martial arts cultivation began with the tempering of the physical body. The more powerful an expert was, the greater their control over their physical body would be. For a top-tier expert in the Innate Stage, their control over their physical body had reached the peak of perfection.","It was simply impossible to use acupoint techniques to subdue someone. They could even take a cannonball head-on. How could they be subjugated by the acupoint technique?","That was why Chu Yunfan’s move shocked them so much.","What they did not know was that Chu Yunfan’s technique was not the acupoint technique in novels. Instead, it was a sealing technique. Although it was only a relatively basic technique, its effect was first-class.","“How is this possible?!”","Elder Tie felt that all of his True Energy and blood seemed to have been locked by a force. Only then did he finally realize the seriousness of the problem.","“Tianluo will have your head for this!” Elder Tie shouted with all his strength.","“And what does Tianluo think it is?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","In the eyes of ordinary people, the Tianluo sect was terrifyingly powerful. But Chu Yunfan had even offended the Jiangs and the Huangs without hesitation, let alone a mere sect such as Tianluo.","After throwing Elder Tie, who was already limp and powerless, aside, Chu Yunfan walked toward Chu Yunfei and his friends.","When Chu Yunfei’s friends looked at Chu Yunfan, their eyes were filled with incomparable shock.","Domineering. It was too domineering. In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, the grand Tianluo sect was nothing at all.","If it was an ordinary person who said it, they would only think that that person was just bragging. However, Chu Yunfan’s move just now had really subdued them.","“Yunfan, that old fellow just now said that the young master of Tianluo will be here soon. W better hurry and leave,” Chu Yunfei said after a moment’s pause as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan frowned and thought for a moment. Then, he said, “Take the flying car back to Xihua City. Once you’re in the city, even Tianluo wouldn’t dare to make a move.”","“What about you?” Chu Yunfei asked.","“I’ll stay here and tie up some loose ends. I’ll help you guys settle some future troubles,” Chu Yunfan said.","Only then did everyone understand that Chu Yunfan meant to stay behind to cover the rear. Chu Yunfei was extremely touched. Only now did he truly feel that blood was thicker than water.","“You guys head back first. I’ll stay behind,” Chu Yunfei said through gritted teeth after a brief pause.","“All right. You can stay,” Chu Yunfan agreed after thinking for a moment.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfei’s friends looked at each other and did not linger any longer. After this incident, they finally realized how childish they had been. This world was far crueler than they had imagined.","After they left, only Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfei, and Elder Tie, who had collapsed to the ground, were left in the empty field.","“You’re dead meat. You’ve offended Tianluo. No matter where you hide, it’s useless,” Elder Tie said stubbornly, “Now, let me go. There might be a chance for you to survive if you do.”","“Idiot.”","Chu Yunfan slapped Elder Tie in the face. His True Energy gathered into his palm as he fiercely slapped Elder Tie’s face.","This caused half of Elder Tie’s face to swell up. It was a patch of green and purple, making him look extremely miserable.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfei looked at Chu Yunfan with some admiration. This was his first time getting into such a situation. When he looked at Chu Yunfan, he felt like he was looking at a god—an Innate expert who was unattainable to others. When Chu Yunfan said that he would teach someone a lesson, he did not hesitate at all.","“Do you know why I didn’t kill him?” Chu Yunfan asked as he looked at Chu Yunfei.","“I don’t.” Chu Yunfei shook his head.","“That little girlfriend of yours was taken away by the people of the Tianluo sect. I think that an elder of the Innate Stage like him should be enough to exchange for her,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfei looked at Chu Yunfan excitedly. He had not made such a request because he knew what kind of existence Tianluo was. To a behemoth like Federation University, it might not be much. But to an ordinary person, it was simply despairing.","Chu Yunfan had come all the way here to save Chu Yunfei. That was enough. He could not let Chu Yunfan take on any more risk for his sake.","However, when Chu Yunfan revealed his purpose, Chu Yunfei felt tears welling up in his eyes.","On the other hand, Elder Tie looked at Chu Yunfan in complete disbelief. On what basis did Chu Yunfan dare to challenge the Tianluo sect? Was he not afraid of death?","While the two of them were talking, a flying carriage arrived before them. A few figures stepped out of the carriage. The leader was a young man who looked to be about twenty-seven or twenty-eight years old. Behind him were a medium-built middle-aged man and a skinny old man.","The three of them all carried an oppressive pressure.","Three Innate Stage experts."]},{"number":676,"title":"Chapter 676 - You Beast! Kill Him!","paragraphs":["These three carried terrifying Innate auras. As they stepped down from the carriage, they quickly spotted Chu Yunfan and Chu Yunfei, especially the young man at the front. When he saw Chu Yunfei, his eyes lit up.","“Hahaha, Chu Yunfei, your end has arrived!”","When he saw this young man, Chu Yunfei gnashed his teeth.","The identity of this young man was obvious. It was the young master of the Tianluo sect.","This young master carried a hint of disdain and arrogance. When he looked at Chu Yunfei, his face revealed a mocking smile.","The young master had never suffered such a huge loss before. The family background and looks that he was so proud of were bested by Chu Yunfei—an ant in his eyes—when he was chasing after Zhang Sisi.","This was a great humiliation to the young master. It was as if he had been ruthlessly slapped several times on his face.","This time, the young master was the one who had ordered Qingyang to capture Chu Yunfei. However, when he saw Chu Yunfan beside Chu Yunfei and Elder Tie who was lying on the ground, he realized the seriousness of the problem.","The young master was very clear about Chu Yunfei’s strength. If he was so powerful that he could make Elder Tie lie on the ground, then it would be impossible for Qingyang to have captured him so easily.","In that case, the problem could only be on Chu Yunfan.","“Young master, be careful. This kid is evil!” Elder Tie quickly said. Although he could not move, he could still speak.","Chu Yunfan had sealed his True Energy and blood flow, rendering him unable to move. This was a great shock to him.","“It’s him.”","Including the young master, the three stared at Chu Yunfan. It was really him who was playing tricks.","Facing the gazes of the three Innate Masters, Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. He said indifferently, “This old guy is an elder of your sect, right? Now, I want to use his life to exchange for Zhang Sisi. You guys won’t be at a loss then.”","“What? We won’t be at a loss? Hahahahaha!” the young master laughed. He did not take Chu Yunfan’s words seriously at all. Instead, he felt that Chu Yunfan had lost his mind. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan had completely gone mad.","“Who do you think you are? You dare to negotiate with us?” the young master looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. His eyes were as cold as a pair of snake eyes.","“I’ll have you know, that sl*t is already dead!”","“What?!”","Hearing the words of the young master, the originally calm Chu Yunfei suddenly became agitated.","“It’s impossible, Sisi can’t be dead!”","The young master threw a cold glance at Chu Yunfei, then said, “That sl*t. I was willing to condescend and wanted to take her as my concubine, but she didn’t know how to appreciate it. In her heart, she still thinks of a stinking loser like you.","“The only thing left for me to do is play her to death. Now that her corpse has been thrown out to feed the dogs, do you want to exchange for her? Hahahaha, you want me to bring my dog here for you?”","“You deserve to die!” Chu Yunfei’s eyes turned red. All the True Energy in his body burst out, but his strength was only barely in the Qi Sea Stage. Even though all of his True Energy had burst out, to everyone present, it was just a sparkling fire.","Chu Yunfei was about to rush out, but Chu Yunfan stopped him.","“You can have your revenge later. There’s no need to rush,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Chu Yunfei looked at his cousin with red eyes and nodded fiercely.","“Hahahaha, revenge? On the basis of—” the young master had not even finished laughing when he saw Chu Yunfan point his finger out like a sword. Then, sword light shot out from Chu Yunfan’s finger and instantly pierced through Elder Tie’s throat.","Elder Tie, who had been clamoring earlier, was now dead.","“Since you’ve already killed Zhang Sisi, then there’s no need for this old fellow to exist anymore.” Chu Yunfan said casually as if he was talking about something very simple.","“You...” the young master was shocked. Chu Yunfan said he would make a move, and he really had not hesitated and killed people in front of them.","Chu Yunfan had killed people before, but this was completely different. This was cold and arrogant.","“Scum like you don’t deserve to live in this world,” Chu Yunfan said icily. His eyes were filled with killing intent as he looked at the young master.","“Go! Kill him!” the young master ordered. The old man remained calm while the middle-aged man suddenly launched out.","Boom!","The middle-aged man pierced through the air. He was like a cannonball as he flew toward Chu Yunfan. A ferocious expression appeared on his face. The terrifying aura of an Innate Stage expert was released, and it was even higher than Elder Tie’s.","The middle-aged man had already stepped into the third level of the Innate Stage!","From this perspective, Tianluo was indeed a large-scale force. For a small-scale force like Qingyang, it was impossible for them to obtain an Innate Stage expert. However, Tianluo had far more than just one or two Innate masters.","“You’re dead meat!”","The middle-aged man opened his palm and formed a large hand that was the size of a millstone. Then, he directly crushed down toward Chu Yunfan.","“Yunfei, watch carefully. Watch how I defeat them!” Chu Yunfan said loudly.","At that moment, Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and withdrew it to his waist. Then, he threw out a punch. In that instant, this punch broke through the middle-aged man’s Innate aura. In the blink of an eye, this Innate aura was shattered into pieces.","Following that, Chu Yunfan’s punch did not lose its momentum. It smashed directly into the middle-aged man’s large hand.","Boom!","With a loud boom, the world seemed to shake violently for a moment. It was just one punch. Everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s True Energy burst out from his body and sent the middle-aged man flying back with a punch.","The middle-aged man retreated hastily as his arm hung weakly by his side. His entire body was covered in a cold sweat, and his face was pale. The moment he exchanged blows with Chu Yunfan, his arm was broken by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Just as the middle-aged man was about to escape, Chu Yunfan instantly launched another attack. The Ju Que on Chu Yunfan’s back left his body and turned into a sword light that chased after the middle-aged man.","The sword light shot into the sky, illuminating everything. It caught up with the middle-aged man in the blink of an eye.","The middle-aged man did not have time to dodge. With a scream, he was cut into two halves."]},{"number":677,"title":"Chapter 677 - For Aiding the Wicked, You","paragraphs":["No one had expected that this powerful third-level Innate expert would be so weak against Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan defeated him with ease.","One punch! One strike!","To have killed an Innate level expert, Chu Yunfan’s strength was unquestionable.","“Trash.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Then, Chu Yunfan raised the Ju Que in his hand and pointed it at the young master, then said, “It’s your turn next. Are you ready to die? And you won’t be thrown out to the dogs. Here, you will only feed the monsters.”","Chu Yunfan could see monsters wandering around the fringes of his vision. The smell of blood had attracted them. These monsters had a sense of smell that was dozens of times stronger than dogs. Even the faintest scent of blood was enough to attract them.","The young master was clearly frightened. He was different from the others. He had been able to step into the Innate Stage thanks to all the resources of Tianluo. As the young master of a sect, he possessed many resources and privileges that were unimaginable to many. Though his talent was inferior, he was still able to step into the ranks of Innate experts.","But among the Innate experts, he was one of the weakest. That was why Chu Yunfan’s aura frightened him.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was like a terrifying ferocious beast that had been released from its cage. The terrifying aura from his body made the young master’s hairs stand on end.","However, the young master quickly calmed down.","“You actually dared to threaten me? You’re dead for sure. I’ll make sure you die in this no man’s land!” the young master shouted as an incomparably malevolent expression overtook his face.","At this moment, the old man behind the young master suddenly stood out.","“Brat, you’re far too arrogant!” the skinny old man said as he looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. Even though Chu Yunfan had killed his companion, it was not enough to make his heart waver.","When the old man looked at Chu Yunfan, it was as if he was looking at prey.","“Don’t waste your breath on him. I want him dead!” the young master shouted.","“No problem. Watch me capture him and break his limbs. When the time comes, you can do whatever you want with him, Young Master,” the old man said as he looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","“You want to break my limbs? Old man, this guy is a beast. You helped him commit evil, so you’re just like him. You deserve to die,” Chu Yunfan said as he stared back at the old man.","Dear readers!you are reading on our content stealing site.Please copy and search this link \" https://bom.so/sBJMIa \" to support us","“You’re courting death!”","The old man was furious. He roared and unleashed his aura. In the blink of an eye, it swept toward Chu Yunfan as it covered the Sky and Earth.","A terrifying, powerful, and mountain-like aura swept over.","Chu Yunfan could feel Chu Yunfei’s entire body trembling. It was uncontrollable. It was as if a creature at the top of the biological chain was looking down on a creature at the bottom. It was an existence on a completely different level.","Innate-level experts had already begun to transform.","If it was not for the presence of Chu Yunfan beside him, Chu Yunfan would have collapsed in the face of that terrifying aura.","The seventh level of the Innate Stage.","This skinny old man had actually stepped into the seventh level of the Innate Stage, which was a high stage among the Innate Stages. Among Innate Stage experts, he was an absolute expert.","No wonder the old man had absolute confidence that he could defeat Chu Yunfan. With such a peak expert holding down the fort, no matter what kind of strength Chu Yunfan had, it would be impossible for him to overturn the heavens.","“Brat, your performance is indeed stunning. However, before my absolute strength, there’s no possibility of you turning the tables,” the skinny old man said coldly.","Swoosh!","The old man made his move. A long spear had unknowingly appeared in his hand. The spear light pierced through the sky. When an expert of such a level attacked, the entire world would roll violently and the air would boil.","This spear attack lunged straight toward Chu Yunfan. From afar, one could only see the old man’s spear shadows that filled the sky sweep toward Chu Yunfan.","The aura of this spear attack shocked Chu Yunfei till he could no longer move. To him, an Innate expert was like a myth—a legend that he would normally never meet. Although he could see it in the virtual world, how could that compare to the battle aura of an Innate expert?","This was Chu Yunfei’s first time truly realizing how terrifying a battle between Innate experts was. And this cousin of his, who was originally on the same starting line as him, had actually become so powerful.","And this old man was so powerful that it was hard to imagine.","Elder Tie who Chu Yunfan had defeated earlier, was clearly not on the same level as this old man. They were simply not on the same level.","And at this moment, just as this spear was about to pierce through Chu Yunfan, a blood-red lightbeam suddenly burst out from Chu Yunfan’s body and shot straight into the sky.","In an instant, the pillar of light turned into a sternum, protecting Chu Yunfan and Chu Yunfei.","Clank!","The spear pierced into the sternum but was unable to move forward. The sternum was incredibly large and was several feet tall. It completely enveloped the space around the two cousins.","“What is this?” The old man immediately turned pale with fright. He had never encountered such a sudden change before.","This was not the evolution of an Innate expert’s protective energy shield.","Although the energy force of an Innate expert was very strong, it was limited. With the terrifying power of this spear, even the protective energy shield of an Innate expert would be penetrated in an instant. There was simply no other possibility.","However, this sternum was able to completely protect Chu Yunfan within it. This was the most terrifying thing.","A magic treasure!","The old man instantly knew that this was the work of a magic treasure. Although he did not know why Chu Yunfan had such an item, he reacted quickly. He immediately retreated, not daring to get close.","Any magic treasure was immeasurable to a martial artist.","However, the old man’s reaction was a little too slow. In that instant, a blood-red skeletal hand rose out of thin air.","In the blink of an eye, it grabbed at the old man."]},{"number":678,"title":"Chapter 678 - Burning a Seventh-Level Innate to Death","paragraphs":["That blood-red skeletal hand appeared out of thin air, bringing with it a boundless and violent blood-red energy. In an instant, the entire air was filled with blood-red, demonic energy.","This terrifying demonic aura was being released from Chu Yunfan’s body, causing Chu Yunfei to instantly feel a huge pressure. That demonic feeling that was released from Chu Yunfan’s bones made Chu Yunfei very uncomfortable.","The demonic energy placed powerful pressure on Chu Yunfei’s spirit. Even an Innate expert would feel extremely uncomfortable, not to mention he who had yet to reach the Acquired Stage. He had just barely stepped into the Qi Sea Stage.","Chu Yunfei was just an ordinary person. How could he withstand that demonic energy?","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan’s True Energy immediately split out, helping shield Chu Yunfei from this blood-red violent energy.","Then Chu Yunfei saw a blood-red skeletal hand suddenly reach out and aim straight for the old man.","“D*mn it!” the old man roared. His hand suddenly swept out, aiming at the blood-red skeletal hand.","Boom!","The old man’s spear swept out like a cannonball. With a loud boom, the moment the long spear touched the blood-red skeletal hand, the old man instantly felt a terrifying force rebound through his weapon from the blood-red skeletal hand.","Spurt1","The old man instantly coughed up a mouthful of blood. Although he looked rather skinny, his physical strength had far surpassed that of an ordinary Innate expert. However, this attack forced him to retreat and made him cough up blood. It was as if an archaic divine mountain had suddenly crushed down.","‘What terrifying strength. What kind of magic treasure is this?!’","A completely inconceivable thought flashed through the old man’s mind. It was as if he did not dare to believe it. This terrifying strength had clearly surpassed the level that he could imagine.","For such a demonic treasure to appear in the hands of a junior like Chu Yunfan was enough to explain the problem. He definitely had some background. It could even be said that he had a great background.","But under such circumstances, there was room for the old man to think twice about it. The blood-red skeletal hand was already flying back toward him.","Bam!","Before the old man could stabilize his footing, the blood-red skeletal hand swept over his body. With a muffled groan, many of the bones in his body were crushed and he was sent flying backward like a meteor. And before he could react, he saw the skeletal hand grow bigger and bigger and grab ahold of him.","Then, the blood-red skeletal hand started to burn with blood-red flames. The old man was instantly burned to ashes. The toughness of his body, which he was proud of, did not help in the slightest against this extremely strange demonic fire.","All of this took a long time to describe, but it was actually completed in a short period. Chu Yunfei and the young master were both dazzled and dumbfounded.","All of this had transpired before they could react.","“What...” The young master looked at the old man that Chu Yunfan had easily killed using that blood-red skeletal hand. He had a look of incredulity on his face.","Although the old man was not famous in the outside world, he was one of the top ten experts within the Tianluo sect. Such an expert had a high position in the sect.","If the young master’s father had not doted on him so much, he would not have been able to get this old man to help him.","And now, seeing the old man being burned to death, the young master no longer had the confidence to win. He felt a sense of fear and terror rising within him.","Although the young master had barely opened up his Ren and Du meridians and stepped into the Innate Stage, it was more than enough to bully ordinary people. But against a super fierce person like Chu Yunfan, the only thing he felt was an incomparable fear.","“No... No... No! You can’t kill me!” the young master looked at Chu Yunfan, who was slowly walking toward him with the Ju Que in his hand.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had no intention of letting him go, he immediately turned around and fled. If he could get back into his carrriage, there was hope for him to escape.","“Trying to escape?” Chu Yunfan suddenly flung out his arm. Immediately after, the Ju Que flew out and turned into a ray of light as it chased after the young master.","Bam!","The sword landed in front of the young master, and he almost ran into it.","The Ju Que blocked the young master’s path of escape.","“Isn’t it a little too late to leave now?”","Seeing that his way was blocked, the young master immediately turned around. The fear on his face turned into hatred.","“If you dare to kill me, you’ll die for sure. My father is the sect leader of Tianluo. How could an ant like you imagine how powerful Tianluo is?!” the young master said as he gritted his teeth. He tried to use the name of the sect to scare Chu Yunfan.","“Hiding behind your father now? Do you think that we have anything to fear at this point?” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at the young master.","“You b*stard. Do you even have time to be afraid?” Chu Yunfei said angrily. His expression had long been completely distorted. “Sisi is just a plaything in your eyes. Now, I’ll return to you what you did to her a hundred times over!”","Chu Yunfei’s anger could not be suppressed. He had been previously intimidated into submission by the other party. But now, it was clear that Chu Yunfan had the upper hand. The situation was now completely different.","“I’ll cut off his four limbs. You can decide what to do after that,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Chu Yunfan’s large hand suddenly reached out, and the Ju Que that had been deeply embedded in the ground flew out and landed in his hand.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan made his move. His sword swept out horizontally, and sword light shot up into the sky, directly slashing down at the young master.","Bam!","With a heavy sound, the sword ruthlessly slashed down, but it stopped a foot in front of the young master.","Chu Yunfan could not move an inch.","Turns out that the young master had a jade pendant on his body that emitted light and released a barrier, protecting him inside.","“Who dares to touch my son?!”"]},{"number":679,"title":"Chapter 679 - Slicing up a Human, the Young Master of the Tianluo Sect Is Dead!","paragraphs":["Just as the voice finished speaking, a vague image appeared within the shield.","“A primordial spirit?”","Chu Yunfan immediately recognized it. This was clearly a primordial spirit that could only be formed after one had stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage.","Divines were truly different from the rest. They were the legendary gods in ancient Chinese legends. As long as one reached that stage, even if their physical body was destroyed, their spirit would still remain and will be able to reincarnate.","However, according to the information Chu Yunfan received, even though he was already a veteran at the peak Innate Stage, Tianluo’s sect leader had yet to step into the Divine Abilities Stage.","The Divine Abilities Stage was not that easy to step into. Even if there were a hundred Innate experts, there was no guarantee that even one of them would reach the Divine Abilities Stage.","“Is this the doing of that jade pendant?” Chu Yunfan saw that the jade pendant on the young master was emitting a glow that came from magic treasures. Thai enchantment was being released by this jade pendant.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories that this was a magic treasure. But this was different. This magic treasure was a one-time-use magic treasure. It could seal a certain divine ability or enchantment within it using a strand of primordial spirit.","Normally, this primordial spirit would not show itself. But when the situation turned critical, it would automatically appear.","Although this one-time magic treasure was not as valuable as a magic treasure like the Demon Descends Illustration, it was still priceless. Only a top-notch expert at the Divine Abilities Stage could create such a magic treasure.","It was clear how much the sect leader of Tianluo doted on his son. Perhaps it was because he knew his son’s personality. Sooner or later his son would kick a hornet’s nest and provoke a strong person, so the sect leader had prepared this backup plan, just in case.","At this time, the young master came to his senses. Previously, his father had placed this jade pendant on him, telling him not to never take it off, even when he was bathing. It could very well save his life.","Previously, the young master had dismissed this though. Moreover, Chu Yunfan had scared him out of his wits earlier, so he had not thought about the jade pendant.","“You’re finished. Once this barrier is activated, my father will know what you’ve done. You’re dead meat!” the young master said with a malevolent expression on his face.","The young master would never forget the experience of being on the verge of death, and the two people in front of him had caused all this. He had to take revenge.","“I have the protection of the enchantment now. You can’t kill me. If you kneel down and bow to me, and become my slave, I’ll let you go,” the young master said proudly. He was relieved to be saved from the verge of death. It was like a roller coaster ride from Hell to Heaven.","The young master’s arrogant nature suddenly burst out.","“What did you say?!” Chu Yunfei roared. He was like an injured beast.","The young master saw that there was hope for revenge, but it was suddenly shattered.","“Hahahaha, a stinking loser like you wants to kill me?” the young master said arrogantly, “My father will be here soon. All of you are dead meat. None of you will be able to escape!”","“Idiot!”","Chu Yunfan did not wait for the young master to continue being smug. He swung his sword and the stand of primordial spirit was torn into pieces by the sword light.","Then, the sword light descended from the sky and slashed at the barrier.","Boom!","With a loud sound, cracks appeared on the sturdy barrier. This sword strike completely stunned the young master. He never thought that Chu Yunfan would still dare to make a move at this point. On top of that, Chu Yunfan had not hesitated in the slightest.","What made the young master even more panicked was that the barrier that he thought was impregnable was actually sp useless and was slashed apart so easily.","“A magic treasure is pretty great, but it also depends on who’s using it. Trying to scare me with just a wisp of your father’s primordial spirit? You’re too naive.” Chu Yunfan sneered disdainfully.","People like the young master were always borrowing power, always relying on the strength of others. They would never understand that one’s own strength was the root of everything.","If the sect leader of Tianluo was here, Chu Yunfan would have fled immediately. But a mere wisp of primordial spirit wanted to scare Chu Yunfan? How was that possible?","Only then did the young master realize how dire his situation was. He hurriedly tried to flee in the direction of the carriage.","But how could Chu Yunfan let the young master escape?","Chu Yunfan was right behind him. Several sword lights slashed down consecutively.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Finally, after a series of loud sounds, Chu Yunfan shattered the barrier surrounding the young master.","The moment the enchantment shattered, Chu Yunfan’s sword followed closely behind and slashed at the young master.","Slice!","One of the young master’s legs was cut off. Then, he staggered and fell to the ground.","At this moment, the sword in Chu Yunfan’s hand once again unleashed its power. A sword light swept out and collectively chopped off the young master’s remaining leg and two arms.","Chu Yunfan instantly chopped the young master, who had been extremely arrogant before, into a human pillar.","The young master fell to the ground, the carriage was just a few feet away from him. He never thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to break through his barrier. It was completely unbelievable. How could Chu Yunfan be so powerful?","Chu Yunfan was younger than the young master. How could there be such a monster in this world?","“Now that I’ve cut off his limbs, you can do whatever you want with the rest.” Chu Yunfan withdrew his sword. After a few dazzling hand seals, his True Energy blasted into the young master’s body, rendering him unable to move.","Even if Innate masters lost all their limbs, once they found an opportunity, the situation would turn extremely dangerous. This was because their control over their bodies had already reached an unimaginable level.","If it was Chu Yunfan, he would naturally not be afraid. However, Chu Yunfei’s strength was too far behind.","Just as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he saw Chu Yunfei rush over, take out a dagger from his clothes, and sat atop the young master.","“D*mn it, D*mn it. D*mn it!”","One slash after another, the dagger ruthlessly stabbed into the young master.","Chu Yunfei was like a madman as he ruthlessly stabbed the young master countless times until the young master was badly mutilated. Even if the vitality of an Innate expert was tenacious, he still died in the end."]},{"number":680,"title":"Chapter 680 - I Will Exterminate the Whole Clan","paragraphs":["One stab after another, Chu Yunfei stabbed the young master of the Tianluo sect to death. He only stopped when the young master’s body was badly mangled.","Chu Yunfei finally dropped his savage expression, and two lines of tears flowed down his cheeks.","“I’ve finally taken revenge, Sisi. Did you see that? I’ve finally taken revenge,” Chu Yunfei muttered to himself.","After a long while, Chu Yunfei finally got up from the ground. Then, he sincerely bowed to Chu Yunfan.","“Thank you, cousin.”","Chu Yunfei had never thanked Chu Yunfan like this before. After this incident, he seemed to have undergone a metamorphosis. He had transformed from a young man to a much more mature one.","At this moment, Chu Yunfei’s state of mind was now even closer to Chu Yunfan’s. Having been through this experience, he finally understood that his past self had been been a joke. It was just a quarrel between children.","“What are you being polite for? We’re family after all. How could I just stand by and watch you being taken away?” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan believed that after this incident, Chu Yunfei would grow up a lot, although this incident was a heart-wrenching one for him.","Chu Yunfan thought that Chu Yunfei was just fooling around, but now he realized that he was not. Zhang Sisi would rather die than submit, and Chu Yunfei would seek justice even if it meant dying.","The relationship between the two was much deeper than Chu Yunfan had imagined. However, even while the Alchemy Emperor was still alive, life and death were still very terrifying. Even he had not been able to defeat death.","This pain could only be slowly healed over time.","“In the past, I was too naive. I thought that the world was what I imagined it to be. In the past, I was so naive that I thought that you and Yuntian were nothing more than that,” Chu Yunfei said with a self-deprecating smile.","The two cousins of the Chu family—Chu Yunfan and Chu Yuntian—were both admitted to Federation University. Although Chu Yuntian’s performance was not as stunning as Chu Yunfan’s, it was undoubtedly stunning enough in Jinghai city.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfei had been admitted to an ordinary university. Chu Yuntian had always been very strong, so it was fine. However, Chu Yunfan had been similar to him in the past. All along, he was not convinced by Chu Yunfan’s strength.","Not having a clear understanding of how strong Chu Yunfan was now, Chu Yunfei still wanted to compete with Chu Yunfan. But now, he finally understood how naive he was.","“You’re just at the beginning, and your foundation is pretty good. You have a lot of potential to enter the Innate Stage in the future, so don’t fret,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfei smiled bitterly. Chu Yunfan made reaching the Innate Stage so easy, but he knew very well how difficult it was. In fact, he had never thought of entering the Innate Stage before. It would be enough if he could enter the Acquired Stage in this life. He was just one of the common people.","There was a difference between people.","“All right, now that we’ve had our revenge, let’s hurry up and leave. When reinforcements from Tianluo arrive, we’ll be in trouble,” Chu Yunfan said.","Tianluo was still a very powerful figure to Chu Yunfan at the moment. Although he had killed their seventh-level Innate elder as if he was catching a chicken, he had burned through 3,000 low-grade spirit stones.","Those stones were worth hundreds of millions. Even with his vast wealth, Chu Yunfan felt his heart ache. If the battle continued, he might go bankrupt.","Although Chu Yunfan was not afraid of Tianluo, he had to admit that it would be a huge problem.","“Yeah, let’s go.” Chu Yunfei nodded.","Chu Yunfei had just witnessed the terrifying battle between Innate masters. Such a battle was indeed not something he could participate in.","The two cousins quickly rushed toward Xihua City. Fortunately, this place was not too far from the city’s borders. Under Chu Yunfan’s lead, they quickly entered Xihua City.","Not long after they left, a fighter jet flew over and stopped at the place where the battle had taken place. A tall, middle-aged man alighted from the jet with a group of experts with strong auras that could tear a mountain apart.","When the man saw his son, who had been stabbed beyond recognition, and the three Innate elders lying on the ground, his eyes immediately turned red. The death of his son was an especially great blow to him.","The man’s wife had died during childbirth. After that, he poured all his love for his wife into his son. He doted on his son even though his son’s talent was not up to par. He had spent several times the resources of ordinary Innate experts to forcibly help his son open up the Ren and Du meridians.","The man knew that his son’s arrogant and despotic character might provoke powerful enemies, but he was reluctant to say anything. He just spent a large sum to find a magic treasure that could save his son’s life. He had done everything he could.","The man believed that regardless of what faction the expert was from, if they knew his son was from Tianluo, they would give him face and spare his son’s life. Who knew that the other party would be so cruel to kill his son, and even stab his son into meat paste. Even with modern medical technology, it was impossible to save him.","“Who? Who did this?! I will kill him and throw his body out into the wild!” The sect master’s roar shook the entire area. This scared the monsters that had rushed over when they smelled the scent of blood. The pressure of an Innate expert was not something they could contend against.","“Investigate. Investigate for me. Who did my son offend? I will make sure he dies. I will slaughter his entire clan to vent my hatred!” Tianluo’s sect master gnashed his teeth.","The experts behind him all agreed and began to investigate this matter.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan had already entered Xihua City. Only then did he finally heave a sigh of relief. Only now could he be considered safe.","Chu Yunfan turned around and told Chu Yunfei, “You have to keep your head down for some time. Try not to leave your university. This matter has become so big that Tianluo will definitely find out about you. Although the Federation’s laws are very strict in protecting ordinary people, Tianluo will be willing to risk it. If anything goes wrong, it might be too late even if I want to save you.”","“I understand.” Chu Yunfei nodded. He was not stupid, so he naturally understood.","After giving his instructions, Chu Yunfan let Chu Yunfei meet up with his friends. He had more important things to attend to.","The birthday banquet for the Heavenly Dragon Elder at the Heavenly Dragon Villa was about to begin. Chu Yunfan had to seize every moment to improve himself, because, after that would be the life and death battle between him and Jiang Lingxiao.","There was no way out of it. Either Jiang Lingxiao would die, or Chu Yunfan would die.","It was almost time."]},{"number":681,"title":"Chapter 681 - The Man of the Hour, the","paragraphs":["To Chu Yunfan, time flew by. The date of the battle was getting closer and closer. However, he could only win. If he could not kill Jiang Lingxiao, then this battle would be meaningless.","When Chu Yunfan returned to Federation University, the first thing he did was rush to Jeang Yuanbin’s training hall on the outskirts of the Metropolis. At this moment, Jeang Yuanbin was in secluded cultivation, so he was the person with the highest authority in the training hall.","Of course, all of Jeang Yuanbin’s disciples, including Sha Peng, had authority. It was just that they were not as high as Chu Yunfan.","When they saw Chu Yunfan arrive at the training hall, they were somewhat surprised, especially Sha Peng. Chu Yunfan usually did not have much time to train here.","Ding Yin and the others looked at Chu Yunfan with excited faces. During the Fall Symposium, Chu Yunfan fully displayed his might and defeated Wang Qi, Zha Hanhai, Huang Jianjun, and Qi Shaohua—four Innate level experts—in succession.","Qi Shaohua was previously publicly acknowledged as Federation University’s second strongest expert after Jiang Lingxiao, so the moment news of his defeat got out, it instantly caused a huge uproar among the students of Federation University.","Chu Yunfan’s actions had undoubtedly broken the long-standing structure of Federation University. Although he had defeated Wang Qi before, Wang Qi was only the vice president of Federation University’s student council. He had not shaken the structure much then.","But now that Chu Yunfan had defeated Qi Shaohua, everything was completely different. Originally, Qi Shaohua and Jiang Lingxiao stood side by side. In addition, there was a group of Innate-level super genius students who formed a group of powerhouses. This was the situation at the upper echelon of Federation University.","And now that Chu Yunfan had defeated Qi Shaohua, and without much difficulty. He had defeated Qi Shaohua very easily. The drama was now completely different. The entire situation had changed from Jiang Lingxiao and Qi Shaohua standing side by side to Jiang Lingxiao and Chu Yunfan standing side by side.","But not everyone accepted this fact. Even when the peerless genius Jiang Lingxiao, which was said to only appear once every ten years, had truly reached this step and was acknowledged by everyone, he had entered his third year of university. Upon entering his fourth year, he was constantly away from the university. Only then did he become the strongest person in everyone’s hearts.","Chu Yunfan had further broken this record. He had reached the level of being able to stand side by side with Jiang Lingxiao, who was in his fourth year, in his second year.","How shocking was this? Although Chu Yunfan had yet to fight with Jiang Lingxiao, even Jiang Lingxiao’s most diehard fans had to admit that Chu Yunfan was now on the same level as Jiang Lingxiao if one considered the difference in age.","The current Chu Yunfan was even more shocking than Jiang Lingxiao.","And at this moment, everyone suddenly realized that in this short span of a year, Chu Yunfan had achieved many great feats. He had become the champion of the instructor competition, the champion of the Dao Conference, and the champion of the year-end assessment. Apart from being the top scorer in the college entrance examinations, Chu Yunfan had obtained all the honors that could be obtained at this age.","Chu Yunfan had already left his peers far behind. With his current cultivation level, he could definitely be considered one of the more elite combat forces in the entire Federation.","Only then did everyone finally reluctantly accept this sudden reshuffling. It was because this process had been too short. In reality, Chu Yunfan had indeed gone through what needed to be done, so it was only natural for him to ascend to the top.","And only then did everyone truly pay attention to the approaching battle between Chu Yunfan and Jiang Lingxiao.","Back then, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan had lost his mind. At that time, although Chu Yunfan was already the champion of the instructor competition and could be considered a gifted student of the younger generation that received more attention within Federation University, the gap between him and Jiang Lingxiao was all-encompassing. It was as big as the gap between Heaven and Earth.","At that time, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan had gone crazy. He was a freak. Otherwise, why would he have challenged Jiang Lingxiao? Moreover, it was a life-and-death battle that was completely suicidal.","But from the looks of it now, Chu Yunfan had not been boasting, nor was he insane. Instead, he was indeed capable.","In less than a year’s time, Chu Yunfan had already grown to the same level as Jiang Lingxiao.","And the storm that followed was just the beginning. The Imperial Palace had undoubtedly become the first choice for many new students. Everyone could see that, even though Chu Yunfan was still a little weaker than Jiang Lingxiao, Jiang Lingxiao was already in his fourth year, while Chu Yunfan was only in his second year.","In other words, Chu Yunfan could at least rule Federation University for another two years. Yes—ruled. No one would feel that there was anything wrong with using this term now.","And during this period of time, there was no doubt that the Imperial Palace would become the most dazzling organization. Without Jiang Lingxiao to suppress him, Chu Yunfan would probably reach an unimaginable level. The student council, which was originally the most glorious organization around, would probably have to live with its tail between its legs for another two years.","And although the new recruits that the student council was currently recruiting were not bad, they were still far from being comparable to Chu Yunfan.","All sorts of analysis and discussion posts were constantly appearing on Federation University’s forum. They were endless, and even quickly spread to other universities.","Chu Yunfan’s reputation was no longer limited to the new students, but had begun to have a huge impact on all the students.","And Jeang Yuanbin’s new disciples, being fellow disciples of Chu Yunfan, naturally felt honored at this moment.","Chu Yunfan returned in a hurry and did not even spare the time to say a word before hurriedly entering seclusion again.","Even Ding Yin, who had initially been somewhat unconvinced of Chu Yunfan, was now filled with great admiration. He said, “Senior Chu does not relax even for a single moment when it comes to his cultivation. He’s truly a role model for our generation. We must learn from him. In the future, we will not tarnish Senior’s reputation.”","At this moment, Sha Peng saw the notification on his terminal. He saw that Chu Yunfan had started his seclusion after entering the training hall. However, the place he had entered was not an ordinary training room.","Chu Yunfan had entered a special training room within the training hall. It could simulate all kinds of extremely harsh natural environments without having to leave their homes. It was equivalent to walking through all kinds of dangerous places.","This extreme training room was one of the most expensive areas in Jeang Yuanbin’s training hall. Back when Jeang Yuanbin had brought Sha Peng around, he had said that this extreme training room had cost him a total of over 30 billion yuan before it was finally finished. Within the entire Federation University, it was one of the top training rooms.","And they were not allowed to enter. According to Jeang Yuanbin, if they entered, there would only be death, and they did not have the authority to do so.","They had not expected Chu Yunfan to enter this place for secluded training."]},{"number":682,"title":"Chapter 682 - Guillotine Winds Mode—Extreme Training","paragraphs":["Sha Peng’s astonishment attracted the attention of the juniors. They too had access to the cameras in the training hall. Chu Yunfan also did not set himself to private, so they could see him walk into the extreme training room.","Although they did not have the authority to use this particular training room, it was not as if they did not know what kind of place this was.","They were all very surprised. According to Jeang Yuanbin, if they entered the extreme training room, there would only be one end result—death.","And Chu Yunfan could actually enter this room to cultivate.","At this moment, in this extreme training room, Chu Yunfan walked to the center of this spacious training room that was hundreds of square meters wide. He only found out about the existence of such a training room after reading the message Jeang Yuanbin left him.","This room had taken tens of billions to build. Such a luxurious training room made Chu Yunfan speechless. There was a reason why among the four major elements of cultivation, wealth came first.","If it had been Chu Yunfan, it would not have been impossible for him to build such a room, but it would take him some time. He had only risen to fame recently, and most of his funds were spent on himself, so he did not leave much money.","After taking a deep breath, Chu Yunfan started his chosen mode in the training room through his terminal. Instantly, gusts of strong wind blew from all directions in the originally calm extreme training room.","The wind got stronger and stronger and the sky turned dark. Sand and stones flew in every direction.","“The captain chose the Guillotine Winds mode?” Sha Peng, who was watching through the surveillance cameras, was flabbergasted.","This extreme training room could simulate all kinds of extremely harsh natural environments. And naturally, there was a strong wind mode as well. However, this strong wind mode was not the usual kind of strong wind.","With his strength, Chu Yunfan was unafraid of any ordinary tornado or hurricane. His legs gripped the ground like the roots of an old tree. He could not be shaken. If one was able to traverse through a hurricane without being afraid, one would basically be Superman.","However, extremely harsh environments were different. The wind from this type of head-chopping wind was like a steel knife. If one was not careful, one’s head would be blown off. Even an Acquired level expert would be easily blown into pieces and would disintegrate in an instant.","Shortly, the strong wind had already covered everything. There was even a faint feeling that space had been distorted. Chu Yunfan’s figure was instantly submerged in the raging winds.","Chu Yunfan felt countless gusts of wind being thrown at his body as if there were countless forces tearing him apart.","The Guillotine Winds!","The terrifying winds swept over Chu Yunfan, almost breaking his neck. This power was indeed terrifying, It could tear almost everything apart. He could almost feel his muscles being torn open one after another, and fresh blood spurted out.","With his physical body cultivation which had reached the first layer of the Imperial Physique—the Skin Stage—Chu Yunfan was still instantly torn apart. One could imagine how terrifying it was. If it was an Acquired, they would probably be torn into pieces in an instant.","This was the reason why Jeang Yuanbin did not allow Sha Peng and the others to utilize this room. He knew that they would not be able to withstand it. If they were not careful, it could lead to a tragedy.","This extreme training room was usually the place where Jeang Yuanbin went into seclusion to cultivate. He used it to cultivate the strength of his body.","Chu Yunfan’s goal was to make use of this extreme training room to allow his Imperial Physique to break through from the first stage to the second stage—the Flesh Stage. After his Imperial Physique improved again, his strength would improve by leaps and bounds as well.","This was the best method Chu Yunfasn could think of to improve his cultivation in a short period. After all, he had just broken through to the Innate Stage. It would be too difficult for him to break through to the second level so soon. When his Imperial Physique reached the Innate Stage, he could then start the second stage of cultivation.","Crack!","Crack!","Crack!","Chu Yunfan’s flesh and skin started to split open, but he was not bleeding. His control over his body had reached its peak, and the moment cracks appeared, he controlled the nearby muscles to control the blood flow to that area. Even so, his body was covered in all kinds of cracks and wounds. He looked extremely terrifying.","Sha Peng and the others were watching all this through the surveillance cameras. Although their vision was blocked by the fierce winds, they could vaguely see Chu Yunfan who was enduring the fierce winds.","They could feel the terror of these winds. They gulped audibly. If it were them, they would probably be instantly torn into pieces.","“Will Senior Chu be all right?” one of the junior sisters asked worriedly.","It was only now that they truly understood why the training room was called the extreme training room. It was indeed extreme and was not something that ordinary people could bear.","“There shouldn’t be a problem. The captain doesn’t do things rashly. He’ll be fine,” Sha Peng said as he shook his head. Although he said this, there was still looked a bit worried. The level of this extreme training was not something that he could fathom.","After an entire hour, the violent winds finally died down. Only then did Sha Peng and the others finally see Chu Yunfan again. At this moment, Chu Yunfan looked an absolute fright. His entire body was densely covered with all sorts of wounds, and almost every inch of his skin had been torn apart. It was simply terrifying.","However, there was a single drop of blood in sight. Chu Yunfan’s control over his body had reached an unimaginable level. That said, there was not a single piece of good flesh left on his body.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan walked toward the advanced treatment pod at the side. When the door of the pod opened, Chu Yunfan entered and quickly submerged himself into the green nutrient fluid within.","This was the Federation’s top-tier treatment option. Each round of treatment would cost at least a million dollars, but it was worth it. Many diseases and injuries that could not be treated at the large hospitals could be treated with this treatment pod.","This was treatment pod was the culmination of human medical knowledge. This equipment alone costs more than a billion dollars.","‘Oh goodness. Thank god you’re okay,’ Sha Peng and the others were stunned and finally let out a sigh of relief."]},{"number":683,"title":"Chapter 683 - Coming Out After One Month","paragraphs":["At this moment, Chu Yunfan was receiving treatment in the treatment pod. His entire body was being sprayed with medicinal liquids to help heal his injuries. That plus the strength of his Imperial Physique, the injuries that seemed terrifying, was not particularly so.","It was not considered a fatal threat.","As he was receiving treatment, Chu Yunfan could feel that the level of his Imperial Physique had deepened. However, it was still too little for him. He had to increase the difficulty of his training. Time was of the essence.","This was the core of all the problems he was facing at the moment. If he was given a few more years, he could have avoided using this extreme training method to improve his Imperial Physique. But doing so would take at least one to two years for him to master the second level of the Imperial Physique.","And Chu Yunfan lacked that kind of time.","After about half an hour, all of Chu Yunfan’s injuries had been healed and he had recovered to his peak. This treatment pod was indeed the crystallization of human medical technology. It was convenient and fast.","However, the price of it was enough to make one’s teeth ache. Chu Yunfan could use it, but he had to pay for it out of his own pocket. After all, the instructor could not provide all kinds of resources to the students indefinitely. Otherwise, the instructors would go bankrupt.","After the treatment was done, Chu Yunfan once again threw himself into the extreme tempering. What was even more unexpected to Sha Peng and the others was that Chu Yunfan actually increased the difficulty level. The Guillotine Winds had clearly risen to another level.","And Chu Yunfan, who was in the midst of it, could no longer stand and allow the fierce wind to blow at him as he originally did. Instead, he swayed and fought back against the fierce wind. From afar, his movements were agile. It was as if he was fighting a ferocious beast.","The camera zoomed in and Chu Yunfan’s fellow disciples realized that it was not a ferocious beast at all. It was because the Guillotine Winds had been upgraded. Amidst the strong wind that blew at him, there was a strong wind that had turned into wind blades. Those wind blades were extremely terrifying. It swept through the air at an extremely fast speed. Even metal would be sliced apart.","This was the true origin of the Guillotine Winds mode. If one was not careful, these wind blades would cut off their head.","Chu Yunfan kept jumping up and down to fight against these wind blades.","However, these wind blades were too terrifying. Chu Yunfan’s punch could send a tank flying. However, upon touching these wind blades, even though they were scattered by his punch, a huge wound would be torn open on his palm. The wounds were so deep that his bones could be seen.","This was the true tempering of the limits of life and death. If one was not careful, one would surely die here.","The juniors were dumbstruck. They could not believe what they were seeing. What kind of extreme tempering method was this? They had never heard or seen it before.","They had previously felt the pain of Sha Peng’s training methods, but compared to Chu Yunfan’s extreme training method, Sha Peng’s methods were nothing. They were clearly not on the same level.","The sky was filled with wind blades. If they were in Chu Yunfan’s place, even if they were not torn apart, they would not be able to dodge all the wind blades that filled the sky. They would probably be dismembered by the countless wind blades within minutes.","To readers! our content is stolen.Please copy and search this link \" https://tinyurl.com/39hpcn6j \" to support us","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was able to dodge the wind blades and managed to avoid being dismembered by them. Not only was Chu Yunfan’s physical strength astonishing, his movement techniques were top-notch as well. That was why he was able to dodge the dense wind blades.","But because there were too many wind blades, no matter how fast Chu Yunfan was, it was impossible for him to destroy all of them. Moreover, with how terrifying they were, it was impossible for him to destroy all of them. Doing so would result in his entire arm being cut off. He could only dodge most of them. Only when he could not dodge would he fight head-on.","Even so, to Chu Yunfan’s teammates, this was already astounding. It was simply not a level that they could imagine.","Chu Yunfan had made such a big splash. He was indeed deserving on his reputation. It was better to meet him than to hear his name. Only after seeing how he trained who others realized how inexperienced they truly were.","“All right, since Captain Chu is busy, let’s continue with our own training.” Sha Peng pulled everyone’s attention back. They did not know how long Chu Yunfan would be in seclusion, so they could not just sit around and continue to watch him. “Captain Chu was last year’s Dao Conference champion. This year, I hope none of you will embarrass the captain and Mr. Jeang. Especially you, Ding Yin. I don’t expect you to become the champion, but you must at least place within the top 100. Only then will you live up to Mr. Jeang’s hopes.”","“Understood!” Ding Yin said forcefully. Although he was a proud person by nature, he knew his capabilities. Within Federation University, there were many existences that he could not contend against, let alone other universities. The experts from other sects were also as numerous as the clouds.","And it was precisely because of it that Ding Yin regarded Chu Yunfan as his idol.","Chu Yunfan was able to turn the tables and become the Dao Conference champion depsite the circumstances that no one would have been optimistic about. He had helped Federation University turn the tables, this was something that no ordinary person could do.","After Sha Peng and the others resumed their training, the entire training hall once again descended into a state of calm.","In the blink of an eye, a month had passed. Within Jeang Yuanbin’s training hall, everything had been calm and tranquil. However, for Federation University, the shock brought on by Chu Yunfan’s defeat of Qi Shaohua was still brewing.","The matter this time was truly too shocking. As the organizer of the Fall Symposium of Federation University, Qi Shaohua was supposed to be the most dazzling existence at the symposium. However, Chu Yunfan had completely eclipsed him. He was easily defeated by Chu Yunfan and become the stepping stone that allowed Chu Yunfan’s reputation to soar.","Over the past month, winds and clouds surged. Even though Chu Yunfan was in seclusion, the Imperial Palace had become the target of countless people’s attention. There were even rumors saying that after being defeated by Chu Yunfan, Qi Shaohua’s temper had become much worse. There were a few times when he lost his temper for no reason, causing the people around him to suffer.","Regardless of whether the rumors were true or false, Qi Shaohua was definitely not in a good mood after his defeat. He was ambitious and wanted to challenge Jiang Lingxiao to become the number one in the entire university. However, he had been defeated by a junior who did not care about him at all.","Not only did Qi Shaohua not become number one, he even slipped down and became number three.","For some within the elite circles, a month had passed. The birthday celebration of the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s Heavenly Dragon Elder was finally coming.","And it was also at this time that Chu Yunfan came out of seclusion."]},{"number":684,"title":"Chapter 684 - Great Improvement in Strength","paragraphs":["After a month of hell-like bitter training, Chu Yunfan finally came out of seclusion.","During this one month, even Chu Yunfan himself was somewhat incredulous that he had been able to persevere.","The cultivation process of the Imperial Physique was truly hell-like torture. Since ancient times up until now, very few had succeeded in cultivating it. Even if one’s willpower was strong, it was useless.","Chu Yunfan had almost fainted several times during the process. But every time he was about to keel over, the godhead in his mind would emit wisps of cool air that allowed him to maintain his clarity so that he did not faint where he stood.","In the extreme training room, if Chu Yunfan fainted, the only result would be death.","This was also the reason why ordinary people were not allowed to enter the extreme training room. Even ordinary Innate experts would find it hard to obtain such a training resource unless they were a top expert like Jeang Yuanbin. In the entire Federation, he could be said to be extremely resourceful and had many connections.","This was because the extreme training room was made up of high-tech equipment, not a relic of the Ancient ZenithCivilization. It was not something that could be found just by searching out in the wilds.","Fortunately, after a month of cultivation, Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique had finally reached the Flesh Stage.","Chu Yunfan could feel the explosive power in his body. The rise in the strength of his physical body was obvious. Every one of his cells contained a strong power within them.","Chu Yunfan felt that he could shatter a mountain with a single punch.","And after this one month of training, Chu Yunfan owed Jeang Yuanbin a huge sum of one billion yuan. During this one month, he had been in extreme danger countless times. Even with his Imperial Physique, he had actually been cut many times by the increasingly powerful Guillotine Winds. Even his head had almost been chopped off once.","It was the most dangerous experience Chu Yunfan had ever had. It was a narrow escape from death. Fortunately, modern medical technology was advanced enough. In addition to the strength of the Imperial Physique, he had managed to escape death.","After training over and over again, every time Chu Yunfan recovered from a serious injury, it was as if he had been reborn. Originally, he needed time to grind his Imperial Physique. Now, in just a short month, he had completed the transformation.","Of course, the price Chu Yunfan had to pay was also extremely high. In one month, he had used up one billion yuan of various medical resources.","There were all kinds of resources prepared in Jeang Yuanbin’s training hall. There was even an unlimited supply of medicinal pills for cultivation. There was also a medical warehouse that could be used at will.","Of course, Chu Yunfan had to pay for all of this. In just a month, he had used up one billion yuan. It could be imagined just how many times Chu Yunfan was on the verge of death.","And now, all of this had paid off. Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique had broken through to the Flesh Stage and was steadily reaching the peak of first level of the Innate Stage.","Most importantly, with the Imperial Physique now at the Flesh Stage, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had broken through to the fourth level of the Innate Stage. It could even be said that ordinary fourth-level Innate experts were no match for him. Compared to a month ago, he was at least several times stronger.","“Heavenly Dragon Villa. Heavenly Dragon Elder.”","Chu Yunfan held the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s Heaven’s Pride Invite in his hand. The reason why so many people were fighting for these invitations was that the Heavenly Dragon Elder would help those who held the invitation and guide them to break through.","“There’s still time. I can still break through. Hmph. Jiang Lingxiao, I want to see if you’re as strong as they say.” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled into a sneer.","Not far away, Sha Peng and the others looked at Chu Yunfan with respect.","In the past, they were in awe of Chu Yunfan because of how strong he was. But now, they felt differently, They had seen what Chu Yunfan’s self-torturing training methods looked like. It was a method that they absolutely could not withstand, but Chu Yunfan had persevered.","Chu Yunfan was now well known, and there was indeed a reason why he was reputed to be someone who could compete with Jiang Lingxiao. His reputation was not undeserved. Only a person who was so ruthless to himself could truly become a major figure in the entire Federation.","After he came out of seclusion, the first thing Chu Yunfan did was not to immediately head to the Heavenly Dragon Villa. Instead, he entered the training room in the training hall.","Chu Yunfan had received an invitation card from the Heavenly Dragon Villa to celebrate the birthday of the Heavenly Dragon Elder. Since it was a birthday celebration, there should be a birthday present. Would it not be very rude of him to go empty-handed?","Chu Yunfan was certain that the birthday present he planned on giving would satisfy the Heavenly Dragon Elder.","Chu Yunfan bade farewell to his fellow disciples and took the shuttle directly to the Heavenly Dragon Villa.","The shuttle pierced through the clouds and encountered quite a few flying monsters along the way, but it managed to land safe and sound at the airport of the Heavenly Dragon Villa.","Although the Heavenly Dragon Villa was only the size of a normal villa when it was first built, after nearly a hundred years of expansion, it had long become a city that boosted millions.","And at the core of this city, of course, was the first Heavenly Dragon Villa that as built. It was the spiritual center of the entire city and where the Heavenly Dragon Elder resided.","The main Heavenly Dragon Villa sat atop the Heavenly Dragon Mountain in the middle of the city. The mountain was very tall, but it had a majestic aura. At this moment, the entire Heavenly Dragon Mountain was filled with a festive atmosphere.","But the foot of the mountain was a somewhat somber atmosphere. On this day, on the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s birthday, many martial artists had come from all over the world. On the several paths leading up the mountain at its base, they stared at the various guests coming and going.","The Heavenly Dragon Elder’s birthday was benign celebrated. The people who came to pay their respects were those from the various upper classes of the Federation. There were even some bigshots among them.","However, all the influential people who lived in the cities near the Heavenly Dragon Villa also came to pay their respects. It was just that they would not be able to meet the Heavenly Dragon Elder, so they could only stay at the side courtyard.","However, the people who were able to live near the Heavenly Dragon Villa and still be influential were mostly people who had connections with the Heavenly Dragon Villa.","When they saw these powerful martial artists staring at them back and forth, they were immediately puzzled.","“Who are these people?” someone asked in puzzlement, “These foreigners are sp arrogant. Take a good look at this place, will you? How dare they be so impudent.”","“It’s probably your first time coming to pay respects. This is an old tradition. Don’t mind how fierce these people look. In fact, they are all here to try to get an invitation card to attend the celebration.” Someone stepped forward to explain.","“What kind of invitation card would get them in?”","“The Heaven’s Pride Invite.”"]},{"number":685,"title":"Chapter 685 - An Innate Blocking the Way? Defeated in One Strike!","paragraphs":["“The Heaven’s Pride Invite? What’s that?”","Many people did not know much about this invitation card, because the Heaven’s Pride Invite was something that was only passed down to certain circles.","“Those are the invites for the current generation of geniuses, but there are no specific requirements for who it is. Whoever has a card will be able to get in.”","“What if the holder loses it?”","“If they can’t hold on to their invitation, then they aren’t worthy.”","Many people finally understood why these fierce-looking foreign martial artists dared to be so impudent here during the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s birthday. Turns out that the Heavenly Dragon Villa had secretly allowed such a thing to happen.","This was obviously done to maintain the value of the Heaven’s Pride Invites. Although the Heavenly Dragon Villa could gather a lot of information, something would always fall through the cracks. With this method, the value of the people selected would naturally be guaranteed.","“No wonder they’re so desperate. As long as they obtain this invitation card, they can receive guidance from the Heavenly Dragon Elder. The elder is a powerhouse in the Divine Abilities Stage. Those who receive his guidance can break through by at least one realm. This can save one a lot of time.”","Many passers-by were envious. They were able to attend the birthday celebration because they had some connections with the Heavenly Dragon Villa. However, they were only passers-by. It was impossible for them to actually meet the elder not to mention receive his guidance.","While everyone was discussing this matter, a black-clothed young man carrying a large sword on his back strode onto the scene.","“I’m finally here.” Chu Yunfan gazed at the Heavenly Dragon Mountain Range, which was not very tall, but it was extremely majestic.","The interior of the entire mountain range had long been hollowed out. There was a huge space within that had been transformed into a huge base. This was the core of the Heavenly Dragon Villa.","The city that spanned across the mountain range was extremely vast. Chu Yunfan could see the faint outlines of an array formation around the entire mountain range.","This formation encompassed the entire Heavenly Dragon Mountain Range. Such a large amount of spending was indeed astonishing. It made Chu Yunfan involuntarily recall the origins of the Heavenly Dragon Villa. Like many top organizations, more than a hundred years ago, the Heavenly Dragon Villa was just an ordinary organization. Later on, they accidentally stumbled upon the Heavenly Dragon Mountain where they obtained the inheritance of an ancient sect.","From then on, the Heavenly Dragon Villa had been unstoppable. It did not take long for them to establish themselves, and their strength began to grow.","During this process, they encountered many situations where the organization was almost destroyed. However, these attempts were later blocked by the array formation the Heavenly Dragon Villa had set up. This formation had afforded the Heavenly Dragon Villa and the Heavenly Dragon Elder precious time.","There were many guesses about this array formation, and there were many versions of the rumors. However, it was recorded in Federation University’s encyclopedia that this formation was from the Heavenly Dragon Mountain itself. It was left behind by the ancient civilization that once occupied the mountain.","Of course, this level of confidential information was not something that ordinary students could see for free. They had to exchange Federation University’s points for this information.","Chu Yunfan had found out all this about the Heavenly Dragon Villa when he was investigating. This was the benefit of having a top-tier colossus backing him up.","If Chu Yunfan did not have any connections, it would be impossible for him to know the origins of the Heavenly Dragon Villa.","However, before Chu Yunfan could make his way up the mountain, a group of tall martial artists stopped him.","“Are you Chu Yunfan?” the leading martial artist asked as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan knew that this person was someone of note. Since he had rushed to the foot of the Heavenly Dragon Villa and dared to act impudently without fear of being attacked by the Heavenly Dragon Villa, there was only one possibility. He must be coveting the Heaven’s Pride Invitation.","These people were really good at scheming. They knew that no matter where Chu Yunfan hid, he would definitely come to the banquet. As long as they intercepted Chu Yunfan at the last moment, they would be able to get the invite all the same.","“I am,” Chu Yunfan said. “And where do you come from? Tell me your names.”","“You don’t have to know our names. Hehe, someone in the black market offered a beautiful price for that Heaven’s Pride Invite of yours. If you hand it over, we won’t make things difficult for you. Otherwise, you won’t leave here unscathed today.”","The leader grinned hideously. His body emitted a fierce aura. It was evident that he was not easy to deal with. He was clearly a murderer who had the blood of many on his hands.","“Looks like this invitation is really valuable.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “A person who hides his head and shows his tail. Don’t they even have the courage to fight me face to face?”","“Shut up, Chu Yunfan. Hurry up and hand over the invitation. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being rude. If you lose an arm or a leg, don’t say I didn’t warn you!” the leader boomed.","“In that case, I shall help the Heavenly Dragon Elder to clean up some pests. You black market pests should stick to the shadows. You actually dare to appear out in broad daylight? You must be tired of living.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","There were indeed many experts in the black market who would do anything to obtain a high reward. However, these outlaws were wanted by the Federation, which was why they had dared to venture out into a neutral region like Heavenly Dragon Villa. If they dared to appear this brazenly in a Federation city, they would be courting death. Local enforcements would certainly come to encircle and suppress them shortly.","The black market experts were instantly enraged when they heard this. They could see Chu Yunfan’s contemptuous attitude toward them.","“Get him!” The leader roared. He instantly released the aura of an Innate expert. A bloody aura that had been nurtured through the slaughter of countless people was released. One could even smell the faint scent of blood.","Stab!","However, before the leader could barely finish his words, a sword light swept past and entered his throat.","A blood flower bloomed. The leader’s eyes were still wide open. He never thought that Chu Yunfan would make a move just because of a disagreement. On top of that, he was an Innate expert. With his strength, he could be considered one of the stronger people in the Federation.","Yet, the leader was unable to block Chu Yunfan’s attack.","How was this possible?!","The death of their leader did not frighten the other black market experts. On the contrary, it provoked their anger, and they all pounced on Chu Yunfan.","However, how could these Acquired Stage experts defeat Chu Yunfan? Before the passersby could react, they saw a dazzling wave of sword moves, and the heads of the black market experts were separated from their bodies."]},{"number":686,"title":"Chapter 686 - If I Don’t Make You Kneel in One","paragraphs":["In just a short while, there were already corpses lying everywhere.","The passers-by were completely stunned. They could not believe that Chu Yunfan actually dared to kill people. Moreover, he killed so many people in one go.","Was Chu Yunfan really not afraid of the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s anger?","Even these lawless black market experts did not dare to kill people here.","To Chu Yunfan, this was not a big deal. Even if he killed someone, it depended on the situation. After all, he had the support of the Chu family and Federation University. Furthermore, he was well-known in the university. Among the hundreds of thousands of students at the university, he was one of the few students who were highly regarded.","Chu Yunfan came from a prestigious family, while those thugs were just bugs. Would the Heavenly Dragon Villa fall out with Federation University just because of some people from the black market?","That was clearly impossible. Among the many powers within the Federation, the Heavenly Dragon Villa had always been relatively neutral. They certainly would not want to get involved in this mess.","The reason why the Heavenly Dragon Elder would use his birthday every ten years to set up this Heaven’s Pride Invite was to personally guide the younger generation to becoming top expert who could cultivate divine abilities.","It was probably not just for the birthday celebration. Those who were able to obtain his invitations were the most outstanding people of the past few years, and their future prospects were limitless.","If the Heavenly Dragon Elder befriended these people now, they would naturally not make things difficult for the Heavenly Dragon Villa in the future. This was the reason why the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s foundation had become more and more stable over the years, and the reason why they were able to make friends all over the world.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan was not worried.","If it was in a city of the Federation, he might have been hesitant. But in a neutral place like the Heavenly Dragon Villa, he could not care less.","Under everyone’s stunned gazes, Chu Yunfan swept his gaze across his surroundings before saying, “Whoever wants this invitation of mine, I dare you to come take it. There’s no need to hide your head and show your tail.”","After saying that, Chu Yunfan strode off toward the Heavenly Dragon Mountain.","At this moment, in the distance, a few disciples of the Heavenly Dragon Villa looked at each other. Their eyes were filled with disbelief.","“He’s so ruthless,” a Heavenly Dragon Villa disciple said as he looked at Chu Yunfan’s back.","They had been posted here to monitor the experts from the black market to prevent them from acting recklessly. The Heavenly Dragon Villa had tacitly allowed these experts to attack those who were holding on to the Heaven’s Pride Invites. However, these people were wild and unruly. If something were to really happen, it would be a real slap in the face.","However, these disciples had not expected to see such a scene.","Previously, these black market experts had also intercepted others. But at most, they were just knocked down. None of them had killed so many people as easily as Chu Yunfan just had.","“What should we do? Should we report this?”","“Such a big matter must be reported. First, find a robot to dispose of these corpses. Throw them far away and feed them to the monsters,” the leader of these disciples said.","He was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s ruthlessness, but he did not have any good feelings toward those people from the black market.","In fact, most people did not have any good feelings toward these black market thugs who had slaughtered countless innocent creatures.","Chu Yunfan walked up the stairs and finally, when he was halfway up, he met the real person who had been hiding in the shadows. The person who was really interested in Chu Yunfan’s invitation card was someone else. Those people from the black market were just pawns.","“Junior Chu, why are you in such a hurry to leave? What are you planning to do?” a slightly frivolous voice sounded.","On the mountain path, a young man in embroidered robes strode down and blocked Chu Yunfan’s path.","“Who are you?” Chu Yunfan asked as he looked at the youth.","“My name is Yao Xuecheng!” the luxuriously dressed youth said.","“Never heard of you,” Chu Yunfan said as he rolled his eyes. He had never heard of this guy before. And he had called Chu Yunfan his junior. Was there such a blind character among the juniors and seniors?","One had to know that even Qi Shaohua had been defeated by Chu Yunfan would not be so blind as to dare to find trouble with Chu Yunfan.","The young man’s face stiffened. He was not a current student of Federation University. He had already graduated a few years ago. However, he had been a relatively famous person when he was still in university. How could he be completely forgotten by others after only a few years? It was simply humiliating.","“I was a student of Federation University a few years ago. That make me your senior,” Yao Xuecheng said.","“No need to try to make nice with me. If you want my invitation, just say so,” Chu Yunfan said as his lips curled upwards.","“Good. You’re very straightforward. If you hand over the invitation to me, I will definitely remember this favor of yours,” Yao Xuecheng said.","“Favor? Who do you think you are? Is your favor that valuable? Were you the one who hired those people from the black market?” Chu Yunfan said rudely.","Chu Yunfan did not have a good impression of these people. Everyone knew how important the invitation was. Because of this, he felt it very strange. Who did Yao Xuecheng think he was? Why did he think that his favor could be exchanged for this Heaven’s Pride Invite.","After being choked by Chu Yunfan’s words, Yao Xuecheng’s expression turned extremely ugly. He had not expected Chu Yunfan to disrespect him to such an extent. Chu Yunfan had practically grabbed him by the collar and ruthlessly slapped his face.","Why?","Yao Xuecheng had graduated just a few years ago, yet he was disrepected by his junior to this extent. This was simply outrageous.","“Very well. Chu Yunfan, I’ve long heard that you’re very arrogant, but I never thought that you would be this arrogant. Since that’s the case, then I shall show you my might. I’ll have you know what it means to respect your elders!”","Yao Xuecheng was completely enraged by Chu Yunfan’s words. His body emitted a terrifying aura. He had already stepped into the Innate Stage when he was in his fourth year of university a few years ago. Now that a few years had passed, his cultivation had naturally advanced further. He was no longer a weakling in the Innate Stage.","Yao Xuecheng looked at Chu Yunfan confidently. He was at least five or six years older than Chu Yunfan. This was simply unsolvable for martial artists of their age. No matter how much of a genius Chu Yunfan was, it should be impossible for him to overcome such a huge gap.","However, Yao Xuecheng never imagined that he would not be meeting a genius, but an abnormal monster.","“Cut the crap. How dare trash like you jump out in front of me? If I don’t make you kneel in one move, I’ll give up the invitation.”"]},{"number":687,"title":"Chapter 687 - Chu Yunfan Who Was Worthy of","paragraphs":["There were many who coveted the invitation in Chu Yunfan’s hands, and Yao Xuecheng was just one of them.","Chu Yunfan was too lazy to say anything about these people.","It did not make any sense at all.","“Make me kneel in one move?”","Yao Xuecheng’s face turned ashen. Although he could not compare to Jiang Lingxiao back then, he was still one of the top geniuses in the university back then. After graduating, his journey had been smooth sailing. With his background and talent, who would dare not give him face, let alone such contempt and disdain.","“You don’t know your palce.” Yao Xuecheng snorted coldly, his eyes flashing with a fierce light. “I thought that if you knew the severity of the situation, I would give you some leeway. Now, it seems like I don’t have to.”","“Hahaha, don’t know my place? I think the one who doesn’t know your place,” Chu Yunfan retorted.","Just as Chu Yunfan finished his sentence, Yao Xuecheng made his move.","“Space Breaker!” Yao Xuecheng shouted.","With a boom, every pore on his body released Innate-level True Energy. A terrifying Innate aura swept out. The air in the entire mountain instantly seemed to freeze over.","Yao Xuecheng wanted to snatch Chu Yunfan’s Heaven’s Pride Invite. His age was almost over the line. If he missed this opportunity, there would be nothing left for him in the future.","Yao Xuecheng’s punch caused the air to shake violently. The air dispersed at a speed visible to the naked eye. This was a level that most Innate experts could achieve, but in his hand, it emitted an unimaginable and astonishing power.","Yao Xuecheng could see Chu Yunfan being beaten into a sorry state. After all, a junior was only a junior.","All of a sudden, Chu Yunfan only let out a cold snort. Then, he reached out with one hand, and like an eagle’s claw, he ruthlessly clawed at Yao Xuecheng.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan instantly turned the air wave that was threatening to sweep over him into nothingness. The terrifying air wave had instantly disappeared without a trace.","“What?!”","Yao Xuecheng’s eyes widened. Then, his punch collided head-on with Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Bang!","After a huge collision sound, Yao Xuecheng screamed in pain. His entire arm was dripping with blood. At the instant of the collision, that terrifying enormous force rebounded back through his arm. The muscles on his arm burst open and blood spurted out.","“Impossible!”","Yao Xuecheng took a few steps back before he managed to steady himself. However, his eyes were wide open in disbelief.","That punch just now could have smashed a huge mountain. It almost broke his entire arm. It was as if his fist had smashed into the body of a ferocious beast.","And Chu Yunfan who was standing in front of him did not move at all.","Chu Yunfan sneered. If it was before he had cultivated the Imperial Physique to the second level—the Flesh Stage—then Yao Xuecheng had already stepped into the third level of the Innate Stage would have posed some threat to him.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s Imperial Physique had already reached a certain level of strength. Not to mention human martial artists, even top-tier monsters of the same level were nothing to him.","And just as Yao Xuecheng was still in complete disbelief, Chu Yunfan took a step forward. In the blink of an eye, he ad already executed his attack. His leg suddenly swept out.","“Mantis Divine Kick!”","With this kick, Chu Yunfan seemed to have turned into an incomparably powerful mantis, slicing the world apart. With just one kick, Yao Xuecheng was instantly sent flying backwards.","Spurt!","Yao Xuecheng coughed up a mouthful of blood, and he flyflew backwards like a kite with a broken string. Countless ribs in his chest had been brokenchest, and he was screaming nonstop.","It was just one move, and it was a simple one. Yao Xuecheng had lost.","Yao Xuecheng finally realized that Chu Yunfan was not someone he could deal with, but it was already too late.","After kicking Yao Xuecheng away, Chu Yunfan continued his trek up the mountain. Only then did the Heavenly Dragon Villa disciples trailing behind Chu Yunfan finally dare go forward and bring Yao Xuecheng for treatment.","Meanwhile, the bystanders looked at each other in dismay. Everything had happened too quickly. Though they had barely blinked, many felt that Chu Yunfan had defeated the Innate Stage Yao Xuecheng far too quickly.","“Who is he? How in the world is he so terrifying?”","“Chu Yunfan? Isn’t he the youngest person ever to receive an invitation from the Heavenly Dragon Elder?”","“Indeed, it is him. It’s better to meet him than to hear about him. He’s only a few years old. Did he start cultivating the moment he was born?”","This was the first time these people had heard of Chu Yunfan. After all, the Federation was simply too big. Who knew how many billions of people there were. Only a few people, such as the president of the Federation, were able to become famous throughout the entire Federation.","Most would not even be able to name the vice president of the Federation, much less a student of Federation University like Chu Yunfan. Though many had heard of Chu Yunfan, they had never actually seen him in person before, not to mention seeing him make a move.","At this moment, in a VIP room of the Heavenly Dragon Villa, a man around his mid-twenties threw a bone china teacup onto the ground.","“Trash!”","This man cursed non-stop.","“You can’t even handle such a small matter. You can’t even stop Chu Yunfan!”","From beside the young man, a robust old man stepped forward and said, “Young Master, what should we do next?”","“Send more people. I want that invitation!” the young man took out five invitation cards from his pocket. They were the Heaven’s Pride Invites. Then, he suddenly threw them on the ground.","“No matter what, I must get that invitation card from Chu Yunfan. Aren’t those old guys in the clan worried about him? I want them to see that I, Jiang Beixuan, am the most outstanding person in the Jiang clan and the most qualified person to take over the position of clan leader. Who does Jiang Lingxiao think he is?!","“Is everything ready? He must not walk away from here alive!” Jiang Beixuan said with a sneer.","“Young Master, don’t worry. Chu Yunfan will not be able to escape even if he has wings,” the old man said as he nodded.","“Good. Hmph, Chu Yunfan, don’t blame me. If you want to blame someone, blame yourself for offending the Jiangs. I will teach you a lesson so that I can prove to those old fellows who’s the most outstanding successor!”"]},{"number":688,"title":"Chapter 688 - The Three Outlaws of the Faraway Domain","paragraphs":["An enormous square was situated at the end of the mountain road that snaked up Heavenly Dragon Mountain. In the square, there were people coming and going. It was very lively, but there were three people firmly blocking the path.","They were two men and a woman. All of them were in their twenties, but they looked different from one another. One of the young men was tall and slender. He wore clothes that were as black as ink and looked extremely gloomy and cold.","The other man was dressed in a bright yellow monk robe. He looked like a monk, but his expression was a little repulsive.","And the woman was dressed as a Daoist nun. And just like the two people from before, she had a cruel expression on her face.","Standing before them was a young man dressed in a luxurious robe. He was half-kneeling and had spat out a mouthful of blood. He was staring at the three.","The people around them were watching, but none of them stepped forward to help. Even the Heavenly Dragon Villa disciples who were on guard seemed to have received a warning. They did not step forward to help but just watched from afar.","“Hand over the invitation. Otherwise, don’t blame us for being impolite,” the monk in the bright yellow robe said with a sinister smile.","“The Three Outlaws of the Faraway Domain. You’re on the Federation’s wanted list, yet you still dare to openly appear here. Aren’t you afraid of death?”","The youth who had spat out blood viciously stared at the three people in front of him as he spoke.","“Hehe, the Heavenly Dragon Villa is a neutral place. If I don’t kill anyone, even the elder won’t attack me. What’s so strange about us appearing here?” The yellow-robed monk laughed sinisterly.","“What’s the point of having the Heaven’s Pride Invite?!” the young man in luxurious robes gritted his teeth.","Chu Yunfan watched this scene. The young man in luxurious robes spoke while he checked himself for injuries. It was obvious that he was trying to stall for time.","However, just as the young man in luxurious robes finished speaking, the yellow-robed monk suddenly charged at him like a ferocious beast. Then, he kicked the young man away.","The young man did not even have time to dodge and was sent flying. He spat out another mouthful of blood while soaring through the air. Then, everyone heard the clear sounds of bones breaking.","The young man’s sternum had been instantly broken.","Everyone was speechless. This yellow-robed monk was so brutal. They had seen the battle earlier. The young man was extremely strong, but compared to the yellow-robed monk, there was clearly a huge gap.","“Jin Chengtian has lost. And he had lost so easily. The Outlaws are brazenly snatching invitations. Jin Chengtian is supported by one of the Great Eights—the Jins. There’s no doubt that the Jin family is an extremely powerful one. Aren’t they afraid of death?”","“If they were, they wouldn’t be called the Three Outlaws of the Faraway Domain. A few years ago, when they had just entered the Innate Stage, they committed dozens of murders to supplement their cultivation of demonic techniques. They even killed the members of the Chu family. At that time, the junior leader of the Chu family, Chu Haoyue, chased after them. But The Outlaws managed to escape. Since then, they’ve been famous. Hehe, these are lawless characters.”","“The Outlaws showing up here in the open indicates that there’s someone behind this.”","Everyone was discussing.","“If they really manage to snatch the invitations, the elder wouldn’t really give them pointers, right?”","“That’s hard to say. According to the elder’s rules, he only recognizes the invitations and not the person. Moreover, with his status and strength, why would he care about such a thing?”","Everyone cast a disgusted look at The Outlaws, but they did not dare step forward. The Heavenly Dragon Villa disciples were also restricted by the rules and could not attack them. Moreover, if an ordinary disciple attacked, they would be no match for The Outlaws. Unless some elders of the villa attacked, they would only be able to suppress them.","The Outlaws brazenly coming out into the open indicated that there was likely someone supporting them from behind the scenes. Someone had hired them.","Many were speculating. The Outlaws were an unruly bunch. They were people who did not submit to the rule of Heaven and Earth. Just what kind of person would be able to subdue them?","Then, the yellow-robed monk walked up to Jin Chengtian and snatched the invitation he was holding. Then, he said, “If you want to stall for time, you should think of whether you have the acting skills to back you up. As for this invitation card? Of course, it’s useful to us. I’m only twenty-five years old. This invitation is just right.”","At this moment, everyone was in an uproar. The Outlaws had been quite famous for some time, but in reality, it had only been a few years. They were only twenty-five years old. Although they had already reached the limit, they were still within the invitation range of these Heaven’s Pride Invites.","After taking the invitation card, the yellow-robed monk sneered and said, “That’s all. Is trash worthy of receiving an invitation? I think the people who sent out the Heaven Dragon Villa’s invitations are all f*cking blind!”","The yellow-robed monk’s unscrupulous comments caused the Heaven Dragon Villa’s disciples to reveal indignant expressions.","“I heard that there’s a kid who’s not even twenty who received an invitation card. I wonder what the Heavenly Dragon Villa saw in him. Could it be his so-called potential?","“Hahaha, what a joke. Potential doesn’t equate to strength. So what if he has potential? I’ll guard the path. It’s fine if he doesn’t appear. But if he does, his limbs will definitely be broken. Who does he think he is to deserve an invitation?”","The yellow-robed monk was completely unrestrained.","“Chu Yunfan should be the last one. The others have either passed or have already been robbed of their invitations. They’ve lost their qualifications. Seems like he’s the only one left.”","“That’s right. I have been watching. He hasn’t appeared yet. Did he enter through some smaller path?”","“That’s impossible. This is the only path on the mountain. No matter which path he took, he would definitely appear here. There’s no other path for him to take. The Heavenly Dragon Mountain is covered in an array formation. If he doesn’t take the main path, he will definitely end up trapped in the formation,” someone familiar with the situation said.","“Could it be that he’s too afraid to come?” the yellow-robed monk said with a cold smile. “He would dare come out and embarrass himself when his hair isn’t even fully grown out yet?”","All of a sudden, with a whoosh, a stone appeared out of thin air and shot toward the yellow-robed monk at lightning speed."]},{"number":689,"title":"Chapter 689 - Killing a Murderer With Ease","paragraphs":["This stone was not big, but when it flew through the air, it was like a cannonball that brought with it a terrifying tide. It shot toward the yellow-robed monk.","The monk only had time to raise his hand to block it. Then, he let out a miserable cry because his palm had been blasted through. A small hole had been blasted through by that small stone. It was almost as terrifying as a cannonball.","“Who did that?!”","The yellow-robed monk could not care less about the wound on his hand as he hurriedly looked in the direction the stone had just flown out from. He saw that it was a young man with a large sword on his back. His expression became ferocious because he instantly recognized this young man.","In fact, The Outlaws had come here to surround and intercept those who had the Heaven’s Pride Invites. Of course, they naturally knew of those who were holding onto these invitations.","Without a doubt, Chu Yunfan was the owner of the last Heaven’s Pride Invite. In fact, they all knew what Chu Yunfan looked like.","“Chu Yunfan, you’ve finally appeared.” The yellow-robed monk looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. “I had only wanted to break your limbs to make you hand over the invitation, but you actually dared to fight back. Looks like you’re tired of living.”","Hearing the yellow-robed monk’s words, many sucked in a lungful of cold air. Only now did they remember the origins of the Three Outlaws of the Faraway Domain.","The Outlaws were born within the Federation. A few years ago, when they participated in the college entrance examination, they massacred over a thousand examinees. After mastering their demonic techniques, they stepped into the Innate Stage and shook the entire Federation.","In terms of strength, The Outlaws were definitely not the strongest of the Federation’s most wanted criminals. But in terms of fame, they were infamous.","After that, The Outlaws evaded the pursuit of the Federation several times and entered the Faraway Domain. Up until now, no one had been able to do anything to them.","“Is this the last Chu Yunfan? Sigh, another person is going to die at the hands of The Outlaws.”","“I’ve heard of Chu Yunfan. He’s not old, but it’s a pity that he’s too young. Every one of the three Outlaws is a genius, and they’re much older than Chu Yunfan.”","“Aren’t The Outlaws being a little too ferocious and lawless? Is there no one who can restrain them?”","Many people were worried about Chu Yunfan. In their eyes, this was the end for Chu Yunfan.","However, there were also people who had different thoughts, especially those who knew of Chu Yunfan’s past. They sneered.","“The Outlaws? They are indeed very famous but don’t underestimate Chu Yunfan. He’s not someone to be trifled with. What was the big deal about them slaughtering thousands of examinees in the college entrance examination? Chu Yunfan had also slaughtered hundreds of elite students at the Dao Conference. He’s even fiercer than the Outlaws.”","“It’s true that he’s young, but if you underestimate him just because of that, you’ll be very surprised!”","“The Three Outlaws of the Faraway Domain?” Chu Yunfan raised an eyebrow as he observed the three people in front of him. “I don’t know who’s behind you guys, but if pests like you don’t cower in a dark sewer and dare to come out to do evil, then allow me to clean you guys up. It just so happens that the three of you are pretty valuable. Tsk tsk, your strength is average, but the reward is so high.”","The bounty offered for The Outlaws was indeed high. The three of them were in deep blood debt, and the price the Federation had offered for them was as high as one billion federation coins. Coincidentally, he also owed Jeang Yuanbin a huge debt. The bounty would be enough to repay it.","“You’re courting death.” The yellow-robed monk narrowed his eyes, and a terrifying aura was released from his entire body. It was the aura of a person who had killed countless people.","Chu Yunfan did not take The Three Outlaws to heart at all. As someone who could kill as easily as by waving his hand, he naturally had no qualms.","A cold smile appeared on the corner of Chu Yunfan’s mouth. In his eyes, the three outlaws of the absolute domain had already become a bunch of pure bounty.","Boom!","The yellow-robed monk made his move. The demon-subduing pestle on his back suddenly moved. It smashed down, causing the entire air to shatter. It was extremely terrifying.","At the same time, it seemed as if a Buddha had appeared behind him. The Buddha’s appearance was shockingly his own. However, this Buddha did not have a golden appearance. Instead, it had a blood-red appearance.","This was a strange phenomenon formed from the condensation of True Energy. Similarly, it was also a manifestation of the demon-subduing pestle the yellow-robed monk had cultivated to.","“Go to hell,” Chu Yunfan said coldly before he pushed out with his palm. In an instant, he smacked the demon-subduing pestle.","Clang!","A voice that sounded like a great bell rang out. Chu Yunfan had smacked the demon-subduing pestle away with his palm. The yellow-robed monk could not hold on to his weapon even with both his hands. He felt as though an extremely terrifying power was seething along this weapon.","After sending the pestle flying, Chu Yunfan’s palm did not lose any momentum. It directly struck at the blood-colored Buddha that had formed around the yellow-robed monk.","Fwoosh!","The blood-colored Buddha instantly collapsed, shattering inch by inch. The yellow-robed monk was dumbstruck. Chu Yunfan’s strike had seemed so ordinary and unlike any absolute martial skill. However, the power that erupted from it was so powerful that it was shocking and terrifying.","“D*mn it. Blood Lotus Strike!”","The yellow-robed monk saw Chu Yunfan’s attack getting closer and closer. He immediately panicked and sent out an attack that filled the sky.","The shadows that filled the sky were like blood-colored lotus flowers that bloomed in the sky.","Although this yellow-robed monk looked arrogant, in terms of strength, he was indeed extremely terrifying. At the peak of the third level of the Innate Stage, coupled with his age, he could not be compared to Chu Yunfan, Jiang Lingxiao, and the others. However, he was already considered one of the best among his peers.","The blood-colored lotuses that filled the sky landed on Chu Yunfan’s attack. However, they were unable to stop it. They turned into nothingness.","This strike seemed slow but was actually fast. In just an instant, it had landed on the yellow-robed monk’s chest.","The yellow-robed monk was dumbstruck. He did not dare to believe it as if he could not accept this outcome. He had used all his strength in this strike. In terms of strength, he was indeed above Qi Shaohua. He had the right to be proud. However, he was unable to block Chu Yunfan’s strike.","Chu Yunfan’s strike had pierced through the yellow-robed monk’s chest, shattering all of his internal organs. All of his life force was cut off.","The yellow-robed monk was dead."]},{"number":690,"title":"Chapter 690 - This Was the True Meaning of Not","paragraphs":["The entire place was deathly silent. One could even hear the sound of a pin drop.","Everyone was dumbstruck. Those were The Three Outlaws. With the size of the Federation, it was naturally impossible that there would not be a single person who could deal with them, but in terms of age, they were definitely first-rate existences.","In particular, The Outlaws had appeared at the same time, making them extremely difficult to deal with. Even Chu Haoyue had attacked them once. But in the end, they managed to escape.","Although it had happened a few years ago, it was clear how difficult it was to kill The Outlaws.","And now, Chu Yunfan had killed one of them with a single strike. This was the thing that shocked everyone the most.","Even for the small group of people who thought highly of Chu Yunfan, although they knew of his fierce reputation, Chu Yunfan being able to remain undefeated by The Outlaws was still an impressive feat.","As for defeating The Outlaws, that was something they had never expected. Chu Yunfan might be able to do it in the future, but he was not even twenty years old yet.","The Outlaws were already twenty-five years old. The difference of five years was like the difference between Heaven and Earth. This was common knowledge that everyone knew, but Chu Yunfan just had to overturn this common knowledge.","“What technique was that? It was so fierce!”","“This wasn’t a technique. It was just purely the strength of the physical body. The strike smashed his opponent’s protective energy shield, pierced him right through the chest, and killed him!” someone said as they gasped.","“I’ve seen people with extraordinary innate divine strength before, but I’ve never seen someone as abnormal as this. Although those with extraordinary talent will gain a great advantage in the path of cultivation, I’ve never heard of someone as abnormal as this!”","“Chu Yunfan. As expected of Chu the killer god!”","Discussions broke out everywhere.","The Heavenly Dragon Villa disciples were especially delighted. After the initial shock, they were incomparably happy. A hooligan had actually dared to act so impudently in the Heavenly Dragon Villa.","If it was not for the orders of the higher-ups, they would have long chopped the other party to death.","“There are still two more heads to go. It’s your turn next.” Chu Yunfan slowly walked toward the remaining two of The Outlaws.","The Daoist nun and the black-clothed young man had expressions of extreme grief and indignation on their faces. Especially the Daoist nun. It was obvious that the yellow-robed monk and she had an intimate relationship.","“You dare to kill my husband in front of me? I want you to die!”","The Daoist nun’s eyes were bloodshot. She suddenly stomped her feet and her body instantly transformed into a ray of light as she flew toward Chu Yunfan.","In just an instant, the Daoist nun had arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","Immediately after, silver dust floating in the Daoist nun’s hand swept toward Chu Yunfan like a huge dragon. It flashed and in the blink of an eye, arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","This silver dust moved faster and faster, aiming to kill Chu Yunfan on the spot.","“You overestimate yourself.”","In terms of strength, this Daoist nun’s strength was on par with that yellow-robed monk. She was also very terrifying. Among her peers, she was indeed one of the best. Even Qi Shaohua would be at a disadvantage in front of her.","However, the Daoist nun was now facing Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s index and middle fingers came together and transformed into a long sword. Sword light shot out from it.","Bam!","The silver dust and Chu Yunfan’s sword light collided. The silver dust was an extremely powerful divine weapon. Every strand of the silver dust was not made of ordinary silk. Instead, it was woven from a special kind of silk spat out by demonic silkworms.","It looked no different from ordinary silver dust, but in reality, when this silver dust smashed down, it would cut through iron as if it were mud. But under the strangulation of the sword light forced out by Chu Yunfan’s fingertips, it turned into nothingness.","The silver dust instantly paled. However, the Daoist nun was unwilling to give up. The paled dust instantly shot out a sharp sword, which turned into a treasured sword, stabbing toward Chu Yunfan’s head.","Swoosh!","True Energy exploded, sweeping out like a wild tide.","However, Chu Yunfan was still calm and unhurried as if he had nothing to do. He raised his hand, and the silver dust instantly met with Chu Yunfan’s palm and was shattered inch by inch.","Crack! Crack! Crack!","With every inch that the silver dust treasured sword advanced, it would crack an inch. There was no way for it to advance any further, let alone injure Chu Yunfan.","“How is this possible?!”","The Daoist nun’s eyes were wide open. She could not believe it. How was Chu Yunfan so terrifying? She had never seen a physical body that could withstand a divine weapon. In fact, Chu Yunfan was even stronger than that.","The Daoist nun finally understood how her husband had been killed by Chu Yunfan’s ordinary strike. It was because Chu Yunfan’s physical body was simply too terrifying.","But at this moment, it was already too late. The Daoist nun was standing too close to Chu Yunfan.","“Sh*t! Save me!” the Daoist nun shouted.","Then, the Daoist nun saw the black-robed young man who had yet to move jump out.","“My aide!” The black-robed young man realized that something was wrong. However, it was still too late. Chu Yunfan’s movements were far faster than the black-robed young man had imagined.","Chu Yunfan used the Nine Heavenly Deity Transformations. In an instant, the Daoist nun discovered that Chu Yunfan’s strike had already pierced through her. An incomparably large hole had been punched through her chest, and fresh blood sprayed out.","When the blood landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, it was repelled by his energy force and fell to the ground like flowers.","Another one of the Three Outlaws had died tragically.","Many sucked in a lungful of cold air. They had not even been able to keep up with the battle between the two of them. Two of the three Outlaws had already died.","“They can’t even withstand a single blow. This is what it means to be truly unable to withstand a single blow!”","“The Outlaws are famous, but in reality, they’re nothing more than that.”","“What do you mean they are nothing more than that? Are you kidding me? It’s not that the Outlaws are weak, all right? It’s just that Chu Yunfan is far stronger!”","“They’re simply not on the same level!”","The instant he killed the Daoist nun, Chu Yunfan could feel the dark and cold aura of the black-robed young man appear around him. In an instant, he had already surrounded Chu Yunfan.","The eyes of the black-robed young man were crimson red. The Daoist nun and the yellow-robed monk had risked their lives for him. The three of them had slaughtered countless living beings, cultivated demonic techniques, and escaped the pursuit of the Federation together.","They had escaped death countless times. They were not brothers or sisters, but were better than that.","And now, they were dead.","“I want you dead!”"]},{"number":691,"title":"Chapter 691 - The Extinction of the Three","paragraphs":["The black-clothed young man instantly appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. He was extremely fast. Compared to the other two, the black-clothed young man was even more powerful and terrifying.","The other two were only at the third level of the Innate Stage and were slightly stronger than Qi Shaohua. However, this black-clothed young man had reached a completely different level.","The fourth level of the Innate Stage!","Following the black-clothed young man’s sudden attack, a stream of energy force that was more than 30 feet long appeared in the air. This energy force stream gathered together and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","This stream of energy force turned into a terrifying blade ray in mid-air and tore the sky apart.","“I’ll kill you!”","Many of the onlookers sucked in a lungful of cold air. This blade was enough to tear an intermediate mecha into pieces.","“It’s over. Chu Yunfan is dead for sure!”","“This slash is too terrifying. Chu Yunfan’s reaction is too slow!”","“It’s over. Something big is about to happen. It’s fine if The Outlaws kill the others, but who is Chu Yunfan? He’s Federation University’s most favored rising star. Federation University will not let this go!”","Boom!","The blade light landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, stirring up a terrifying airwave. It swept through the air and instantly covered everyone’s eyes.","However, just as everyone thought that Chu Yunfan would not be able to escape this calamity—even the black-clothed young man revealed a sinister expression—Chu Yunfan’s voice sounded out.","“The Three Outlaws of the Faraway Domain? You guys are nothing. Today, I will end the Outlaws!”","Following that, an even more unstoppable surge of True Energy swept out like a wild tide. Then, everyone saw Chu Yunfan appear in the middle of the battle area. That fatal slash had no effect on Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan had become extremely terrifying. The black-clothed young man had already stepped into the fourth level of the Innate Stage. His aura was incredibly powerful and enveloped the entire battle area. However, Chu Yunfan had broken through this aura. Compared to the young man, Chu Yunfan was twice as powerful.","With a loud bang, the air collapsed. It was a shocking scene as if a mountain had collapsed before his eyes. Chu Yunfan did not display any powerful martial skills. He simply clenched his fists and threw a punch.","Chu Yunfan’s punch was like a bomb going off. The air boiled, and this punch swept out like a tidal wave.","“Sh*t!”","The young man quickly reacted. He knew he was in trouble as the power of the punch instantly drowned him like a tidal wave.","“Aaaarrrrgh!”","The young man let out a long roar and tried to resist. He turned his hand and slashed at Chu Yunfan’s punch with his saber, wanting to cut Chu Yunfan’s fist in half.","Bam!","The young man’s slash landed on Chu Yunfan’s fist, but it did not affect him in even the slightest. Instead, the saber was sent flying.","Following that, the fist force landed on the young man’s body.","Spurt!","The young man let out a muffled groan as he was sent flying. Like a kite with a broken string, he was instantly defeated and heavily injured by Chu Yunfan.","When Chu Yunfan punched out, everyone felt as if the entire square was shaking. Everything disappeared. Only this shocking punch remained.","This punch seemed to be able to pierce a huge hole in the sky.","It was just a simple punch technique, but in Chu Yunfan’s hands, it had the power to turn into a miracle. This was a horizontal push with absolute strength.","There was no need for any fancy moves.","At this moment, everyone had just come to their senses. The Three Outlaws of the Faraway Domain—fearsome existences that had once caused many people to have nightmares—had died in Chu Yunfan’s presence.","“The Outlaws are dead. Chu Yunfan is a first-class fierce person!”","“The Heavenly Dragon Villa was not wrong in sending him a Heaven’s Pride Invite.”","“Previously, I was very puzzled as to why the Heavenly Dragon Villa would make such a decision. Now, it seems that the ones who don’t understand the situation are us.”","At this moment, many guests had a feeling of admiration for the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s intuition, and the Heavenly Dragon Villa disciples were finally able to hold their heads high. The owners of several invitations had been intercepted, causing many people to doubt the Heavenly Dragon Villa.","Although they were displeased, they could not say anything. Just like that Jin Chengtian, they could only blame him for being too disappointing.","Jin Chengtian was quite strong, but at last, there were stronger ones among the strong ones. There were countless experts within the Federation. Within this age group, there were many insufferably strong existences.","“Stop!”","Suddenly, a loud voice was heard. Everyone saw a figure rushing over from a distance. The person had the momentum of a thunderbolt.","And why would Chu Yunfan stop now? He let out a cold laugh and met the black-clothed young man head-on.","At this moment, the black clothed young man was in a miserable state. He was no longer as high-spirited as before. Seeing that Chu Yunfan was unwilling to give up, he let out a long cry and said, “I want you to die together with me!”","As the leader of The Outlaws, the young man had killed his way to fame. There was a fierceness deep within his bones. After being forced to such an extent, he could no longer endure it and erupted.","Blood-red energy erupted from within the young man’s body. He looked extremely frightening and ferocious. A powerful surge of True Energy surged through his body. He looked like a bomb that was about to explode.","“Sh*t!”","The guests present, as well as the Heavenly Dragon Villa disciples, were all people with cultivation bases. They immediately knew that something was wrong.","This leader wanted to self-destruct and perish together with Chu Yunfan. This method was indeed ferocious. However, there were so many people here, and all of them would be affected.","Among these people, there was only one in a hundred who had entered the Innate Stage. Most of them were still in the Acquired Stage. The consequences of an Innate expert self-destructing would be devastating.","Right at this moment, Chu Yunfan merely sneered and pulled out the Ju Que sword that was strapped to his back. It swept across the sky with shocking sword light, almost tearing the world into two halves.","Before the leader could self-destruct, his entire body was split into two halves from top to bottom, and he died tragically.","At this point, the famous Three Outlaws came to an end.","Many were still in a daze. All of this had happened too quickly. The entire process had turned so quickly that they were unable to regain their senses.","But they know at least one thing—The Three Outlaws of the Faraway Domain were finished."]},{"number":692,"title":"Chapter 692 - Jiang Lingxiao. It’s Jiang Lingxiao Again!!!","paragraphs":["“How dare you defy me!”","After a loud shout, a figure arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","At the same time, when this figure arrived in front of Chu Yunfan, a palm fiercely struck down toward Chu Yunfan. This strike seemed to shake the Heavens and Earth. It gathered all the surrounding Spirit Energy and transformed into a large Spirit Energy hand that grabbed toward Chu Yunfan.","In the face of this sudden attack, Chu Yunfan did not even look at it. He simply turned around and struck out with his palm.","Boom!","A terrifying collision occurred. That large Spirit Energy hand was shattered into pieces and turned into a shockwave that spread out in all directions.","Those who were watching the battle were forced to retreat. Although they had already retreated a few steps away, they realized that it was not enough. They had not left the battle circle of Innate masters yet.","Chu Yunfan did not move at all during the collision. No matter how the boundless blast swept out, it could not make him waver. His legs were like two pillars that were firmly inserted into the ground.","The person who had ambushed Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, took two steps back before finally regaining his balance.","That person had stormed here in anger, but in the end, he was unable to take down Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan focused his gaze and saw that it was a young man in a luxurious robe. This young man’s face carried a hint of anger and an unruly expression.","Jiang Beixuan stared coldly at Chu Yunfan. The person who had attacked forcefully just now was none other than him.","“Who are you?” Chu Yunfan stared coldly at the young man in front of him as he asked. His eyes flickered with an extremely dangerous aura.","“It’s Jiang Beixuan. The prodigy who has taken Jiang Lingxiao’s spot!” someone in the crowd shouted, revealing Jiang Beixuan’s identity.","Jiang Beixuan immediately turned his head to look. However, there was a vast sea of people, so he could not tell who had said that. He was furious. This was equivalent to poking his sore spot because he hated that this was a fact.","Back then, Jiang Lingxiao was the one who got the Heaven’s Pride Invite, not Jiang Beixuan. This made him extremely angry. In terms of strength and talent, he believed that he was not inferior to Jiang Lingxiao. However, everyone’s gazes were fixed on Jiang Lingxiao.","Ever since Jiang Lingxiao had displayed his talent, he had become the most dazzling genius of the Jiang family.","Jiang Beixuan was qualified to obtain this invitation. Even if Jiang Lingxiao had not given it to him, he still had the ability to snatch one for himself.","But now that Jiang Lingxiao had given it to him, what did Jiang Beixuan become?","Jiang Lingxiao had given away the Heaven’s Pride Invite that no one could snatch from him. It was because he was in secluded cultivation right now and did not have the time to attend the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s birthday banquet.","This made Jiang Beixuan extremely displeased. This made it seem as if even Jiang Lingxiao did not care for the banquet, which was why he had given it to him.","It was because of this that Jiang Beixuan was extremely sensitive about this. If he knew who said that, he would definitely skin them alive to vent his anger.","After obtaining an invitation, Jiang Beixuan did not just sit back and watch. On the contrary, he snatched the invitations of several other people in a row.","Jiang Beixuan had a plan. If it was possible, he wanted to wipe everyone out. Only he alone would have a Heaven’s Pride Invite. That way, he would be able to cancel those rumors and slanders.","Jiang Lingxiao was nothing. He, Jiang Beixuan, did not need Jiang Lingxiao’s handouts.","The Three Outlaws were his subordinates. A year ago, he had entered the Faraway Domain and had gone through a lot of trouble to find the Threww Outlaws. He had defeated them and taken them in as his subordinates.","Jiang Beixuan had put in a lot of effort to make that happen.","Although The Outlaws were infamous, their talent was not to be underestimated. It was because of this that Jiang Beixuan wanted to take them in even more. In the future, he would be able to have a few more high-level Innate subordinates. Even in a behemoth like the Jiang family, high-stage Innate Stage subordinates were still extremely rare and hard to come by.","Because Jiang Beixuan had always acted in secret, no one knew that he had subjugated the notorious Outlaws.","And now, Chu Yunfan had completely exposed Jiang Beixuan’s plans. Chu Yunfan had killed the black market experts that he had hired. The Outlaws that he had planned to use in the future had also been killed.","Jiang Beixuan had suffered heavy losses. Thinking of this, he looked at Chu Yunfan with fierce killing intent in his eyes.","“Jiang Beixuan? I’ve never heard of you. If was Jiang Lingxiao, I’d be a little interested.” Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and had no recollection of who this Jiang Beixuan was. But since it was not Jiang Lingxiao, he was not very interested.","When Chu Yunfan found out that Jiang Lingxiao might be coming to the banquet as well, he was not afraid. On the contrary, he only had one thought—he had to think of ways to get rid of Jiang Lingxiao.","If it could not be delayed until the planned battle, then so be it.","Although this was a little aboveboard, the Jiangs had repeatedly surrounded, ambushed, and tried to kill Chu Yunfan. They had forced Chu Yunfan to escape death several times. If they had not underestimated his strength, he probably would not have been able to escape death.","Chu Yunfan remembered all of this. Since the other party intended to attack openly, how could Chu Yunfan not play along with them?","“Jiang Lingxiao. It’s Jiang Lingxiao again!”","Jiang Beixuan’s face alternated between green and white. When he saw the disdain in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, the jealousy and anger in his heart suddenly flared up. The killing intent in his eyes became even more pronounced.","“You actually dared to kill my subordinates. You will pay,” Jiang Beixuan said coldly.","“The Outlaws are your subordinates? Do you know what the crime of harboring a fugitive is?” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","“They’ve already converted. They no longer roam around and commit crimes!” Jiang Beixuan said loudly, “And you killed them. This is simply unforgivable!”","“They’ve converted to be your subordinates? Who the hell are you? Can you replace the laws of the Federation? Or are you God? If they convert to you, they can put down their butcher’s knife and become a saint?","“The Outlaws have accumulated countless blood debts and their crimes are unforgivable. As a citizen of the Federation, you should be executed,” Chu Yunfan said disdainfully as he sneered.","“You actually dare to cover up for such major criminals? You know the law, but you still dare to talk to me about converting? I see that you’re related to them. Perhaps you’re the mastermind behind them. I’ll take you down and then interrogate you slowly.”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Jiang Beixuan was on the verge of going insane. He was extremely furious as he said, “Let’s see if you take me down first or I kill you first!”"]},{"number":693,"title":"Chapter 693 - The Life Ender? That’s Nothing!","paragraphs":["Jiang Beixuan had always been a smart man and rarely would he be so flustered and exasperated. However, when it involved Jiang Lingxiao, he would be so.","To the proud Jiang Beixuan, Jiang Lingxiao was simply a nightmare. Originally, he had the genius figure who was the center of the Jiangs’ attention. But because of Jiang Lingxiao’s existence, his limelight was stolen away.","Those who were about the same age as Jiang Lingxiao were almost completely overshadowed by him. There was even news that the clan leader of the Jiangs had once commented that Jiang Lingxiao might be the person after him who was most likely to step into the Divine Abilities Stage. This comment was enough to establish Jiang Lingxiao as the future clan leader of the Jiangs.","The Jiang clan leader was practically a god within the Jiang family. Because of him, Jiang Lingxiao had the prestige within the Jiangs. No one dared to ignore his words.","It was precisely because of this that everyone placed their bets on Jiang Lingxiao. An ambitious person like Jiang Beixuan could not even obtain a fair competition environment.","Everything Jiang Beixuan had done was to prove to those blind old fellows who was the true hope of the Jiangs. And now, all this anger had erupted and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","“Life Ender!” Jiang Beixuan roared. What he displayed was the Jiangs’s famous ultimate skill, the Life Ender strike.","The Jiang clan leader had relied on this technique to become famous. He had defeated countless powerful enemies and finally reached the peak of this ultimate skill. With this blade, an incomparably huge word “kill” appeared and a killing intent permeated the world.","The Life Ender.","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. He was no stranger to the Life Ender. Because of Jiang Lingxiao, he was destined to face the Jiangs. Therefore, it was impossible for him not to look up some information about the Jiangs.","The Jiang’s Life Ender tehcnique was extremely famous. There were many who practiced it. It was an absolute art that shook the Federation.","Of course, the most powerful of all was the Life Ender technique was in the hands of the Jiang clan leader. It was said that he had once killed a Divine ferocious beast with this technique.","And it was said that Jiang Lingxiao had also used the Life Ender to defeat many enemies, so Chu Yunfan was no stranger to the technique that Jiang Beixuan was using.","This technique was well-known throughout the Federation, but it was nothing to Chu Yunfan who had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","This technique is only so-so. Watch me break it.”","Chu Yunfan’s aura began to boil, and then, all of it gathered together. In the blink of an eye, it swept out like a wild tide that filled the sky.","“World Overlord, Sky Sword!”","Chu Yunfan swept out with his sword. The sword light had the power to soar into the sky. A faint dragon’s roar rose up, and in an instant, it charged toward the Life Ender.","Just as the two sides were about to collide, a figure fell from the sky and landed in the middle of the two. Then, he casually used one hand to break the attacks of both sides.","In an instant, the two people’s attacks that were enough to cover the Sky and the Sun were blocked and turned into nothingness.","Everyone saw that it was a young man dressed in a luxurious robe. He was handsome and elegant. He didn not use any tricks and easily blocked the attacks of the two people.","‘It’s an expert!’ This thought instantly appeared in Chu Yunfan’s mind.","If this young man was not a top-notch expert, how could he easily block Chu Yunfan’s attacks? He was at least a high-stage Innate Stage expert above teh seventh level.","“Greetings, Junior Villa Leader!” The Heavenly Dragon Villa disciples saw this person and hurriedly lowered their heads.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan realized that this young man dressed in luxurious robes was the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s junior leader, Lin Shaoyu.","This was yet another young genius who had once shocked the Federation. However, in recent years, as he focused on managing the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s affairs, so gradually, fewer and fewer people had heard of him.","It was not like back when Lin Shaoyu was young where his name shook the entire region.","This was similar to the junior leader of the Chu family, Chu Haoyue. When he was young, his name shocked the Federation. However, he slowly withdrew his edge and slowly began to retreat behind the scenes.","“Greetings, Junior Leader Lin!” Chu Yunfan said.","“Junior Leader Lin!” On the other side, Jiang Beixuan also said.","The influence of the Heavenly Dragon Villa was not inferior to the Jiangs. As the junior leader of the Heavenly Dragon Villa, Lin Shaoyu’s status was naturally far above Jiang Beixuan. Even the people behind the plutocrats was not on equal footing with Lin Shaoyu.","“If the two of you continue to fight here, I’m afraid I won’t be able to help you. Speaking of which, our forces are like branches, and we have our own connections. Why do we have to go to such an extent,” Lin Shaoyu said, “Everyone who comes here is an honored guest. I don’t wish for anyone of you to die. After all, it’s my ancestor’s birthday. I hope that everyone won’t make things difficult for me.”","“But he killed my subordinates,” Jiang Beixuan said unhappily.","“You are so muddle-headed. You’re a descendant of the Jiangs that’s highly regarded. Your future is limitless. Why must you die on this hill? Moreover, The Outlaws have murdered many people. Once the news gets out, the police will find trouble with you. Can you stop them then?” Lin Shaoyu said, “I’m only telling you this because our two families are family friends. If it were anyone else, I wouldn’t have bothered to say anything.","“And you, Chu Yunfan. I received a message from Brother Haoyue earlier saying that you’re quite an interesting person. Now that I look at you, it seems like he wasn’t lying,” Lin Shaoyu looked at Chu Yunfan and said with a smile.","Only then did Chu Yunfan realize that Lin Shaoyu had connections with Chu Haoyue. They were from the same generation after all. Chu Haoyue was one of the top figures of a generation. Now that he was preparing to take over, he would definitely stand at the peak of the Federation in the future.","“All right, there’s a bottom line for playing around. The birthday banquet is about to begin. You guys wanted to make a move and I’ve given you a chance to do so. Now, all of you better behave yourselves. Someone will guide you to the banquet in a while. I still have some matters to attend to, so I won’t be accompanying you guys.”","After Lin Shaoyu finished speaking, he did not linger. He turned around and left. As for The Three Outlaws and Jin Chengtian, he did not even glance at them. The dead and the losers were not worthy of his attention."]},{"number":694,"title":"Chapter 694 - The Reward of a Peak Innate Monster’s Inner Core","paragraphs":["“Consider yourself lucky.” Jiang Beixuan glanced at Chu Yunfan and snorted.","Chu Yunfan simply sneered in response. In the eyes of ordinary people, Jiang Beixuan was indeed strong. He could even subdue The Outlaws. His strength was indeed above them.","However, this was nothing to Chu Yunfan. If Lin Shaoyu had not stopped him, he would definitely let the other party know his true strength.","Seeing that the two of them had stopped fighting, the guests who were watching the show heaved a sigh of relief. However, they were a little disappointed. In the end, there was no show for them to watch.","Not long after, the Heavenly Dragon Villa disciples came to guide Chu Yunfan and Jiang Beixuan into the main venue. At this moment, the main venue was already in full swing.","The banquet had been planned according to the traditional Chinese style. Each person had a small table which was ladened with all kinds of delicacies. It was extremely luxurious. There were also waiters constantly shuttling around, serving these famous big shots in various fields of the Federation.","Chu Yunfan was arranged to sit at the front. Not far away was the host of the birthday banquet, the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s seat. Seated around the elder were the various upper echelons of the Heavenly Dragon Villa and the various big shots of the Federation.","There were a total of ten seats in this region, but when Chu Yunfan really arrived, he realized that these ten seats were not fully occupied. There were only three people in total.","Other than Chu Yunfan, the remaining two people were acquaintances of his. One of them was Jiang Beixuan.","Other than Jiang Beixuan, there was another person who was waiting quietly. This person was none other than the most outstanding disciple of Stellaris sect’s current generation, Feng Tianyuan.","When Feng Tianyuan saw Chu Yunfan and Jiang Beixuan walking over, he asked, “Where’s Jiang Lingxiao? Why didn’t he come?”","Jiang Beixuan’s expression immediately turned ugly again. Jiang Lingxiao, Jiang Lingxiao, Jiang Lingxiao. Everyone only ever remembered Jiang Lingxiao. No one remembered him at all.","“Hmph!”","Jiang Beixuan snorted coldly and had no intention of answering. He just sat in his seat.","Chu Yunfan quickly figured out why only three people were here even though there were ten spots. The reason was very simple. They had been intercepted. It probably had something to do with Jiang Beixuan or Feng Tianyuan.","If Chu Yunfan was not strong enough, then one of the people who were intercepted would definitely be him.","The two of them began to block out the other guests. It seemed that there were ten spots and no one interfered with each other, but many things were not so simple. Cultivation was like sailing against the current, not advancing but retreating instead.","It was like a thousand-person dragon boat race. In the end, there were only a few who would reach the top. Their peers, seniors, and juniors were all competitors.","The goal of these people was to one day possess supernatural powers, but there were very little people who could do it. The more they cultivated, the fewer resources they had. The fewer competitors they had, the more resources they could get.","The competition was never held at the last moment, but it had started from the beginning. Both Jiang Beixuan and Feng Tianyuan knew this very well. It was only then that Chu Yunfan finally came to his senses.","The two side grew up in different environments. Chu Yunfan had been brought up in an ordinary family. To him, resources did not really need to be fought over because everyone was the same. To fight a little more or a little less would not affect them too much.","Whether it was the strength of their teachers, cultivation resources, or money, most of the people in the entire class and even the entire school were similar.","However, Jiang Beixuan and Feng Tianyuan were different. They had been trained as geniuses since they were young. Their competitors were not the common people. Their opponents were world-famous geniuses, and high-quality resources afford to them were even less compared.","They had been competing with each other for more than ten to twenty years. This habit had already been carved into their bones. Not only were they competing for their own opportunities, but they also had to break the opportunities of others. In the future, they would have one less great enemy.","Chu Yunfan truly finally understood now. What was a world of great competition? This was a world of great competition. The number of heaven-gifted geniuses was unprecedented. Similarly, the competition was also unprecedentedly cruel.","Advance or retreat.","There was no such thing as advancing together. It was a situation where one advanced while the other retreated.","“Chu Yunfan?” Feng Tianyuan said with a faint smile as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","Feng Tianyun did not know that this was the second time he and Chu Yunfan were crossing paths. However, it was already the second time for Chu Yunfan.","Back then, Feng Tianyuan faced the students of Federation University alone without every changing his expression. He was full of vigor. Even if he had met Chu Yunfan at that time, he would not remember him.","But now, more than a year had passed, and Chu Yunfan was qualified to be on equal footing with Feng Tianyun. The wonders of the world could only lie in this.","“This is the first time we’ve met. I didn’t expect you to be able to hold on until this point.”","Feng Tianyuan was speaking from the bottom of his heart. Ten Heaven’s Pride Invites ahd been sent out. It did not matter who they were given to in the beginning. The most important thing was who got them in the end.","That was the most important thing.","The ten cards that were sent out back then, after a few ups and downs, only three people showed up. This made everything crystal clear.","“This is the first time we’ve met? Actually, this is already the second time,” Chu Yunfan said as he smiled faintly.","Feng Tianyuan was stunned. He could not remember when he had met Chu Yunfan. With his memory and Chu Yunfan’s popularity, as long as he had met him, he could not have forgotten.","“Is it strange that I came here?” Chu Yunfan asked as he raised his eyebrows.","“Do you really not know, or do you pretend not to?” Feng Tianyuan said.","Chu Yunfan looked at Feng Tianyuan with a hint of doubt, not knowing what he was talking about.","“It doesn’t matter. Anyway, you’re already here, so I’ll tell you,” Feng Tianyuan said, “This time, in addition to the usual guidance, the Heavenly Dragon Elder will also be offering a peak Innate monster’s inner core as a reward. The owners of the Heaven’s Pride Invites will have a chance to obtain it. Whoever wins in the end will obtain this inner core as a reward.”","Feng Tianyu’s words caused Chu Yunfan to breathe in a lungful of cold air. The value of a peak Innate monster’s inner core was worth billions. Although it could not compare to the inner core that Chu Yunfan had obtained previously, it was a close behind.","The inner core that Chu Yunfan obtained previously, what kind of situation was that? He jadhad used it as a miniaturized nuclear weapon, but he had not consumed it. It could be seen how rare such an item was."]},{"number":695,"title":"Chapter 695 - The Might of the Heavenly Dragon Elder","paragraphs":["It was said that a peak Innate monster could destroy a large-scale inheritance. A peak Innate monster was far more terrifying than a peak Innate human warrior.","In fact, if that peak Innate giant snake had not been ambushed, even with the miniature nuclear weapon, it would have been very difficult to successfully kill it. Only a super large-scale faction that had the support of a Divin expert would be able to systematically hunt down monsters of this level.","Even so, items like these were scarce. It was almost impossible for such things to be given away to outsiders.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s surprised look, Feng Tianyuan finally believed that Chu Yunfan really did not know anything.","“Seems like you have no clue. The reason why the Heavenly Dragon Villa is spending such a huge sum this time around is because the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s leader wants to find a suitable husband for his young daughter,” Feng Tianyuan said.","This was confidential information because the Heavenly Dragon Villa had not publicized this. This was their true purpose. However, since they had already come this far, there was no point in keeping it a secret.","Hearing this, Chu Yunfan immediately understood. No wonder those black market experts and The Three Outlaws dared to enter the Heavenly Dragon Villa. It was because the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s leader wanted to use these people’s hands to weed out some unqualified people.","The losers would not have the qualifications to become the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s son-in-law.","Jiang Beixuan and Feng Tianyuan obviously knew about this, which was why they started to weed out the other competitors.","The Heavenly Dragon Villa was a major power in the Faraway Domain that could stand on equal footing with the Great Eights and Federation University. If they could become the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s leader’s son-in-law, it meant that they would not have to struggle for decades. To geniuses like Feng Tianyuan and others, who were famous throughout the region, this was still extremely attractive.","Thinking about it, everything that was illogical before now made sense.","Chu Yunfan did not reply. He merely sat down at his own table. He was not interested in the leader’s daughter. However, he was determined to get his hands on that peak Innate monster’s inner core.","After the inner core had been refined into a medicinal pill, it could be of great use.","Many alchemy formulas had already appeared in Chu Yunfan’s mind. Thinking about the upcoming life-and-death battle between Jiang Lingxiao and himself, he came to a decision. With this peak Innate monster’s inner core, he was confident that he could kill his way back and forth even if it was a dragon’s cave or a tiger’s den.","‘If the Jiangs know their place when the time comes, all will be well. But if they don’t, then I’ll give them a taste of the methods of an Alchemy Emperor from the Ancient Zenith Civilization!’ Chu Yunfan thought as he sneered.","The Alchemy Emperor was able to become an emperor in that era of unimaginable glory. Naturally, there was a reason for this. It was simply not something that ordinary people could imagine.","But, the prerequisite for everything was that Chu Yunfan had to obtain this peak Innate monster’s inner core.","And at this time, the news of the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s leader offering a peak Innate monster’s inner core had spread. These people were important figures of the Federation. However, this inner core was still something that they could not imagine.","“I’m so envious. A peak Innate monster’s inner core? Each era is getting more and more powerful. Back in our era, an Innate monster’s inner core was an extremely difficult item to come by.”","“Jiang Beixuan has been famous for many years. The inner core will definitely be his.”","“I don’t think so. Feng Tianyuan isn’t an ordinary person. His cultivation has already reached the Innate Stage. His strength is unimaginable.”","“That’s true. And Chu Yunfan isn’t weak either. Tsk tsk, I just found out that he’s the first seat of Federation University’s sophomores. It’s a pity that he’s young. If it were a few more years, he might still have a chance to win. But now, he’s still a little lacking.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. There were clearly more people who thought highly of Feng Tianyuan and Jiang Beixuan, while there were fewer people who thought highly of Chu Yunfan.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan just sat there like an old monk. His face was expressionless and he did not say a word. He was circulating his Emperor Method and making full use of every minute and second to cultivate.","After some time, a commotion started stirring up the entire venue. First, it was the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s Junior Villa Leader, Lin Shaoyu. Behind him, a dignified-looking middle-aged man walked into the hall.","This man was the leader of the Heavenly Dragon Villa.","After the two of them sat down, the sound of conches rang out, shaking the entire Heavenly Dragon Mountain. Golden light filled the sky and turned into a rainbow bridge that appeared out of thin air. This was not a special skill but were actual rays of golden light that turned into a rainbow bridge.","Soon after, a figure stepped on the bridge. He then entered the venue. Everything seemed like a miracle.","This person’s entire body emitted a piercing light. Countless strange phenomena circled his body that had transformed into a heavenly dragon that coiled around him. Without a doubt, this person was none other than the Heavenly Dragon Elder of the Heavenly Dragon Villa.","Only after the Heavenly Dragon Elder sat down did the strange phenomena on his body dissipate. Everyone saw that it was an old man with white hair and a youthful face. Just by sitting there, he radiated an imposing aura.","A Divine Abilities Stage expert.","Many were excited. Even for these important figures of the Federation, it was still rare for them to meet a Divine expert. Many would never meet such an expert in their entire lives. At most, they will only see them when they watched a video on the virtual network.","But now that they were within the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s presence, they understood what it meant to have an unrivaled aura. This one person alone was able to suppress all the experts present.","The Heavenly Dragon Villa’s leader, who had been extremely imposing before, now paled in comparison.","The Heavenly Dragon Elder was one of the few experts who could control the fate of the entire human race. He was high and mighty—like a god.","No wonder some people regarded Divine experts as living gods.","‘That’s the Heavenly Dragon Elder?’ Chu Yunfan thought as he gazed at the imposing old man on the throne.","Chu Yunfan had seen countless experts in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, and many of them were able to shatter the Heavens and Earth with a wave of their hands. They were many times more terrifying than Heavenly Dragon Elder. However, this was still the first time Chu Yunfan was seeing a Divine expert in real life.","Different from the Innate Stage, Divine experts were existences who had truly dug out the treasures in their bodies. From then on, they would possess all sorts of unimaginable powers."]},{"number":696,"title":"Chapter 696 - A Confrontation Between Divines","paragraphs":["In terms of cultivation, only by reaching this stage could one be considered to have reached the threshold of developing the body’s treasures.","The Acquired and Innate stages were merely the basic preparations for the cultivation of techniques.","Of course, in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, this was just the beginning of his cultivation path. But in the current federation, he was already a god. There was simply no one who could contend against him.","Just like the nuclear weapons of the Common Era, they were basically walking nuclear weapons in human form. Even Chu Yunfan’s instructor, Jeang Yuanbin, who was at the peak of the Innate Stage, was still unable to withstand a single blow in front of a Divine expert.","After the Heavenly Dragon Elder sat down, everyone stood up and saluted.","“Congratulations, Heavenly Dragon Elder. May you live a long life!”","The elder looked at everyone and nodded. He seemed to be satisfied and said, “Today is my birthday. It is my honor to have all of you here.","“However, before the celebration begins, I think we should clean up some pests first,” the elder said.","The Heavenly Dragon Elder’s words made everyone’s heart tighten. They did not know what he was talking about. At this moment, the elder made his move.","All of a sudden, countless amounts of Spirit Energy gathered around the elder. Everyone felt as if the air around them had instantly frozen. A terrifying pressure floated above their heads, but it did not descend.","With just his strength alone, the elder made the tens of thousands of guests feel his terrifying pressure. This was a power that Innate experts could not even imagine.","And in that instant, the Spirit Energy transformed into several dragon claws and flew toward the crowd.","In the blink of an eye, seven to eight guests were pulled out from within the crowd. Then, everyone could only watch helplessly as these people were lifted into the air.","Everyone was a little confused, not knowing why the elder was doing this.","However, they heard the elder speak slowly, “The Monster Cult dares to send people to spy on my birthday banquet? Do they really think that I’m so old that I won’t kill?”","At this moment, everyone realized that these people were members of the Monster Cult. What they were even more curious about was how the elder knew. They had not been able to detect it at all, but the elder took a few glances and was actually able to see through them.","This was truly inconceivable.","However, when the crowd thought about how the current world evaluated these Divine experts as living gods, it was not strange. Gods themselves were capable of doing things that many mortals would never think of. It was simply inconceivable.","Only Chu Yunfan knew that it was a divine ability that only Divine experts possessed. It was divine sense.","Under this divine sense, it was like everything was being put under a radar. Nothing could escape this divine sense. Unless one’s cultivation level was much higher, everything would be seen at a glance.","Those cult members could hide from the perception of many, but they could not hide from this divine sense. Divines possessed incredible abilities. If not for this, they would not be considered Divines in the first place.","Chu Yunfan, who had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, knew that this was an ability that could only be used after one’s mental strength was extremely powerful.","“Heavenly Dragon Elder, if you kill us, our cult master will not let you go!” one of the cult members said after he realized that they had been discovered and captured. They did not bother to deny it. They knew that to deny it in front of a Divine expert was a ridiculous thing. It was simply courting death.","“You still dare to threaten me?” the elder said with a cold smile. “If your cult master dares to take even one step onto Heavenly Dragon Mountain, I will spill his blood where he stands.”","Even the elder, who had always been neutral, did not have a good impression of the Monster Cult. The cult was the foundation of all the evil forces in the world. Even if it was as powerful as the human federation, it would give the others a chance to catch their breath.","However, the cult was different. Their main goal was to let the monsters rule the world. This was no longer a struggle for power and benefits, but a war between species.","Everyone understood the reason why non-humans had different hearts. Once the monsters ruled the world, would their forces still be as carefree as they were now?","That was obviously impossible.","Every faction had cooperated and competed with the Federation on various matters. Only on this matter did the various factions work together.","“Heavenly Dragon Elder, if you kill my disciples, I will kill your Heavenly Dragon Villa’s disciples in the future!” a huge threat suddenly came from the void.","Immediately after, everyone could clearly see that the Spirit Energy in the sky had started to condense, turning into a huge demonic eye that stared fixedly at everyone. It was as if it was looking at countless ants.","Many felt a chill run down their spines when this gaze swept over them.","“It’s the Demonic Eye! That’s the cult’s leader’s divine ability! The cult master must be nearby!”","“My god! Is the Heavenly Dragon Villa about to turn into a battlefield?!”","“Has the cult eaten the heart of a bear and the guts of a leopard?! They actually dare to attack the Heavenly Dragon Villa?!”","Many people recognized the enormous eye that carried a demonic aura. It was the cult leader’s famous skill, The Demonic Eye.","Ordinary people barely knew of the existence of the Monster Cult. However, the guests present here today were all important figures that had shaken the Federation. Naturally, they knew the culty very well. They knew about the origins of The Demonic Eye.","What they were even clearer about was how terrifying it would be if this place turned into a battlefield. After all, it was a war between two Divine experts. It would be like standing between two walking nuclear bombs in the Common Era. Who was not afraid? Who was not worried?","“If you manage to enter Heavenly Dragon Villa, we’ll discuss it then.” The Heavenly Dragon Elder sneered and flicked his finger. A rainbow light swept out and blasted into The Demonic Eye.","The Demonic Eye that had made countless guests feel extremely uncomfortable instantly disappeared without a trace. The uncomfortable feeling finally disappeared. They heaved a sigh of relief.","“The remnants of the cult shall be killed without mercy.”","The Heavenly Dragon Elder’s aura was steady as he spoke. In mid-air, the dragon claws swiped down one after another, and the cult members were instantly turned into minced meat."]},{"number":697,"title":"Chapter 697 - The Main Event Begins","paragraphs":["Though there were Innate level experts among them, they still died against an expert of this level.","Everyone fell silent. Many were frightened by the methods of the Heavenly Dragon Elder. Speaking of which, the elder had not done such a thing in decades. This was because other than the traditional forces of the Federation, he was neutral.","Most people did not dare to provoke the Heavenly Dragon Villa. Naturally, there were fewer opportunities for the elder to make a move. All sorts of rumors about the elder’s old age were spreading.","After all, the Heavenly Dragon Elder was already close to 200 years old. Even according to the lifespan of Divine experts, he had already entered old age.","With the current lifespan of humans, most people could live past 100 years old. They could reach the limit of the number of times the human cells could divide—120 years old.","Those who reached the Innate Stage would be able to break through this limit and live past 150 years old. However, those who could live past 200 years old were only Divine experts","However, even for Divine experts, this was considered as stepping into old age.","Regardless of what kind of expert it was, once they stepped into old age, their abilities would start to decline in all aspects. This was in accordance with the laws of nature.","The principle that the fist was afraid of the young was true most of the time.","Many people even began to belittle them. There was even a saying that Divine experts who had reached their old age could be surrounded and killed by a few peak Innate experts.","This kind of rumor was quite popular in private.","And now, the Heavenly Dragon Elder had used the blood of these cult members to declare that he was not that old. If one thought that he could be belittled just because he was old, that would be a huge mistake.","Although the elder was old, he was not so old that he could not wield a blade.","The crowd did not know how much of the Heavenly Dragon Elder’s intention was to demonstrate his power, but they sensed it. Moreover, they also understood that even if the elder demonstrated his power, it would not be in their favor.","People like them might be important figures in the Federation, but to experts like the Heavenly Dragon Elder, they were nothing.","The true targets of the elder’s demonstration were the other Divine experts.","Why did he, the Heavenly Dragon Elder, have to hold a grand birthday banquet every ten years? It was not to show off. It was to announce to the public that he was not dead yet. As long as he was not dead, he would serve as a great deterrent.","“All right. The pests have been cleared out,” the elder said with a smile. Then, he raised the wine cup on the table in front of him and said loudly, “Everyone, I won’t say anything else. Cheers!”","Everyone raised their cups and drank. Following that, the entire atmosphere became lively again. They exchanged greetings and toasted each other.","Then, the important figures of the Federation whom many would only ever see on television left their seats one by one. Then, they took turns to come forward to toast and celebrate the elder on his birthday.","Only the important figures of the Federation were qualified to come forward to toast. After these important figures had taken turns to greet the elder, it was Chu Yunfan, Feng Tianyuan, and Jiang Beixuan’s turn to come forward and toast him.","“We wish you a long and boundless life, Heavenly Dragon Elder,” Chu Yunfan and the other two said as they raised their cups.","The elder smiled and drank his wine for the first time. The elder’s cup had only touched his lips when those important figures had toasted him. Many were secretly paying attention to this and were shocked. The elder’s concern for these few people was really incredible.","“Good. Very good. You guys are not bad. In the future, mankind will still have to depend on you. The world is ultimately yours,” the elder smiled and gave them encouraging words. Chu Yunfan and the others humbly said a few words before returning to their seats.","“These are the three little guys who received the invitations this year?” the elder said to the Heavenly Dragon Villa’s leader who was sitting beside him.","With his status and age, there was nothing wrong with the elder calling them little guys.","“That’s right. They’re the three elites who received the invitations this year.” The leader nodded. He was the leader of the Heavenly Dragon Villa, but at this moment, he was only a son.","“Only three people came this year? interesting. And that Chu Yunfan is not even 20 years old?” the elder said with a smile.","“That’s right. Chu Yunfan is a branch descendant of the Chu family. He’s only 19 this year. But according to the information I received, he’s extremely powerful. In his second year, he’s already the second-strongest person at Federation University. He’s only second to Jiang Lingxiao who did not come this time,” Lin Shaoyu said.","“That’s indeed impressive. I didn’t expect that a branch descendant of the Chus would have such a cultivation level,” the elder said. He knew too well how important resources were during the cultivation process. As a branch descendant of the Chud, Chu Yunfan definitely would not have been able to obtain many resources. However, he was still able to surpass everyone else. This could only be attributed to Chu Yunfan’s talent.","“I heard that you plan on choosing a husband for Shuna?” the elder asked. He was talking about the leader’s daughter, Lin Shuna.","“Yes. Shuna is already 22. It’s about time for her to start a family. Although martial artists usually start families late, it’s not a bad idea to get engaged first. Those who managed to get their hands on an invitation and come here are the cream of the crop among their peers. If they become Shuna’s husband, she definitely won’t be wronged,” the leader said with a smile.","“This is not a matter of grievance. Our family isn’t in any difficulty that we need to use Shuna to form a marriage alliance. Let her choose her own husband. None of you should interfere,” the elder said.","The leader smiled bitterly. There were many girls in the Heavenly Dragon Villa who had chosen their husbands this way, but the elder did not wish to interfere in Shuna’s affair. It was clear how much he loved this little granddaughter of his.","However, since the elder had spoken, the leader naturally had nothing to say.","After drinking and eating, everyone stopped and looked at the elder sitting on the throne. They knew that the main event had yet to begin.","The elder glanced at everyone, then said, “Everyone, I believe you have heard that the Heavenly Dragon Villa will be giving out a peak Innate monster’s inner core as a reward. The reward will be given to the most outstanding junior of humanity in the past ten years.”"]},{"number":698,"title":"Chapter 698 - The Shock of the Crowd","paragraphs":["Everyone’s gaze immediately fell on Chu Yunfan, Jiang Beixuan, and Feng Tianyuan.","Everyone knew that the peak Innate Stage monster’s inner core would definitely fall into the hands of one of these three people.","Many people’s eyes flashed with envy and jealousy. Back in their time, they did not have such an opportunity. This was simply unimaginable.","Let alone in the past, even now, most of them could not afford a peak Innate monster’s inner core. At most, they could only look at it.","“This time, the Heavenly Dragon Villa sent out a total of ten Heaven’s Pride Invites. Due to various reasons, only the three owners of these cards came in the end. Therefore, the winner of the three will receive this inner core,” the elder said slowly.","As for the rumor of selecting a husband for the young daughter of the Heavenly Dragon Villa, Lin Shuna, it was never mentioned. This made many disappointed, especially Feng Tianyuan and Jiang Beixuan. They had come with this goal in mind, so they were even more disappointed.","However, they soon regained their spirits. Even without the matter of selecting a husband, just the value of a peak Innate monster’s inner core was worth the trip.","“In that case, I’ll take the lead.” Jiang Beixuan stood up. His figure was like a bolt of lightning as he rushed into the center of the banquet hall.","After Jiang Beixuan steadied himself, he instantly looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “Chu Yunfan, hurry up and accept your death.”","Everyone’s gaze turned to Chu Yunfan. Many had found out about Chu Yunfan through the Internet. When they found out that Chu Yunfan was only nineteen years old, many felt in awe.","Chu Yunfan was only nineteen, and he was able to get a Heaven’s Pride Invite and come all the way here without it being snatched away.","The meaning behind this was beyond doubt. Chu Yunfan was definitely a super potential stock, and his future was limitless.","“Since you want to die, then I’ll grant you your wish.”","Facing the aggressive Jiang Beixuan, Chu Yunfan had no intention of giving in. He slowly walked to the center of the hall and faced Jiang Beixuan from afar.","Everyone’s gaze fell on the two people in the hall, especially Feng Tianyuan, whose eyes were shining brightly. No matter who won or lost, they were his opponents. Although he was conceited about his strengths and had absolute confidence in himself, he could not afford to be careless.","“We were interrupted in our earlier battle. Now, no one will come to save you.” Jiang Beixuan looked at Chu Yunfan with a cold smile, his eyes flashing with cold killing intent.","“Idiot.” Chu Yunfan was barely bothered to pay attention to Jiang Beixuan. He simply sneered.","Jiang Beixuan’s face instantly fell, and then, he made his move. He released all the aura in his body, It was as if the Spirit Energy in the entire hall had suddenly condensed.","Many of the guests immediately felt as if they were suffocating. The pressure brought by Innate-level strength was enough to strangle them. Most of them were only at the peak of the Acquired Stage and had not truly crossed the threshold of life and death to become Innate experts.","They were instantly shocked. Jiang Beixuan was not even thirty, but he was already so amazing. It was truly unbelievable.","“Life Ender!”","Jiang Beixuan lashed out with this technique once again. Compared to the previous time, this time was even more terrifying.","A sharp killing intent was released. It was as if the world was filled with a terrifying atmosphere of killing. When this killing intent was released, many guests with lower cultivations were immediately infected. Their eyes turned red, and a sense of killing intent appeared in their hearts out of nowhere.","Fortunately, these people were not ordinary people. Although their cultivation levels were not high, they had been to various places within the Federation for many years, and their state of mind far surpassed that of ordinary people.","They immediately regained their clarity. Even so, they felt as if they were breathing in a lungful of cold air, and their entire bodies were drenched in cold sweat.","This Life Ender technique was famous, but not many had witnessed it before. When it was used, it could affect a person’s mind. It was indeed very impressive.","“End!”","Along with Jiang Beixuan’s explosive shout, this attack headed straight toward Chu Yunfan. The terrifying blade light was several feet long. Jiang Beixuan’s astonishing skill could be seen from this.","“Such an insignificant skill. The Life Ender is only so-so.” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly. This caused many guests from the Jiang clan and those related to them to reveal looks of dissatisfaction.","The Life Ender was the ultimate skill of the Jiangs’ clan leader, yet Chu Yunfan actually rated it as an insignificant skill. This was simply outrageous.","Just as the Life Ender was about to chop down onto Chu Yunfan’s body, the Ju Quw sword on Chu Yunfan’s back suddenly emitted a “buzz” and a sword rainbow instantly shot up into the sky. It was as if it was about to break through the barrier between Heaven and Earth.","Many people’s expressions changed when they saw this. If Jiang Beisuan’s saber attack just now perfectly reflected his dense and powerful cultivation strength, then Chu Yunfan’s cultivation strength was even more unbelievable.","Boom!","The sword rainbow and the saber light collided fiercely. A terrifying shockwave spread out from the spot where the two sides were fighting.","It turned into a terrifying shockwave that swept out in all directions. Just as it was about to hit everyone, the Heavenly Dragon Elder pointed his finger to the air and a well-hidden barrier rose up. It blocked the shockwave of this collision.","The guests finally had a feeling that they were safe and sound. Only now did they have the mood to watch the ensuing battle.","After this terrifying Innate-level collision, the weapons of both sides collided, and an incomparably loud sound of metal clashing rang out.","After this terrifying collision, everyone saw Jiang Beixuan retreat continuously. Chu Yunfan had cut off the Life Ender blade intent that he had slashed out with his saber. He had no way to affect Chu Yunfan’s body in the slightest.","Jiang Beixuan retreated a few steps before he managed to stabilize himself. However, Chu Yunfan did not move an inch. Chu Yunfan was completely unaffected.","The outcome of this collision was clear at a glance.","Many were shocked. Jiang Beixuan was only twenty-five years old, but he was already so powerful and amazing. It made them feel worthless.","But Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying. He was only nineteen, but he already had an invincible attitude.","Chu Yunfan’s future was limitless."]},{"number":699,"title":"Chapter 699 - Jiang Beixuan Who Was Defeated in One Move","paragraphs":["“This is impossible!”","A look of disbelief flashed through Jiang Beixuan’s eyes. In his previous clash with Chu Yunfan, he had not been able to gain any advantage. In his opinion, he just had not been paying attention. Otherwise, how could Chu Yunfan escape so easily?","But now that they were really exchanging blows, Jiang Beixuan realized that this was not the case at all. Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was clearly not inferior to his.","“I’ve already said that the Life Ender is only so-so.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","These words infuriated Jiang Beixuan. To him, this was absolutely intolerable. Chu Yunfan actually dared to look down on the Jiang family’s ultimate technique.","“Very well. Then show me just how capable you are!” Jiang Beixuan said angrily. He finally released all of his aura and no longer concealed it.","Everyone finally saw Jiang Beixuan’s true strength.","The peak of the fourth level of the Innate Stage.","Jiang Beixuan was even stronger than The Three Outlaws combined. If he had not had such strength, how could he subdued them and make them work for him.","Many people exclaimed in surprise. Thinking about Jiang Beixuan’s strength and his age, he really had a bright future.","“Even though it’s said that there are many geniuses, it’s still rare to see someone at this level.”","“Before Jifng Lingxiao, Jiang Beixuan was a strong candidate for the next head of the Jiang family.”","“It can’t be helped. If Jiang Beixuan trains diligently, he will get the chance to reach the peak of the Innate Stage after a couple more decades. He’s already a top-tier figure within the Federation. However, Jiang Lingxiao is different. I heard that the Jiangs’ clan leader proclaims that he will certainly be able to reach the Divine Abilities Stage in the future.”","“Sigh, and what a bright future that is!”","Many people were discussing animatedly. Then, they turned to look at Chu Yunfan. How was he going to deal with Jiang Beixuan, who had now unleashed all his strength?","No matter how monstrous Chu Yunfan was, the difference in age was still there, It was impossible for him to surpass that.","“End, end, end.","“End the Heavens.","“End the Earth.","“End all life!”","Jiang Beixuan shouted. After each sentence, the aura on his body grew stronger. It was as if wandering killing intent from all over the world had gathered together. It turned into terrifying blood-red killing energy and gathered in his body.","“I didn’t expect Jiang Beixuan to have cultivated the Life Ender to the last step. He has already cultivated enough saber intent to trigger all the killing intent in the world. This allows him to be ranked in the top five of this generation.”","A guest from Jiang family clapped his hands and laughed. “Chu Yunfan definitely can’t contend with him. He must pay the price for underestimating our family’s technique!”","Everyone could feel the terrifying killing intent. Compared to the previous slash, this was at least twice as strong.","Everyone knew that the main point of the Life Ender was its killing intent. The stronger the killing intent, the more terrifying the power of the technique would be.","This slash was majestic. The blade light that shot up into the sky made people shudder. If it was not for the protective barrier, they would have even thought of escaping.","After the blade force had reached its limit, it suddenly fell with a bang.","“If you still don’t give up, then I’ll break all your illusions.”","Facing this terrifying blade that had taken shape, Chu Yunfan was not even bothered to try and block it. It was not until it swooped down that he made his move.","With this move, the aura in Chu Yunfan’s entire body exploded. It was not the slightest bit weaker than Jiang Beixuan’s aura from before. It was on par with his. It even broke through Jiang Beixuan’s aura and suppressed it.","All of this happened in an instant. Chu Yunfan attacked with the Ju Que once again.","Boom!","Sword radiance was released from the sword. It instantly shattered the killing intent that filled the sky. It was as if the sky had been torn into two.","Boom!","The sword and saber collided once again. Violent waves of True Energy rose up and annihilated everything in its path.","At that moment, it was as if that moment would last forever—until a figure flew out like a kite with a broken string. Everyone took a closer look. Who could that person be if not Jiang Beixuan?","Jiang Beixuan was covered in blood. The collision had shaken his muscles to the point that large and small cracks had appeared. He looked extremely miserable.","Jiang Beixuan clutched tightly onto his saber, but his entire arm was already a bloody mess. The place where Chu Yunfan’s sword had collided with his saber was the place where Chu Yunfan’s strange strength was the greatest.","Jiang Beixuan’s muscles were torn and blood spurted out like a pillar, He was unable to stop the blood flow.","The entire venue was deathly silent.","“What...” All the guests present were dumbstruck. Most of them had thought highly of Jiang Beixuan because he should have the upper hand in terms of age, inheritance, and cultivation level.","How could Jiang Beixuan have lost so miserably?!","Though some people thought highly of Chu Yunfan, they had not expected such an outcome. At most, they thought that he would barely defeat Jiang Beixuan after a tough battle. That would have been normal, but what happened had not conformed to their understanding at all. Chu Yunfan was simply overturning their worldview.","The guests who were from the Jiang family were in complete disbelief. The outsiders had only heard rumors about Jiang Beixuan, but they did not know exactly how strong he was, so they could still accept this outcome.","However, the Jiang experts were not of the same opinion. They knew Jiang Beixuan very well, so they knew how high his status was within the Jiangs.","Although Jiang Beixuan had been outshined by Jiang Lingxiao, he was still a figure with a bright future. He had locked in all the future big-shot positions within the Jiang family.","It was hard for Jiang Beixuan to find a worthy opponent among his peers. But now, he had been defeated by Chu Yunfan. It would have been fine if he had only lost. That would have been still acceptable.","However, it had been a crushing defeat. Jiang Beixuan was defeated in just one move, and he did not even have the chance to fight back. This was the most terrifying part.","“What a terrifying attack. How could it be so terrifying? What was that move he used?”","“I’ve heard of this move. It’s the Overlord Sword. It’s a skill that has an extremely high requirement for one’s physical quality. The stronger the physical body, the more powerful the power it can unleash. Today, my eyes have been opened. I’ve never seen anyone who can unleash the power of the Overlord Sword to such an extent before.”","“He’s a monster!”","Many of the guests were horrified."]},{"number":700,"title":"Chapter 700 - Body Tempering, Breaking","paragraphs":["Jiang Beixuan’s crushing defeat left the entire scene in complete silence.","No one had expected Jiang Beixuan to be so pale. It was a crushing defeat that left him without the ability to fight back.","Victory and defeat had already been decided with a single strike. Even those who did not have good eyesight could sense the difference between them.","Most were still looking at Chu Yunfan. To them, this was undoubtedly a miracle.","“You can’t even withstand a single strike.” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly.","Jiang Beixuan, who was already burning with anger, coughed up a mouthful of blood. Chu Yunfan was looking down on him.","“What kind of body refining technique is he using? How is he so terrifying?”","Many could tell that Chu Yunfan had not even used his trump card, and he had already defeated Jiang Beixuan with just the strength of his body.","On the throne not far away, the Heavenly Dragon Elder looked at Chu Yunfan with a hint of curiosity. He could tell that Chu Yunfan’s body was extraordinary. It was indeed a very powerful body-refining technique.","After Chu Yunfan had truly mastered it, he would be able to break through the Innate Stage with just one hand. Even for a big shot like the elder who was in the Divine Abilities Stage, this very impressive.","Moreover, the elder knew that the Chu family did not have such an inheritance.","Among the many cultivation methods, body-refining methods were the rarest. Cultivating one’s physical body was to change the genes of an Innate from the Acquired Stage, go against the Heavens, and transform humans into a higher-level life form.","This would affect one’s physical body in a fundamental way.","Therefore, among the many cultivation methods, body-refining methods were the least used. It was obvious that Chu Yunfan had come across other fortuitous encounters and inheritances.","The elder smiled. The development of mankind was inherited from the Ancient Zenith Civilization. Therefore, there would often be people who would obtain some fortuitous encounters and soar into the sky.","The elder was a typical example of this. Starting from nothing, he had fought his way to get the Heavenly Dragon Villa to the top.","This was a feat that ordinary people could not imagine.","After Chu Yunfan defeated Jiang Beixuan, Feng Tianyuan stood up and walked to the center of the arena. He looked at Chu Yunfan.","Feng Tianyuan was unwavering. Though Chu Yunfan had instantly killed Jiang Beixuan, he was not the slightest bit afraid.","“Not bad, Chu Yunfan. You, who dared to challenge Jiang Lingxiao, are indeed stronger than I expected,” Feng Tianyuan said with a faint smile. “However, I will win this battle. You don’t stand a chance. If you admit defeat now, you still have a chance to leave with your dignity.”","“Feng Tianyuan, aren’t you being a little too confident? Let’s give it a go,” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","“In that case, please excuse me.” Feng Tianyuan merely smiled and was not angry.","Voom!","The sword in Feng Tianyuan’s hand suddenly burst out with a dazzling light. When he raised his sword, his entire body seemed to have changed. Everyone felt as if the space around them had suddenly changed.","The sword in Feng Tianyuan’s hand suddenly turned into a star. This casual attack had already displayed his sword intent. Although he looked relaxed, he was highly vigilant against Chu Yunfan. After all, Chu Yunfan had easily defeated Jiang Beixuan.","Although Feng Tianyuan did not take Jiang Beixuan to heart and his target was Jiang Lingxiao, Chu Yunfan’s battle prowess had certainly struck a note with him. He could not afford to be careless. If he was, Chu Yunfan might even be able to defeat him.","This sword thrust out and a cluster of stars fell to the ground. It was a spectacular sight.","“Not bad. Feng Tianyuan is indeed worthy of his name.” The elder nodded in satisfaction when he saw this scene.","After one had cultivated a set of martial skills to the Perfection Stage, they would be able to display their artistic conception. However, there was a gap between the different martial artists. There was a difference in how many artistic conception they could display. The difference in power was like the difference between Heaven and Earth.","If Jiang Beixuan was a genius in the eyes of ordinary people, then Feng Tianyuan was a genius among geniuses. Such a person might not appear even once every ten years. He had been able to learn everything quickly. With the support of a powerful force behind him, his cultivation was unstoppable.","Just this sword intent alone was not something Jiang Beixuan could compare to. The gap between them was too big.","If it was back then, the elder might not be able to suppress the current Feng Tianyuan.","Boom!","Feng Tianyuan’s sword thrust out like a cannonball, instantly breaking through the sound barrier and creating a huge sonic boom.","Starlight filled the sky and the sword light gathered together, turning into a huge divine sword that slashed down.","“The fourth level of the Innate Stage.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a fierce light. Just this one attack had revealed Feng Tianyuan’s cultivation level, and it was shocking.","Just like Jiang Beixuan, they were both at the peak fourth level of the Innate Stage, but there was also a huge difference between them. Feng Tianyuan was at least twice as strong as Jiang Beixuan who was at the same level.","Just like a pot of water and a tub of water, they were both counted as one, but the amount of water they could hold was like the difference between Heaven and Earth.","Jiang Beixuan, who was watching from the side, was dumbfounded. It was fine if it was just Chu Yunfan. But now, Feng Tianyuan, who suddenly appeared, was actually so terrifying.","Jiang Beixuan could feel the terror of that sword. It was crushing him.","“D*mn it. We’re both at the peak of the fourth level. How could the gap be so huge?!”","Jiang Beixuan was not willing to admit defeat. He knew that he was inferior to others, but he did not expect the gap to be so huge.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan. They did not know how he was going to block this sword strike that brought down the stars in the sky.","“Stars?” Chu Yunfan said simply as he looked at this sword strike. “Then I shall cut down the stars.”","The terrifying figures of the Ancient Zenith Civilization appeared in Chu Yunfan’s mind. They had been able to cut down the stars in the sky with a single blade of grass. That was true cultivation that had reached the godly spirit level.","Of course, Chu Yunfan could not achieve such a level yet. He had not even achieved one-thousandth of that power. However, he was confident in facing this attack.","All of a sudden, the aura on Chu Yunfan’s body churned. The Ju Que in his hand danced and created a violent wind. With a sweep of the sword, it burst out with a power that could sweep through a thousand armies and dominate the world.","Boom!","The two swords collided in mid-air. It was as terrifying as a comet crashing into the Earth.","Amidst the billowing smoke and dust, everyone could clearly see that Chu Yunfan did not move at all. However, Feng Tianyuan suddenly fell into a disadvantageous position.","It was only one attack.","Chu Yunfan’s sword momentum did not decrease and landed directly on Feng Tianyuan’s body."]}]);
